ually does — and per-band telemetry rings: eight concentric arcs around the reticle, one per FFT bin, each sweeping at its own rate with arc length reporting it","hash":"389f1d5fbc63df56","embedding":""},{"id":"data-slicer","name":"Data Slicer","category":"distortion","tags":["glitch","slice","chromatic","audio-reactive","scanline","fractal","fbm","voronoi","quasicrystal"],"description":"Beat-reactive fractal tape-slice glitch with FBM domain warping, Voronoi cellular cracks, quasicrystal patterns, and 6-octave temporal jitter. Slices distort organically with curl-noise chromatic aberration and audio-reactive sparkle trails.","hash":"423d6777091508c4","embedding":""},{"id":"dimension-slicer","name":"Dimension Slicer","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","temporal","chromatic","audio-reactive","depth-aware","slice"],"description":"Opens a dimensional rift with temporal slice rotation memory, chromatic inside-slice dispersion, audio-driven slice width modulation, depth-aware zoom warp, and edge glow.","hash":"7ef5b5089125a92f","embedding":""},{"id":"elastic-strip","name":"Elastic Strip","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","elastic","physics","spring","chromatic","frequency","iridescent","bevel"],"description":"Spring-physics strips with sharper nested bevel sub-ribs, traveling pluck packets along each band, stronger soap-film iridescence driven by stretch energy, held drag punch, and bounded click plucks. Direction (V/H) preserved. Display RGBA packed in A.","hash":"9123ed300a05726d","embedding":""},{"id":"elastic-surface","name":"Elastic Surface","category":"distortion","tags":["elastic","rubber","wave","distortion","physics","organic","liquid","membrane","caustic"],"description":"Spring-mass elastic membrane with exact textureLoad state, surface-tension waves, depth-aware deformation, audio-reactive ambient drive, held punch, click ripples, thin-film stretch lighting, and caustic runners. A stores disp.rg+vel.ba (never tonemapped); d