":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","monolith","aurora","liquid-metal","glyphs","audio-reactive","collapse"],"description":"A colossal liquid-metal monolith whose surface forms readable magnetic glyphs under strong bass, then collapses into chaotic auroral breakup on treble. Mouse drag rotates an external magnetic field that sculpts the ferrofluid in real time.","hash":"bf08edd154fe5e0b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-barnsley-fern","name":"Barnsley Fern","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","fern","nature","green","organic","ifs","mathematical","abstract","voronoi","displacement","sdf","masking","audio-reactive"],"description":"A self-similar fractal fern generated by an iterated function system with 4 affine transformations, now hybridized with Voronoi displacement, an SDF vignette mask, and an audio-driven forest palette. Domain-warped FBM, chromatic aberration, mouse attraction, depth detail, and temporal feedback echo keep the foliage ali","hash":"4ed45b949d65eec6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-belousov-zhabotinsky","name":"Belousov-Zhabotinsky Reaction","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","simulation","reaction-diffusion","chemical","spiral-waves","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Chemical oscillator producing spiral waves and target patterns via reaction-diffusion dynamics. Bass modulates reaction rate, mouse seeds new spiral centers, depth controls diffusion.","hash":"09b152979ca2d111","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bifurcation-diagram","name":"Bifurcation Diagram","category":"generative","tags":["generative","chaos","mathematical","fractal","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A logistic-map bifurcation visualization with density and Lyapunov highlighting plus clearly stylized audio-reactive scanner fronts, mouse exploration, click waves, and derivative-aligned trails.","hash":"6eac40970918934b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bio-luminescent-jelly","name":"Bio-Luminescent Jelly","category":"generative","tags":["jellyfish",