y"],"description":"Liquid LSD-like chromatic dripping with RGB channel separation. Upgraded with universal-indicator pH color science: drips change color as they fall through a realistic acid→base gradient. Mouse creates localized acid/base splashes. Critical-angle refraction, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone","hash":"8dc8b8f74943b293","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-glass-lattice","name":"Chromatic Glass Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["raymarched","glass","lattice","chromatic-dispersion","audio-reactive","birefringence","shatter"],"description":"Raymarched 3D chromatic glass lattice with Cauchy multi-order dispersion, internal TIR caustic ribs, acoustic resonance stress birefringence, and micro-fracture edge sparkle glints.","hash":"8ffb75e5ecd28d3d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-metamorphosis","name":"Chromatic Metamorphosis","category":"generative","tags":["metamorphosis","morphing","sdf","raymarching","color","organic","generative","3d","audio","music"],"description":"Metaballs morph continuously between sphere, torus, box, and capsule shapes via smooth-min SDF blending. Surface color evolves independently from geometry in flowing waves.","hash":"c00d93b7103ed8c3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-oracle-jelly","name":"Chromatic Oracle Jelly","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","jellyfish","oracle","bioluminescent","chromatic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired swarm of drifting oracle jellyfish with layered bells, sigil eyes, and curling tentacles. Drags attract persistent wakes and clicks trigger bioluminescent prophecies.","hash":"f6d7ecf17959839c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-singularity-loom","name":"Chromatic Singularity-Loom","category":"generative","tags":["singularity","fractal","weaving","space","audio-reactive","distortion"],"description":"A majestic, gravity-warped cosmic loom weaving fractal strings of pure light around a central singularity.","hash":"bb0a1c23d5