e, creating a living, breathing tapestry of organic growth across temporal dimensions.","hash":"ca7a300daf5697ca","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chrono-voronoi-mycelium","name":"Chrono-Voronoi Mycelium","category":"generative","tags":["generative","voronoi","organic","mycelium","temporal","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Multi-temporal Voronoi fungal growth with fast nutrient wavefronts, smoothly advected spores, and bounded luminous history trails. Mouse and clicks seed growth while audio drives layered colony motion.","hash":"f5186cf3413dbd93","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronodynamic-aether-weaver-automata","name":"Chronodynamic Aether-Weaver Automata","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","quantum","bioluminescent","automata","audio-reactive"],"description":"","hash":"b556bb8577d59169","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronomorphic-glass-tesseract","name":"Chronomorphic Glass Tesseract","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","glass","tesseract","iridescent","refraction"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional glass structure that continuously folds through time and space, refracting shifting iridescent cosmic energies. Features chronomorphic spatial distortion and raymarched chromatic dispersion.","hash":"42383d5a64e4f92f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-biomechanical-void-leviathan","name":"Chronos Biomechanical Void-Leviathan","category":"generative","tags":["leviathan","biomechanical","void","quantum","audio-reactive","temporal","volumetric"],"description":"A colossal, ancient biomechanical leviathan forged from shifting quantum-obsidian and echoing temporal-glass, swimming gracefully through a violently fractured space-time nebula while continuously shedding liquid auroral starlight.","hash":"42c44526df6353ba","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-crystal-labyrinth","name":"Chronos Crystal Labyrinth","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","tesseract","fractal","refraction","raymarching","time-distortion"],"description":