al persistence for death fade trails and chromatic","hash":"fa0ac39ee34018f7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-coral-reef-colony","name":"Coral Reef Colony","category":"generative","tags":["coral","organic","generative","audio-reactive","mouse-interactive","underwater","bioluminescence","DLA","caustics","HDR"],"description":"Upgraded coral reef with space colonization branching, DLA patterns, fBm polyp detail, bioluminescent fluorescent proteins, subsurface scattering, caustic light, HDR bloom, and ACES tone mapping. Bass drives nutrient availability, mids steer current, treble triggers spawning. Mouse attracts growth; depth filters water ","hash":"235822f4ee5440c9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-clockwork-dyson-sphere","name":"Cosmic-Clockwork Dyson-Sphere","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","cosmic","fractal","audio-reactive","volumetric","kifs","domain-warping","voronoi","beer-lambert","fresnel"],"description":"A hyper-intricate colossal megastructure of interlocking golden gears, glowing plasma conduits, and rhythmic mechanical fractal shifts enclosing a blinding quantum singularity. Upgraded with enhanced KIFS SDFs, domain-warped FBM, Worley/Voronoi noise, Beer-Lambert volumetric extinction, Fresnel-Schlick metallic reflect","hash":"a2d8319eb6bad92b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-slime-mold","name":"Cosmic Slime Mold","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","slime-mold","organic","growth","veins","dendritic"],"description":"Simulation of slime mold growth with vivid psychedelic coloring. Branching veins of bright neon spread across the screen in organic dendritic patterns. Colors shift from deep purple to hot pink to electric cyan. Mouse feeds the slime causing rapid growth pulses.","hash":"5812220743541389","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-velvet-hypnosis","name":"Cosmic Velvet Hypnosis","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","hypnosis","spiral","velvet","cosmic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired velvet spiral well with soft chromatic arms, counter-spirals, and moving moire. Drags torque persistent trails and clicks send luminous hypnosis halos outward.","hash":"edd46d9b978228dd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-web-filament","name":"Cosmic Web Filament","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cosmic","voronoi","filament","organic","dark-matter","web","gravity","procedural","audio","music","reactive","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"Large-scale cosmic structure evolving at speed — Zel'dovich streaming, Voronoi filaments and Apollonian voids, with caustic striation running along each strand. Stellar populations are graded through a psychedelic spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor opens a void well that drags the web toward it, holding collapses str","hash":"b851a72585517359","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cryogenic-frost-plasma-matrix","name":"Cryogenic Frost-Plasma Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","ice","plasma","fractal","raymarching","audio-reactive"],"description":"An infinitely shattering and reforming matrix of absolute-zero hyper-fractals that bleed iridescent thermal plasma when fractured by heavy bass frequencies.","hash":"e46e564f4c83fef1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystal-caverns","name":"Crystal Caverns","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","cave","3d","raymarching","fantasy","glowing","stalactites","procedural","generative","alpha-transmission","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Infinite procedural cave system with glowing crystals featuring physical light transmission. Crystals have IOR-based Fresnel reflection and variable purity affecting their glow transparency.","hash":"f465d0638d0a930b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystal-lattice-growth","name":"Crystal Lattice Growth","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","fractal","dendrite","generative","audio-reactive","geometric","abstract","procedural"],"description":"Mineral dendrites crystallise from a golden-ratio nucleation seed. Radially symmetric branches grow with bass energy, prismatic hue shifts with mids, treble adds refractive sparkle.","hash":"02901ca862e6a68f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystalline-chrono-dyson","name":"Crystalline Chrono Dyson","category":"generative","tags":["generative","dyson","crystal","kifs","worley","voronoi","fresnel","beer-lambert","fbm","domain-warping","audio-reactive","temporal","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"A crystalline Dyson sphere with KIFS fractal panel interiors, Worley/Voronoi crystal lattice, Fresnel-Schlick reflections, plasma conduits with Beer-Lambert subsurface scattering, domain-repeated panels, and audio-reactive quasar core. Mouse orbits the structure.","hash":"fe439ea537f38569","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystalline-mandala-bloom","name":"Crystalline Mandala Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mandala","kaleidoscope","crystal","bloom","audio-reactive"],"description":"Audio-reactive kaleidoscopic mandala that folds the source image through a rotating polar symmetry. Crystalline petal SDFs, hue-rotated chroma, concentric bass-rings, and treble sparkles bloom outward from a mouse-anchored center.","hash":"216f2a8eccc84975","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystalline-nebula-weaver-void-spider","name":"Crystalline Nebula-Weaver Void-Spider","category":"generative","tags":["fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"A crystalline void-spider weaving at speed: a skittering articulated gait, a faceted plated carapace, and three tiers of web thread down to fine cross-bracing filaments. The nebula and the weaver are both graded through a psychedelic crystalline spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor drags the gravity field, holding lung","hash":"64f51ff2a73b4ddc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cyber-organic-liquid-neon-pulsar","name":"Cyber-Organic Liquid-Neon Pulsar","category":"generative","tags":["neon","pulsar","magnetic-field","astrophysics","raymarched","abstract"],"description":"A biomechanical, pulsating celestial core composed of hyper-viscous liquid-neon and crystalline techno-organic fibers. Enriched with Crab Pulsar 30.2 Hz strobe and 10^8 Tesla magnetic field topology.","hash":"7368acd11b9a60ff","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cyber-terminal","name":"Procedural Cyber Terminal (ASCII)","category":"generative","tags":["ascii","terminal","retro","procedural","decoder","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Transforms the input video feed or image into a high-tech, procedural ASCII terminal display using Signed Distance Functions (SDFs).","hash":"91c3dfc6977b880f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-aether-moth-chrysalis","name":"Cybernetic Aether-Moth Chrysalis","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cybernetic","fractal","bioluminescence","plasma","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate cyber-organic cocoon pulses with bioluminescent plasma trails and crystalline micro-circuitry, breathing and evolving over time.","hash":"342f29e8719a9f7d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-crystalline-neuro-lattice","name":"Cybernetic Crystalline Neuro-Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["cybernetic","crystal","neural","lattice","organic","neon"],"description":"A hyper-structured, ever-evolving neural lattice that crystallizes data streams into neon-infused geometries, blending organic synaptic growth with cybernetic precision.","hash":"2e762d050ba33cb1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-ferro-coral","name":"Cybernetic Ferro-Coral","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","ferrofluid","coral","magnetic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A biomechanical reef of magnetic, liquid-metal coral that dynamically shapes itself in response to acoustic vibrations, revealing a glowing quantum-plasma core beneath a dark metallic exterior. Upgraded (Batch 36): domain-warped FBM branching spikes, ridged micro-creases, Gray-Scott Turing banding carved into the shell","hash":"ecaf83ba1494a185","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-liquid-chrome-engine","name":"Cybernetic Liquid-Chrome Engine","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","liquid-metal","audio-reactive","raymarching","fractal"],"description":"A liquid-chrome engine racing on a wrapped conveyor camera, with audio-driven piston surges, spectral reflection streaks, mouse orbit, and bounded metallic smears.","hash":"ac573c158d4744a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-mycelium-neural-web","name":"Cybernetic-Mycelium Neural-Web","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","mechanical","audio-reactive","fractal","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"A bio-mechanical mycelial net streaming and firing fast. Hyphal filigree carves branching detail over the trails, data pulses race at a treble-driven rate, and the whole net is graded through a psychedelic neon spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor is an attractor whose whip speed mutates the growth, holding blooms the ","hash":"45f8c7a9015005ab","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-plasma-orchid-nexus","name":"Cybernetic Plasma-Orchid Nexus","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cybernetic","floral","plasma","glow"],"description":"A hyper-stylized digital flora ecosystem where crystalline petals of plasma bloom from a glowing cybernetic core, pulsating with neon chromatic aberration.","hash":"8b192189181177e5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cycloid-bloom","name":"Cycloid Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","colorful","spirograph","cycloid","mandala","floral","generative","abstract","prismatic"],"description":"Five nested hypotrochoid curves form a blooming floral mandala. A coarse-plus-refined curve search keeps the petals efficient, the mouse pulls the bloom without an audio gate, clicks send petal waves, and each layer shimmers from its own FFT voice while color feedback burns bright arcs.","hash":"b2b75