ice of fractal mini-universes. Now audio-reactive to bass frequencies with meaningful alpha compositing.","hash":"a545223e31c99b5b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-echo-dunes","name":"Echo Dunes","category":"generative","tags":["generative","desert","dunes","mirage","echo","audio-reactive"],"description":"Wind-carved sand ridges with heat mirage distortions and cursor-centered acoustic echo rings.","hash":"b15aa573e3aeb33e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-eldritch-quantum-fractal-eye","name":"Eldritch-Quantum Fractal-Eye","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","eldritch","quantum","eye","audio-reactive","neon"],"description":"A colossal, hyper-dimensional eye constructed from infinitely folding quantum fractals and liquid plasma.","hash":"9248daf6bfe8e0fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-eldritch-tesseract-hive-mind","name":"Eldritch Tesseract-Hive Mind","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"An impossible, non-Euclidean hypercube hive populated by swarms of luminescent algorithmic sentinels, constantly unfolding and fracturing into new geometric dimensions driven by quantum noise and acoustic energy. Upgraded for fast motion: dual-plane 4D tumble, velocity-stretched sentinel speed-streaks, clamped HDR feed","hash":"0ded622d35bd50b1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-electric-kaleidoscope-storm","name":"Electric Kaleidoscope Storm","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","lightning","kaleidoscope","electric","storm","generative"],"description":"Electric lightning bolts radiating from the center in a kaleidoscope symmetry pattern with 6, 8, or 12-fold symmetry. Neon cyan, magenta, and yellow bolts crack and flicker on a deep dark background. Bolts rebranch and reseed each frame for constant motion. Sparks fly randomly. Mouse rotates the kaleidoscope and change","hash":"ceb85b3fccfdb1fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-calligraphic-ecosystems","name":"Emergent Calligraphic Ecosystems","category":"generative","tags":["generative","calligraphy","emergent","flow-field","organic","audio-reactive","procedural","music","ecosystem","predator-prey"],"description":"A system of interacting calligraphic strokes following local orientation rules that spontaneously form complex alien writing systems. Mouse plants seeds or disturbs regions. Audio influences stroke behavior and interaction rules. Enriched with Wolfram Alpha Lotka-Volterra predator-prey dynamics: cyclic population oscil","hash":"d9c2987449c35918","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-calligraphic-weave","name":"Emergent Calligraphic Weave","category":"generative","tags":["calligraphy","ink","weave","flow-field","audio-reactive"],"description":"An emergent weave of pressure-shaped calligraphic filaments, chromatic hairlines, and timestamped ink fronts that bend beneath a held pointer.","hash":"a8f30b7b76a0e40d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-script-gardens","name":"Emergent Script Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["generative","calligraphy","emergent","script","glyphs","strokes","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","procedural","golden-ratio","phyllotaxis","biological"],"description":"Interacting ink-like and neon strokes follow golden-ratio phyllotaxis (137.5°) to self-organize into alien symbolic gardens. Bass drives growth iteration count. Mouse interaction plants dense stroke seeds with φ-boosted intensity. Temporal feedback creates organic overgrowth trails. ACES tonemapped with chromatic aberr","hash":"6630b45f26d86e88","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-erosion-strata","name":"Erosion Strata","category":"generative","tags":["generative","procedural","erosion","sedimentary","strata","canyon","earth-tones","fbm","voronoi","domain-warping","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Procedural sedimentary rock layers carved by domain-warped erosion channels, revealing mineral veins, fossil imprints, and weathered edges. Features atmospheric haze, subsurface scattering, and geological era palette cycling.","hash":"aeebaca750908600","embedding":""},{"id":"