quencies.","hash":"bef933a05613fbb5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-aurora-hummingbird-core","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Aurora Hummingbird-Core","category":"generative","tags":["organic","biomechanical","aurora","plasma","quantum"],"description":"A hyper-fast, biomechanical hummingbird woven from liquid auroral plasma and shattered quantum glass, hovering within a massive chrono-distortion flower.","hash":"89570a917ba3a269","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-chrono-nebula-phoenix","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Chrono Nebula-Phoenix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","biomechanical","phoenix","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic cybernetic phoenix rising from a deep-space nebula, its wings woven from liquid auroral plasma and shattered quantum glass that burst into geometric temporal fractals upon acoustic climax.","hash":"2304bbdf736a5186","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-chrono-void-whale","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Chrono Void-Whale","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cosmic","mechanical","void","volumetric"],"description":"A colossal, slow-moving biomechanical space leviathan swimming gracefully through a dense volumetric plasma-ocean, whose transparent cyber-skeletal ribs refract and ripple with shifting temporal energy streams.","hash":"48e9f27f42ddc6fe","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-plasma-void-dragon","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Plasma Void-Dragon","category":"generative","tags":["dragon","plasma","organic","quantum","audio-reactive","cybernetic","void","sdf","raymarched","voronoi","kaleidoscopic","geometry"],"description":"A majestic hyper-dimensional cyber-dragon of flowing quantum plasma with octahedral crystal scale-shards, box-ribbed spine segments and a bass-pulsed torus halo engraved with rotating star sigils, soaring through a kaleidoscopically folded dark-matter nebula veined with Voronoi energy circuits.","hash":"7f0aeb01c8038822","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-glass-fl