ategory":"generative","tags":["silk","fabric","veil","organic","gold","cream","elegant","showcase","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Multi-layered translucent silk ribbons flowing in an ethereal wind. Audio drives undulation amplitude; mouse gathers and disturbs the fabric like a hand through cloth. Gold-cream palette with depth-layered parallax and fabric sheen.","hash":"3f7a555d924bbac5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-evolutionary-cellular-gardens","name":"Evolutionary Cellular Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cellular-automata","evolutionary","organic","coral","audio-reactive","procedural","music"],"description":"Multi-state cellular automata where the rules themselves slowly evolve based on local conditions and global audio input. Audio drives genetic pressure on the automata. Mouse introduces invasive species or protected zones. Organic coral-like emergent structures that change fundamental behavior over time. Upgraded with a","hash":"c815a477058c727c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-feedback-echo-chamber","name":"Feedback Echo Chamber","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","echo","feedback","multi-layer","ghosting","audio","music","reactive","alpha","accumulative","mouse-reactive","shockwave"],"description":"Temporal feedback echo chamber with mouse gravity wells, click shockwaves, fBM domain warp, depth-aware compositing, and psychedelic palette blending","hash":"f96f5904bd2c9b50","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ferrofluid-monolith","name":"Ferrofluid Monolith","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","monolith","magnetic","raymarched","liquid-metal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A raymarched liquid-metal obelisk grows magnetic radial spikes around an emissive core, with pointer orbit and click-driven field rings.","hash":"ecbccd6e6fe706c6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fibonacci-spiral-garden","name":"Fibonacci Spiral Garden","category":"generative","tags":["fibonacci","phyllotaxis","spiral","garden","bloom","audio-reactive"],"description":"Ninety-six golden-angle blossoms unfurl as an interactive phyllotaxis garden with spectral petals and click-seeded growth fronts.","hash":"fcd427265b98e005","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-audio-symphony","name":"4th of July — Audio Symphony","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","audio-reactive","music-sync","spectrum","pyrotechnics","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"A fireworks display conducted by the music. A smoothed bass envelope triggers bigger, faster launches on transients; mids layer in secondary shells; treble crackles a cloud of micro-sparks. Mouse click or hold launches a personal synced shell at the cursor.","hash":"dbb35359962d20b3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-chrysanthemum","name":"4th of July — Chrysanthemum Burst","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","chrysanthemum","peony","pyrotechnics","spherical","dense","rings","audio-reactive","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Dense spherical chrysanthemum and peony shells with hundreds of sparks arranged in concentric rings. Fast ballistic petals, radial speed-line streaks, and advected HDR trails. Bass expands burst radius, mids add secondary ring shells, treble crackles the outer petals. Mouse detonates a massive peony at the cursor.","hash":"82d5929b4f2318de","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-comet-trail","name":"4th of July — Comet Trail","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","comet","trail","streak","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Blazing comet shells with brilliant heads and long luminous tails that streak across the night sky. Each shell launches upward then leaves a glowing path as sparks peel off the main trajectory. Bass makes bigger comet heads, treble adds sparkle along the trail. Mouse fires a comet from the cursor.","hash":"f6d2677a27678e3c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-crackle-palm","name":"4th of July — Crackle Palm","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","crackle","palm","multi-stage","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Multi-stage pyrotechnic shells that bloom in two acts. A primary burst erupts first, then delayed secondary crackle and palm fronds spawn from sub-points along the fading sparks. Treble drives thousands of micro-crackle pops; mids trigger the second-stage palm arms. Bass deepens the initial detonation. Mouse launches a","hash":"03b0c1031817b263","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-crossette","name":"4th of July — Crossette Split","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","crossette","split","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Crossette shells that split into four brilliant sub-bursts at the cardinal points. A primary flash blooms, then each arm detonates into its own mini-chrysanthemum. The iconic four-petal pattern creates geometric symmetry in the sky. Mids trigger the split timing, treble crackles each arm. Mouse fires a crossette at the","hash":"d77200842d23beb5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-dahlia-burst","name":"4th of July — Dahlia Burst","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","dahlia","petals","disk","flat-burst","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Flat dahlia-disk shells that bloom into layered rows of radial petals — warm coral cores fading to gold tips across concentric petal rings. Unlike spherical chrysanthemums, dahlia bursts spread in a wide flat disk before petals curl and fall. Bass expands disk radius, mids stagger petal-row timing, treble adds micro-pe","hash":"1e4ba0dca5e67428","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-fan-shell","name":"4th of July — Fan Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","fan","spread","hemisphere","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Wide fan shells that burst into a sweeping hemisphere of colored sparks, like a peacock tail opening in the sky. Sparks spread in a broad arc with strong horizontal bias before falling. Mids widen the fan angle, bass deepens the colors. Mouse opens a personal fan at the cursor.","hash":"ce786e8ba468f86f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-horse-tail","name":"4th of July — Horse Tail Brocade","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","horse-tail","brocade","streamers","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Classic horse tail and brocade shells rain long, straight golden streamers from a single burst point. Each spark traces a tight gravity arc with minimal spread, creating luminous waterfalls of light. Bass lengthens the tails, treble adds silver micro-dust along the streams. Mouse launches a personal brocade cascade.","hash":"2dbfcd986eaf6619","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-kamuro-gold","name":"4th of July — Kamuro Gold","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","kamuro","gold","glitter","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Dense kamuro shells rain slow-falling gold and silver glitter like a luminous snowstorm. Thousands of tiny sparks hang in the air before drifting down, creating thick clouds of metallic shimmer. Perfect July 4th brocade feel. Bass thickens the cloud, treble adds micro-sparkle. Mouse releases a golden kamuro shower at t","hash":"1b37185cc6742e6b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-nocturne","name":"4th of July — Fireworks Nocturne","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","pyrotechnics","celebration","sparks","gravity","particles","night-sky","audio-reactive","generative","explosive","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"A living fireworks display over a dark velvet night. Multiple mortar shells launch, burst in jewel and gold colors with realistic gravity arcs and lingering ember trails. Bass detonates bigger shells and richer bursts, treble crackles extra sparks. Mouse click or hold launches a personal command shell at the cursor. Te","hash":"aaabb57606df8191","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-ring-shell","name":"4th of July — Ring Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","ring","halo","donut","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Perfect ring and halo shells that bloom as luminous donuts in the night sky. Sparks launch outward along a crisp circular front then cascade downward with gravity. Classic Saturn-ring pyrotechnics with jewel-tone cycling. Bass widens the ring, treble adds inner sparkle. Mouse launches a personal halo at the cursor. Upg","hash":"57a6d1fafcddee26","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-roman-candle","name":"4th of July — Roman Candle","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","roman-candle","barrage","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Classic roman candles firing rapid star bursts from fixed launch tubes along the horizon. Bass enlarges launches, treble adds trail and burst detail, held mouse fire follows the normalized cursor, and each click launches a discrete personal candle. Bright shells produce luminance-derived depth.","hash":"27a04bc510399bed","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-smoke-bloom","name":"4th of July — Smoke Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","smoke","bloom","volumetric","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Soft volumetric smoke gathers around bursts and along falling sparks, while a feedback light bloom adds luminous halos to the brightest areas. Bass swells the smoky glow, mids add secondary burst layers, and treble scatters micro-sparks. Mouse launches a smoky peony at the cursor.","hash":"88fc1778b539652f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-strobe-shell","name":"4th of July — Strobe Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","strobe","blink","flash","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","psychedelic","4th-of-july"],"description":"Hypnotic strobe shells that flash multiple times before dissolving into falling sparks. Each burst pulses with rhythmic white-hot flashes synced to the beat, then blooms into color. Treble drives flash rate, bass amplifies each pulse. A psychedelic July 4th finale feel. Mouse triggers a strobe barrage at the cursor.","hash":"45bfc427e9d7b98d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-willow-cascade","name":"4th of July — Willow Cascade","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","willow","pyrotechnics","trails","golden","long-exposure","gravity","audio-reactive","generative","cinematic","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Classic willow-style fireworks with long, drooping golden and silver trails. Velocity-stretched droop streaks, wind-advected embers, and advected HDR trails. Bass deepens the droop, treble adds silver micro-sparkle along the trails. Mouse launches a personal willow shell at the cursor.","hash":"a9e766273b77cc19","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-wind-ripple","name":"4th of July — Wind & Ripple","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","wind","ripple","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Sparks drift on a fast time-varying wind while ripple events ignite shock-front barrages. Comet-tail speed lines, wind conveyors, and advected HDR trails. Bass deepens the shells, mids add secondary gusts, treble scatters silver micro-sparkle. Mouse launches a personal wind-swept shell at the cursor.","hash":"5dc5089425d744f8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-flame-fractal-attractor","name":"Flame Fractal Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","attractor","orbit-density","audio-reactive"],"description":"A curling orbit-density attractor folds luminous ember filaments through a bass-driven flame field with interactive vortex wakes.","hash":"3eb3794cf00c5fce","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-flowing-silk-ribbons","name":"Flowing Silk Ribbons","category":"generative","tags":["silk","ribbons","fabric","iridescent","flow","audio-reactive"],"description":"Layered anisotropic silk ribbons flow through an iridescent field, comb beneath a held pointer, and ring with timestamped clicks.","hash":"f3fd38814f15a325","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fourier-epicycles","name":"Fourier Epicycles","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","mathematical-art","epicycles","fourier","harmonics","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Rotating Fourier epicycle wheels tracing harmonic curves with chromatic separation, metallic rim glow, and temporal trajectory trails. Bass drives rotation speed, mouse reshapes coefficients.","hash":"78beab879eb5e38e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-bioluminescence-spore-network","name":"Fractal Bioluminescence Spore-Network","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","organic","bioluminescence","audio-reactive","network","kifs"],"description":"A hyper-organic, slowly expanding fractal network of glowing bioluminescent spores that mathematically bloom and connect via glowing filaments in response to audio frequencies.","hash":"cc5611e4b6cc855b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-chrono-dendrite-forge","name":"Fractal Chrono-Dendrite Forge","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","dendrite","time-manipulation","bismuth","glass","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate procedural branching structure simulating crystalline growth and decay through a spacetime distortion field, rendered with a bismuth-iridescent glass aesthetic. Upgraded with a three-point warm/cool/rim lighting rig, HDR bloom-ready speculars, volumetric near-miss glow, chrono-violet depth fog, ACES t","hash":"d303d2f37607a188","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-clockwork","name":"Fractal Clockwork","category":"generative","tags":["steampunk","mechanical","3d","raymarching","gears","metallic","brass","clockwork","procedural","generative","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Infinite interlocking brass gears rotating in perfect mechanical sync, stepping one tooth per escapement tick around ruby jewel bearings. Steampunk raymarched masterpiece with metallic PBR shading and mouse orbit control.","hash":"56bbc648e4884153","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-ember-lattice","name":"Fractal Ember Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","fractal","ember","fire","shatter","lattice","showcase","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Hexagonal crystal lattice glowing like hot embers. Mouse click shatters the lattice into rigid shards that fly outward; release to watch them drift back and reform over ~1.5s. Audio drives glow pulse, lattice breathing, spark frequency, and ember beads that crawl along the lattice lines; flying shards cool to deep red ","hash":"cd0e88e03d5a0646","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-flame-classic","name":"Classic Fractal Flame","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","ifs","swirl","horseshoe","audio-reactive"],"description":"A classic fractal flame blends swirl, horseshoe, and polar affine variations into warm spectral density traps with temporal embers.","hash":"5c492784ed3e4034","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-neuro-mycelium-lattice","name":"Fractal Neuro-Mycelium Lattice","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-connected, pulsating network of organic filaments that endlessly branches and bridges across void space.","hash":"e5391437c1b695cd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-tree-growth","name":"Fractal Tree Growth","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","tree","growth","recursive","botanical","audio-reactive"],"description":"A recursively evaluated distance-field tree unfurls through binary branch paths, luminous leaves, pointer wind, and click-seeded growth fronts.","hash":"d27b1179dde32b8f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractured-monolith","name":"Fractured Monolith","category":"generative","tags":["monolith","floating","frac