ed-glass polygon mosaic with FBM domain-warped Voronoi cells, curl-noise liquid flow, physically-based IOR refraction with Fresnel-Schlick reflections, Beer-Lambert caustic attenuation, and chromatic RGB dispersion driven by audio bands. Mouse warps the mosaic grid.","hash":"6c014440b70c1b69","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravitational-ferrofluid-singularity-engine","name":"Gravitational Ferrofluid Singularity-Engine","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","singularity","raymarching","interactive","metallic","iridescent"],"description":"A stylized ferrofluid singularity with rotating magnetic domains, orbiting spike fronts, accelerating droplets, click shocks, and bounded horizon-aligned light trails driven by live audio.","hash":"7a056d49a363ae72","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravitational-strain","name":"Gravitational Strain Field","category":"generative","tags":["gravity","lensing","space","physics","stars","dark-matter","generative","simulation","audio","music","domain-warping","voronoi","beer-lambert","fresnel"],"description":"Orbiting gravity wells warp a procedural star field through bounded RK4 geodesic integration. Tidal emission, accretion disks, click fronts, and held-pointer strain runners illuminate the generated potential field.","hash":"2debf4e3ca20153c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravito-phononic-accretion","name":"Gravito-Phononic Accretion","category":"generative","tags":["generative","gravity","lensing","cosmic","accretion","audio-reactive","procedural","music","blackbody","physics"],"description":"Multiple audio-driven gravitational centers that accrete and sculpt procedural density fields with gravitational lensing distortion. Different audio bands control different gravitational bodies. Mouse can add temporary mass concentration. Dark cores with swirling filamentary gas. Blackbody temperature colors for accret","hash":"dcb48ba9c3f9c23b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-graviton-plasma-lotus","name":"Graviton Plasma Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["generative","lotus","raymarching","kifs","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A raymarched KIFS plasma lotus with sprung gravitational lensing, bounded click pulses, multi-band iridescent lighting, temporal petal echoes, and real hit depth.","hash":"1f3242793386837e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-bismuth-core-reactor","name":"Holographic Bismuth-Core Reactor","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","kifs","raymarching","holographic"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, endlessly unfolding bismuth core reactor, merging metallic stepped-fractals with liquid-holographic interference patterns.","hash":"78cf4b554e65b409","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-data-core","name":"Holographic Data Core","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","cyberpunk","hologram","data","neon","procedural","infinite","audio","music"],"description":"An infinite journey through a quantum lattice of glowing data nodes, smooth scan packets, pointer beams, and click-launched data rings with bounded display history.","hash":"dce8a9e35018c867","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-fracture","name":"Holographic Fracture","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fracture","cracks","holographic","iridescent","crystal","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Iridescent cracked planes with SDF fracture lines and thin-film holographic shards. Audio drives crack glow, and mouse interaction spawns new radial cracks.","hash":"53a694ff48ced462","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-lens-flare-matrix","name":"Holographic Lens-Flare Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["generative","holographic","matrix"],"description":"Generate a matrix of holographic lens flares that follow motion in the video or a synthetic flow field.","hash":"91383cc2b6c59172","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-membrane","name":"Holographic Membrane","category":"generative","tags":["holographic","membrane","iridescence","thin-film","tra