l condenses a striated fu","hash":"eaf5f1f483651f41","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-refractive-rain-matrix","name":"Hyper-Refractive Rain-Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["generative","rain","refraction","caustics","raymarch","audio-reactive"],"description":"A raymarched refractive rain matrix with viscous drop merging, pointer repulsion, audio-driven caustics, bass-triggered lightning strobes, prismatic RGB dispersion on drop rims, and fall-aligned HDR rain streaks.","hash":"458f2017489b2bdf","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-crystal-symbiosis","name":"Hyperbolic Crystal Symbiosis","category":"generative","tags":["generative","hyperbolic","geometry","crystal","non-euclidean","iridescent","audio-reactive","mathematical"],"description":"Competing crystal growth in hyperbolic (Poincaré disk) geometry. Racing growth-front runners, tile pulse waves, and advected HDR trails. Local curvature influenced by audio and mouse. Iridescent jewel coloring with symmetry-breaking facet borders, hyperbolic growth zoning, symbiotic twin lamellae where rival crystals m","hash":"0ffb2cedef8c68b9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-tessellation","name":"Hyperbolic Tessellation Engine","category":"generative","tags":["hyperbolic","tessellation","fractal","non-euclidean","escher","geometric","generative","audio","music"],"description":"Non-Euclidean Poincaré-disk tessellation in real-time. Hyperbolic tiles subdivide infinitely toward the boundary disk, colored by recursive depth — M.C. Escher meets fractals.","hash":"d37513684f8c62ae","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-tree","name":"Hyperbolic Tree Fractal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","hyperbolic","tree","fractal","poincare","nature","audio","music"],"description":"Recursive tree fractal rendered in hyperbolic Poincare disk. Branches sway with audio, leaves glow with treble. Möbius-transformed space.","hash":"db1e030c6d191be5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperdimensional-bismuth-lattice","name":"Hyperdimensional Bismuth Lattice","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"16940da59a3f043d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperdimensional-plasma-loom","name":"Hyperdimensional Plasma Loom","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","quantum","abstract","geometric","strands","raymarching"],"description":"A mesmerizing tangle of iridescent energy threads weaving themselves into complex, higher-dimensional geometric topologies, creating the illusion of cosmic fabric being spun in real-time.","hash":"ed9e3aff2bad6bfb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hypnotic-vortex-tunnel","name":"Hypnotic Vortex Tunnel","category":"generative","tags":["tunnel","vortex","hypnotic","generative","audio-reactive","psychedelic","abstract","neon"],"description":"An infinite vortex tunnel of nested spinning rings coloured by spectral light. Bass spins the rings faster, treble fires radial arc strobes, mouse shifts the vanishing point.","hash":"c5da2fb9d601128d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ice-crystal-lattice","name":"Ice Crystal Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["ice","crystal","hexagonal","frost","branching","audio-reactive"],"description":"Hexagonal ice branches advance through luminous frost fronts, pointer-seeded nucleation, Fresnel-like rims, and click-launched fracture waves.","hash":"d48afb0647921aa9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ifs-fractal-flame","name":"IFS Fractal Flame","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","ifs","organic","fire","bloom","abstract","translucent","alpha-layered"],"description":"Iterated Function System fractal flame with probabilistic affine transforms, non-linear variations, and flame palette rendering. Features organic fbm drift, temporal accumulation trails, HDR bloom, chromatic aberration, audio-reactive morphing, and advanced alpha compositing via Beer-Lambert transmittance, luminance ke","hash":"446cb2f5096b8a6d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-image-pixel-detonation","name":"4th of July — Pixel Detonation","category":"generative","tags":["firewo