pe the flow, glow controls density and tube radius, trail decay preserves feedback, and audio and mouse input animate the view.","hash":"6efa5f269ec91ea5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-luminescent-aether-plasma-astro-axolotl","name":"Luminescent Aether-Plasma Astro-Axolotl","category":"generative","tags":["axolotl","plasma","aether","organic","volumetric","fractal","aquatic","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","tessellation","interactive"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, cyber-organic celestial axolotl drifting gracefully through a fluid-dynamic quantum nebula — raymarched SDF with FFT-folded fractal gills, click-ripple tissue deformation, a mouse-orbit camera, and a kaleidoscopic aether-caustic tessellation sea.","hash":"f1dbd14a896cb8dd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-luminescent-aether-plasma-nebula-koi","name":"Luminescent Aether-Plasma Nebula-Koi","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","particle systems","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-organic, glowing biomechanical space-koi woven from flowing aether-plasma and shattered chromatic crystal, swimming gracefully through a volumetric quantum nebula while reacting dynamically to ambient acoustic frequencies.","hash":"704fdd72293fc26b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-luminescent-chrono-fluid-astrolabe","name":"Luminescent Chrono-Fluid Astrolabe","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","liquid","holographic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate, multi-dimensional astrolabe forged from flowing liquid-gold plasma and hard-light holograms, endlessly spinning and realigning its cosmic rings in perfect synchronization with audio frequencies.","hash":"1d244d3085786750","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-luminescent-chrono-prism-astro-stag","name":"Luminescent Chrono-Prism Astro-Stag","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","mechanical","volumetric"],"description":"A hyper-majestic, biomechanical celestial stag woven from shattered chrono-prisms and glowing liq