al audio input. Audio drives genetic pressure on the automata. Mouse introduces invasive species or protected zones. Organic, plant-like emergent structures that change their fundamental behavior over time.","hash":"e9084ef2d3cb6db6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-murmuration-phantom","name":"Murmuration Phantom","category":"generative","tags":["murmuration","flock","swarm","curl-noise","twilight","audio-reactive","organic","volumetric"],"description":"Starling murmuration simulation — thousands of dark birds flowing in organic, ever-changing shapes against a twilight sky. The flock morphs between coherent structures driven by a curl noise flow field, with individual birds only visible as subtle silver glints at the edges. Bass drives flock density, mids morph betwee","hash":"fa465e892024e93a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-mushroom-mandala-garden","name":"Mushroom Mandala Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","mushroom","mandala","bioluminescent","organic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired radial garden of breathing mushroom caps, luminous gills, traveling spores, and pulsing mycelium. Drags bend persistent growth and clicks release patterned fairy-ring fronts.","hash":"ad31c3ca12168ba3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-mycelium-network","name":"Mycelium Network","category":"generative","tags":["generative","organic","nature","bioluminescent","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Growing network patterns resembling fungal mycelium with diffusion-limited aggregation branching and bioluminescent tips Batch 38 FAST MOTION upgrade: bioluminescent signal pulses race along the hyphae (closed-form traveling wave), the growth front uses fast-in/smooth-out time-warp easing, bass transients fire expandin","hash":"bcdb54d475429a70","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-navier-stokes-ink","name":"Navier-Stokes Ink","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","simulation","fluid","navier-stokes","ink","turbulence","audio-reactive","vj","sdf","raymarch","interactive","depth"],"description":"A single-pass fluid-inspired ink field with semi-Lagrangian advection and local pressure approximation, extended by raymarched vortex tubes and a tessellated emitter corona. Mouse input, bounded click ripples, audio, and FFT energy shape the motion and geometry.","hash":"6bc82235abe78006","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-nebula-light-trail-swarm","name":"Nebula Light-Trail Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","particles","trails","glow","audio","generative","space"],"description":"Photon-like particles race through the scene leaving glowing, fading trails that pulse with audio. Creates a constantly reforming nebula.","hash":"7f1f4482ff8b2061","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-nebular-chrono-astrolabe","name":"Nebular Chrono Astrolabe","category":"generative","tags":["generative","nebula","astrolabe","raymarching","fbm","domain-warping","curl-noise","fresnel","beer-lambert","audio-reactive","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A cosmic nebula astrolabe with concentric FBM-domain-warped rings, volumetric curl-noise clouds, satellite box structures, Fresnel-Schlick reflections, Beer-Lambert attenuation, and audio-reactive gravity wells. Mouse bends spacetime.","hash":"65b9b3a12d76d6dc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-acid-geometry","name":"Neon Acid Geometry","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","geometry","acid","morphing","additive","shapes","ph-science","chemistry"],"description":"Geometric shapes (triangles, hexagons, circles) morphing and melting in psychedelic neon. Upgraded with universal-indicator pH color science: geometry edges glow with realistic acid/base transitions driven by bass oscillation. Critical-angle refraction distortion, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and ACE","hash":"98daa1572d3cbeaf","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-cyber-mandala","name":"Neon Cyber Mandala","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","mandala","geometric","sacred-geometry","rainbow","generative","golden-ratio","fibonacci"],"description":"A slowly rotating mandala made of neon geometric shapes including rings, stars, and polygons. Each ring features a different decorative pattern - dots, radiating lines, zigzags, waves, and diamonds. Bright neon rainbow gradients cycle through colors. Connecting threads pulse with energy. Floating particles orbit the de","hash":"3ff4c5b7b7284525","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-lotus","name":"Neon Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["lotus","flower","neon","generative","audio-reactive","colorful","abstract","psychedelic"],"description":"A blooming neon lotus flower with layered petals unfolding in real-time. Bass swells the bloom, mids shift the chromatic glow, treble adds iridescent shimmer on each petal edge.","hash":"6c456f3a4774e47a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-neural-network","name":"Neon Neural Network","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","network","glow","signals","data-flow","generative","neural","relu","ai","abstract"],"description":"A glowing neon neural network visualization enriched with ReLU activation mathematics. Neurons fire using R(x)=max(0,x) thresholds. Bass drives input layer activation intensity. Mids control synaptic connection strength. Treble adds backpropagation error glow as red halos along edges. Network layers visualized as conce","hash":"2b085c47a6d727fd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-plasma-biomechanical-hive","name":"Neon-Plasma Biomechanical Hive","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","neon","organic","plasma","audio-reactive","cyberpunk"],"description":"A hyper-organic, biomechanical labyrinth of pulsing neon circuitry and breathing metallic tissue that spawns luminescent plasma-spores reacting to ambient cosmic frequencies. Upgraded (fast-motion batch): the spores now swarm at speed with spring-damped cursor pursuit and velocity lead, bass kicks and clicks fire bound","hash":"3b01d43098ec1f5a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-snowfall","name":"Neon Snowfall","category":"generative","tags":["generative","snow","neon","particles","winter","audio-reactive"],"description":"Chromatic snow particles descend in luminous streaks with high-frequency treble twinkle.","hash":"1a0dd97140fa0d4d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-stellated-octahedron","name":"Neon Stellated Octahedron","category":"generative","tags":["generative","geometry","stellated","octahedron","star-tetrahedron","neon","kaleidoscope","audio-reactive"],"description":"A neon-lit stellated octahedron (star tetrahedron) — two interpenetrating tetrahedra with blazing rainbow edges and dual-color facet glow. Six-fold kaleidoscopic symmetry multiplies the geometry; bass pulses the star scale, treble ignites vertex spikes. Mouse spins the form through space.","hash":"cda964cd317d387e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-tropical-paradise","name":"Neon Tropical Paradise","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","tropical","nature","bioluminescent","aurora","sunset","ocean","ocean-optics","coral","fluorescence"],"description":"A psychedelic tropical paradise with stylized neon palm trees, aurora sky, glowing flowers, and bioluminescent water enriched with ocean light attenuation physics. Hot pinks, electric blues, neon greens, sunset oranges. Mouse creates ripples in the water and sways the trees. Stars twinkle in a psychedelic sky. Surface ","hash":"5a07e247ad274a49","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-bioluminescence-matrix","name":"Neural Bioluminescence Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","matrix","bioluminescence","neural"],"description":"A pulsing, infinite organic matrix of glowing synthetic neurons firing quantum light impulses across a void, merging biological growth with cybernetic circuitry.","hash":"4110b0664d6b7689","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-dust","name":"Neural Dust","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","particles","dust","neural","noise","glow","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Dr