"},{"id":"gen-prism-tide","name":"Prism Tide","category":"generative","tags":["generative","prismatic","interference","waves","audio-reactive","colorful","caustics","dispersion","atmospheric"],"description":"Refractive chroma tides form spectral wavefronts and foam-like interference crests. Enhanced with prism dispersion, animated caustics, Mie scattering haze, OkLab color mixing, split-tone grading, and ACES filmic tone mapping.","hash":"f5bc37418ff84fa5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-aether-loom","name":"Prismatic Aether-Loom","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","strings","iridescent","audio-reactive"],"description":"A warp-flight weaving machine of iridescent light, velocity-aligned spectral threads, click-launched shuttle waves, and bounded radial braid trails.","hash":"66f5bca2b8a79b95","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-bismuth-lattice","name":"Prismatic Bismuth Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["crystalline","iridescent","fractal","geometric","audio-reactive","alpha-transmission","physical","audio","music"],"description":"Endlessly folding hyper-geometric expanse of iridescent bismuth crystals with physical light transmission. Features thin-film interference, metallic Fresnel reflection, and oxide layer transmission.","hash":"07e27ec727b04160","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-crystal-growth","name":"Prismatic Crystal Growth","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","prismatic","glass","fresnel","growth","sdf"],"description":"SDF crystal lattice that grows over time with Fresnel reflectance for glass-like translucency. Alpha encodes crystal thickness — thin edges are transparent, thick centers opaque. Audio drives growth rate and crystal rotation.","hash":"b27b83e25528dd87","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-aether-void-kitsune","name":"Prismatic Cyber-Aether Void-Kitsune","category":"generative","tags":["kitsune","cybernetic","prismatic","aether","volumetric","fractal","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","tessellation","kaleidoscopic","geometry"],"description":"A hyper-majestic cybernetic celestial kitsune of shattered prismatic glass and liquid quantum-aether, hex-rune-etched armor and octahedral shoulder crystals, orbited by a prismatic shard swarm and stacked auroral torus rings, its nine radiant tails carving rifts into a kaleidoscopically folded volumetric particle-storm","hash":"33284c4f18764717","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-aurora-astral-dragonfly","name":"Prismatic Cyber-Aurora Astral-Dragonfly","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic biomechanical dragonfly forged from liquid auroral plasma and shattered chromatic crystal.","hash":"473150c757a879b0","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-auroral-manta-swarm","name":"Prismatic Cyber-Auroral Manta-Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["aurora","swarm","organic","cyber","plasma","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, hyper-dimensional ocean of auroral plasma where a synchronized swarm of glowing, cyber-organic manta rays glide and ripple in perfect unison with deep ambient acoustic bass drops.","hash":"3b69a2816f5101a4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-chrono-nebula-peacock","name":"Prismatic Cyber-Chrono Nebula-Peacock","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","mechanical","peacock","audio-reactive","fractal"],"description":"A hyper-majestic, biomechanical celestial peacock woven from shattered quantum glass and glowing liquid-aurora.","hash":"4f91d0a6886da3f5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-chrono-void-kitsune","name":"Prismatic Cyber-Chrono Void-Kitsune","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","kitsune","quantum","crystal","organic","mechanical","audio-reactive","volumetric"],"description":"A hyper-majestic, nine-tailed cybernetic space-fox woven from shattering prismatic quantum glass and glowing liquid-aurora.","hash":"dd9a98ab300b3d04","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-prismatic-cyber-chrono-void-tortoise","name":"Pri