ck and self-organize into luminous geometric mandalas, reacting violently to acoustic frequencies. Optimized: 4-tap scalar-potential curl flow, HDR feedback chain, generated depth.","hash":"2683ff7930925d05","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-fluorescent-nebula-anemone","name":"Quantum-Fluorescent Nebula-Anemone","category":"generative","tags":["organic","nebula","quantum","particles","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-organic, glowing cosmic sea-anemone suspended in a volumetric deep-space nebula, whose translucent quantum tentacles ripple and mathematically divide in perfect sync with ambient acoustic frequencies.","hash":"e3b09bd97b959d24","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-foam-alpha","name":"Quantum Foam Alpha","category":"generative","tags":["quantum","foam","probability","uncertainty","particles","translucent"],"description":"Particle positions rendered as quantum probability clouds with uncertainty-based alpha translucency. Audio drives vacuum fluctuations and pair creation; mouse measurement collapses the wavefunction.","hash":"48d5d4ddf3958c8a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-foam","name":"Quantum Foam","category":"generative","tags":["quantum","foam","cellular","abstract","audio-reactive","generative","cosmic","procedural","lod-scaling","blue-noise","hdr-ready"],"description":"Performance-optimized Worley-noise quantum vacuum. A frame-budget-aware Detail slider drives octave count, while blue-noise jitter and a branchless 3x3 Worley kernel keep bubbles smooth and cheap. Bilinear temporal feedback trails previous frames through dataTextureC, and HDR/aux data are chained out via dataTextureA/B","hash":"d34b42d6ec9ba43a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-liquid-gold-cymatic-vortex","name":"Quantum Liquid-Gold Cymatic-Vortex","category":"generative","tags":["liquid","gold","vortex","cymatic","audio-reactive","metallic"],"description":"","hash":"7d2a4fd285a7956f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-liquid-metal-chronosphere","name":"Quantum Liquid-Metal Chronosphere","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"eee9b79444489ac1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-mycelial-neural-web","name":"Quantum Mycelial Neural Web","category":"generative","tags":["organic","network","volumetric","mycelial","bioluminescence","raymarching"],"description":"An emergent, bioluminescent network of mycelial structures that pulses and evolves like a cosmic brain, bridging organic growth patterns with quantum probabilistic entanglement.","hash":"1a3ca03bb867492a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-mycelium","name":"Quantum Mycelium","category":"generative","tags":["organic","microscopic","fungal","network","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A hyper-organic, microscopic journey through an infinitely growing, glowing fungal network that pulses with data-like energy and branches dynamically based on spatial noise.","hash":"f7bd8f6bd88d0865","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-neural-lace","name":"Quantum Neural Lace","category":"generative","tags":["cyber","network","3d","raymarching","scifi","glowing","lattice","audio","music"],"description":"Crystalline quantum lattice with pulsating fiber-optic strands. Warp-flight camera conveyor, traveling pulse packets along lattice fibers, and advected HDR trails. Pulse Speed drives packet velocity; Energy Level controls glow; Fiber Chaos warps strand distortion. Mouse orbits the camera.","hash":"a6397b48057109dd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-pollen","name":"Quantum Pollen","category":"generative","tags":["generative","particles","pollen","organic","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","feedback","bloom","depth-aware","video-feedback"],"description":"Bioluminescent pollen swarms drift through layered, domain-warped fields. Mouse gravity wells pull pollen into orbit, clicks inject explosive bursts, and audio drives scale, morph speed, and sparkle. Incoming video luminance seeds new particles, while motion-vector advection and temporal decay create emergent, living t","hash":"51d91438875ea943","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-singularity-forge","name":"Quantum Singularity-Forge","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","quantum","gravity","fractal","audio-reactive","raymarched","black-hole","accretion-disk"],"description":"A colossal cosmic forge where swirling accretion disks of superheated stardust collide around a hyper-dense singularity, ejecting crystalline constellations in sync with bass frequencies.","hash":"0de611c9de8aa9bd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quantum-superposition","name":"Quantum Superposition Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["quantum","superposition","particles","wavefunction","probability","physics","generative","abstract","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Particles exist in quantum superposition — visible at multiple Lissajous-orbit positions simultaneously as Gaussian probability clouds. Mouse clicks collapse the wave function locally.","hash":"d6e08416d4e4414e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-quasicrystal","name":"Quasicrystal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","quasicrystal","symmetry","mathematical","procedural","audio","music","reactive","domain-warping","voronoi","fresnel","gem"],"description":"Penrose tiling-inspired quasicrystal patterns with n-fold symmetry using the projection method from higher-dimensional lattices. Upgraded with domain-warped FBM, Voronoi/Worley noise, Fresnel-Schlick gem surfaces, enhanced harmonics, and deep audio reactivity.","hash":"7ebdb14c0d18d20c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-radiant-chrono-glass-nautilus","name":"Radiant Chrono-Glass Nautilus","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","nautilus","chrono-glass","plasma","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"A hyper-organic, infinitely spiraling nautilus shell forged from refractive chrono-glass and glowing liquid-plasma.","hash":"b015ce737aad43bf","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-radiant-cyber-bismuth-nebula-colossus","name":"Radiant Cyber-Bismuth Nebula-Colossus","category":"generative","tag