gory":"generative","tags":["cosmic","moth","quantum","crystal","organic","mechanical","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, colossal cybernetic space moth floating through a deep-space nebula, its wings woven from crystalline threads of frozen time and quantum aether-plasma that softly pulse and ripple in sync with ambient cosmic acoustics.","hash":"c836f64c0450928a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-void-silk-nebula","name":"Sentient Void-Silk Nebula","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-dimensional fluid simulation that weaves iridescent void silk threads.","hash":"d118c7fe80feb51d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-crystalline-pulse","name":"Crystalline Pulse","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","crystal","geometric","voronoi","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract","diamond-lattice","phonon","bravais"],"description":"Geometric crystal formations based on diamond cubic Bravais lattice structure with phonon pulse propagation. FCC lattice positions, acoustic phonon frequency ω = 2√(k/m)|sin(ka/2)|, bass-driven vibration, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and mouse lattice defect injection create a scientifically-grounded","hash":"def5fb01b7234674","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-kinetic-bloom","name":"Kinetic Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","flower","mandala","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","geometric","organic","upgraded-rgba"],"description":"Geometric flower mandala with damped harmonic oscillator physics. Each petal is a spring-mass system: ζ from mids, ω₀ from bass, underdamped motion x(t)=e^(-ζω₀t)cos(ωt). Bloom cycles triggered by bass. Temporal feedback, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"b37316b7fd795912","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-nebula-core","name":"Nebula Core","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","nebula","space","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract","atmospheric","balmer-series","astrophysics"],"description":"Deep-space nebula with organic plasma clouds enriched by Wolfram Alpha Hydrogen Balmer Series astrophysics data. H-alpha dominates core, H-beta fills mid regions. Bass drives ionization front expansion. Mouse seeds new star formation.","hash":"dde898d05e48e06e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sierpinski-tetrahedron","name":"Sierpinski Tetrahedron","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","sierpinski","tetrahedron","3d","geometric","jewel","metallic"],"description":"3D Sierpinski tetrahedron rendered as a 2D projection with multi-orbit trap coloring (vertex, edge, shell). Domain-warped FBM distorts the view, jewel-tone palette with metallic sheen, HDR specular highlights, and audio-reactive recursion depth.","hash":"086afd5676cbbca4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-silica-tsunami","name":"Silica Tsunami","category":"generative","tags":["generative","raymarching","glass","refraction","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","click-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"A slow-motion wave of refractive glass-like particles that crests and shatters, dynamically reshaping around the mouse and reacting to audio amplitude.","hash":"d6e369c9d2151c33","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-singularity-forge","name":"Singularity Forge","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","black-hole","gravity","plasma","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A gravity-warped stellar forge with relativistic accretion shear, ballistic jet knots, mouse lensing, and bounded angular light trails driven by live audio.","hash":"7680a87797904d0d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-solar-wind-ribbons","name":"Solar Wind Ribbons","category":"generative","tags":["solar","aurora","ribbons","plasma","generative","audio-reactive","cosmic","abstract"],"description":"Magnetised plasma ribbons stream like coronal mass ejections caught mid-flight. Bass swells ribbon width, treble brightens edges, mouse steers the aurora curtain.","hash":"3dafdd026421e687","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sonic-lava-flow","name":"Sonic Lava Flow","category":"generative","tags":["artistic","generative","fluid","lava","molten","volumetric"],"description":"Navier-Stokes-style fluid solver with domain-warped FBM, Voronoi crust detail, Beer-Lambert volumetric glow, Fresnel molten surface, enhanced curl noise, and deep audio reactivity creating a living molten world.","hash":"ef20128932bfdefc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sonoluminescent-chrono-geode-matrix","name":"Sonoluminescent Chrono-Geode Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["geode","plasma","fractal","temporal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A colossal, infinitely shattering crystalline geode that fractures to reveal a violently erupting sonoluminescent plasma core. Fast-motion upgrade: closed-form orbital camera with eased time-warp spin, sonoluminescent flash-burst physics (bubble-collapse cycles with ballistic shockwave shells), bass-transient kick burs","hash":"04f269f6672b43b6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-spectral-ferrofluid","name":"Spectral Ferrofluid","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","magnetic","organic","spikes","translucent","field-lines"],"description":"Magnetic ferrofluid simulation with field-strength alpha translucency and audio-reactive spikes. Mouse acts as a magnetic source while temporal feedback creates organic fluid memory.","hash":"4836d2ce57da8a2b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stable-fluids-jos-stam","name":"Stable Fluids (Jos Stam)","category":"generative","tags":["fluid","simulation","dye","smoke","pressure","navier-stokes","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Classic stable fluids solver with pressure projection. Velocity advection, force application, divergence estimation, Jacobi pressure solve, gradient subtraction, dye advection, and audio-reactive color mapping.","hash":"d1f3b067d62a01dc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stardust-nebula","name":"Stardust Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","space","stars","generative","audio-reactive","cosmic","abstract","atmospheric"],"description":"A stellar nursery in HII emission colours: curl-noise gas clouds, dark absorption pillars, and proto-star sparkle. Bass swells the pillars of creation, treble ignites new suns.","hash":"98f803b0b5792ac5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-acoustic-resonance-manifold","name":"Stellar-Acoustic Resonance-Manifold","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"c27302e9514697a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-plasma-ouroboros","name":"Stellar Plasma-Ouroboros","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"An infinite, self-consuming mechanical serpent made of fractured glass scales and stellar plasma.","hash":"d743cc8e971dc4e4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-web-loom","name":"Stellar Web-Loom","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","neuro","plasma","volumetric","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional cosmic loom weaving infinite tendrils of starlight and plasma silk across a dark void, blending organic neuro-network vibes with vast, mechanical astrophysics. Upgraded for fast motion: warp-flight camera driven by Weave Speed, radial speed-line streaks, clamped HDR feedback light-trails, bass-trans","hash":"07ce5596e0aabd09","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-strange-field-flow","name":"Strange Field Flow","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","attractor","chaos","colorful","acid","neon","flow","generative","abstract","fractal"],"description":"A strange-attractor flow field blending Peter de Jong and Clifford attractor maps. Each pixel evaluates iterated orbit density and paints acid-neon whorls. Attractor coefficients pulse to bass and treble, morphing the topology. Temporal persistence burns psychedelic trails.","hash":"3cd54b4987c33f44","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-string-theory","name":"String Theory","category":"generative","tags":["generative","physics","waves","harmonics","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A stylized standing-wave string ensemble with harmonic modes, sprung mouse plucking, click resonance shells, audio excitation, temporal trails, and generated relief depth.","hash":"848d965c75437347","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-superfluid-quantum-foam","name":"Superfluid Quantum-Foam","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","fluid","audio-reactive","raymarching","volumetric","mouse-driven","click-reactive","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A mesmerizing, hyper-turbulent ocean of boiling quantum probability foam, where iridescent hyper-bubbles merge and burst in sync with audio frequencies, releasing flashes of raw cosmic energy.","hash":"a08da4cc904abf03","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-supernova-remnant","name":"Supernova Remnant","category":"generative","tags":["generative","nebula","physics","space","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Expanding shell structures with shockwave physics and Rayleigh-Taylor instability patterns, inspired by Hubble nebula images","hash":"f5ccaec2c888d92f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-chrono-mycelium-engine","name":"Symbiotic Chrono-Mycelium Engine","category":"generative","tags":["organic","mechanical","mycelium","audio-reactive","quantum","plasma"],"description":"A hyper-organic, ever-evolving cybernetic mycelial network that metabolizes temporal energy, pulsing with luminescent plasma as it entwines around a central quantum gear.","hash":"f860d6bb23984001","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-cyber-fungal-core-reactor","name":"Symbiotic Cyber-Fungal Core-Reactor","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","mycelium","quantum","volumetric","reaction-diffusion"],"description":"A biomechanical network of luminescent mycelium feeding off the chaotic energy of a fractured quantum singularity. Upgraded with a spring-smoothed mouse gravity-well attractor that steers fungal growth, click-spawned spore-burst shockwaves with bounded energy, hold-to-mutate surges, real audio reactivity (bass/mids/tre","hash":"030ca5ebba1d0287","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-cyber-mycelium","name":"Symbiotic Cyber-Mycelium","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","organic","cyberpunk","mycelium","neon","sdf"],"description":"A mesmerizing descent into a synthetic fungal network where glowing bioluminescent fibers transmit digital pulses between pulsating data-nodes. It bridges the gap between organic growth algorithms and rigid, luminous cybernetic aesthetics.","hash":"7de79d49158910e2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-light-networks","name":"Symbiotic Light Networks","category":"generative","tags":["generative","network","bioluminescent","organic","light-transport","audio-reactive","procedural","music"],"description":"A network of light-conducting organic structures that grow, compete, and support each other while transporting and transforming light in complex ways. Audio influences light color, intensity, and transmission rules. Mouse seeds or prunes the network. Bioluminescent organic networks with complex internal light transport","hash":"e5295c48f1907f1f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-plasma-reef-matrix","name":"Symbiotic Plasma-Reef Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","ocean","bioluminescent","plasma","audio-reactive","raymarched","coral","deep-sea"],"description":"A hyper-vibrant deep-sea reef of fractal coral structures and bioluminescent plasma that pulsates with rhythmic audio, swarming with microscopic glowing entities.","hash":"a37d79202445a8ec","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-tectonic-plasma-crucible","name":"Tectonic Plasma-Crucible","category":"generative","tags":["magma","obsidian","fractal","lava","audio-reactive","tectonic","voronoi","raymarched"],"description":"A violently shifting landscape of cooling obsidian geometric slabs floating on a turbulent, audio-reactive ocean of blinding-hot plasma magma that constantly fractures, erupts, and reshapes itself.","hash":"8329ec14300e64b9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-temporal-motion-smear","name":"Temporal Motion Smear","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","motion","smear","trails","frame-differencing","audio","music"],"description":"Motion-aware temporal smearing using frame differencing and directional blur, creating colorful trails that follow moving objects","hash":"ead088b8ac99323d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-thermal-rainbow-topography","name":"Thermal Rainbow Topography","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","thermal","topography","terrain","contour","heatmap"],"description":"Topographic terrain visualization with thermal imaging color grading. Contour lines with neon glow trace evolving mountainous terrain rendered in a bright rainbow thermal palette from black through blue, cyan, green, yellow, red to white. Mouse creates glowing hot spots on the landscape. Upgraded (Batch 36): domain-war","hash":"01df75ffdf408de8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topological-acoustic-knots","name":"Topological Acoustic Knots","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topological","liquid-crystal","audio-reactive","flow-field","iridescent","abstract","music"],"description":"Orientational director field inspired by liquid crystals where audio frequencies drive topological defect creation, motion, and annihilation. Mouse can pin or create defects. Iridescent oil-slick coloring with flowing directional fields.","hash":"74a84041d15b8303","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topological-phase-weave","name":"Topological Phase Weave","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topology","liquid-crystal","nematic","defects","iridescent","procedural","audio","music","reactive","scientific","phase-transition","euler-characteristic"],"description":"A simulation of nematic liquid crystal fields where audio frequencies control topological defect creation, motion, and annihilation, producing mesmerizing swirling defect lattices with iridescent color mapping. Enriched with phase transition physics: bass drives an order parameter from disordered (warm chaotic weave) t","hash":"3dec04beff04d2c1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topology-flow","name":"Topology Flow","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topology","flow","mathematical","procedural","audio","music"],"description":"Topological surface flow visualization inspired by Morse theory, showing gradient flows converging and diverging at critical points","hash":"ac1f740993af2bf0","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-torus-knot-rainbow","name":"Torus Knot Rainbow","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","colorful","torus","knot","rainbow","3d","generative","abstract","neon","chromatic","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","fractal","julia","domain-warp","fbm"],"description":"An algorithmically deep (p,q) torus knot rendered as an analytic smooth-union SDF of capsules. Tube radius harmonically modulates with FBM domain warp, while a multi-orbit Julia trap adds iridescent halo detail. Audio drives the wind modulation, spin, and glow intensity; temporal feedback leaves rainbow trails. Depth-a","hash":"e1ab222ba01afce2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-translucent-nebula","name":"Translucent Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","volumetric","gas","stars","translucent","worley-noise"],"description":"Volumetric gas clouds with density-based alpha translucency. FBM and Worley noise create organic nebula structure where dense cores are opaque and edges fade to transparent. Star sparkle reacts to treble and nebula pulses with bass.","hash":"593ccdc366b5a5e5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-turing-morphogenesis","name":"Turing Morphogenesis","category":"generative","tags":["turing","reaction-diffusion","morphogenesis","organic","biological","patterns","generative","spots","stripes"],"description":"Alan Turing's reaction-diffusion morphogenesis simulated via deterministic activator-inhibitor fields. Evolves organic spot, stripe, and labyrinth patterns reminiscent of animal coats and coral growth. Bass modulates feed/kill parameters causing pattern morphing, mouse deposits new activator seeds, and depth controls p","hash":"49337608747e32ba","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-velocity-bloom","name":"Velocity Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","bloom","velocity","motion","glow","audio","music"],"description":"Velocity-sensitive bloom effect that intensifies on motion, creating multi-octave glow with white core and colored aura based on velocity. Upgraded 2026-08-05: Lucas-Kanade-style flow estimation with motion-aligned anamorphic streaks, curl-noise advected feedback trails, Gray-Scott-hint diffusion accumulation, audio pu","hash":"f85e69478ed2e220","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-verlet-cloth-wind","name":"Verlet Cloth Wind","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cloth","physics","fabric","wind","simulation","audio-reactive"],"description":"Verlet integration cloth simulation with wind forces, silk/fabric shading, anisotropic specular highlights, and audio-reactive gusts.","hash":"fc0c5b2da6891684","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vitreous-chrono-chandelier","name":"Vitreous Chrono-Chandelier","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","mechanical","audio-reactive","raymarching","glass","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"An infinite, abyssal cavern illuminated by a colossal, self-assembling chandelier of hyper-refractive glass chimes and glowing quantum pendulums that shatter and reform to the rhythm of time and sound.","hash":"158c0b2c18b02938","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vitreous-quantum-lotus-singularity","name":"Vitreous Quantum-Lotus Singularity","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","fractal","flower","refraction","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","thin-film","iridescent"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, translucent crystalline lotus flower continuously blooming and fracturing around a gravitational singularity. Upgraded with thin-film iridescence on the vitreous petals, per-petal cell color variation, symmetry-folded radial vein inlays pulsing with the music, an event-horizon core with photon ring","hash":"872a75ab3ffad765","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-void-harmonic-cymatic-resonator","name":"Void Harmonic Cymatic Resonator","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-dimensional sound-reactive sculpture that renders the visible form of acoustic frequencies in the void, resembling Chladni patterns suspended in dark matter.","hash":"650993074ec15d7d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-volcanic-ink","name":"Volcanic Ink","category":"generative","tags":["generative","volcanic","lava","ink","embers","audio-reactive","LOD","blue-noise","temporal-feedback","ACES","HDR-ready"],"description":"Molten fissures and soot plumes mix with blue-noise ember sparks in a dark volcanic ink basin. Now with resolution-aware LOD scaling, unrolled temporal blur, pipeline data slots, and HDR output.","hash":"afd87474d6caf26c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-von-karman-vortex","name":"Von Kármán Vortex Street","category":"generative","tags":["fluid-dynamics","vortex","karman","analytic","physics","audio-reactive"],"description":"Analytic vortex-street flow visualization. Ten alternating point-vortex pairs shed behind the mouse-driven obstacle; their combined streamfunction ψ = U·y + Σ ±(Γ/2π)·ln(r) produces isocontours tracing the classic Kármán street wake. Envelope-smoothed bass drives shedding speed and brightness pulses; mids morph vortex ","hash":"743f2863916c6522","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-voronoi-crystal","name":"Voronoi Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","voronoi","crystal","procedural","animated","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Animated Voronoi crystal growth with sprung seed refraction, audio-driven iridescence, click-fractured facets, temporal polish, and generated relief depth.","hash":"6a009940b175ca58","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vortex-cathedral","name":"Vortex Cathedral","category":"generative","tags":["generative","vortex","cathedral","radial","cosmic","audio-reactive","volumetric-god-rays","starburst-diffraction","chromatic-aberration","light-attenuation"],"description":"Spinning radial arches and sanctum rings form a gothic vortex illuminated by bass-lit cores. Enhanced with volumetric god rays, 6-pointed starburst diffraction spikes, chromatic aberration at edges, multi-layered sanctum glow, and realistic light attenuation.","hash":"f7f80fdcf906a497","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-wasm-hls-physarum-swarm","name":"WASM HLS Physarum Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["physarum","slime-mold","agent-based","swarm","video-reactive","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"A living swarm of physarum agents that trace organic paths across the screen, reacting to live video input as food, audio frequencies as steering pulses, and mouse movement as attraction points.","hash":"4d7109190f96110a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-worley-cellular-noise","name":"Worley Cellular Noise","category":"generative","tags":["cellular","worley","organic","tissue","biological","abstract","natural"],"description":"Worley cellular noise generating organic tissue-like patterns. Computes F1, F2, and cell boundaries with time-varying feature points, fBm variation, and subsurface scattering simulation.","hash":"e2aaf0245dc93500","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-xeno-botanical-synth-flora","name":"Xeno-Botanical Synth-Flora","category":"generative","tags":["organic","botanical","cybernetic","bioluminescent","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A dense, alien jungle of luminescent, synthetic flora that blooms and breathes with the rhythm of sound, blending organic curves with crystalline cybernetic materials.","hash":"4a9bf9eb8d14ee98","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-xeno-mycelial-resonance-web","name":"Xeno-Mycelial Resonance-Web","category":"generative","tags":["organic","mycelium","fractal","bioluminescent","audio-reactive","raymarching"],"description":"An infinite, subterranean expanse of bioluminescent, hyper-dimensional mycelium that rhythmically pulses, grows, and interconnects its glowing neural networks in response to audio frequencies.","hash":"9db01174da766985","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-zeta-function-landscape","name":"Zeta Function Landscape","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mathematical","zeta","riemann","landscape","abstract","audio","music"],"description":"Critical-strip Riemann zeta landscape evaluated through a guarded Dirichlet-eta continuation. Magnitude creates height, near-zeros form valleys, click ripples refract the domain, and eight FFT regions voice the color field.","hash":"ac7941976867b64f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-capabilities","name":"System Monitor","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Cyberpunk system monitor demonstrating mouse inputs, time, and frame feedback.","hash":"9463f18bc400d639","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cyclic-automaton","name":"Greenberg-Hastings Automaton","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cellular-automaton","excitable-media","audio-reactive","waves"],"description":"Excitable cellular medium with firing, refractory cooling, bass-driven spontaneous ignition, directional held-mouse painting, and timestamp-bounded click wavefronts.","hash":"23a86ae783d27a4e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fluffy-raincloud","name":"Vorticity Raincloud","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","clouds","rain","storm","audio-reactive"],"description":"Audio-reactive cloudscape with curl-noise advection, buoyant thunderheads, Mie silver lining, and rain sheets driven by stored flow.","hash":"b83ac2a17b72fe75","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grid","name":"Domain-Warped FBM Grid","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","noise","grid","domain-warp","moire","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive domain-warped FBM grid with mouse gravity well, recursive moiré sub-grids, chromatic dispersion edges, and temporal motion blur.","hash":"03731c484789e6ff","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok41-mandelbrot","name":"Buddhabrot Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fractal","mandelbrot","buddhabrot","nebula","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Buddhabrot orbit accumulation with bass-breathing sample count, mids hue shift, treble sparkle stars, mouse-driven panning, orbital rainbow trails, and ACES temporal accumulation.","hash":"cc789aa2120f4fd1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok41-plasma","name":"Spherical Harmonics Plasma","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","sphere","atmosphere","spherical-harmonics","gas-giant","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive 3D gas giant using Y(l,m) spherical harmonics with HDR ACES tone mapping, Rayleigh limb scattering, mouse-driven light, and treble-triggered lightning tendrils.","hash":"1525a34b6b871509","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok4-life","name":"SmoothLife Predator-Prey","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","simulation","life","predator-prey","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"Two-species SmoothLife cellular automaton with Lotka-Volterra predator-prey dynamics. Species A (green prey) uses Rafler 2011 birth/survival rules; species B (red predator) grows on prey density and decays without it. Audio bass drives prey birth-rate, treble drives predator decay, mids control coupling strength.","hash":"0307efd19a92b034","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok4-perlin","name":"Stratified Erosion Terrain","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","terrain","erosion","sediment","landscape","audio-reactive"],"description":"Depth-aware terrain with sediment transport, layered rock hardness, reflective valley water tables, wind abrasion, and bass-driven seismic uplift.","hash":"0d3b05555b4112c8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grokcf-interference","name":"Cylindrical Drum Modes","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cymatics","bessel","drum","audio-reactive","chladni","physics"],"description":"Vibrating circular membrane Bessel function modal synthesis: u_{mn} = J_m(α_{mn}·r/R)·cos(mφ)·cos(ω_{mn}·t). GPU polynomial Bessel J₀–J₃ (Abramowitz & Stegun). Audio bands activate mode families (bass→radial, mids→azimuthal, treble→higher-order). Chladni node-line colouring.","hash":"219362d1c09ea219","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grokcf-voronoi","name":"Worley Cellular","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","voronoi","cellular","worley","audio-reactive","thin-film","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Worley cellular fields with thin-film interference edge glow and micro-cosmic starfields hidden inside each cell.","hash":"0611510cb344e8b3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-warp","name":"Hyper Warp","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Advanced domain warping with fractal noise, etched warped contour lines, and flow-dispersed prismatic reaction-diffusion feedback.","hash":"20656da505a7e2bb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-julia-set","name":"Julia Set — Orbit Trap","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fractal","julia","orbit-trap","abstract","colorful"],"description":"Generalised Julia set iteration z^n+c for n=2..6 with smooth (continuous) iteration count μ=i−log₂(log₂|z|), multi-trap orbit colouring (circle, line, cross traps), and animated Julia parameter c orbiting a Mandelbrot cardioid boundary. Audio-driven trap scale.","hash":"28cfe651d61f0562","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kimi-crystal","name":"Kimi Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","crystal","ice","hexagonal","transmission","physical"],"description":"Animated crystalline structures growing on a hexagonal grid with physical light transmission. Features ice IOR-based Fresnel reflection, purity-based absorption, and variable crystal thickness.","hash":"8f42a9360837e621","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kimi-nebula","name":"Kimi Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Cosmic nebula cloud swirls with ethereal gas formations, twinkling stars, and mouse-driven stellar winds.","hash":"67f65f05fcf7c4bd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen_mandelbulb_3d","name":"Mandelbulb 3D","category":"generative","tags":["mandelbulb","fractal","3d","raymarch","orbits"],"description":"3D Mandelbulb fractal with ray marching, orbit trap coloring, soft shadows, and distance-based alpha for atmospheric depth","hash":"4718025f85e3dd12","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-orb","name":"Lorenz Strange Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","particles","mathematical-art","chaos","attractor","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Lorenz strange attractor (σ, ρ, β) with bioluminescent depth halos and persistent scent trails. Mids drive rotation, bass adds streams, treble jitters chaos.","hash":"73711485d7d6d08a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-psychedelic-spiral","name":"Superformula Spirograph Spiral","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","audio","music","reactive","spirograph","spiral","fractal-floral"],"description":"Superformula-driven spirograph spiral with nested epicycles, audio-reactive petal modulation, mouse-centered orbit drift, and temporal feedback warping.","hash":"0a707940f37318d3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen_quantum_foam","name":"Quantum Foam","category":"generative","tags":["quantum","generative","entanglement","volumetric","hdr"],"description":"Quantum vacuum fluctuation visualization with virtual particle pairs, entanglement webs, and HDR volumetric glow","hash":"939502c4c3e6be43","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-rainbow-smoke","name":"Rainbow Smoke with Dual Scattering","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","smoke","audio-reactive","scattering","volumetric"],"description":"Multi-scale rainbow smoke with vorticity confinement, buoyancy, Rayleigh edge glow, and Mie-lit cores driven by bass and treble.","hash":"181b7bec8ab1d441","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-reaction-diffusion","name":"FitzHugh-Nagumo Excitable Media","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","reaction-diffusion","excitable-media","audio-reactive","waves"],"description":"Dual-mode excitable media: Gray-Scott morphogenesis or FitzHugh-Nagumo action-potential waves with mouse/current injection and bass-triggered pulses.","hash":"9ae2dddc2a67e053","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-trails","name":"Boids Flocking","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","flocking","particles","boids","trails","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Reynolds boids flocking with bass-driven panic, mids cohesion, treble flash bursts, mouse attraction, motion-blur streaks, and pheromone trails.","hash":"dfa4dfe8c9c12f23","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-wave-equation","name":"Fluid Ripples","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","liquid","waves","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive water ripple simulation with wave interference. Bass amplifies wave energy and mouse-driven pulses. Parameters control intensity, speed, scale, and damping detail.","hash":"029c861ff92e751d","embedding":""},{"id":"generative-psy-swirls","name":"Psychedelic Swirls","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","swirl","psychedelic","chromatic","temporal","audio-reactive","vortex","rainbow"],"description":"Multi-layer polar swirl vortex with chromatic hue separation per layer, temporal swirl accumulation, audio-driven twist modulation, HSV rainbow cycles, and ripple glow trails.","hash":"8fc9c17c580dabf4","embedding":""},{"id":"generative-turing-veins","name":"Turing Veins Generative","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","turing","veins","organic","chromatic","audio-reactive","temporal","bioluminescence"],"description":"Multiscale reaction-diffusion Turing patterns generating organic vein/network structures with bioluminescent glow, chromatic activator/inhibitor separation, temporal colony evolution via dataTextureC, and audio-driven feed rate modulation.","hash":"9ea689c972fec066","embedding":""},{"id":"gravito-phononic-accretion","name":"Gravito-Phononic Accretion","category":"generative","tags":["gravitational","accretion","cosmic","organic","audio-reactive","lensing","blackbody","HDR"],"description":"SPH density estimation around orbiting accretors with cubic-spline kernel, shock-wave detection, and temperature-based blackbody coloring. Bass adds mass to primaries, mids drive orbital precession, treble creates acoustic standing waves. Mouse introduces a rogue body with tidal forces. Ripples seed density perturbatio","hash":"4dc72a9dbf85e6e6","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-crystal","name":"Holographic Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","crystal","holographic","prismatic","interference","audio-reactive"],"description":"Crystal facet interference patterns with rainbow holographic shifts. Mouse tilts the crystal lattice.","hash":"15f69499e2febec4","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-entropy-vortex","name":"Holographic Entropy Vortex","category":"generative","tags":["vortex","holographic","entropy","iridescent","atmospheric","audio-reactive"],"description":"A swirling entropy vortex with holographic color shifts, iridescent thin-film interference, and atmospheric depth.","hash":"c5279b8ee26c3717","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic_interference","name":"Holographic Interference","category":"generative","tags":["holographic","interference","rainbow","diffraction","temporal","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","speckle","generative"],"description":"Laser interference pattern simulation with multiple coherent sources, object beam and reference beam phase accumulation, speckle pattern, chromatic dispersion on holographic fringes, HDR bloom, and ACES tone mapping. Bass drives reference beam angle, mouse moves the virtual object, depth controls holographic parallax.","hash":"3ea1a973b5042ce4","embedding":""},{"id":"hyperbolic-crystal-symbiosis","name":"Hyperbolic Crystal Symbiosis","category":"generative","tags":["hyperbolic","crystalline","symbiosis","geometric","audio-reactive","abstract","iridescent","reaction-diffusion","ripple","drift","chromatic","interactive","kaleidoscope","audio-palette","smin","hybrid"],"description":"Voronoi crystal facets on a true Poincaré disk with geodesic distance and Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion. Kaleidoscope symmetry mirrors the domain into audio-reactive sectors, while an audio-driven palette shifts crystal hues with bass, mids and treble. Iridescent thin-film coloring on facet edges with HDR bloom at trip","hash":"a7a67aadc999cc80","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive_neural_swarm","name":"Neural Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["neural","network","swarm","interactive","neon","biological"],"description":"Agent-based neural network visualization with signal propagation, connection weights, and emergent activation patterns","hash":"cb26f226e059e6b4","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi_flock_symphony","name":"Kimi Flock Symphony","category":"generative","tags":["boids","flocking","generative","particles","musical","interactive","procedural"],"description":"Advanced particle flocking simulation with musical visualization, featuring separation, alignment, cohesion, and mouse interaction.","hash":"8b5aca8ac04301d0","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-fractal-dreams","name":"Kimi Fractal Dreams","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Multi-layer fractal with orbit traps, burning ship variant, and smooth color cycling.","hash":"2d9a41ab474c1866","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-nebula-depth","name":"Kimi Nebula Depth","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Halftone dot and Sobel edge ink-stipple effect: posterized luma rendered as resolution-independent dots with ink outlines, paper grain, and a mouse-driven vignette.","hash":"de29da041bc178d4","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-quantum-field","name":"Kimi Quantum Field","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Wave interference patterns with uncertainty visualization and probability densities.","hash":"1ecb5bfbaf26cb52","embedding":""},{"id":"lava-lamp-blobs","name":"Lava Lamp Blobs","category":"generative","tags":["generative","lava","metaballs","organic","retro","audio-reactive"],"description":"Metaball lava blobs rise and merge with chromatic warm-cool color shifts and audio-reactive heat.","hash":"69ed8e9ed2dc6707","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid_crystal_birefringence","name":"Liquid Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["interactive","cursor","liquid-crystal","birefringence","polarization","optics","lcd","interference"],"description":"Twisted-nematic cell between crossed polarizers. The analyzer now obeys Malus's law and rotates toward a held pointer, producing the dark extinction brushes real liquid-crystal microscopy shows — previously no analyzer existed at all, so the effect's most recognisable feature could not appear. Transmitted light relaxes","hash":"fb585155fda72e06","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid_magnetic_ferro","name":"Magnetic Ferrofluid","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","magnetic","liquid","interactive","metallic"],"description":"Interactive ferrofluid simulation with magnetic field lines, Rosensweig instability spike formation, and metallic iridescent rendering","hash":"a807540ed1a1f58d","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-flux-garden","name":"Magnetic Flux Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","magnetic","ferrofluid","fields","organic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Ferrofluid-like magnetic field lines curve between cursor poles, blooming with organic turbulence and treble seeds.","hash":"978ea29d145206e9","embedding":""},{"id":"molten-gold","name":"Molten Gold","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","gold","liquid","metal","molten","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract"],"description":"Molten gold liquid metal effect with flowing fBM noise. Hypnotic idle animation with satisfying mouse claim interaction. Audio-reactive: bass fuels glow, treble adds specular highlights, mid drives ripple shimmer.","hash":"8b9a2dcb5685671b","embedding":""},{"id":"morphogenic-resonance","name":"Morphogenic Resonance","category":"generative","tags":["generative","organic","geometric","morphing","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","abstract","biological"],"description":"Organic shapes that morph between geometric and biological forms via sinusoidal interpolation. Closed-form morph-field conveyor, traveling resonance rings, and advected HDR trails. Bass drives morph speed, mids add surface ripple resonance, treble creates smooth edge discharge. Mouse warps the morph field.","hash":"9f853ab175b28c6f","embedding":""},{"id":"multi-scale-evolutionary-cellular-gardens","name":"Multi-Scale Evolutionary Cellular Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["cellular-automata","evolutionary","organic","garden","audio-reactive","emergent"],"description":"Two competing cellular species whose growth rules slowly evolve under audio pressure. The garden changes its fundamental behavior over time while remaining visually coherent.","hash":"c8d02f61b19fc1fa","embedding":""},{"id":"mycelium-network","name":"Mycelium Network","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mycelium","fungal","network","branching","nutrients","pulse","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"Underground fungal hyphae network with pulsing nutrient flows traveling along branches. Audio triggers bright nutrient pulses.","hash":"c9b7863a9a11d651","embedding":""},{"id":"nebula-gyroid","name":"Nebula Gyroid","category":"generative","tags":["generative","gyroid","raymarch","iridescent","organic","nebula","sdf","fluid","geometry","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Ethereal, flowing organic form created with raymarched gyroid SDFs. Features iridescent lighting, multiple blended gyroid layers, and mouse-reactive domain warping for a fluid geometry effect.","hash":"6fea51330c04ea3e","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-fern-garden","name":"Neon Fern Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fern","garden","organic","neon","nature","audio-reactive","chromatic","temporal","growth"],"description":"Procedurally generated fern fronds unfurling in neon colors against dark soil. Bass drives growth animation, mids control frond density, treble creates dewdrop sparkles. Mouse attracts or repels frond tips.","hash":"32168a9d75198de9","embedding":""},{"id":"neural-mandala","name":"Neural Mandala","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mandala","geometric","network","nodes","audio-reactive","pulsing","abstract"],"description":"Concentric geometric rings with interconnected node networks that pulse and evolve. Audio drives ring expansion and node brightness.","hash":"3c5809120f9326dc","embedding":""},{"id":"neural-synapse-web","name":"Neural Synapse Web","category":"generative","tags":["generative","neural","synapse","network","cybernetic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Pulsing neural nodes and synaptic signals with guarded six-float spring state, uniform bounded click waves, live plasma audio, exact display history, ACES, semantic alpha, and source depth.","hash":"da4e3b29ead53b6c","embedding":""},{"id":"phase-memory-weave","name":"Phase Memory Weave","category":"generative","tags":["viscous","memory","phase","material","audio-reactive","abstract","opalescent","caustics"],"description":"Authoritative Ginzburg-Landau state packed as psiR, psiI, slow memory, and activity, with exact center/neighbor loads, sprung thermal focus, bounded click phase fronts, opalescent ACES display, semantic alpha, and source depth.","hash":"01a1ee58d69c668d","embedding":""},{"id":"phosphorescent-jellyfish","name":"Phosphorescent Jellyfish","category":"generative","tags":["generative","bioluminescent","organic","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","underwater"],"description":"Glowing jellyfish with trailing tentacle bioluminescence. Bass pulses the bell contraction, mids create tentacle wave motion, treble adds individual photophore sparkles. Mouse attracts the jellyfish swarm.","hash":"66997d9d4d964cd0","embedding":""},{"id":"plasma-jet-stream","name":"Plasma Jet Stream","category":"generative","tags":["generative","plasma","jets","energy","physics","audio-reactive"],"description":"High-energy plasma jets radiate from center with bass-driven intensity, mids-driven spread, and treble sparks.","hash":"f8afcbb630db518e","embedding":""},{"id":"plasma-orb","name":"Plasma Orb","category":"generative","tags":["plasma","electric","orb","generative","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","glow","arcs","mhd","tokamak","magnetic-reconnection","synchrotron"],"description":"Magnetohydrodynamic plasma orb with tokamak-style field lines, Alfvén waves, magnetic reconnection flares, and synchrotron emission. Audio drives plasma temperature and field chaos; mouse pinches the orb. Depth controls field line density perspective.","hash":"ef1a3cb53027faeb","embedding":""},{"id":"psy-swirls","name":"Psychedelic Rainbow Swirls","category":"generative","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generative swirling vortex fields with multi-layer procedural noise flow, spectral rainbow HSV cycles from polar angles, temporal twisting, and psychedelic distortion. Mouse attracts swirls; ripples spawn color bursts.","hash":"e4d073dda3238fd9","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-foam-lattice","name":"Quantum Foam Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["generative","quantum","foam","lattice","crystalline","audio-reactive","chromatic","abstract","futuristic","particles"],"description":"Quantum foam visualization: bubbling vacuum fluctuations forming a crystalline lattice that pulses to bass. Mids drive lattice distortions, treble creates sparkles at node intersections. Mouse warps the lattice locally.","hash":"5df3fbae8606087d","embedding":""},{"id":"recursive-ancestral-terrains","name":"Recursive Ancestral Terrains","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","terrain","evolutionary","ancestral","organic","exploration"],"description":"A fractal landscape where different ancestral 'lineages' of terrain rules coexist. Moving the mouse selects which generational traits are expressed in different regions, revealing the evolutionary history of the land.","hash":"52cb67d734d1bb5f","embedding":""},{"id":"retro_phosphor_dream","name":"Phosphor Dream","category":"generative","tags":["crt","retro","phosphor","analog","vintage"],"description":"Authentic CRT simulation with RGB phosphor triads, persistence afterglow, interlaced flicker, barrel distortion, and chromatic aberration","hash":"72ee5e99e89c7281","embedding":""},{"id":"sacred-geometry-torus","name":"Sacred Geometry Torus","category":"generative","tags":["generative","sacred-geometry","torus","golden-ratio","phi","cosmic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Golden ratio torus knots and sacred geometry nodes rotate in layered phi-harmonic patterns driven by bass.","hash":"41ece74df398071c","embedding":""},{"id":"sand-dunes","name":"Sand Dunes","category":"generative","tags":["generative","desert","dunes","sand","landscape","wind","audio-reactive","nature","bagnold","physics","domain-warp","ggx","atmospheric"],"description":"Bagnold dune physics with domain-warped anisotropic fBm, GGX sun glints on grain faces, Rayleigh-Mie atmospheric haze, and temporal sand-drift feedback. Separation bubbles at crests, ripple superposition on slip faces, OkLab desert palette, subsurface scattering and HDR saltation sparkles. Audio drives wind migration, ","hash":"4ff735ec43892860","embedding":""},{"id":"solar-flare-cascade","name":"Solar Flare Cascade","category":"generative","tags":["generative","solar","flare","stellar","corona","space","audio-reactive","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"Solar prominence and flare cascades erupting from a stellar limb. Bass drives flare intensity, mids create magnetic loop structures, treble adds coronal mass ejection particles. Mouse position shifts the stellar limb.","hash":"bf1cd7c2a0b1f57f","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-analytic-noise-flow","name":"Analytic Noise Flow","category":"generative","tags":["analytic-derivatives","flow-field","noise","perlin","streamlines","curl"],"description":"Perlin noise with analytic derivatives for ultra-smooth flow fields. Gradient computed alongside noise value in single evaluation, eliminating finite-difference jitter for perfectly parallel streamlines.","hash":"44b58e1c60fe1134","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-distance-field-text","name":"Distance Field Text","category":"generative","tags":["SDF","distance-field","procedural-text","glyph","overlay","runes","audio-reactive","depth-aware","temporal-feedback","ACES","chromatic-aberration","HDR"],"description":"SDF-based procedural glyph overlay with audio-reactive domain warp, depth-aware shadows, temporal feedback trails, ACES tone mapping, and chromatic aberration. Generates abstract runes and symbols as signed distance fields with smooth scaling, glowing edges, and chromatic cycling.","hash":"65cc24293b53a2c4","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-quaternion-julia","name":"Quaternion Julia","category":"generative","tags":["quaternion","julia","fractal","4D","raymarching","morphing"],"description":"4D quaternion Julia set raymarched in real-time. The 4th dimension animates over time creating organic morphing fractal forms with orbit-trap coloring and physically-based lighting.","hash":"f85b2a19a96bc74c","embedding":""},{"id":"spore-galaxy","name":"Spore Galaxy","category":"generative","tags":["generative","galaxy","spores","organic","cosmic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Organic spore particles disperse in galactic spiral arms with bass-driven arm swell and treble sparkle.","hash":"ba67e731189668e2","embedding":""},{"id":"stellar-plasma","name":"Stellar Plasma","category":"generative","tags":["generative","procedural","nebula","cosmic","plasma","fbm","fluid","loops","domain-warping","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"An endlessly morphing procedural cosmos powered by domain-warped fractional brownian motion. Creates swirling, liquid-like cosmic nebulae with interactive mouse gravity.","hash":"f12e50c0aa07b80a","embedding":""},{"id":"supernova-core","name":"Supernova Core","category":"generative","tags":["generative","supernova","space","explosion","rays","shockwave","audio-reactive","chromatic","physics","sedov-taylor","alpha","transmittance"],"description":"Sedov-Taylor blast wave with radioactive decay luminosity (56Ni->56Co->56Fe). Rayleigh-Taylor instability fingers and neutrino-driven convection cells. Blackbody cooling sequence with iron emission lines and chromatic aberration. Audio drives shock expansion. Mouse creates asymmetric ejecta. Depth controls light echo p","hash":"61d9eb94be8117f5","embedding":""},{"id":"supernova-remnant","name":"Supernova Remnant","category":"generative","tags":["generative","supernova","space","shockwave","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic"],"description":"Expanding supernova shockwave with turbulent ejecta filaments. Bass drives the expansion front, mids create Rayleigh-Taylor instability fingers, treble adds radioactive decay sparkles. Mouse pulls the remnant center.","hash":"756bfacda9a2b4f3","embedding":""},{"id":"symbiotic-light-propagation-networks","name":"Symbiotic Light Propagation Networks","category":"generative","tags":["symbiotic","light","organic","network","bioluminescent","audio-reactive"],"description":"Two organic species grow while transporting and transforming light through their network. They support each other symbiotically while competing for resources. Mouse seeds new growth while audio controls light color and transmission.","hash":"a370945dbff38f61","embedding":""},{"id":"topological-acoustic-knots","name":"Topological Acoustic Knots","category":"generative","tags":["topological","liquid-crystal","defects","audio-reactive","scientific","abstract","knots","schlieren"],"description":"Nematic Q-tensor evolution with topological charge computation and trefoil-knot SDF constraint. Schlieren texture with defect-core coloring and HDR bloom on +1 defects. Bass creates defect pairs via Kibble-Zurek quench, mids drive annihilation dynamics, treble adds acoustic phonon waves. Mouse pins director with homeot","hash":"d0c9b5ba9c76a0bf","embedding":""},{"id":"tornado-vortex","name":"Tornado Vortex","category":"generative","tags":["generative","tornado","vortex","storm","spiral","debris","lightning","audio-reactive","physics","rankine"],"description":"Rankine vortex model with viscous core, radial inflow, and vertical updraft. Lagrangian debris advection with condensation funnel and subsurface scattering. Lightning flash illumination. Audio drives Fujita-scale intensity. Mouse acts as a probe flung by vorticity. Depth controls debris perspective.","hash":"edc43e5083f2ff44","embedding":""},{"id":"turing-veins","name":"Turing Veins","category":"generative","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generative multiscale reaction-diffusion Turing patterns forming organic vein/networks with bioluminescent glow. Procedurally evolves over time; depth increases complexity; mouse perturbs fields. Subtly distorts and overlays input image.","hash":"5e97c23aa21b7896","embedding":""},{"id":"volumetric-cloud-nebula","name":"Volumetric Cloud Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["generative","nebula","clouds","volumetric","raymarch","space","cosmic","procedural"],"description":"Raymarched volumetric clouds with nebula coloring. Warp-flight orbital camera, fast cloud advection, treble ionization flashes, and advected HDR streaks. Bass/mids/treble drive flow, color, and sparkle. Extinction slider controls optical depth per march step.","hash":"5079374c93b33495","embedding":""},{"id":"wolfram-data-demo","name":"Wolfram Data Demo","category":"generative","tags":["wolfram","scientific","mathematical","procedural","physics","golden-ratio","atmospheric","diffraction"],"description":"Demonstrates scientific constants and mathematical functions from Wolfram Alpha. Features phyllotaxis patterns, Airy disk diffraction, Fibonacci spirals, and atmospheric scattering using real physical data.","hash":"6df5e55d713f52de","embedding":""},{"id":"adaptive-mosaic","name":"Adaptive Mosaic","category":"geometric","tags":["mosaic","pixel","geometric","depth","voronoi","tiles","pattern","audio","reactive"],"description":"Depth-adaptive tile mosaic with exact C history, grout conveyor runners, click tile pulses, held fine-focus, and treble-flickered Voronoi crackle.","hash":"4aa4920d8e802e28","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-glyph","name":"ASCII Glyphs","category":"geometric","tags":["filter","image-processing","ascii","glyph","SDF","typography"],"description":"SDF glyph morph with bass character swap and depth luminance map. Pixels are quantized into glyph cells; depth controls brightness tiering. Bass swaps glyph patterns on beats, treble adds chromatic highlights to dense characters.","hash":"775aab58de16b10d","embedding":""},{"id":"crystal-mosaic","name":"Crystal Mosaic","category":"geometric","tags":["mosaic","crystal","geometric","triangular","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","caustics","refraction","subsurface-scattering"],"description":"Image broken into triangular mosaic tiles that rotate based on mouse proximity. Enhanced with crystal Fresnel refraction lighting, caustics projection, rim lighting on tile edges, subsurface scattering glow, light attenuation, and chromatic aberration at tile boundaries.","hash":"03759006d57e013f","embedding":""},{"id":"datamosh","name":"Datamosh","category":"geometric","tags":["datamosh","glitch","compression","motion-vectors","retro","video-artifacts","smear","trail"],"description":"Corrected single-state datamoshing: authoritative A packs motion, age, and strength, while current source pixels are predicted through that state with sprung scrubbing, bounded click corruption, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"279ea7f1481a59ef","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-crease","name":"Digital Crease","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","paper","crease","fold","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","temporal","origami"],"description":"Origami crease simulation with spring fold focus, held deepen, capped ripples, exact C fold memory, chromatic folding, and ACES tone map.","hash":"85dd9c6d0781a56d","embedding":""},{"id":"flip-matrix","name":"Flip Matrix","category":"geometric","tags":["split-flap","kinetic","geometric","interactive"],"description":"Inertial split-flap cells propagate hover and click update waves through hinge mechanics, distinct front/back materials, bevel lighting, and held acceleration.","hash":"f72599f7c0536045","embedding":""},{"id":"hyperbolic-dreamweaver","name":"Hyperbolic Dreamweaver","category":"geometric","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Infinite non-Euclidean Poincaré disk tilings weaving the image through psychedelic Möbius transformations, depth-aware curvature, chromatic aberration, and glowing symmetry lines. Mouse centers the dream; ripples perturb the fabric.","hash":"91242a3d2df039ad","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-origami","name":"Interactive Origami","category":"geometric","tags":["origami","fold","paper","geometric","normal-map","interactive","depth","audio","reactive"],"description":"Folded-paper crease planes with held pinch, traveling crease runners, foil iridescence, bounded click rings, and exact C history. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"9ea76d4eb85526a9","embedding":""},{"id":"kaleido-scope-grokcf1","name":"Kaleido-Scope Prism grokcf1","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","pattern","audio","feedback"],"description":"Kaleidoscope with stained-glass facet seams, wedge conveyors, radial packets, oil-slick prism palettes, held singularity, bounded iris clicks, spring-damper mouse follow, and trails packed as display RGBA except origin [env, springXY, vel].","hash":"2052f40a9e280c65","embedding":""},{"id":"kaleido-scope","name":"Kaleido-Scope","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","pattern","kaleidoscope","prismatic","hyperbolic","tessellation"],"description":"Hyperbolic Poincaré-disk tessellation kaleidoscope with animated morphing between symmetry types, iridescent metallic boundaries, HDR specular vertices, and depth-driven stereoscopic chromatic aberration.","hash":"277c1d693c61c5d3","embedding":""},{"id":"kinetic-tiles","name":"Kinetic Tiles","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","kinetic","tiles","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Mechanical square facet tiles rotate and scale in a kinetic traveling wave. Driven by spring-damper cursor, click ripple wavefronts, depth extrusion, bevel glints, exact-C temporal trails, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"6bba0d45f1e64146","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-poly-grid","name":"Neon Poly Grid","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","pattern"],"description":"A futuristic hexagonal grid that lights up when you touch it, leaving a fading trail.","hash":"df999dae5b4828f0","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-quantum-lattice","name":"Neon Quantum Lattice","category":"geometric","tags":["geometric","neon","quasicrystal","penrose","tiling","metallic"],"description":"Aperiodic Penrose-like quasi-crystal tiling with phason conveyor drift, traveling vertex-energy runners, click-driven dephasing fronts, neon edge glow, and bounded display-history trails.","hash":"b7b0ff11a2f2e3aa","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-hypercube-projection","name":"Hypercube Projection","category":"geometric","tags":["hypercube","tesseract","4D","projection","geometric","rotation"],"description":"Animated 4D tesseract projected into 2D using double rotation in XW and YZ planes. 32 edges are rendered with depth-based glow and input image texture-mapped onto faces.","hash":"428c03860aa496eb","embedding":""},{"id":"time-lag-map","name":"Time-Lag Map","category":"geometric","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Per-pixel temporal delay creating echo, smear, and time-displacement effects.","hash":"b604341abdc25127","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-zoom-turbulence","name":"Voronoi Zoom Turbulence","category":"geometric","tags":["filter","image-processing","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Voronoi cells pulse with closed-form zoom and site-boundary shear conveyors. Sprung pointer agitates or calms cells, clicks emit zoom fronts, exact-C persistence, ACES display, and semantic agitation alpha.","hash":"bae086fad8c387d6","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-chromatic-circuit","name":"Chromatic Circuit","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","hex","circuit","chromatic","glow","pulse","edges"],"description":"Opal-circuit style hex-grid trace edges, radial pulse glow, and chromatic aberration are layered over the input image while preserving alpha.","hash":"a395f5c24e3b452a","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-hex-voronoi-distort","name":"Hex Voronoi Distort","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","hex","voronoi","mosaic","distortion"],"description":"Hexagonal grid mosaic distortion blended with animated 2D Voronoi cells. Samples the input image through distorted hex centers while preserving the original alpha channel.","hash":"6e8fb512b8fb39f2","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-iridescent-fbm-glow","name":"Iridescent FBM Glow","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","fbm","iridescence","glow","noise"],"description":"Domain-warped FBM drives a thin-film iridescent glow with audio reactivity, depth-aware fog, ACES tone mapping, IGN dither, chromatic aberration, Fresnel rim and OkLab mixing.","hash":"7cb8bf98ee08ec66","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-kaleidoscope-pulse","name":"Kaleidoscope Pulse","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","kaleidoscope","pulse","radial","mirror"],"description":"Mirrors the input image into FBM-domain-warped kaleidoscope segments, adds an ACES-tonemapped radial pulse, and writes semantic alpha encoding pulse energy and depth.","hash":"23f282ff34aa6956","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-neural-voronoi-feedback","name":"Neural Voronoi Feedback","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","voronoi","fbm","feedback","dust","noise","iridescence"],"description":"Voronoi neural cells, FBM-driven feedback drift, and glowing neural dust are blended over the input image while preserving alpha.","hash":"cbe727c98b13544a","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-spectral-fbm-displace","name":"Spectral FBM Displace","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","fbm","domain-warp","spectral","chromatic","displacement","noise"],"description":"FBM spectral displacement with conveyor bands, oil-slick interference, held warp, click fronts. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"f81c554b060af4c7","embedding":""},{"id":"hyb-temporal-fbm-ghost","name":"Temporal FBM Ghost","category":"hybrid","tags":["hybrid","temporal","fbm","domain-warp","ghost","glow","palette","noise"],"description":"Temporal RGB channel offsets, FBM domain-warp displacement, and a ghosting glow are blended over the input image while preserving alpha.","hash":"92d4e1ba90ee6100","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-chromatic-liquid","name":"Hybrid Chromatic Liquid","category":"hybrid","tags":["interactive","cursor","audio","music"],"description":"Fluid-like distortion with RGB channel separation flowing along a noise-generated flow field. Audio reactivity pulses dot size and ink density with the music.","hash":"53eb024931c2bbf4","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-cyber-organic","name":"Hybrid Cyber-Organic","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Digital circuit traces that grow organically with neon glow, combining hexagonal grid structures with cellular growth patterns","hash":"2505d46e86aefe18","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-fractal-feedback","name":"Hybrid Fractal Feedback","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Julia set fractal with feedback trails and per-channel temporal delay creating RGB separation trails","hash":"0093cdc69d0cec7e","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-magnetic-field","name":"Hybrid Magnetic Field","category":"hybrid","tags":["audio","music","magnetic","field","particles","trails","glow"],"description":"Magnetic field line visualization with flowing particles and FBM-varied field distortion. Audio reactivity makes field lines pulse and glow with the beat.","hash":"39c9b532bd85091f","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-noise-kaleidoscope","name":"Hybrid Noise Kaleidoscope","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Domain-warped FBM noise fed through kaleidoscope symmetry with dynamic hue shifting and RGB channel splits","hash":"5de1af4b5ea3529a","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-particle-fluid","name":"Hybrid Particle Fluid","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Particles that move like fluid with glowing trails, combining particle advection with curl noise velocity field","hash":"19f10c31d092f521","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-reaction-diffusion-glass","name":"Hybrid Reaction-Diffusion Glass","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Turing chemistry used as glass thickness: the pattern refracts the photo with thickness-scaled IOR and caustic concentrate where the gradient focuses.","hash":"0a6cf73aa94acdda","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-sdf-plasma","name":"Hybrid SDF Plasma Field","category":"hybrid","tags":[],"description":"Raymarched SDF scene with plasma noise displacement and dynamic palette-based coloring","hash":"27ca712ba985a92c","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-spectral-sorting","name":"Hybrid Spectral Sorting","category":"hybrid","tags":["interactive","cursor"],"description":"Audio-reactive pixel sorting with frequency-based color shifts and displacement based on spectral analysis","hash":"8215233a84ddcaf1","embedding":""},{"id":"hybrid-voronoi-glass","name":"Hybrid Voronoi Glass","category":"hybrid","tags":["interactive","cursor","voronoi","glass","dispersion"],"description":"Stable Voronoi cell boundaries drive Cauchy dispersion, Fresnel and total internal reflection, thickness absorption, cursor lens pressure, and click fracture fronts.","hash":"89fb26628e00fbd1","embedding":""},{"id":"ripple-bloom","name":"Ripple Bloom","category":"hybrid","tags":["ripple","bloom","hybrid","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","organic","dispersion","subsurface"],"description":"Huygens wavelet ripple simulation with frequency dispersion, chromatic dispersion on crests, multi-pass Gaussian bloom, caustic refraction light patterns, rainbow dispersion at bright edges, 6-pointed starburst diffraction from bright points, film grain, radial chromatic aberration, color grading with lift/gamma/gain, ","hash":"f1b351ebc71cf712","embedding":""},{"id":"aerogel-smoke","name":"Aerogel Smoke","category":"image","tags":["aerogel","volumetric","scattering","fluid","interactive"],"description":"Advected aerogel density transports scattering energy and flow through raw A/C state, with Rayleigh and Henyey-Greenstein light transport, Beer-Lambert extinction, cursor lighting, held injection, and click plumes.","hash":"a7c1296171cf9471","embedding":""},{"id":"alucinate","name":"Alucinate","category":"image","tags":["psychedelic","warp","interactive","organic","fluid","filter","image-processing","fractal","reaction-diffusion","audio-reactive"],"description":"Reaction-Diffusion Psychedelia with Gray-Scott Turing patterns, domain-warped FBM, kaleidoscopic IFS fractals, conformal mapping, and audio-reactive color science.","hash":"7076cd1f691317c1","embedding":""},{"id":"analog-film-degrade","name":"Analog Film Degrade","category":"image","tags":["film","vintage","grain","dust","scratches","sepia","vignette","retro"],"description":"Vintage film degradation with grain, dust, scratches, color fading, and vignette.","hash":"6780687126dd2a36","embedding":""},{"id":"bismuth-crystallizer","name":"Bismuth Crystallizer","category":"image","tags":["crystal","bismuth","hopper","iridescence","metallic","transmission","physical"],"description":"Generates geometric hopper crystal patterns with physical light transmission. Simulates bismuth crystals with thin-film interference iridescence, metallic Fresnel reflection, and oxide layer transmission.","hash":"0914eaaa2bcd2b02","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-threads","name":"Chroma Threads","category":"image","tags":["threads","chromatic","woven","fabric","sheen","brdf","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Woven fabric simulation with anisotropic noise, silk/sheen BRDF, subsurface scattering, and chromatic aberration on thread edges.","hash":"17815cc4558cba77","embedding":""},{"id":"chrono-slit-scan","name":"Chrono Slit Scan","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","noise","fractal","temporal","artistic"],"description":"Multi-slit temporal scan with continuous slit heads and cross-runners, held-pointer slit bending, bounded click scan fronts, audio-reactive speed, exact-load display history, and sparse early-exit sampling.","hash":"6efd8f1f6a433117","embedding":""},{"id":"circular-pixelate","name":"Circular Pixelate","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A hexagonal compound-eye field refracts the image through deep lenslets, with chromatic aperture glints, held dilation, and age-guarded click propagation.","hash":"b53b37c4427d3a92","embedding":""},{"id":"color-blindness","name":"Color Blindness Sim","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates various forms of color blindness (Protanopia, Deuteranopia, Tritanopia) with split-screen comparison.","hash":"7d7f8144fc8b0745","embedding":""},{"id":"color-channel-weave","name":"Color Channel Weave","category":"image","tags":["weave","fabric","threads","chromatic","texture","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Samples RGB channels from offset positions simulating a woven fabric. Horizontal threads carry red; vertical threads carry blue; green is neutral. Audio shifts thread spacing and chromatic offset. Mouse tilts the warp direction.","hash":"aeb1af9f7292415e","embedding":""},{"id":"concentric-spin","name":"Concentric Spin","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Concentric rings that rotate in alternating directions. Mouse controls the center. Audio-reactive rotation with ring gap opacity.","hash":"c3d703f2853e3926","embedding":""},{"id":"contour-flow","name":"Contour Flow","category":"image","tags":["image","contour","flow","edge-detection","advection","curl","turbulence"],"description":"Multiscale image gradients drive tangent advection and coherent exact-history ribbons, with held pointer vortices and traveling contour fronts from clicks.","hash":"8afa9193c9febf7b","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-anisotropic-diffusion","name":"Anisotropic Diffusion","category":"image","tags":["anisotropic-diffusion","perona-malik","oil-painting","convolution","edge-aware","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Perona-Malik anisotropic diffusion that smooths along edges but not across them. Creates oil-painting simplification into flat colored regions. Alpha stores per-pixel diffusion coefficient as a process map. Mouse acts as heat source accelerating diffusion.","hash":"da0967d0f8b152fc","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-bilateral-dream","name":"Bilateral Dream","category":"image","tags":["bilateral","convolution","edge-preserving","painterly","psychedelic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Edge-preserving bilateral smoothing with psychedelic color preservation. Uses RGBA32FLOAT alpha channel to store accumulated weight for deferred normalization. Mouse controls varying sharpness region.","hash":"9fcc019d9f7ead3e","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-bilateral-grid-splat","name":"Bilateral Grid Splat","category":"image","tags":["bilateral-grid","fast-bilateral","edge-preserving","convolution","splatting","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Fast approximate bilateral filter using 3D grid splatting (spatial x, y + intensity). Achieves edge-preserving smoothing at O(1) per pixel. RGBA32FLOAT stores HDR accumulated color and weight. Mouse creates high-resolution detail zone.","hash":"3d4c6825b2373acd","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-difference-of-gaussians-cascade","name":"Difference of Gaussians Cascade","category":"image","tags":["difference-of-gaussians","multi-scale","edge-detection","convolution","psychedelic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Multi-scale Difference-of-Gaussians at 4 scales with signed response storage. Creates neural-edge glow where edges at different scales colorize differently. RGBA32FLOAT stores signed bipolar responses in all channels. Mouse controls scale emphasis.","hash":"d2cd90fc46a400b5","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-fractal-kernel","name":"Fractal Kernel","category":"image","tags":["fractal","mandelbrot","convolution","kernel","psychedelic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Convolution kernel shaped by Mandelbrot set membership. Pixels inside the fractal are sampled, creating alien mathematically beautiful blur patterns. Alpha stores fractal iteration depth. Mouse warps the Mandelbrot center live.","hash":"f6dbc31599b22535","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-frequency-domain-notch","name":"Frequency Domain Notch","category":"image","tags":["frequency-notch","spectral","convolution","moire-removal","frequency-painting","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Spatial-domain approximation of frequency notch filtering using tuned sinusoidal convolution kernels. Removes moire patterns or creates frequency painting. Alpha stores spectral response magnitude. Mouse selects target frequency band.","hash":"40b9eac8aa501e9e","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-gabor-texture-analyzer","name":"Gabor Texture Analyzer","category":"image","tags":["gabor","convolution","texture-analysis","orientation","psychedelic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Gabor filter bank detecting oriented texture patterns at 0, 45, 90, and 135 degrees. RGBA32FLOAT stores signed bipolar responses in all four channels. Mouse rotates the filter bank for swirling texture segmentation.","hash":"782a99dd5f6518cb","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-guided-filter-depth","name":"Guided Filter Depth","category":"image","tags":["guided-filter","convolution","depth-aware","edge-preserving","depth-of-field","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Guided filter using depth texture as guide for edge-aware filtering. Creates depth-of-field blur that perfectly respects object boundaries. Alpha stores filtering confidence coefficient. Mouse creates localized focus aperture.","hash":"57041433b95aec49","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-guided-video-filter","name":"Guided Video Filter","category":"image","tags":["convolution","guided-filter","edge-preserving","sharpening","post-processing","anti-halo","painterly"],"description":"Guided image filter that uses the original crisp video frame as the guide image to restore sharp edges on heavily processed or convoluted content from the previous slot pass. Eliminates halo artifacts while preserving painterly, glitch, or artistic effects inside smooth regions. Mouse proximity creates a live sharpenin","hash":"b533b19f4940bfff","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-morphological-erosion-dilation","name":"Morphological Erosion Dilation","category":"image","tags":["morphological","convolution","erosion","dilation","edge-detection","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Mathematical morphology on images — erosion shrinks bright regions, dilation expands them. RGBA32FLOAT packs erosion (R), dilation (G), gradient (B), and top-hat (A) into one pass. Mouse controls directional structuring element.","hash":"fc503927ac3bd754","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-non-local-means","name":"Non-Local Means","category":"image","tags":["non-local-means","convolution","denoising","patch-similarity","artistic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Gold-standard denoising that averages similar patches across the image. Cranked to artistic overdrive for hallucinatory double-exposure effects. Alpha stores self-similarity importance map. Mouse controls focus zone precision.","hash":"fdffb4995924c227","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-reaction-convolution","name":"Reaction Convolution","category":"image","tags":["convolution","reaction-diffusion","gray-scott","mouse-driven","interactive","rgba-as-data"],"description":"Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion applied as a convolution filter on the input image. Uses image luminance to seed chemical concentrations and mouse interaction to inject patterns.","hash":"1bb31ba349e4ed81","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-spiral-blur","name":"Spiral Blur","category":"image","tags":["spiral","logarithmic","golden-ratio","convolution","motion-blur","vortex","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Logarithmic spiral convolution creating rotational motion blur along golden ratio spirals. RGBA32FLOAT stores HDR accumulated color and spiral coverage factor. Mouse controls spiral center and tightness for vortex-like effects.","hash":"b5bb63623e531efc","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-steerable-pyramid","name":"Steerable Pyramid","category":"image","tags":["steerable-pyramid","orientation","sub-band","convolution","wavelet","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Decomposes image into oriented sub-bands at 0, 45, 90, and 135 degrees using steerable filters. RGBA32FLOAT stores full-precision signed sub-band coefficients for lossless reconstruction or artistic boosting. Mouse steers the decomposition angle.","hash":"75d5f736d46924b6","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-stochastic-stipple","name":"Stochastic Stipple","category":"image","tags":["stipple","pointillism","blue-noise","dithering","convolution","artistic","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Blue-noise dithered weighted Voronoi stippling creating pointillist art from any image. Each dot represents a local neighborhood sized by average luminance. Alpha stores continuous stipple density for downstream dot-size variation. Mouse creates higher-resolution stipple zone.","hash":"fbdef26cedc88be1","embedding":""},{"id":"conv-structure-tensor-flow","name":"Structure Tensor Flow","category":"image","tags":["structure-tensor","LIC","flow-visualization","convolution","texture-analysis","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Computes structure tensor, extracts eigenvectors for dominant texture orientation, and visualizes flow via Line Integral Convolution. RGBA32FLOAT packs eigenvector components, coherency, and LIC intensity. Mouse creates vortices in the flow field.","hash":"b2731554d17c4149","embedding":""},{"id":"cross-conv-mouse-bilateral","name":"Bilateral Paint","category":"image","tags":["crossover","convolution","bilateral","mouse-driven","paint","interactive"],"description":"Edge-preserving bilateral paint with an aspect-correct pointer brush, rapidly traveling sheen packets, audio response, and click-launched smoothing fronts.","hash":"ba98f71a1ede5d02","embedding":""},{"id":"crt-scanline-damage","name":"CRT Scanline Damage","category":"image","tags":["crt","scanline","retro","distortion","glitch","phosphor","monitor","damaged","temporal","audio-reactive","chromatic","depth-aware"],"description":"Damaged CRT monitor simulation with barrel distortion, RGB phosphor mask, scanlines, temporal phosphor decay via dataTextureC, audio-driven chromatic barrel separation, depth-aware distortion, and occasional vertical roll.","hash":"854523fac025d0fe","embedding":""},{"id":"crumpled-paper","name":"Crumpled Paper","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates the look of crumpled paper with interactive smoothing.","hash":"496b46a9ba5409af","embedding":""},{"id":"crystalline-shatter","name":"Crystalline Shatter","category":"image","tags":["crystal","shatter","voronoi","refraction","chromatic","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Voronoi cell decomposition shatters the image into crystal facets, each refracting light independently with chromatic aberration. Bass pulses crack new cells; mouse proximity amplifies the shatter.","hash":"ba0f710c4d0f5cdd","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-halftone-scanner","name":"Cyber Halftone Scanner","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"CMYK-style halftone pattern with a scanning glitch line.","hash":"f577b2afdf259661","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-lens","name":"Digital Lens","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","lens","digital","chromatic","audio-reactive","anamorphic","temporal-feedback","gravity-well","alpha-layered","luminance-key"],"description":"Brown-Conrady lens with sprung gravity-well focus, held boost, capped click ripples, chromatic dispersion, caustic streaks, bass-envelope trails, and preserved [bassEnvelope, trailRGB] A packing.","hash":"66702ab0b40b5ae7","embedding":""},{"id":"directional-blur-wipe","name":"Directional Blur Wipe","category":"image","tags":["blur","wipe","directional","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"Splits the screen with an audio-reactive directional blur. Mouse controls split position; chromatic offset scatters RGB per treble. Depth-scatter increases blur radius on distant objects.","hash":"b8b264c62e4a6241","embedding":""},{"id":"ember-drift-dissolve","name":"Ember Drift Dissolve","category":"image","tags":["ember","fire","dissolve","advection","heat","atmospheric","audio-reactive","held-furnace"],"description":"Bright areas of the image lift off as glowing embers and are carried upward by a living heat field. Creates haunting, beautiful disintegration especially on video. Treble controls spark density while bass thickens the rising glow. Held press opens a furnace under the cursor — stronger rise, denser birth, white-hot core","hash":"f22672ce4d6de69c","embedding":""},{"id":"fireworks-depth-parade","name":"4th of July — Depth Parade","category":"image","tags":["fireworks","depth","parade","layered","pyrotechnics","july-4","image-reactive","audio-reactive","4th-of-july"],"description":"Depth layers of your image launch fireworks in parade sequence — foreground detonates first, then midground, then background. Creates a cinematic 3D-ish celebration where near elements pop before far ones. Image colors tint each layer's shells. Bass amplifies foreground launches. Mouse triggers a depth-sorted barrage.","hash":"cf584f7a6613889e","embedding":""},{"id":"fireworks-edge-ignite","name":"4th of July — Edge Ignite","category":"image","tags":["fireworks","edge","contour","pyrotechnics","july-4","image-reactive","audio-reactive","4th-of-july"],"description":"Image contours and edges become ignition lines for a fireworks show. Bright boundaries spark and launch colored shells along the detected edges of your photo. The picture's outlines trace themselves in pyrotechnic light. Bass deepens edge bursts, treble adds crackle along contours. Mouse ignites edges at the cursor.","hash":"803edbedde118721","embedding":""},{"id":"fireworks-patriotic-july4","name":"4th of July — Patriotic Pyro","category":"image","tags":["fireworks","patriotic","july-4","red-white-blue","pyrotechnics","image-reactive","audio-reactive","4th-of-july"],"description":"Happy July 4th! Your image fuels a red, white, and blue fireworks spectacular. Bright regions launch patriotic shells cycling through crimson, silver-white, and electric blue. Image hues blend with the classic American palette for a backyard celebration feel. Bass booms the big shells, treble crackles the finale. Mouse","hash":"1be1921d3d8c7d8f","embedding":""},{"id":"fireworks-portrait-burst","name":"4th of July — Portrait Burst","category":"image","tags":["fireworks","portrait","bright-region","pyrotechnics","july-4","image-reactive","audio-reactive","4th-of-july"],"description":"Bright regions of your image become the cores of spectacular firework detonations. Faces, skylines, and luminous highlights erupt in bursts that inherit the source colors. The photo celebrates itself — portraits explode in their own palette. Bass triggers larger cores, treble adds sparkle. Mouse detonates at the cursor","hash":"be7b735cec25cda8","embedding":""},{"id":"fractal-noise-dissolve","name":"Fractal Noise Dissolve","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Dissolves the image into fractal noise around the mouse.","hash":"0aa4f33b35cec533","embedding":""},{"id":"frost-reveal","name":"Frost Reveal","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive frost reveal effect with crystalline patterns that form based on mouse interaction.","hash":"56667190fadaadb3","embedding":""},{"id":"frosted-glass-lens","name":"Frosted Glass Lens","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","frost","glass","lens","scattering"],"description":"Frosted lens with a Beckmann microfacet scattering lobe — five taps drawn from a Beckmann slope distribution, giving the heavy-tailed blur of ground glass rather than a single offset — and depth-dependent frost thickness so far, cold geometry frosts over while near geometry stays clear. Adds ACES, bounded click frost-c","hash":"693221af16a6875f","embedding":""},{"id":"gamma-ray-burst","name":"Gamma Ray Burst","category":"image","tags":["burst","stellar","relativistic","jet","hdr","audio-reactive"],"description":"Stylized relativistic-jet visualization with bounded Doppler beaming, synchrotron-inspired emission, magnetic spirals, localized click bursts, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"6c84394db294db9a","embedding":""},{"id":"glitch-reveal","name":"Glitch Reveal","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","glitch","reveal","spring-cursor"],"description":"Chaotic block-scatter noise field stabilized by a sprung cursor reveal window; held widens radius, clicks add capped ripples, exact C feedback, ACES composite.","hash":"7f43e660193063a3","embedding":""},{"id":"glitch-ripple-drag","name":"Glitch Ripple Drag","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Exact-load liquid glitch feedback with plasma-driven drag, a sprung origin, bounded click ripple trains, chromatic tearing, ACES display output, and semantic trail alpha.","hash":"acf293833b0f67ff","embedding":""},{"id":"graphic-novel","name":"Graphic Novel","category":"image","tags":["graphic-novel","halftone","ink","printmaking","interactive"],"description":"Adaptive ink contours and rotated print screens layer registration character, paper fibers, held ink emphasis, and click-driven engraving fronts over posterized source color.","hash":"025303e11c3cde61","embedding":""},{"id":"heat-haze-mirage","name":"Heat Haze Mirage","category":"image","tags":["heat","haze","mirage","distortion","atmospheric","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","atmosphere","refraction","shimmer","amber","caustic"],"description":"Inferior mirage from a refractive-index gradient: dn/dy ray bending, stronger false-water inversion fold, amber caustic runners, held-press gradient boost, spring-damped heat nozzle [133..137], capped click blooms, per-band FFT shimmer, ACES, and semantic alpha. Scene depth preserved with mirage relief.","hash":"e10a215f64e27b77","embedding":""},{"id":"hex-lens","name":"Hex Lens Interactive","category":"image","tags":["hex","lens","honeycomb","prismatic","audio-reactive","bokeh","dispersion","diffraction","fbm"],"description":"Honeycomb microlenses with hexagonal bokeh blur, wavelength-dependent chromatic dispersion, hexagonal aperture diffraction starbursts, FBM domain warping, and 6-fold/12-fold star patterns. Audio-reactive lens rotation and prismatic shimmer.","hash":"2b4313e5959a5af3","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-shatter","name":"Holographic Shatter","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","shatter","holographic","chromatic","temporal","shard"],"description":"Fractures the image into digital shards with temporal shard velocity persistence, chromatic edge refraction per shard, audio-driven impact intensity, holographic interference patterns, and plasma palette tinting.","hash":"37663e5e6741af02","embedding":""},{"id":"honey-melt","name":"Honey Melt","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A golden hexagonal grid that melts under the mouse.","hash":"6e7ad93f8c59cf34","embedding":""},{"id":"kintsugi-repair","name":"Kintsugi Repair","category":"image","tags":["kintsugi","gold","cracks","audio-reactive"],"description":"Kintsugi-inspired Voronoi cracks with held-pointer repair energy, rapid gold runners, stable sparkles, three-band audio response, and bounded click fronts.","hash":"88a6ab2d7b899a32","embedding":""},{"id":"lenticular-holographic-shift","name":"Lenticular Holographic Shift","category":"image","tags":["lenticular","holographic","moire","print","perspective","audio-reactive","interactive"],"description":"Simulates a lenticular/holographic print that dramatically shifts perspective, color, and moiré interference as you move the mouse or as audio beats. Stunning on portraits and detailed imagery.","hash":"a4537dc8c708acfc","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-chrome-ripple","name":"Liquid Chrome Ripple","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A capillary chrome sheet with pointer and click wave trains, derivative normals, RGB refraction, thin-film reflection, dual-lobe highlights, caustics, and advected metallic afterimages.","hash":"83b111e48c7b15d9","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-refraction","name":"Luma Refraction","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","chromatic","audio-reactive","temporal","refraction"],"description":"Ripples propagate through the image with speed determined by brightness. Features chromatic refraction offsets (R/G/B at different normals), temporal wave damping memory, audio-driven wave amplitude, and semantic alpha handling.","hash":"9036aa6e71c85a87","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-chroma","name":"Magnetic Chroma","category":"image","tags":["magnetic","chroma","hsv","rk2","neon","bloom","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"HSV hue-wheel warping via RK2-integrated magnetic field line advection per RGB channel. Chromatic dispersion, neon glow, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"fe8d964093586117","embedding":""},{"id":"mercury-temporal-mirror","name":"Mercury Temporal Mirror","category":"image","tags":["mercury","liquid","reflection","temporal","ripple","audio-reactive","metallic"],"description":"A stylized liquid-metal mirror with directionally advected wave state, traveling capillary packets, audio rain tracks, and click-launched impact fronts. Its generated depth follows the evolving wave energy rather than a physical fluid model.","hash":"8f1791c10dc5a3c7","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-pulse-dissolve","name":"Neon Pulse Dissolve","category":"image","tags":["neon","glow","edge","dissolve","audio-reactive","cinematic"],"description":"Audio-reactive neon edge dissolve with smooth traveling scan packets, held-pointer energy, bounded click fronts, and continuously advected luminous noise.","hash":"638f0ebe041342bb","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-pulse-stream","name":"Neon Pulse Stream","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","neon","tube","packets","glow"],"description":"Bundled neon tube bank: five curl-perturbed sinusoidal tubes are shaded with a gaussian core, Fresnel rim and outer bloom, and each owns one FFT bin driving its thickness, hue drift and the gaussian light packets running along it. The pointer is a magnetic attractor that bends the bundle, clicks inject bounded pulse fr","hash":"0ecdc65863556118","embedding":""},{"id":"oil-slick-iridescence","name":"Oil Slick Iridescence","category":"image","tags":["iridescence","oil","thin-film","rainbow","interference","audio-reactive","cinematic","snell","fresnel"],"description":"Nanometre-scale thin-film interference: film thickness is expressed in real nanometres (120–900 nm), the incidence angle comes from the height field's own gradient, the in-film angle follows Snell's law, and the two reflected beams combine with Fresnel weighting plus the pi phase step at the external interface. Curl-no","hash":"079d4393757df64f","embedding":""},{"id":"optical-illusion-spin","name":"Optical Illusion Spin","category":"image","tags":["hypnotic","rings","spin","audio-reactive","illusion","fast-motion","aces"],"description":"Counter-rotating snake-ring packets plus a Fraser-spiral whip. Bass drives spin, sprung pointer centers the illusion, capped click shells, exact-C afterimage, ACES display.","hash":"130dd15122f61a96","embedding":""},{"id":"page-curl-interactive","name":"Page Curl Interactive","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","interactive","audio-reactive","temporal","curl","chromatic","aces","oklab","lighting"],"description":"Impossible-page tunnel curl with aurora-marbling on the backside, held curl-radius and projection twist, bounded chromatic fold shockwaves, studio lighting, exact-load A/C trails, and depth-aware premultiplied composition.","hash":"da9357afa9f136d6","embedding":""},{"id":"pin-art-3d","name":"Pin Art 3D","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates a 3D pin art toy where image brightness controls pin height. Mouse pushes pins down.","hash":"506ee048b32f7e49","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-scattering","name":"Pixel Scattering","category":"image","tags":["image","scatter","velocity","curl-noise","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Physical velocity-field advection combining divergence-free curl noise, Fibonacci golden spiral dispersal, vortex drag wakes, spring cursor dynamics, click shockwaves, exact-C temporal streak advection, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"5b48ce46862ada52","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-stretch-interactive","name":"Pixel Stretch Interactive","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","chromatic","bloom","structure-tensor"],"description":"Anisotropic pixel stretching guided by image structure tensor, with chromatic smear along edge directions, HDR bloom on highlights, ACES tone mapping, and film grain. Bass drives stretch magnitude, mouse controls direction, depth creates parallax layering.","hash":"df3a0e1159dd68fe","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-tornado","name":"Pixel Tornado","category":"image","tags":["vortex","tornado","distortion","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","cinematic"],"description":"A pixel-level tornado vortex whose eye tracks the mouse. Bass energy widens the funnel; treble adds turbulent jitter. Click ripples send radial shockwaves through the frame.","hash":"9efa01d986289634","embedding":""},{"id":"plastic-bricks","name":"Plastic Bricks","category":"image","tags":["plastic","bricks","toy","relief","brdf","ambient-occlusion","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"LEGO-style plastic bricks with microfacet BRDF, ambient occlusion in stud cavities, fingerprint smudges, and subsurface scattering. Bass drives assembly animation, mouse deconstructs bricks, depth controls stud perspective.","hash":"18deed2190fe664e","embedding":""},{"id":"polka-wave","name":"Polka Wave","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Four-plate CMYK polka halftone with moving rosettes, held wave pressure, bounded click fronts, three-band audio, and spectral overprint.","hash":"6f6422f04f19c21d","embedding":""},{"id":"posterize-neon-edges","name":"Posterize Neon Edges","category":"image","tags":["posterize","neon","edge","glow","comic","stylized","artistic","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","hdr","film"],"description":"Edge-aware posterization with FBM-noise organic boundaries, multi-band luminance quantization, HDR neon bloom with ACES tone mapping, and cyan/magenta split-tone. Audio-reactive and mouse-driven.","hash":"528e539e329df528","embedding":""},{"id":"pyramid-downsample-pass1","name":"Gaussian-Laplacian Pyramid (Pass 1: Gaussian Blur)","category":"image","tags":["pyramid","gaussian","blur","frequency","laplacian","multipass"],"description":"Pass 1 of 3: Separable Gaussian blur via 18×18 shared-memory tile. Stores the blurred image for the next frame's Laplacian decomposition. Chain with pyramid-bandprocess-pass2.","hash":"40a3c8e534f3bbb2","embedding":""},{"id":"retro-gameboy","name":"Retro Game Boy","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates a classic handheld green dot-matrix display.","hash":"80bef42fa74b8629","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-ripple-distortion","name":"RGB Ripple Distortion","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A ripple effect that separates RGB channels based on distance from mouse.","hash":"05d8d02a1622e414","embedding":""},{"id":"ring-slicer","name":"Ring Slicer","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Slices the image into rotating concentric rings centered on the mouse, with organic noise-wobbled seams, palette-driven edge glow, subtle audio-reactive spin, and a mouse-down grab-and-twist.","hash":"6534ba26ee4108b3","embedding":""},{"id":"ripple-blocks","name":"Ripple Blocks","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Grid blocks that scale based on a wave pattern from the mouse.","hash":"a39225b9ee24adc5","embedding":""},{"id":"scanline-cyberpunk","name":"Scanline Cyberpunk","category":"image","tags":["crt","scanlines","cyberpunk","glitch","neon","cinematic","audio-reactive","retro"],"description":"CRT scanlines and RGB phosphor triads with continuous head-roll packets, fast phosphor runners, held-pointer distortion, click corruption fronts, real audio, and cyberpunk color grading.","hash":"925d9dbc820d28e9","embedding":""},{"id":"silk-flow-advection","name":"Silk Flow Advection","category":"image","tags":["silk","flow","advection","painterly","fabric","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"The colors and details of the input are gently carried along living, silky curl-noise flows. The mouse acts like a finger disturbing delicate fabric. Creates beautiful organic painterly motion on stills and video.","hash":"28cb535714469278","embedding":""},{"id":"slime-drip","name":"Slime Drip","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A gooey, dripping slime effect that can be wiped away.","hash":"6f0832ded635f337","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-cooperative-edge-linking","name":"Cooperative Edge Linking","category":"image","tags":["edge-detection","edge-linking","cooperative","workgroup","segmentation","union-find"],"description":"Workgroup-cooperative edge detection and chain tracing. Uses shared memory union-find to link connected edges within each tile, assigning unique edge IDs for downstream segmentation and flow effects.","hash":"7de60c64b205906d","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-histogram-equalize","name":"Histogram Equalize","category":"image","tags":["histogram","equalization","CLAHE","contrast","cooperative","workgroup"],"description":"Real-time CLAHE histogram equalization using workgroup cooperative histogram building. Computes local histogram per 8x8 tile and remaps intensities via CDF for dramatic adaptive contrast enhancement.","hash":"64fc0b094d25e67d","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-mesh","name":"Spectral Mesh","category":"image","tags":["mesh","wireframe","spectral","audio-reactive","grid"],"description":"Adaptive Delaunay-style spectral mesh with image-gradient-driven density, chromatic wavelength vertex coloring, wireframe glow, HDR bloom, ACES tone mapping, and subsurface scattering. Bass drives subdivision, mouse attracts vertices, depth controls foreshortening.","hash":"9cd85ddc46984556","embedding":""},{"id":"steampunk-gear-lens","name":"Steampunk Gear Lens","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","steampunk","gear","mechanical","sepia"],"description":"A rotating mechanical gear lens with sepia filter and audio-reactive rotation.","hash":"1b7785162d532f82","embedding":""},{"id":"tensor-flow-sculpting","name":"Tensor Flow Sculpting","category":"image","tags":["depth","tensor","warp","sculpt","flow","artistic","deformation","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Depth is treated as a 4-D strain tensor that warps and sculpts the image like clay — bulk regions bend dramatically while high-frequency edge details stay crisp.","hash":"5fad2ee207e5627d","embedding":""},{"id":"tesseract-fold","name":"Tesseract Fold","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","kaleidoscope","geometric","folding","iridescent","atmospheric"],"description":"Neon stained-glass tesseract faces with spectral edge diffraction, inner-face interference, held projection-plane deformation, bounded click-pulsed fold shells, closed-form 4D-style rotation, and depth-aware alpha.","hash":"d178c5a115a86c5c","embedding":""},{"id":"texture","name":"Procedural Texture Analyzer","category":"image","tags":["image","video","edge-enhance","unsharp","temporal","vignette","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Multi-scale texture analyzer with Laplacian edge enhancement, unsharp mask, temporal smoothing, golden-ratio vignette, and audio-reactive sparkle/glitch.","hash":"297d100cd548aaee","embedding":""},{"id":"tilt-shift","name":"Tilt Shift Miniature","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing","tilt-shift","miniature","depth-of-field"],"description":"Scheimpflug principle tilt-shift with angular blur kernel and depth-aware circle-of-confusion. Bass drives tilt angle oscillation, mouse positions the focal plane, depth controls local blur radius. Features boosted saturation, vignette on blurred regions, ACES tone mapping, and chromatic aberration in out-of-focus area","hash":"49a3991b533e7e68","embedding":""},{"id":"triangle-mosaic","name":"Triangle Mosaic","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Equilateral triangle mosaic with truthful display-history feedback, animated seam runners, held twist, click fronts, depth scaling, and spectral color.","hash":"c634c3703558793a","embedding":""},{"id":"velvet-scatter-bloom","name":"Velvet Scatter Bloom","category":"image","tags":["velvet","subsurface","bloom","atmospheric","audio-reactive","organic","cinematic"],"description":"Rich velvet-like subsurface scattering on darker regions of the input, with living audio-reactive bloom and a moving mouse light that reveals hidden color beneath the surface. Feels luxurious and organic on both stills and video.","hash":"f3b149bf5676168d","embedding":""},{"id":"vhs-chroma-bleed","name":"VHS Chroma Bleed","category":"image","tags":["vhs","retro","glitch","chroma","noise","jitter","tape","analog","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"VHS tape aesthetic with authentic tape degradation: time-varying chromatic aberration, tape tracking error with horizontal wobble and jitter, audio-reactive line dropouts, compression artifacts, analog warmth, saturation roll-off, noise bands, film grain, scanlines, CRT barrel distortion, and vignette. Chromatic bleed ","hash":"876ed1d8f8229018","embedding":""},{"id":"video-echo-chamber","name":"Video Echo Chamber","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Orbiting history conveyors and horizontal chromatic streaks form bounded video echoes around the mouse, while clicks launch expanding echo rings. Depth is passed through unchanged.","hash":"4c18f75a38134cc7","embedding":""},{"id":"voxel-depth-sort","name":"Voxel Depth Sort","category":"image","tags":["voxel","depth","3d","audio-reactive","isometric","ambient-occlusion"],"description":"Converts the image into a 3D grid of isometric floating blocks. Block height is determined by brightness and depth, with ambient occlusion, soft shadows, and mouse-rotated isometric projection.","hash":"ecbc0bdd55ca809d","embedding":""},{"id":"watercolor-bloom","name":"Watercolor Bloom","category":"image","tags":["watercolor","bloom","paint","soft","audio-reactive","temporal","artistic"],"description":"Soft watercolor bloom with exact-load advected wet pigment, fast pigment runners, held-pointer diffusion, click blooms, paper fiber texture, truthful drying, and real audio.","hash":"8a0e9db6cdddea7f","embedding":""},{"id":"wave-halftone","name":"Wave Halftone","category":"image","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Halftone dot pattern with a waving grid and mouse magnification lens.","hash":"d9dcceaa52416bf3","embedding":""},{"id":"anamorphic-flare","name":"Anamorphic Flare","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generates a cinematic horizontal lens flare centered on the mouse position.","hash":"70d117beb1d07988","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-decode","name":"ASCII Decode","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Renders the view as a digital ASCII matrix. Mouse movement acts as a decoding lens.","hash":"5798de4df30a755f","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-lens","name":"ASCII Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Reveals the image as procedural ASCII characters within a lens radius around the mouse.","hash":"7fc4ba9c9e1a2378","embedding":""},{"id":"bio-touch","name":"Bio-Luminescent Touch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","bioluminescence","voronoi","organic","glow"],"description":"Bioluminescent cellular membranes with traveling nuclei, held curl vortices, click growth fronts, three-band audio, and spectral organism color.","hash":"be981a25d0c51c6a","embedding":""},{"id":"biomimetic-scales","name":"Biomimetic Scales","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"","hash":"2ed556173863403b","embedding":""},{"id":"block-distort-interactive","name":"Block Distort","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","grid","glitch","audio-reactive","volumetric-glow","rim-lighting","lighting"],"description":"Cursor pressure shoves image blocks into a prismatic distortion field with beat-reactive grid highlights. Enhanced with volumetric glow from mouse position, rim lighting on grid edges, audio-reactive light pulses, and warm/cool 3-point fill lighting.","hash":"c99432e31dcea46c","embedding":""},{"id":"blueprint-reveal","name":"Blueprint Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","blueprint","ink","reveal","schematic"],"description":"Temporal ink dissolve with depth hatch density and audio surge. Sobel edge detection draws blueprint lines; previous reveal state bleeds outward like spreading ink. Depth modulates hatch fineness, bass creates ink ripple surges from the mouse.","hash":"cac3ccdc486a9c8f","embedding":""},{"id":"brush-strokes","name":"Brush Strokes","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["paint","brush","impasto","artistic","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Impasto oil brush stroke simulation with directional bristle friction, dynamic glaze cycling, and canvas grain relief. Features spring cursor bristle tracking, click paint spatter ripples, exact-C temporal paint accumulation, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"c5e7ef9124bbf512","embedding":""},{"id":"bubble-wrap","name":"Bubble Wrap","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive bubble wrap that you can pop with your mouse. Popped bubbles stay popped!","hash":"b7031857a2ae12de","embedding":""},{"id":"charcoal-rub","name":"Charcoal Rub","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Scratch-off effect like rubbing charcoal paper. Mouse reveals image beneath textured overlay.","hash":"d84e15f0c30473b0","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-depth-tunnel","name":"Chroma Depth Tunnel","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","tunnel","chromatic","distortion"],"description":"A mouse-centered chromatic tunnel with smooth axial flight, helical spectral runners, bounded afterimage streaks, and click-launched shock rings. Depth is passed through unchanged.","hash":"eb23df466c932ab3","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-kinetic","name":"Chroma Kinetic","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","chromatic-aberration","kinetic","mouse","motion-blur","velocity"],"description":"Velocity chromatic aberration with directional smear and audio split. R channel leads, B lags based on motion direction; bass drives lead amount, mids drive smear glow. Directional motion trails sample along the velocity vector for cinematic motion blur.","hash":"7d543531f4d4e654","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-lens","name":"Chroma Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Held magnifying lens with chromatic edge splitting, actual tangential edge blur, rapid rim runners, audio response, and click-launched glass fronts.","hash":"df4148d8856f44a3","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-shift-grid","name":"Chroma Shift Grid","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["chromatic","lens","grid","distortion"],"description":"Grid-based multi-mode chromatic aberration with alpha-channel translucency blending. Uses single UV displacement + spectral tint via mix(), with Voronoi F2-F1 cell pattern variation. Alpha encodes grid distortion strength * cell activity.","hash":"ee3ba51543088589","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatic-mosaic-projector","name":"Chromatic Mosaic Projector","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","mosaic","chromatic","voronoi","audio-reactive","interactive","hdr","temperature","alpha-layered","edge-preserve","luminance-key"],"description":"Animated Voronoi projector with crossed mosaic conveyors, tile-belt runners, held gravity warping, bounded chromatic tile blasts, audio pulsing, exact-load temporal trails, and layered premultiplied alpha.","hash":"71ce2b90a7e7b7e0","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatic-shockwave","name":"Chromatic Shockwave","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Continuous chromatic ripples emanating from the mouse.","hash":"82c68bf33bd162e0","embedding":""},{"id":"chronos-brush","name":"Chronos Brush","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","brush","temporal","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"Freeze time by painting over the video feed with chromatic brush tints that cycle per click. Audio boosts brush size and opacity; depth modulates paint intensity.","hash":"1c246ac2fb7a6939","embedding":""},{"id":"circuit-breaker","name":"Circuit Breaker","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Transforms image into a circuit board. Mouse interaction overloads the circuits.","hash":"8407a1fabc18a423","embedding":""},{"id":"cmyk-halftone-interactive","name":"CMYK Halftone Interactive","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["cmyk","halftone","print","audio-reactive"],"description":"Rosette/moire CMYK halftone with rotating screens, registration drift and held plate shear, ink conveyors/packets, click blooms, rainbow registration glow, and three-band audio. A remains CMYK coverage masks.","hash":"3e4a0b17425246b3","embedding":""},{"id":"codebreaker-reveal","name":"Codebreaker Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"","hash":"a006566aed5c9f1d","embedding":""},{"id":"cross-mouse-spec-dispersion-lens","name":"Prismatic Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crossover","mouse-driven","prismatic","dispersion","lens","refraction","chromatic"],"description":"Crossover shader combining mouse-driven lens interaction with physical spectral dispersion. The cursor becomes a prismatic lens that refracts RGB channels differently using Cauchy's equation.","hash":"5abd31cedabe668a","embedding":""},{"id":"cross-stitch","name":"Cross Stitch Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Quantizes the image into cross-stitch patterns. Mouse movement unravels or distorts the fabric.","hash":"14d06c7714accad3","embedding":""},{"id":"crystal-freeze","name":"Crystal Freeze","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crystal","ice","freeze","transmission","voronoi","physical"],"description":"Mouse freezes the image into growing ice crystals with physical light transmission. Features Voronoi-based crystal cells with Fresnel reflection, path absorption, and purity-based scattering.","hash":"10e1263741b22925","embedding":""},{"id":"crystal-illuminator","name":"Crystal Illuminator","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crystal","gemstone","transmission","fresnel","voronoi","physical","mouse-driven"],"description":"Faceted glass/gemstone surface with physical light transmission. Features Voronoi-based facets with mouse-controlled lighting, Fresnel reflection, and purity-based scattering for realistic crystal appearance.","hash":"3ca9ccc6fb97aa1c","embedding":""},{"id":"crystal-refraction","name":"Crystal Refraction","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crystal","lens","refraction","dispersion","transmission","fresnel","audio","music","reactive","alpha","physical-transmittance"],"description":"Interactive faceted crystal lens with physical light transmission. Features IOR-based chromatic dispersion, Fresnel reflection at edges, and variable crystal thickness affecting light path.","hash":"d947b8e026e2ca05","embedding":""},{"id":"cursor-aura","name":"Cursor Aura","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","interactive","audio-reactive"],"description":"Glowing aura around cursor with customizable colors, edge detection, and audio-reactive bass pulsing.","hash":"af364ee49ac49308","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-focus","name":"Cyber Focus","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"High-tech focus aperture with smooth scanner packets, stable block interference, chromatic defocus, and click-launched rings of clarity.","hash":"df2139ad64958290","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-glitch-hologram","name":"Cyber Glitch Hologram","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["hologram","glitch","cyber","datamosh","interference","audio-reactive"],"description":"Block-based datamoshing with structure-tensor motion estimation, holographic cosine interference fringes, cyan/magenta color separation, chromatic aberration on glitch blocks, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"aff5ba7f28469e64","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-hex-armor","name":"Cyber Hex Armor","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Articulated hex armor retracts around the pointer while beveled seams and audio-routed circuit traffic carry expanding click waves.","hash":"9f97568847d52706","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-lattice","name":"Cyber Lattice","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Layered perspective lattice rails carry thin-film cell traffic through spring-followed held deformation and expanding click waves.","hash":"af570d21557f7197","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-magnifier","name":"Cyber Magnifier","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","magnifier","cyber","hud"],"description":"High-tech magnifying lens with chromatic aberration and HUD overlay.","hash":"f850e3f182a8d819","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-organic","name":"Cyber Organic Scanner","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["scanner","organic","biotech","pulse","audio-reactive","bioluminescent","atmospheric"],"description":"Biotech scan lines reveal pulsing synthetic veins beneath the image, concentrated around the cursor. Enhanced with bioluminescent OkLab color mixing, blackbody warmth modulation, volumetric vein glow, split-tone grading, and ACES filmic tone mapping.","hash":"e24876e56114cde5","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-rain","name":"Cyber Rain","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["rain","neon","wet-glass","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","temporal-feedback","depth-aware","chromatic-aberration"],"description":"Neon rain on wet glass with mouse wiper, audio-envelope intensity, temporal wetness accumulation, depth-aware rain occlusion, and chromatic-aberration glow.","hash":"f6ce8048d7dbe4f5","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-ripples","name":"Cyber Ripples","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","interactive","feedback","fbm","palette","sdf"],"description":"Interactive cursor-driven ripples fused with domain-warped FBM turbulence, audio-driven cyber palette shifting, SDF ring masking, click shockwaves, bass envelope feedback trails, depth-aware compositing, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"0d59e9055e667e5c","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-slit-scan","name":"Cyber Slit Scan","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Traveling multi-head slit scan with diagonal tear ribbons, phosphor aurora / oil-slick bands, held-pointer bending, click injections, conveyor decay, bit crushing, and three-band audio. Display RGBA packed in A.","hash":"45ce282762b38e31","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-trace","name":"Cyber Trace","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"A glowing neon trail that follows your mouse cursor and reacts to clicks, overlaid on the video feed.","hash":"64d3d1b58a64efd0","embedding":""},{"id":"data-slicer-interactive","name":"Data Slicer","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","glitch","feedback","temporal","fbm","slice"],"description":"Glitchy horizontal slicing with FBM-warped torn edges, click-triggered slice bursts from ripple history, bass-modulated slice count, and semantic alpha at slice boundaries.","hash":"e8f61024d87158e0","embedding":""},{"id":"data-stream-corruption","name":"Data Stream Corruption","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Vertical data streams fall like rain; your mouse leaves a trail of corrupted code blocks.","hash":"465749b4dcdbaab5","embedding":""},{"id":"data-stream","name":"Digital Stream","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["digital","matrix","green","data","stream","glitch","interactive","audio-reactive"],"description":"Matrix data strips with hex glyphs, spring wake, cyber palette, capped click ripples, held turbulence boost, regional FFT strip bins, and ACES output.","hash":"31b49d3fc9a21410","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-compression","name":"Digital Compression","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","compression","blocky","yuv"],"description":"YUV block crush with spring focus window, held widen, capped ripples, block-edge geometry, exact C artifact memory, and ACES tone map.","hash":"7db0560c92a90b76","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-haze","name":"Digital Haze","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","fog","haze","hex"],"description":"Beer-Lambert digital haze with hex grid overlay, iridescent scatter, sprung clear window, capped click pulses, and per-cell FFT static.","hash":"59d0a4b204ce319b","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-mold","name":"Digital Mold","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","mold","reaction-diffusion","organic","temporal","growth","bioluminescent"],"description":"Gray-Scott mycelium with nutrient-gradient chemotaxis — hyphae extend up the image-luminance gradient the way real mycelium forages, rather than diffusing isotropically — and per-band sporulation regimes, where each FFT bin pushes its own zone into a different region of the Gray-Scott parameter plane so the colony grow","hash":"00223763f7116b5a","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-reveal","name":"Digital Rain Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","digital-rain","reveal","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"Matrix rain with glyph shapes hides the image; sprung brush reveals content. Held enlarges brush, clicks add capped ripples, regional FFT colors, depth-weighted reveal, ACES composite.","hash":"eadc6ddae5fffdec","embedding":""},{"id":"directional-glitch","name":"Directional Glitch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","glitch","interactive","audio-reactive","temporal-feedback","chromatic-aberration","curl-noise","voronoi","multi-scale","sdf","palette","kaleidoscope"],"description":"SDF-masked Voronoi-ridge and FBM domain-warped glitch bands radiate from the mouse, driven by curl-noise displacement, audio-reactive cosine palette, chromatic aberration, depth-aware masking, and kaleidoscope temporal feedback.","hash":"c4f2a4ec73809639","embedding":""},{"id":"double-exposure","name":"Double Exposure Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","double-exposure","zoom","overlay","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Photographic double exposure combining source imagery with a domain-warped, rotated, and scaled secondary exposure. Features spring-damper transform pivot dynamics, rotational ripple shockwaves, exact-C ghost trails, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"88c26c08cecc3727","embedding":""},{"id":"dynamic-halftone","name":"Dynamic Halftone","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["halftone","filter","image-processing","interactive","audio-reactive"],"description":"Variable-angle CMYK print rosettes morph between expressive dot shapes, with held magnification, click-driven ink waves, and three-band plate motion.","hash":"302f66bc2c148112","embedding":""},{"id":"echo-ripple","name":"Echo Ripple","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","ripple","feedback","interactive"],"description":"Oil-slick thin-film rings with bioluminescent wake harmonics, stronger held gravity bowl, capped click history (50), exact-load feedback advection, and ACES display preserving [displayRGB, bassEnvelope] A packing.","hash":"860a01f3222ac482","embedding":""},{"id":"edge-glow-mouse","name":"Edge Glow Mouse","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["edges","glow","neon","cursor","audio-reactive","bloom","chromatic","HDR","iridescent","oil-slick"],"description":"Unsharp-masked edges bloom into oil-slick magenta/teal neon with anisotropic bloom packets racing along tangents, richer click ring bursts, held tighten+intensify, C-persisted halo trail, ACES, and FFT band shimmer. Distinct psychedelic film — not plain cyan.","hash":"f1d6d074bd2f9435","embedding":""},{"id":"energy-shield","name":"Energy Shield","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","hex-grid","sci-fi","audio-reactive","force-field"],"description":"A sci-fi hexagonal force field that lights up under the cursor, trails activation history, and detonates expanding impact rings on click. Hex edges shimmer with oil-slick iridescence instead of flat cyan; a stronger Fresnel rim reads as a curved shield surface. Held press tightens the hex grid and sharpens cell edges. ","hash":"eb61df908d4d02e7","embedding":""},{"id":"entropy-grid","name":"Entropy Grid","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Scrambles the image into a chaotic grid using domain-warped FBM, Voronoi cellular ridges, and Clifford strange-attractor chaos. Mouse restores order (or creates chaos) with audio-reactive entropy.","hash":"424eec11f3c1f9e6","embedding":""},{"id":"fabric-zipper","name":"Fabric Zipper","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Unzip the canvas to reveal the underlying image. Drag the mouse vertically to control the zipper.","hash":"15362662baa0a2cc","embedding":""},{"id":"ferrofluid","name":"Magnetic Ferrofluid","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Viscous image-warping ferrofluid with rotating magnetic domains, droplet runners, gradient-derived metallic normals, held attraction, click fronts, chromatic reflection, and advected HDR trails.","hash":"2787483c5361541e","embedding":""},{"id":"fiber-optic-weave","name":"Fiber Optic Weave","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Deconstructs the image into glowing optical fibers with weighted mouse plucks, click-launched pulses, and per-fiber audio voices.","hash":"6cc2e84da0d0cacc","embedding":""},{"id":"flux-core","name":"Flux Core","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Energy arcs emit from the cursor, connecting to bright areas in the image.","hash":"319c9bd263ca6520","embedding":""},{"id":"focal-pixelate","name":"Focal Pixelate","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Mouse-driven focal pixelation with FBM domain warp, depth-aware fog, IGN dither, and semantic alpha for slot-chain compositing.","hash":"b43ba88f93612c6a","embedding":""},{"id":"foil-impression","name":"Foil Impression","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Embossed metallic foil with moving brushed highlights, held impression pressure, click rings, three-band audio, and iridescent spectral reflection.","hash":"7c672a6a2fb8d3dc","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-bead-curtain","name":"Glass Bead Curtain","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["glass","beads","iridescent","refraction","caustics","fresnel","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Physical glass bead curtain with Fresnel refraction, chromatic caustics, subsurface scattering, and bead-collision physics. Bass drives wind sway, mouse pushes beads aside, depth controls perspective bead size.","hash":"d8ce92d934d0724b","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-shatter","name":"Glass Shatter","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["glass","shards","prismatic","distortion","shatter","voronoi","birefringence","fracture"],"description":"Voronoi facets with stress birefringence: residual stress concentrates at the facet boundaries and under load, and the resulting retardation produces per-wavelength polariscope fringes along the cracks. Crack energy accumulates in dataTextureC so repeated clicks progressively craze the glass rather than each producing ","hash":"69df1be3098ebeae","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-wall","name":"Glass Wall","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Physical glass refraction with single-sample spectral tint, depth-aware mortar edges, and alpha translucency from refraction strength and glass thickness.","hash":"8aee5545aa439358","embedding":""},{"id":"glitch-cathedral","name":"Glitch Cathedral","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Stained-glass geometric patterns with glitch artifacts; mouse triggers channel separation and pixel sorting.","hash":"d306fea65bc57604","embedding":""},{"id":"gravity-lens","name":"Gravity Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"","hash":"ff43f988cc9a4f99","embedding":""},{"id":"hex-mosaic","name":"Hexagon Mosaic","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","hexagon","mosaic","interactive","glass","ripple"],"description":"Hexagonal glass-tile mosaic that reveals the clear image around the mouse cursor. Beveled tiles with grout seams shimmer with audio-reactive glints, bass boosts saturation, clicks send light ripples across the tiles, and holding the mouse down magnifies the mosaic under the cursor.","hash":"b251d7f5ebceda47","embedding":""},{"id":"hex-pulse","name":"Hex Pulse","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["hex","honeycomb","wave-equation","interference","bioluminescent","chromatic","HDR"],"description":"Honeycomb hexagonal lattice with damped wave equation interference. Bioluminescent cell glow, chromatic dispersion at edges, and HDR bloom on constructive interference nodes. Mouse excites local cells; bass triggers cascades.","hash":"e30fd7924b8680e7","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-edge-ripple","name":"Holographic Edge Ripple","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["holographic","edge-detect","diffraction","iridescence","filter"],"description":"SDF edge detection with Laplacian zero-crossings, damped wave equation ripples, holographic rainbow diffraction, and Fresnel iridescence with ACES tone mapping.","hash":"70e7e26dd3629c5c","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-prism","name":"Holographic Prism","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["prism","holographic","dispersion","interference","speckle","audio","chromatic","depth-aware"],"description":"Triangular prism dispersion with Snell's law refraction, wavelength-accurate rainbow spectrum, holographic interference fringes and speckle. Bass rotates prism, mouse controls incident angle, depth drives parallax.","hash":"198b1392762adfe5","embedding":""},{"id":"hyper-chromatic-delay","name":"Hyper-Chromatic Delay","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","spectral","echo","reverb","distortion","audio-reactive"],"description":"Spectral Multi-Tap Echo with wavelength-dependent refraction, per-channel lens distortion, motion-aware temporal blur, and audio-reverb-inspired feedback echoes.","hash":"70af075d47d611e9","embedding":""},{"id":"hypnotic-spiral","name":"Hypnotic Spiral","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Bounds-safe breathing spiral geometry with corrected normalized pointer warp, held reversal, capped click waves, depth twist, three-band audio, and spectral color.","hash":"b5a5e53caba8aead","embedding":""},{"id":"impasto-swirl","name":"Impasto Swirl","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates wet oil paint mixing. Mouse acts as a smudge tool that stirs the image.","hash":"0df6400f71e2f60e","embedding":""},{"id":"infinite-fractal-feedback","name":"Infinite Fractal Feedback","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Perpetual zoom tunnel with rotating mandala patterns. Mouse controls the zoom focal point and rotation speed.","hash":"a36315ed5feed046","embedding":""},{"id":"infinite-spiral-zoom","name":"Möbius–Droste Spiral","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["warp","distort","fractal","mobius","droste","spiral","zoom","temporal","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Möbius transformation composed with log-polar mapping for Droste self-similar infinite zoom. Temporal Möbius drift, audio-driven zoom speed, depth-scaled chromatic aberration, and multi-fold symmetry.","hash":"aea2cb54755c9ebf","embedding":""},{"id":"infinite-video-feedback","name":"Infinite Video Feedback","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Create a feedback loop with the previous frame, applying zoom and rotation centered on the mouse.","hash":"ae26745a3ddc811a","embedding":""},{"id":"ink-bleed","name":"Ink Bleed","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","ink","paper","diffusion","artistic","brush"],"description":"Anisotropic capillary diffusion on paper: ink wicks along a procedural fibre grain roughly four times faster than across it, so blots elongate with the grain instead of spreading as isotropic discs. Fibre angle and wicking rate are modulated by the eight FFT bins, and the nib is a spring-damped pointer in extraBuffer[1","hash":"d339978ffaf9fccc","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-emboss","name":"Interactive Emboss","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Mouse-aimed relief emboss with sprung light, bevel ridges, traveling highlight packets, oil-slick phosphor on crests, held-drag punch, and bounded click dents. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"31c2f90b2a11410c","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-film-burn","name":"Film Burn","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["film","burn","embers","analog"],"description":"Sprung film-burn hole with cigarette-click brands, ember conveyors along the rim, oil-slick heat color, and held-drag flare. A remains [hole, fire, smoke, alpha].","hash":"7e0ce12d5b587c04","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-fisheye","name":"Fluid Lens Dynamics","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","lens","fluid","temporal"],"description":"Kelvin-Voigt droplet lens with capillary waves, held meniscus pinch, oil-slick thin-film rim, traveling caustic runners, and exact-load state memory. A remains [h, v, nx, ny].","hash":"ae6d5b3cc6b2d0cd","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-frost","name":"Interactive Frost","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Realistic frost grows over the image; use your mouse (warmth) to melt it away.","hash":"d49a27e9ca97e3ff","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-glitch-brush","name":"Glitch Brush","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["glitch","interactive","brush","mouse-driven","audio-reactive"],"description":"Sprung glitch brush with click grenades, traveling scan-head conveyor, oil-slick phosphor tears, held-drag density, and exact C paint persistence. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"a0629fc596b2d2a6","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-glitch-cubes","name":"Interactive Glitch Cubes","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","cubes","extrusion","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic"],"description":"Image-mapped cubes with exact prior-state settling, beveled grout, conveyor packets, held extrusion, oil-slick edge runners, and bounded click fronts. A packs [rgb, settledHeight].","hash":"fdbdccf730a278ac","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-glitch","name":"Interactive Glitch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Continuously pulsing digital glitch blocks with fast scan tears, held-pointer amplification, real audio, and click-launched corruption fronts.","hash":"3b6ad726a50f48b4","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-halftone-spin","name":"Interactive Halftone Spin","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"CMYK halftone screens with held shear, ink conveyors, click splats, oil-slick registration glow, and three-band audio. A remains [C, M, Y, K] coverage.","hash":"d67b800e58e39861","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-kuwahara","name":"Oil Painting (Kuwahara)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive Kuwahara oil painting with held wet-focus, traveling wet runners, oil-slick pigment, click clarity fronts, and exact C wetness trail. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"5aa3aa61e1fc9367","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-magnetic-ripple","name":"Magnetic Ripple","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","fbm","curl-noise","worley","domain-warp","fractal","magnetic","field-lines"],"description":"Worley magnetic field lines with curl, spring envelopes, held field punch, oil-slick domain-wall runners, and bounded click shockwaves. A remains [env, mouseXY, intensity].","hash":"cc9c623f07c78aa6","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-pixel-wind","name":"Pixel Wind","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Wind effect driven by cursor direction.","hash":"b60b0de4f0588600","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-ripple","name":"Interactive Ripple","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["ripple","water","metallic","wave","audio-reactive","dispersion","caustics","huygens"],"description":"Analytic Huygens wavelet field with interference lattices, traveling crest packets, held-pointer pressure, click ripples, and thin-film spectral color; it is not a stateful PDE solver.","hash":"363136261834501c","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-voronoi-lens","name":"Interactive Voronoi Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["voronoi","lens","distortion","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","temporal-feedback","depth-aware"],"description":"Voronoi cells act as audio-reactive lenses with mouse-driven focus, temporal trail accumulation, depth-aware edge fog, and neon cell-boundary accents.","hash":"65e0861f1135c58d","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-voronoi-web","name":"Voronoi Web","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Dynamic voronoi web connected to the cursor.","hash":"0352ace421db9cef","embedding":""},{"id":"kaleido-portal-interactive","name":"Kaleido Portal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"A circular portal that reveals a kaleidoscopic view of the video, controlled by the mouse.","hash":"65f56032136b374b","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-chromatic-warp","name":"Kimi Chromatic Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"RGB channel separation and prismatic distortion with rotating conveyors, radial color runners, click shock rings, and bounded display-history trails around the cursor.","hash":"ed8e41814dac58a0","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-ripple-touch","name":"Kimi Ripple Touch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","ripple","water","audio-reactive"],"description":"Interactive water ripple effect at mouse position with expanding waves, chromatic aberration, and bass-driven audio reactivity.","hash":"45145f8f94cd9d7b","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-spotlight","name":"Kimi Spotlight","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","spotlight","reveal","audio-reactive"],"description":"Flashlight effect that reveals full color under the beam while surroundings are desaturated and darkened. Audio-reactive spotlight size pulses with bass.","hash":"bce936fea582aa5b","embedding":""},{"id":"kinetic-dispersion","name":"Kinetic Dispersion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","dispersion","glitch"],"description":"Mouse-velocity dispersion effect with RGB split, block scattering, and audio-reactive intensity.","hash":"966d7ac7a8225d2b","embedding":""},{"id":"knitted-fabric","name":"Knitted Fabric","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["woven","textile","fabric","audio-reactive"],"description":"Simulates a knitted wool texture. Mouse interaction pulls and stretches the fabric.","hash":"f0c8f41a7f656d08","embedding":""},{"id":"laser-burn","name":"Laser Burn","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","laser","burn","interactive","fire","embers","sparks"],"description":"Temporal burn accumulation with ember glow and audio spark showers. Mouse beam chars the surface persistently; embers fade slower than heat for lingering glow. Treble creates flying spark particles near the beam, bass deepens the char.","hash":"884573f6c0a7b780","embedding":""},{"id":"light-leaks","name":"Light Leaks","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates film light leaks. Move the mouse to change the light source angle.","hash":"e0914d57d45556c4","embedding":""},{"id":"lighthouse-reveal","name":"Lighthouse Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A rotating beam of light that reveals the image, emanating from the mouse position.","hash":"5947f36657a8010f","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-lens","name":"Liquid Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["lens","refraction","chromatic","caustics","liquid"],"description":"Moving multi-lobed aqua/amber lenses and orbiting lenslets refract the image through animated caustic meshes, click-launched rings, and held-pointer compression.","hash":"f76170b5241867e8","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-time-warp","name":"Liquid Time Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","feedback","temporal","warp","flow"],"description":"Temporal feedback follows a second-order midpoint trace through three FFT-banded divergence-free curl octaves. Bounded anti-diffusion restores transported detail without inventing new extrema, while click wipe fronts reveal fresh video.","hash":"898fb3a4523292bd","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-touch","name":"Liquid Touch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"An exact-load height-field solver with a 13-point biharmonic capillary stencil, nonlinear mean-curvature pressure, Marangoni flow, dispersive droplet waves, touch coalescence, and curvature-driven microfoam.","hash":"f3fa789c44ae52f8","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-volumetric-zoom","name":"Liquid Volumetric Zoom","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Unified 3D fluid zoom that merges parallax, vortex dynamics, plasma flow and chromatic aberration into a single volumetric zoom.","hash":"e9fc6c2b1d7e2446","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-warp","name":"Liquid Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","warp","advection","vorticity","simulation"],"description":"RK4 semi-Lagrangian flow combines exact-load state with an analytic pointer Jacobian. A finite-time Cauchy-Green tensor now yields rotation-invariant principal stretch, anisotropic chromatic spread, and near-singular fold caustics; bounded click rings inject vorticity.","hash":"09a1c22d3e7d9e4c","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-echo-warp","name":"Luma Echo Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","temporal-feedback","depth-aware","echo","warp","curl-noise","chromatic"],"description":"Temporal echo accumulation with depth-parallax attenuation and curl-noise swirl warping around the mouse. Bass drives echo amplitude and chromatic trail separation, treble adds twinkling sparkle to high-luma regions, and previous frames bleed through via dataTextureC with a luma-locked palette shimmer.","hash":"731f456965b6d519","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-force","name":"Luma Force","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["particle-advection","curl-noise","spectral","HDR","physics","vortex"],"description":"Physics-based particle advection driven by luma gradients: bright regions repel, dark attracts. Curl noise for divergence-free flow, mouse vortex, spectral chromatic aberration, and HDR velocity glow.","hash":"ba15eef720bc1405","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-magnetism","name":"Luma Magnetism","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["magnetic","field-lines","iron-filings","distortion","interactive"],"description":"Magnetic field line simulation with Runge-Kutta integration. Bright pixels act as north poles, dark as south. Renders glowing iron-filing filaments with HDR bloom and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"aa96df757c4d891b","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-slice-interactive","name":"Luma Slice Interactive","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","interactive","slice","luma"],"description":"Slices the image horizontally, displacing strips based on their luminance and mouse position. Audio-reactive intensity via bass, mids-shimmered RGB fringes tinted by a cosine palette, organic fBM wobble, and a mouse-down surge ripple, finished with vignette and grain.","hash":"3fa8c3651a3e24d2","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-topography","name":"Luma Topography","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Visualizes the image as a 3D terrain map where brightness determines height. The mouse controls a dynamic light source.","hash":"d317b7a47c181fa3","embedding":""},{"id":"magma-fissure","name":"Magma Fissure","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Branching magma fissures diffuse through a cooling heat field with fibrous crust, audio-driven molten emission, held-pointer ignition, and expanding click fractures.","hash":"1c0994475d351093","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-edge","name":"Magnetic Edge","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","neon","edge-detection","chromatic-aberration"],"description":"Anisotropic image-edge attraction follows a spring-damped magnetic pointer, with spectral flux lines, held-field amplification, and expanding click shock rings.","hash":"b17896b171530e4f","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-interference","name":"Magnetic Interference","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","magnetic","interference","domain-walls","glitch"],"description":"Magnetic interference field with a per-band domain-wall spectrum — eight wall families, each pinned at its own defect lattice and driven by its own FFT bin — and hysteresis memory: the magnetisation lags its drive and only switches past a coercive threshold, giving real magnetic lag and remanence. Fixes an unguarded ri","hash":"50a9229c874101cc","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-luma-sort","name":"Magnetic Luma Sort","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Luma-gated magnetic sorting with a guarded spring, canonical plasma bands and read-only FFT voices, exact-load trail advection, bounded click vortices, ACES, and semantic trail alpha.","hash":"5b22def681a41f5f","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-pixels","name":"Magnetic Pixels","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["magnetic","dipole","iron-filings","metallic","chromatic","HDR","physics"],"description":"Pixels behave as iron filings in a magnetic dipole field. Mouse positions the dipole; bass oscillates field strength. Metallic sheen, chromatic aberration, and HDR bloom on field concentrations.","hash":"f46926505c854faa","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-rgb","name":"Magnetic RGB","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"","hash":"73b79131ef27d93e","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-ring","name":"Magnetic Ring","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"","hash":"bde25a3adca9e85c","embedding":""},{"id":"matrix-curtain","name":"Matrix Curtain","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["matrix","code-rain","conway","phosphor","crt","audio-reactive","temporal"],"description":"Conway-inspired occupancy drives recognizable phosphor glyphs in layered rain with held curtain vortices, click/degauss fronts, exact display-history loads, and alternate hues.","hash":"b28d06ee4cee7c93","embedding":""},{"id":"mirror-drag","name":"Mirror Drag","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","mirror","temporal","chromatic","shatter"],"description":"Exact-load temporal mirror feedback with moving shard facets, held drag pressure, chromatic ghosts, click shatter fronts, and three-band spectral glow.","hash":"5e95da213c5d1f60","embedding":""},{"id":"moire-interference","name":"Moiré Interference","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generates dynamic interference patterns between the center and the mouse position.","hash":"ad57e77f93b21897","embedding":""},{"id":"molten-glass","name":"Molten Glass","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Stylized molten glass with exact-load rising heat advection, smooth convection packets, held-pointer heating, click thermal fronts, Fresnel response, and Beer-Lambert absorption.","hash":"1ae18e0104056dc9","embedding":""},{"id":"motion-heatmap","name":"Motion Heatmap","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Advected motion heatmap with rising thermal flow, fast heat runners, held-pointer injection, and click-launched thermal fronts.","hash":"b8de2a1c1d2da195","embedding":""},{"id":"motion-revealer","name":"Motion Revealer","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","depth-aware","optical-flow","motion-trails","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"Lucas-Kanade optical flow structure tensor motion detector with spectral streakline integration, bioluminescent particle wake, and exact-load temporal frame difference.","hash":"a0f389af2696ea29","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-chromatic-explosion","name":"Chromatic Explosion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","chromatic","prism","psychedelic"],"description":"The mouse drives a smooth displacement field with spectral tinting via mix and alpha translucency blending. Click ripples launch shockwaves. Audio-reactive bass pulses the entire field.","hash":"cad48babecd8a8fd","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-electromagnetic-aurora","name":"Electromagnetic Aurora","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","field-simulation","chromatic","psychedelic"],"description":"The mouse acts as a moving electric charge generating flowing EM field lines that distort UVs and rotate hue. Click ripples spawn orbiting opposite-polarity charges.","hash":"45b6b8b2b1c2174b","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-fluid-coupling","name":"Fluid Coupling","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","fluid-simulation","temporal","psychedelic"],"description":"The mouse drags a viscous fluid over the image, creating vortex streets and color absorption. Click ripples inject fluid bursts.","hash":"3dc97efcda21d252","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-gravity","name":"Interactive Gravity","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Gravitational distortion field that follows the mouse cursor.","hash":"4e09df2a44f7a595","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-hyperbolic-navigator","name":"Hyperbolic Navigator","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","geometric","hyperbolic","infinite","psychedelic"],"description":"Navigate an infinitely tiling hyperbolic plane via Möbius transformations driven by mouse position. The image maps onto a Poincaré disk with tiles shrinking toward the boundary.","hash":"c2d827f151929b18","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-ink-bleed","name":"Mouse Ink Bleed","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["ink","bleed","paint","organic","diffusion","artistic","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","temporal-feedback","depth-aware"],"description":"Organic ink that bleeds and diffuses outward from the mouse position with domain-warped FBM turbulence, temporal trails, audio envelope reactivity, and depth-aware compositing.","hash":"10c6df6f23b51191","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-julia-morph","name":"Julia Morph","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","fractal","psychedelic","morphing"],"description":"Mouse position controls the Julia set constant c for real-time fractal morphing. Click ripples pin configurations that blend together over the input image palette.","hash":"c6138417269e6ec7","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-kaleidoscope-tunnel","name":"Kaleidoscope Tunnel","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","kaleidoscope","tunnel","psychedelic"],"description":"Infinite kaleidoscope tunnel centered on the mouse. Moving creates spiraling mirrors with perspective depth. Click ripples send kaleidoscope bursts through the tunnel.","hash":"1e5b57c8d6f7a554","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-magnetic-pixel-sand","name":"Magnetic Pixel Sand","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","magnetic","particles","psychedelic"],"description":"Pixels behave as iron filings attracted or repelled by the mouse magnet based on their brightness. Creates flowing metallic grain patterns with ripple magnetic pulses.","hash":"861a29e41afd723c","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-mandelbrot-zoom-portal","name":"Mandelbrot Zoom Portal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","fractal","psychedelic","zoom","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Nested zoom-burst packets and orbital pointer spin through the Mandelbrot set. Click portals remain, sprung navigation, exact-C persist, ACES display, iteration semantic alpha.","hash":"63a36699ed7915ea","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-neural-dreamscape","name":"Neural Dreamscape","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","neural","network","psychedelic","generative"],"description":"A virtual neural network grid activates around the mouse. Neurons glow and synapse connections pulse with activation. Click ripples send waves through the network.","hash":"9c3e03d746b14326","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-paint-splatter","name":"Paint Splatter","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","paint","temporal","artistic"],"description":"Mouse drags leave colorful paint splatters sampled from the image. Paint spreads, mixes, and dries over time. Click ripples create explosive paint bursts.","hash":"2caba49126f29b77","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-polarized-light-field","name":"Polarized Light Field","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","polarization","interference","optics","psychedelic"],"description":"Mouse controls polarization angle and birefringence over the image. Creates interference fringes, Malus-law filtering, and moiré patterns. Click ripples spawn polarization vortices.","hash":"94399c82f522752a","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-synesthetic-sound-paint","name":"Synesthetic Sound Paint","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","synesthesia","generative","psychedelic"],"description":"Mouse becomes a conductor directing a visual orchestra. Screen regions map to bass blobs, mid waves, and treble sparkles. Without audio, falls back to mouse-driven generative color synthesis.","hash":"c2fa82c52dc2e12d","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-time-crystal","name":"Time Crystal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","crystal","temporal","growth","psychedelic"],"description":"Mouse clicks seed crystal growth via diffusion-limited aggregation. Crystals grow along image gradients, aging and cooling over time. Creates organic mineral formations.","hash":"bbb02498c82109bf","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-voronoi-mosaic","name":"Voronoi Mosaic","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","voronoi","mosaic","stained-glass"],"description":"Click positions seed Voronoi cells that rotate, shift, and scale independently. Stained-glass edge effects with per-cell color tinting create an evolving mosaic.","hash":"57430956d19258a6","embedding":""},{"id":"mouse-wormhole-lens","name":"Wormhole Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","portal","wormhole","psychedelic"],"description":"A wormhole portal at the mouse position inverts, spirals, and color-shifts the image inside. Dragging stretches the portal. Event-horizon glow and gravitational lensing at the edge.","hash":"910db0bc1aa35ca6","embedding":""},{"id":"nano-repair","name":"Nano-Tech Repair","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"The image is corrupted by digital rot. Use the mouse to deploy nano-bots that repair the image.","hash":"162d8668db798635","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-contour-drag","name":"Neon Wake","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music"],"description":"Dual-scale neon contour detection with held warp boost, contour runners, hue conveyor ribbons, capped click edge rings, and three-band audio.","hash":"22378e49585fabc4","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-cursor-trace","name":"Neon Cursor Trace","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","neon","particles","physics"],"description":"Spring-mass cursor physics with persistent phosphor trails, gravity-well mouse attraction, click-burst particle spawning, depth-aware compositing, and ACES tone-mapped neon glow.","hash":"3240f279d36f8a6f","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-echo","name":"Neon Echo","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","crt","phosphor"],"description":"Per-channel CRT phosphor persistence with blackbody-aged echoes, cursor drift, and scanline halation.","hash":"d5e9403a1a91e597","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-edge-radar","name":"Neon Edge Radar","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Mouse-centered radar sweep with depth-aware edge detection, audio-reactive neon emission, ACES tone mapping, IGN dither, Fresnel rim, volumetric fog, hue-preserve clamp and blackbody hotspots.","hash":"0e7d35ea48630e5e","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-flashlight","name":"Neon Flashlight","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Depth-edge neon flashlight with animated cone ribs, radial sweeps, held beam squeeze, click flashes, and three-band spectral pulses.","hash":"94799a35d59f7d1d","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-fluid-warp","name":"Neon Fluid Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Viscous curl jets and neon edge runners around a sprung pointer. Held drag thickens the fluid, clicks kick refraction rings, exact-C glow persist, ACES display, emissive semantic alpha.","hash":"89ae11bb42416b30","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-pulse","name":"Neon Pulse Distortion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","neon","plasma","blackbody","thermal","grid"],"description":"Blackbody plasma cell array where each cell owns one of the eight FFT bins driving its base temperature and flicker rate. Cell temperature is carried through dataTextureC and relaxed with a Stefan-Boltzmann-style T^4 cooling term, so filaments heat fast under the cursor and cool slowly. Fixes a shader catalogued as mou","hash":"a0124f2b7e76b3f5","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-ripple-split","name":"Neon Ripple Split","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"A reactive ripple effect using unified displacement fields and alpha translucency blending. Features spectral tint via mix(), mouse gravity wells, ripple integration, audio-reactive bass envelope, and temporal feedback.","hash":"6a2aaa6837be422e","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-strings","name":"Neon Strings — Blackbody Wire","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["glow","neon","strings","blackbody","thermal","audio","reactive"],"description":"Plucked-string vibration with a stylized heated-wire palette driven by squared displacement. Traveling pluck packets, harmonic afterimage streaks, and click-launched string impulses move across the wire bank while audio drives vibrato and shimmer.","hash":"8e2d5d0693d4cd0f","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-warp","name":"Neon Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","thermal","mirage","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Closed-form thermal packets and a refraction whip. Heat is analytic from pointer and ripples — A stores ACES display, not a second sim. Exact-C glow advection, ACES, heat-energy alpha.","hash":"02bf5550f875e138","embedding":""},{"id":"neural-nexus","name":"Neural Nexus","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["neural","synapse","electric","audio-reactive"],"description":"Biological neural network simulation with pulsing electrical signals; mouse sends shockwaves through synapses.","hash":"da608b9f59d5d878","embedding":""},{"id":"night-vision-scope","name":"Night Vision Scope","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates a night vision intensifier tube with a high-clarity scope area following the mouse.","hash":"39076ffb222521b9","embedding":""},{"id":"optical-feedback","name":"Optical Feedback Loop","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["feedback","loop","infinite","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","domain-warp","depth-aware","hue-shift","tunnel","psychedelic","recursive"],"description":"Infinite optical feedback tunnel with a time-correct spring-damped pointer, multi-front ripple shockwaves and per-band spectral hue rotation that separates the tunnel into rings. Fixes two serious bugs: u.config.y (the ripple count) was used as delta time, freezing the spring and hue when no clicks were alive and explo","hash":"719b153f7566dc88","embedding":""},{"id":"origami-fold","name":"Origami Fold","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["origami","paper","fold","interactive","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","mountain-valley","Kawasaki-Justin"],"description":"Upgraded paper folding with mountain/valley crease patterns, dihedral angle constraints, Kawasaki-Justin flat-foldable vertices, paper fiber texture, shadow casting, HDR specular highlights on creases, ACES tone mapping, and chromatic edge darkening. Bass drives fold animation speed, mouse performs folds (mountain vs v","hash":"f7a5b0dc68e7feb5","embedding":""},{"id":"oscilloscope-overlay","name":"Oscilloscope Overlay","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","overlay","audio-reactive","audio-envelope","sparkle"],"description":"Overlays a real-time luminance waveform of the image scanline at the mouse cursor's vertical position, now with a smoothed bass envelope, treble sparkle, audio-reactive color temperature, HDR tone mapping, and IGN dithering.","hash":"1d74b7330d0ddb41","embedding":""},{"id":"paper-burn","name":"Paper Burn","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Fibrous paper combustion diffuses along anisotropic grain with audio-lit ember fronts, adjustable char width, held-pointer ignition, and expanding click burns.","hash":"d91d8a079d0ae8c6","embedding":""},{"id":"paper-cutout","name":"Paper Cutout","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Quantizes the image into relief paper layers with a spring-following light, audio-shimmered strata, and click-punched emboss rings.","hash":"1edfa0edf106cca9","embedding":""},{"id":"parallax-glow-compositor","name":"Parallax Glow Compositor (Pass 2)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Compositor that applies chromatic aberration, volumetric glow, and depth-aware compositing for volumetric zooms.","hash":"6944ca408d126a39","embedding":""},{"id":"particle-disperse","name":"Particle Disperse","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Mouse blows particles away with wind physics. Particles return to original position with spring forces.","hash":"a648c73ca2c11c3e","embedding":""},{"id":"particle-swarm","name":"Particle Swarm","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","particles","swarm","boids","scattering","physics"],"description":"Boid swarm with anisotropic scattering: each particle reads its neighbours out of the state texture and applies cohesion and separation, so the field forms travelling flocks instead of N independent springs. Per-particle FFT bands drive turbulence and the attractor is spring-damped through extraBuffer[133..136]. Fixes ","hash":"8c3e30ea3a9a3824","embedding":""},{"id":"phosphor-magnifier","name":"Phosphor Magnifier","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crt","phosphor","lens","retro","audio-reactive"],"description":"CRT phosphor magnifier with display-RGBA afterimage feedback, aurora scan runners, raster-beam motion, degauss rings, held lens pressure, click shells, chromatic aberration, and psychedelic phosphor hue. Intentional A feedback correction from diagnostic masks to display RGBA.","hash":"3d07c3b0e68ebc56","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-drag-smear","name":"Pixel Drag Smear","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Exact-load wet-paint feedback with moving curl/combing modes, held drag strength, click pigment fronts, three-band audio, and spectral paint highlights.","hash":"791a1ba39ac77727","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-explode","name":"Pixel Explode","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"","hash":"fdf82f2ad307b399","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-focus","name":"Pixel Focus","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","pixelation","focus","mosaic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Applies a mosaic effect everywhere except for a clear focus area around the mouse. Audio-reactive density adds rhythmic pulse to pixelation.","hash":"d696f6fbd93eae25","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-repel","name":"Pixel Repeller","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"","hash":"350bdf6851ec0c23","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-reveal","name":"Pixel Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","pixel-sort","glitch","scanlines","film-grain","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"Pixel sorting with threshold-based reveal and temporal noise accumulation. Revealed pixels decay back to hidden over time. Glitch chromatic separation on edges, scanline bands, film grain, and depth-controlled pixel perspective.","hash":"43ef7f9e2ae3883b","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-sort-explorer","name":"Pixel Sort Explorer","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Sorts pixels into interval-segmented luma streaks inside a mouse-driven spotlight, with organic line wobble, a traveling scan read-out, and audio-reactive lens breathing.","hash":"a2280a3ae9bd679a","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-sort-radial","name":"Radial Pixel Stretch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Kinetic radial pixel sorting with luminance gates, traveling radial runners, held stretch pressure, click fronts, chromatic separation, and spectral color.","hash":"90e714ff108fcad3","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-stretch-cross","name":"Pixel Stretch Cross","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","fibonacci","depth-aware","stretch","distortion","interactive-mouse","alpha-layered"],"description":"Multi-direction pixel stretch using Fibonacci disk sampling, mouse gravity well, depth-aware attenuation, bass-envelope magnitude, click shockwaves, temporal trails, and layered alpha compositing with depth fading, luminance keying, and accumulative feedback.","hash":"5f245b6f4e02f7dd","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-wind-chimes","name":"Pixel Wind Chimes","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Slices the image into hanging vertical strips that swing like wind chimes when pushed by the mouse.","hash":"12f099502355692d","embedding":""},{"id":"polar-warp-interactive","name":"Polar Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","interactive","polar","warp","audio-reactive","temporal-feedback"],"description":"Recursive liquid polar tunnel bands with interference mandalas, smooth seeded sparkles, held singularity deformation, bounded click spirals, chromatic grading, and truthful A state packed as [bassEnvelope, mouseX, mouseY, alpha].","hash":"a3bfb9f73177da0d","embedding":""},{"id":"poly-art","name":"Poly Art","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Transforms the image into a low-poly Voronoi mosaic. Mouse interaction distorts the grid density.","hash":"52ea806b4c088f83","embedding":""},{"id":"prismatic-3d-compositor","name":"Prismatic 3D Compositor (Pass 2)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Adds parallax shifting, volumetric glow, chromatic aberration and final composite with depth-aware blending.","hash":"164700e8e281f6d3","embedding":""},{"id":"prismatic-feedback-loop","name":"Prismatic Feedback Loop (Pass 2)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Raw prismatic accumulation with exact feedback loads, sprung held-pointer deformation, bounded click bursts, live plasma dispersion, ACES output glow, semantic alpha, and source-depth pass-through.","hash":"24e31715d20f0281","embedding":""},{"id":"psychedelic-noise-flow","name":"Psychedelic Noise Flow","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Layered noise-flow filaments with moving RGB currents, held pointer vortices, click fronts, three-band audio, and psychedelic spectral highlights.","hash":"1257d3cc8216ac4e","embedding":""},{"id":"quad-mirror","name":"Quad Mirror","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","kaleidoscope","mirror","geometric","audio-reactive","post-processing","tone-map","temporal","alpha"],"description":"Four-way kaleidoscope with continuously traveling mirrored ribbons and seam runners, held projection twist, bounded click shells, FBM seam warp, chromatic diffraction, exact-load A/C trails, and semantic alpha.","hash":"b1fc1b759844a108","embedding":""},{"id":"quantized-ripples","name":"Haptic Ripple Field","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","haptic","ripple","posterize"],"description":"Piezo-inspired ripple interference field with velocity-sensitive impulse strength, blended damping models, rough touch-texture modulation, and quantized color bands.","hash":"cfea59169865424a","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-cursor","name":"Quantum Cursor","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","glitch","distortion"],"description":"Quantized reality field around the cursor with chromatic distortion and audio-reactive pulse.","hash":"4ec42da9f2d76472","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-flux","name":"Quantum Flux","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Simulates quantum instability and probability waves emanating from the mouse cursor, causing jitter and color drift.","hash":"7e68594bcc7a0218","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-prism","name":"Quantum Prism","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive honeycomb prism with beveled facets and grout, moving spectral bands, oil-slick facet runners, held cell deformation, click fronts, three-band audio, facet depth, and display history in A.","hash":"1fd98bef00834e7d","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-ripples","name":"Quantum Ripples","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","waves","interference","turbulence","domain-warp","curl-noise","voronoi","sdf","palette"],"description":"Probability-cloud interference with chromatic Voronoi diffraction, entangled twin-ripple sources, stronger held and bounded click response, domain-warped turbulence, audio palettes, depth refraction, and preserved A/C display history.","hash":"411c7c1cbce14130","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-superposition","name":"Quantum Superposition","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Image vibrates between states, stabilizing when observed (mouse hover).","hash":"a2f93bf8b472318d","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-tunnel-interactive","name":"Quantum Tunnel","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","distortion","audio-reactive"],"description":"Interactive radial distortion with chromatic aberration, pulsing effects, and audio-reactive glow.","hash":"558421f0c4b5f9b9","embedding":""},{"id":"radial-hex-lens","name":"Radial Hex Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive hexagonal mosaic lens with radial magnification, FBM organic warp, depth-aware fog, and semantic alpha for slot-chain compositing.","hash":"da8b4eafe25ea3f4","embedding":""},{"id":"radial-slit-scan","name":"Radial Slit Scan","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","slit-scan","color-cycling","volumetric","audio-reactive"],"description":"A time-displacement effect that radiates from the cursor, now enhanced with volumetric glow, cosine palette color cycling, chromatic aberration, split-tone grading, and ACES filmic tone mapping.","hash":"4513bab0b83493b0","embedding":""},{"id":"rain-lens-wipe","name":"Rain Lens Wipe","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Stylized falling lens drops and rapid water streak packets distort the image while the mouse wipes an advected clean-state mask and clicks launch expanding wipe fronts. Depth is passed through unchanged.","hash":"9fedc984be4e23f4","embedding":""},{"id":"rainbow-vector-field","name":"Rainbow Vector Field (Pass 1)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generates a base rainbow pattern and computes a displacement field (stored to depth) for a follow-up prismatic feedback pass.","hash":"61377180fcd448c3","embedding":""},{"id":"raindrop-ripples","name":"Raindrop Ripples","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Raindrops fall creating ripples, but the mouse cursor acts as a shield.","hash":"3f9a3f3bb89862c7","embedding":""},{"id":"reactive-glass-grid","name":"Reactive Glass Grid","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A grid of refractive glass tiles that light up and distort based on mouse proximity.","hash":"f9e7671e379f5904","embedding":""},{"id":"reality-tear","name":"Reality Tear","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive"],"description":"Rips a hole in the image to reveal a static void underneath.","hash":"1402710ca16a1d39","embedding":""},{"id":"refraction-shards","name":"Refraction Shards","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["crystal","shards","refraction","prismatic","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Voronoi crystalline shards refract and Cauchy-disperse the source image. Features continuous orbital facet drift, acoustic stress birefringence, spring cursor deflection, click fracture wavefronts, exact-C temporal persistence, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"98f72a6d6786c79b","embedding":""},{"id":"refractive-bubbles","name":"Refractive Bubbles","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Floating bubbles around the cursor that distort the background like glass.","hash":"1a457cb02ddcc3f5","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-delay-brush","name":"RGB Delay Brush","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Paints colorful time-delayed RGB trails with spring-weighted mouse motion, click stamps, spectrum-separated response, and stylized wavelength absorption.","hash":"60aeae0bfb5a94aa","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-fluid","name":"RGB Fluidity","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Image behaves like a fluid, stirred by the mouse cursor.","hash":"756c780827051272","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-iso-lines","name":"RGB Iso Lines","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"RGB contour maps with iso-runners, ridge ticks, held parallax, bounded click fronts, and rainbow hypsometry. A packs [lineR, lineG, lineB, alpha].","hash":"88c7e1b3a80facc6","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-ripple-waves","name":"RGB Ripple Waves","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Separates RGB channels into distinct ripple waves emanating from the mouse cursor.","hash":"fa24be0e2a93ddd8","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-shift-brush","name":"RGB Shift Brush","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Held-pointer RGB separation brush with exact advected mask history, rapid spectral ribbons, stylized channel transmission, three-band audio response, and bounded click fronts.","hash":"96c01025c95a6bc9","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-split-glitch","name":"RGB Split Glitch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Splits RGB channels based on mouse proximity.","hash":"5ae22658d92303e8","embedding":""},{"id":"scan-slice","name":"Scan Slice","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","slice","chromatic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A spring-weighted mouse selects a bank of vertical slices; click stamps add temporary slices while independent audio bins color their chromatic edges.","hash":"55fa0c9ca12b795f","embedding":""},{"id":"scanline-sorting","name":"Scanline Sorting","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","sort","scanline"],"description":"Bitonic luminance sort within a sprung scan band: held widen, capped click sort bursts, regional FFT palette overlay, ACES tone map, semantic alpha.","hash":"885f0a4062033fdf","embedding":""},{"id":"scanline-tear","name":"Scanline Tear","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["interlacing","vhs","analog","retro","scanlines","sync-loss","tracking","video","ntsc"],"description":"NTSC interlace simulation with sprung tracking focus, held boost, capped sync-loss ripples, exact C field memory, regional FFT phase, and ACES output.","hash":"a8dbb642cc308b68","embedding":""},{"id":"scanline-wave","name":"Scanline Wave","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","distortion","scanlines","CRT","temporal","chromatic","audio-reactive","ACES","dither"],"description":"CRT phosphor aurora with sprung cursor, held local distortion, capped click shockwaves, exact C bass-envelope trail, ACES premultiplied alpha. Preserves [premultipliedRGB, drive] A packing.","hash":"a7fc93efa4418846","embedding":""},{"id":"selective-color","name":"Voronoi Multi-Focal Selective","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Voronoi multi-focal selective desaturation with chromatic aberration, fractal noise masking, polar sectors, SDF shapes, ripple propagation, and depth-aware edge detection.","hash":"e769c3ea0cc94ea9","embedding":""},{"id":"sequin-flip","name":"Sequin Flip","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Articulated sequins flip under hover, held brush, and click fronts, revealing GGX microfacet gold or silver backs with three-band sparkle motion.","hash":"444642382a2aefab","embedding":""},{"id":"signal-tuner","name":"Signal Tuner","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"TV-style signal interference with a smoothed audio envelope, spring-damped mouse follow, click retuning rings, and temporal feedback trails.","hash":"957df30cc18232cf","embedding":""},{"id":"sketch-reveal","name":"Sketch Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["sketch","pencil","reveal","brush","audio-reactive","charcoal","hatching","graphite"],"description":"Gradient-directed pencil and charcoal cross-hatching with graphite sheen, paper tooth texture, smudge effects, and chromatic edge darkening. Bass drives reveal progression, mouse acts as the pencil, depth controls stroke size perspective.","hash":"fe8d8ff79b89bae4","embedding":""},{"id":"sliding-tile-glitch","name":"Sliding Tile Glitch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["glitch","interactive","tiles","grid","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Grid tiles slide along directional conveyors when excited by mouse proximity, clicks, and bass transients. Features spring-damper cursor dynamics, chromatic tear, restoring decay, exact-C phosphor trails, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"6e0349b84c30b99d","embedding":""},{"id":"slinky-distort","name":"Slinky Distortion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Slices the image into horizontal bands that shift back and forth like a slinky.","hash":"f39364531e5ebc6f","embedding":""},{"id":"solarize-warp","name":"Solarize Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["solarize","darkroom","warp","twist","audio-reactive","fast-motion","aces"],"description":"Sabattier solarize with a domain-warp conveyor and traveling threshold wavefronts. Sprung pointer twist, held gain, bounded click fronts, exact-C trails, ACES display, and Mackie-edge semantic alpha.","hash":"755a705d4639b845","embedding":""},{"id":"sonar-pulse","name":"Sonar Pulse","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","sonar","pulse","audio-reactive"],"description":"Radial sonar waves emitting from the cursor that distort and scan the image. Now with audio reactivity.","hash":"64df7c8827c5d87f","embedding":""},{"id":"sonar-reveal","name":"Sonar Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Reveals the original image in a radius around the mouse, with a scanning radar ring. Reactive to audio.","hash":"58fed81f1bb23663","embedding":""},{"id":"sonic-distortion","name":"Sonic Distortion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Superellipse-masked sonic distortion with Lissajous wave interference, FBM domain warping, rose curve modulation, and alpha-ghosted echo trails.","hash":"fffbb3184d72d2db","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-brush","name":"Spectral Brush","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Paints a spectral blackbody flame that follows the mouse, blended in OkLab and split-toned. Audio bass inflates the brush and bloom, while chromatic separation, depth diffusion, and alpha-layered luminance-key compositing add atmosphere.","hash":"e75860cfc146fc94","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-distortion","name":"Spectral Distortion","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","chromatic","warp","noise"],"description":"RGB channels split and warp based on noise, mouse proximity, and bass-driven audio reactivity.","hash":"27b1d69db8770fee","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-smear","name":"Spectral Smear","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Paints sprung, noise-warped spectral trails with bounded click blooms, exact integer history advection, authoritative A display persistence, and ACES output.","hash":"4de94148caca4c4f","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-waves","name":"Luma Ripple","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","ripple","chromatic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Premultiplied luminance waves from a guarded sprung origin, with bounded click trains, three-band and read-only FFT caustics, exact-C persistence, and authoritative A display history.","hash":"a1199854e5840b02","embedding":""},{"id":"sphere-projection","name":"Sphere Projection","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Equirectangular sphere with meridians/parallels, held zoom, bounded click shells, audio spin, and liquid-rainbow lighting. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"aef1b7b7402c91df","embedding":""},{"id":"split-dimension","name":"Split Dimension","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Splits the screen into normal and glitched-negative dimensions with a spring-weighted mouse seam and click-triggered fractures.","hash":"fbd4483c9cda7d42","embedding":""},{"id":"stereoscopic-3d","name":"Stereoscopic 3D","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","anaglyph","3d","temporal","feedback","trails","depth-aware","16x16-workgroup"],"description":"Interactive anaglyph 3D effect. Mouse X/Y controls convergence bias and focal plane with spring-damped smoothing. Audio bass drives a smoothed separation pulse and glitch amplitude. Depth-aware pass-through and temporal state feedback create ghost trails and slot-chain-ready output.","hash":"9aa5c4ee9009a338","embedding":""},{"id":"stipple-engraving","name":"Stipple Engraving","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["stipple","engraving","hatching","printmaking","interactive"],"description":"Tone-aware low-discrepancy stippling combines directional hatching, paper absorption, cursor burnishing, held ink pooling, and click-driven engraving rings.","hash":"3cd791ad7cf774c9","embedding":""},{"id":"strip-scan-glitch","name":"Strip Scan Glitch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Slices the image into vertical strips that drift and jitter, controlled by mouse position.","hash":"3c6a1606ae355696","embedding":""},{"id":"swirling-void","name":"Swirling Void","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","vortex","relativistic","black-hole","temporal"],"description":"General relativistic Kerr metric frame-dragging vortex with accretion disk Doppler beaming, blackbody thermal gradient, photon sphere deflection, and exact-load photon ring persistence.","hash":"a1ab09441be606a2","embedding":""},{"id":"synthwave-grid-warp","name":"Synthwave Grid Warp","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["retro","synthwave","3d","fog","atmospheric"],"description":"3D perspective-projected synthwave floor with atmospheric fog, sun, and mountain silhouettes.","hash":"af720a9815a9e1aa","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-rift","name":"Temporal Rift","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Creates temporal echoes and time-smearing trails where the mouse moves.","hash":"c9ec889aa5d05fa6","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-slit-paint","name":"Temporal Slit Paint","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["paint","brush","artistic","temporal","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Velocity-stretched brush and traveling slit-head runners on a raw A canvas. Display is ACES of the paint composite; coverage stays in A. Held stamps, click spatters, exact-C diffusion.","hash":"0f9fe3da99177d63","embedding":""},{"id":"thermal-touch","name":"Thermal Touch","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["thermal","heat","blackbody","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Heat diffusion simulation with Gaussian blur approximation, blackbody radiation color mapping, persistent mouse heat trails, and HDR glow with ACES tone mapping.","hash":"0a472286d06cbda0","embedding":""},{"id":"tile-twist","name":"Tile Twist","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","organic","abstract"],"description":"Synesthetic quilt tiles with corrected Tile Size/Twist mapping, animated moire seams, drag-driven kaleidoscopic rotation, bounded chromatic tile blasts, smooth sparkle phases, and visible feedback packed as [bassEnvelope, trailRGB].","hash":"c351c00f59b4c3c4","embedding":""},{"id":"vaporwave-horizon","name":"Vaporwave Horizon","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Transforms the image into a retro-futuristic landscape with a mouse-controlled horizon and grid.","hash":"301db65e916da361","embedding":""},{"id":"velocity-field-paint","name":"Velocity Field — Vorticity Confinement","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","fluid","vorticity","physics","audio","reactive","temporal"],"description":"2D Navier-Stokes momentum advection with 4-neighbor vorticity confinement (Fedkiw et al.), viscous Laplace damping, chromatic shear dispersion, and exact-load velocity state persistence.","hash":"80361208f24a224c","embedding":""},{"id":"velvet-vortex","name":"Velvet Vortex","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A spiraling, velvety distortion that swirls video content around the mouse cursor.","hash":"34897bd86dcf8c40","embedding":""},{"id":"venetian-blinds","name":"Venetian Blinds","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive venetian blinds effect. Mouse Y controls the openness of the slats.","hash":"4fe4aa3cc90f9f52","embedding":""},{"id":"vertical-slice-wave","name":"Vertical Slice Wave","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","audio-reactive","distortion","temporal"],"description":"Layered vertical strip waves with seam runners, held amplitude/twist, click fronts, rainbow interference, and state-only spring/audio feedback.","hash":"c7407d562e3a611f","embedding":""},{"id":"vhs-jog","name":"VHS Jog Wheel","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Stylized VHS tracking and jogging with rapid head-switch rolls, horizontal tape-history streaks, and click tape-slip events. Mouse X controls jog distortion and Mouse Y controls tracking.","hash":"33ef96035851a779","embedding":""},{"id":"vhs-tracking-mouse","name":"VHS Tracking","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","vhs","glitch","retro"],"description":"A vertical tracking bar distortion controlled by mouse height with audio-reactive intensity.","hash":"10dcd57665b8b76d","embedding":""},{"id":"virtual-lens","name":"Virtual Lens","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A virtual magnifying glass with alpha translucency blending. Single magnification displacement plus spectral tint via mix. Alpha driven by lens edge falloff and Fresnel reflectance with depth-aware attenuation.","hash":"7c8ba1f45e00214d","embedding":""},{"id":"volumetric-depth-zoom","name":"Volumetric Depth Zoom (Pass 1)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","alpha","depth-layered"],"description":"Raymarched volumetric zoom using multiple depth slices, DOF, parallax and edge specular lighting.","hash":"7fb3b8ba99dd946d","embedding":""},{"id":"volumetric-god-rays","name":"Volumetric God Rays","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","lighting","rays","volumetric","atmosphere"],"description":"Ray-marched volumetric lighting with Mie scattering phase function, dust particle scatter, chromatic dispersion at shaft edges, ACES tone mapping, HDR bloom, and atmospheric haze. Bass drives dust density, mouse positions the light source, depth controls shaft occlusion and extinction.","hash":"5aaa2148518cd6a1","embedding":""},{"id":"volumetric-rainbow-clouds","name":"Volumetric Rainbow Clouds (Pass 1)","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Generates 3D noise clouds with normals, lighting, and depth-aware rainbow coloring for a volumetric prismatic effect.","hash":"f9d93cb768f836a7","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-glass","name":"Voronoi Glass","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Refractive Voronoi glass with true grout borders, facet glint runners, held attraction, and capped shatter fronts.","hash":"85c7a786c378f7c6","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-light","name":"Voronoi Light","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["voronoi","lighting","cellular","interactive","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Voronoi cellular lattice illuminated by an interactive spring cursor lantern. Features cybernetic neon tech mode, stained-glass facet refraction mode, bass ember border ignition, click ripple photon bursts, exact-C phosphorescence, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"fe88fbd3fd610637","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-shatter","name":"Voronoi Shatter","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Breaks the image into crystalline shards that react to mouse movement.","hash":"5d7fa6b146507691","embedding":""},{"id":"vortex-drag","name":"Vortex Drag","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Sprung vortex core with helical streak ribbons. Twist, radius, pinch, and hardness stay exact. Held shear, click whirl fronts, exact-C smear, ACES display.","hash":"9d8119326f9466fd","embedding":""},{"id":"x-ray-reveal","name":"X-Ray Reveal","category":"interactive-mouse","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Interactive X-Ray lens that reveals an inverted, edge-enhanced internal structure.","hash":"6b2e7c53836f182d","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-aurora-bands","name":"Alpha Aurora Bands","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["aurora","spectral","atmospheric","lighting","night-sky"],"description":"Multi-layer geomagnetic curtains with discrete spectral emission bands (oxygen green 557.7nm, oxygen red 630nm, nitrogen blue 427.8nm), solar wind cursor deflection, ACES tone mapping, and atmospheric persistence.","hash":"e70988cc9d8c738d","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-rift-2-pass1","name":"Aurora Rift 2 (Pass 1: Enhanced Volumetric)","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["aurora","volumetric","lighting","enhanced"],"description":"Enhanced volumetric aurora with Birkeland plasma vortex tubes, ionospheric geomagnetic substorm flash bursts, and multi-scale temporal diffusion. First pass of 2-pass system.","hash":"2f142690e33d563d","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-rift-pass1","name":"Aurora Rift (Pass 1: Volumetric)","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["aurora","volumetric","lighting","atmospheric"],"description":"Raymarches volumetric aurora with curl-driven flow, geomagnetic Birkeland curtain folds, discrete atmospheric spectral emission, and temporal diffusion. First pass of 2-pass system.","hash":"cadfbbd88f952860","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora_borealis","name":"Aurora Borealis","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["aurora","atmospheric","lighting","night-sky","nature"],"description":"Flowing atmospheric ribbons with curl noise advection, altitude-based oxygen and nitrogen emission spectra, starfield composite, ACES tone mapping, and atmospheric persistence.","hash":"2a6bee1e4612db01","embedding":""},{"id":"cinematic-flare","name":"Cinematic Flare","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["lens-flare","anamorphic","cinematic","bloom","chromatic","cooke-triplet","diffraction","film-grain","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Physically-based lens flare with Cooke triplet ghost reflections, 6-blade diffraction starburst, scatter halo, anamorphic streaks, Cauchy chromatic dispersion, ACES tone mapping, and temporal persistence.","hash":"5a9ebca590c6a314","embedding":""},{"id":"divine-light-gpt52","name":"Divine Light Cathedral gpt52","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","god-rays","cinematic","stained-glass"],"description":"Expanded volumetric rays with dust motes, Cauchy ray dispersion, rose-window stained-glass projections, and Airy disk diffraction halos.","hash":"0475ed43ecfc1fe9","embedding":""},{"id":"divine-light","name":"Divine Light","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","god-rays","volumetric","lighting"],"description":"Volumetric god rays emanating from cursor position with radial ray-marching, atmospheric dust motes, ACES tone mapping, and temporal beam persistence.","hash":"90655de7ed475aa7","embedding":""},{"id":"dynamic-lens-flares","name":"Dynamic Lens Flares","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","lens-flare","optical","ghosts"],"description":"Cinematic optical train lens flare following cursor, featuring distributed ghost elements with Cauchy chromatic dispersion, internal reflection halos, starburst diffraction, ACES tone mapping, and temporal phosphor persistence.","hash":"7a6c62c996fd153c","embedding":""},{"id":"lens-flare-brush","name":"Lens Flare Brush","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","lens-flare","brush","interactive"],"description":"Generates anamorphic lens flares from bright pixels near the mouse with rainbow chromatic shift, ghost elements, ACES tone mapping, and brush trail persistence.","hash":"c0e76dae30899707","embedding":""},{"id":"matrix_digital_rain","name":"Matrix Digital Rain","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["matrix","digital","rain","cyberpunk","retro","code"],"description":"Matrix digital rain with cascading characters, decoding effect, trail fades, and glow. Alpha tracks character brightness.","hash":"df00be29cb99c800","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-light","name":"Neon Light","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","blackbody","fresnel"],"description":"Blackbody edge emission with Fresnel-bright depth normals, thermal fog, and mouse-heated hotspots.","hash":"1b25cb22384325b8","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-pulse-edge","name":"Neon Pulse Edge","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["neon","edge","glow","bloom","audio","reactive","colorful"],"description":"3×3 Sobel edge detection with multi-layer bloom (tight core + wide halo + diffuse), direction-based hue cycling, depth-aware glow intensity, and audio-reactive pulsing.","hash":"95e9c53bbff4abed","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-volumetric-fake-em","name":"Volumetric Fake + EM Field","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","physics","volumetric","god-rays","electromagnetic"],"description":"God rays with mouse electromagnetic field distortion. Electric field bends light rays; magnetic field causes chromatic RGB separation. Click ripples spawn secondary light charges.","hash":"9a6e5baf0ace8019","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal_echo","name":"Temporal Echo","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["temporal","echo","trail","hue","chromatic","audio","depth"],"description":"Raw HDR echoes orbit the pointer with depth weighting, exact chromatic channel transport, hue rotation, held acceleration, and click-launched echo fronts.","hash":"539930ebd102985a","embedding":""},{"id":"underwater_caustics","name":"Underwater Caustics","category":"lighting-effects","tags":["water","caustics","underwater","gerstner","ocean","jacobian","interactive"],"description":"Five-scale analytic Gerstner derivatives drive Jacobian caustic focusing, spectral depth absorption, bounded god rays, cursor sun control, held swells, and click ripples.","hash":"4277fc15d2316add","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-wipes","name":"Rainy Window","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Persistent rain, wetness, rivulet flow, and glass thickness with exact C loads, a bounded sprung hand wiper, held clearing, click splashes, three-band glints, physical absorption, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"266a85651e9afc18","embedding":""},{"id":"ink-marbling","name":"Ink Marbling","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Persistent pigment and thickness marbling with exact-load advection and neighbor diffusion, three-band plasma turbulence, sprung held stirring, bounded click ink drops, ACES output, and semantic alpha.","hash":"5d91450743bdf9f5","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-liquid-glass","name":"Kimi Liquid Glass","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["fluid","liquid","water","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Persistent liquid-glass height and thickness with exact C loads, held lens push, click waves, three-band caustics, chromatic Snell refraction, interference highlights, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"158338a999e48e89","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-displacement","name":"Liquid Displacement","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["navier-stokes","fluid","liquid","water","simulation","vortex","eddy","interactive","physics"],"description":"Persistent velocity and height-field image displacement with exact-load pressure projection, viscosity diffusion, bounded pointer velocity, held flow injection, click waves, three-band turbulence, caustics, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"ce0aa521d6239f2b","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-fast","name":"Liquid Fast","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","motion-blur","audio-reactive"],"description":"Low-viscosity analytical liquid with bounded pointer inertia, high-speed vortex wakes, dispersive click packets, exact-load temporal advection, three-band spectral caustics, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"f2b347136c574b6e","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-glitch","name":"Liquid Glitch","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","glitch","temporal"],"description":"Block-quantized liquid smearing with bounded pointer tear velocity, held vortex corruption, click shard bursts, three-band chromatic splitting, exact-load datamosh history, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"7488687e88ca20b1","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-jelly","name":"Liquid Jelly","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid"],"description":"Spring-damped jelly deformation with bounded pointer inertia, exact-load thickness slopes, soft recovery, subsurface scattering, three-band audio, click waves, ACES output, and semantic alpha.","hash":"44758c9bc17b90f4","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-metal","name":"Liquid Metal","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid","metal","mercury","reflection","chromatic","distortion","organic","futuristic"],"description":"A persistent ferro-metal simulation whose raw A state packs height, velocity, foam, and wetness, with a bass-driven hexagonal Rosensweig spike mode, held magnetic pole, click impulses, chromatic refraction, and Ward-style anisotropic metallic reflection.","hash":"556fcada12660cb5","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-mirror","name":"Liquid Mirror","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A persistent reflective height field with bounded sprung pointer push, held dents, click waves, exact C state, three-band steel highlights, Fresnel reflection, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"ca254eac7fd641b7","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-oil","name":"Liquid Oil","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A persistent high-viscosity thin-film simulation packing height, response, shear, and coverage in A, with slow capillary flow, pointer stirring, click waves, interference color, specular oil optics, exact C loads, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"6b0af09dc30409e2","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-optimized-pass1","name":"Liquid Optimized (Pass 1)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid","surface-tension","capillary-waves","multi-pass","physics"],"description":"Physics simulation pass: capillary wave dynamics, Laplace pressure, ripple propagation, and ambient micro-ripples. Outputs height field state to dataTextureA.","hash":"9dcdcad51e59cf5d","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-optimized","name":"Liquid Surface Tension (Optimized)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid","surface-tension","capillary-waves","optimized","shared-memory","audio","music","capillary","refraction"],"description":"Capillary surface tension with an ANALYTIC height gradient: the field is evaluated once and its exact derivative accumulated in the same loop, replacing five full evaluations (up to 250 ripple iterations per pixel) with one. The saved budget buys an eight-train FFT capillary spectrum with dispersion-correct phase speed","hash":"78e520cdedd705b4","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-pass1","name":"Liquid (Pass 1)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid","capillary-waves","physics","multi-pass"],"description":"Capillary wave physics pass: surface tension simulation with Laplacian and biharmonic operators, gravity waves, ripple sources, and ambient micro-ripples. Outputs persistent height field to dataTextureA.","hash":"43294ba8c7383ef1","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-perspective","name":"Liquid Perspective","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","parallax","bioluminescent","gerstner","refraction"],"description":"A perspective-compressed three-wave Gerstner sheet with a depth-aware parallax Jacobian, silhouette-safe refraction, secondary shear flow, and bioluminescent click crests.","hash":"df9f5f80293fa26f","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-rainbow-prismatic","name":"Liquid Rainbow Prismatic","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid-rainbow","prismatic-dispersion","upgraded-rgba","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","thin-film","caustics"],"description":"Cauchy-separated RGB refraction through animated thin-film thickness, a six-tap caustic kernel, held lens deformation, and prismatic click fronts.","hash":"0f274273e8a02991","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-rainbow","name":"Liquid Rainbow","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","rainbow","iridescent"],"description":"Thin-film liquid refraction with bounded pointer inertia, held vortex shear, dispersive click crests, exact-load trails, Fresnel interference, three-band chromatic separation, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"6c1c4aa620dd7746","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-rgb","name":"Liquid RGB","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","chromatic","caustics","beer-lambert","vortex-flow"],"description":"Independently advected wavelength channels curl through vortex-flow dispersion, Beer–Lambert absorption, chromatic caustic seams, and held or click-driven shear.","hash":"5894fb60fd5bcef3","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-smear","name":"Liquid Smear","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","smear","brush","paint","feedback"],"description":"Spring-damped pigment drag follows the pointer's real velocity and bends along source-image contours. FFT-scaled anisotropic bleed gains a monotone local-extrema clamp, preserving fine fibres without feedback ringing or negative pigment.","hash":"42b4a124bef863bc","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-tensor-vortex","name":"Liquid Tensor Vortex","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["liquid","metal","tensor","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","depth-aware","vorticity"],"description":"Six analytic divergence-free stream-function modes produce an exact velocity-gradient tensor. Q-criterion vortex cores, principal strain, cohesive surface tension, Rankine pointer flow, and FFT energy bands drive liquid-metal refraction and temporal folds.","hash":"b90a177fb47bb148","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-v1","name":"Liquid (Ambient)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A clean baseline persistent liquid height field with ambient capillary modes, held pointer push, click waves, exact C state, three-band caustics, ACES output, and semantic alpha.","hash":"0bf5191edda1a010","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-viscous-grokcf1","name":"Liquid Viscous Nebula grokcf1","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","nebula","temporal"],"description":"Cosmic viscous flow with bounded heavy pointer inertia, held vortex shear, long-lived click eddies, exact-load nebula trails, three-band emissive veins, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"242b0d2a31038edb","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-viscous-simple","name":"Liquid Viscous (Simple)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","viscous","audio-reactive"],"description":"An efficient laminar streamline field with a lightweight cohesion stencil, shear-thinning response, spectral surface sheen, and held or click-driven vortices.","hash":"21a3069592b2fe02","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-viscous","name":"Liquid Viscous","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","fluid","navier-stokes","vorticity","simulation","dye"],"description":"A persistent 2D fluid state with midpoint semi-Lagrangian transport, streamline-aligned viscosity, Reynolds-number turbulence transition, shared-stencil vorticity confinement, a convergent local Jacobi projection, continuously drifting audio vortices, and per-band dye injection.","hash":"1cc593fb705b2b55","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-zoom","name":"Liquid Zoom","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","zoom","parallax","tunnel","depth"],"description":"Endless zoom-through built from four phase-offset parallax layers composited back-to-front by scene depth, each owning two FFT bins so the stack pulses through the spectrum. Replaces the previous two-layer version whose depth write picked a dominant layer with a hard threshold that popped on every crossing. Clicks emit","hash":"13e44c2101663e4c","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid","name":"Liquid (Interactive)","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"The canonical persistent capillary liquid with viscosity-controlled recovery, bounded pointer inertia, held surface push, click packets, curvature foam, exact C state, three-band optics, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"4832771f44fa8592","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-melt-interactive","name":"Luma Melt","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["fluid","liquid","water"],"description":"Luma-thresholded cohesive rivulets branch under heat-dependent viscosity, held-pointer melting, exact advected history, and aspect-correct click fronts.","hash":"396278bd46e15861","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-velocity-melt","name":"Luma Velocity Melt","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","melt","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","curl-noise"],"description":"Exact-load HDR history melts downward under luma-derived velocity, curl turbulence, depth viscosity, held pointer stirring, click fronts, three-band heat and chromatic flow, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"89f20d62d195f1f6","embedding":""},{"id":"rain-ripples","name":"Rain Ripples","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","liquid","ripples"],"description":"Rain-driven ripple packets with bounded pointer wakes, held water push, exact-load HDR persistence, FBM micro-ripples, Voronoi drops, three-band caustics and thin-film color, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"bcb81d48969e39ad","embedding":""},{"id":"viscous-drag","name":"Viscous Drag","category":"liquid-effects","tags":["fluid","liquid","water"],"description":"Diffused drag state drives traveling jets, pressure and thickness buildup, elastic recovery, held-pointer smears, click fronts, and illuminated viscous ridges.","hash":"5a31d1e8ec73e7d1","embedding":""},{"id":"audio-reactive-pyramid","name":"Audio Reactive Pyramid","category":"post-processing","tags":["audio-reactive","sharpening","pyramid","fft","frequency","laplacian","detail"],"description":"Three-level Laplacian-style sharpening pyramid whose band intensities are driven by matching FFT frequency bands: coarse detail by bass bins (0–12), mid detail by mid bins (13–50), fine detail by treble bins (51–127). Compatible with the ford442/flac_player FFT wire format (128 bins in extraBuffer[5..132]).","hash":"8ec670d0b29e72a9","embedding":""},{"id":"audio-reactive-rgb-dispersion","name":"Audio Reactive RGB Dispersion","category":"post-processing","tags":["audio-reactive","chromatic-aberration","dispersion","fft","spectral-centroid","rgb","frequency"],"description":"Chromatic (RGB) dispersion effect whose offset magnitudes and direction are driven by the spectral centroid of the live 128-bin FFT array. Bass-heavy music produces tight warm dispersion; treble-heavy music produces wide cool dispersion. Compatible with ford442/flac_player FFT wire format (128 bins in extraBuffer[5..13","hash":"d2dac1460b3d5ce5","embedding":""},{"id":"audio-reactive-temporal-decay","name":"Audio Reactive Temporal Decay","category":"post-processing","tags":["audio-reactive","temporal","trails","feedback","fft","decay","frequency"],"description":"Feedback trail effect whose per-pixel decay rate is modulated by the energy of a selectable FFT frequency bin range, now enhanced with spectral visualization overlay, chromatic aberration on trails, multi-pass bloom on bright areas, anamorphic streaks, film grain, scanlines, color grading with lift/gamma/gain, and vign","hash":"c6d8d3463cb7fd5a","embedding":""},{"id":"chrono-luma-slit-scan","name":"Chrono Luma Slit Scan","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","slit-scan","chrono","luminance","history","time","psychedelic","abstract"],"description":"Luminance slit-scan with horizontal/vertical scan runners, held temporal halo, treble warp detail, and capped ripple fronts.","hash":"40e84b8e16bbacca","embedding":""},{"id":"long-exposure","name":"Long Exposure Light Painting","category":"post-processing","tags":["long-exposure","light-painting","temporal","accumulation","glow","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Simulates an open camera shutter accumulating light over time. Bright regions of each frame persist and blend into a glowing exposure buffer stored in dataTextureC; darker regions fade slowly, leaving luminous light-painting trails. Mouse click resets the exposure. Bass brightens incoming frames for punchier accumulati","hash":"f15ae84cf4e75290","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-pixel-sort","name":"Luma Pixel Sort","category":"post-processing","tags":["stylized","artistic","glitch","pixel-sort","audio-reactive"],"description":"Fibonacci disk neighborhood pixel sorting with depth-aware blending, audio-reactive threshold modulation, and luminance-keyed alpha.","hash":"fae98bde6e5e79ac","embedding":""},{"id":"optical-flow-tracer","name":"Optical Flow Tracer","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","optical-flow","motion","tracer","ghost","after-image","motion-vector"],"description":"Lucas-Kanade optical flow tracer: computes per-pixel motion vectors between the current frame and the previous history frame, then warps after-images along those trajectories. Moving objects leave physically-accurate ghost trails that follow actual motion paths rather than fading in place.","hash":"75d4dff7e90d62a1","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-depth-sort","name":"Pixel Depth Sort","category":"post-processing","tags":["filter","depth-aware","pixel-sort","chromatic-aberration","audio-reactive","optimized","sorting-network","lod"],"description":"Directional pixel sorting by depth with a 25-comparator sorting network, mouse-following sort angle, depth-weighted color selection, distance-based LOD, chromatic aberration at boundaries, bass-driven sort length, depth-layered alpha, temporal feedback, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"fec80e7629c97ca2","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-bloom","name":"PP Bloom","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","bloom","hdr","blur"],"description":"High-quality HDR bloom with multi-tap Gaussian blur, anamorphic stretch, and lens dirt effects","hash":"6bff02e488c82b90","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-chromatic","name":"PP Chromatic","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","chromatic","distortion","lens"],"description":"Five-wavelength Cauchy lens dispersion with pointer-centered curvature, audio-lit caustics, temporal fringe persistence, vignette control, and expanding click refraction fronts.","hash":"7edacfbf4293ac95","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-sharpen","name":"PP Sharpen","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","sharpen","edge-enhance","detail","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Adaptive bilateral unsharp mask with halo suppression, coring noise reduction, multi-mode edge pop, interactive spring lens inspection, click clarity wavefronts, exact-C temporal stabilization, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"39e7da8e2591c14a","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-ssao","name":"PP SSAO","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","ssao","ambient-occlusion","depth"],"description":"Stylized screen-space depth occlusion with rotating sample kernels, held-pointer focus, rapid scan packets, three-band audio response, color bleed, and bounded click fronts.","hash":"7fbd527801a5f16b","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-tone-map","name":"PP Tone Map","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","tone-map","hdr","color-grading"],"description":"HDR to LDR tone mapping with ACES, Uncharted 2, Reinhard, and AgX algorithms. Includes exposure, contrast, and saturation controls.","hash":"f7248f242e3b4723","embedding":""},{"id":"pp-vignette","name":"PP Vignette","category":"post-processing","tags":["post-process","vignette","grain","film","vintage","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Cinematic optical vignette with triangular film grain, continuous multi-style color grading, bleach bypass blend modes, spring-damper cursor deflection, exposure ripple blooms, exact-C temporal grain integration, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"da678492fac4350e","embedding":""},{"id":"radial-blur","name":"Radial Blur","category":"post-processing","tags":["blur","bokeh","depth-of-field","post-processing","chromatic"],"description":"Depth-aware radial blur with bokeh shape selection, chromatic aberration, Gaussian kernel weighting, and vignette.","hash":"a2edc9379b721353","embedding":""},{"id":"soft-vignette-bloom","name":"Soft Vignette Bloom","category":"post-processing","tags":["bloom","vignette","cinematic","post-processing","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","depth-aware","filmic","lens-flare","starburst","chromatic-aberration","bokeh-dof","anamorphic-streaks"],"description":"Cinematic post-processing with multi-scale Gaussian bloom pyramid, anamorphic highlight streaks, and superellipse vignette. Enhanced with lens flare ghost images, 8-pointed starburst diffraction spikes, chromatic aberration at edges, bokeh depth-of-field with hexagonal aperture, and enhanced light falloff with realisti","hash":"1f983e66c34eece7","embedding":""},{"id":"spatio-temporal-3d-conv","name":"Spatio-Temporal 3D Convolution","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","convolution","noise-reduction","motion-blur","sharpening","3d-kernel","spatio-temporal"],"description":"3×3×T spatio-temporal convolution using the history ring buffer. A Gaussian spatial kernel is applied at each of T past frames and blended with temporal weights. Param 3 selects the operation mode: Temporal Noise Reduction (averages frames to kill flicker), Motion Blur (exponential frame accumulation), or Temporal Shar","hash":"1b99c8d3a574aa04","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-decay-multiresolution","name":"Temporal Decay Multiresolution","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","multiresolution","decay","timescale","psychedelic","rainbow","motion"],"description":"Four-timescale temporal decomposition with a spring-following history lens and click echo rings. R=fast, G=medium, B=slow, and A=ultra-slow luminance.","hash":"54e009d26764f47c","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-feedback-zoom-tracer","name":"Temporal Feedback Zoom Tracer","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","feedback","zoom","tunnel","psychedelic","warp","abstract"],"description":"Reads the most recent history frame through a slight affine warp (zoom + rotation) then blends with the current frame. The compounding warp generates infinite self-generating psychedelic zoom tunnels from any video content.","hash":"e653dd96b75cb580","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-frequency-decomposition","name":"Temporal Frequency Decomposition","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","frequency","fourier","glow","analysis","psychedelic","abstract"],"description":"Discrete temporal Fourier analysis across the 8-frame history ring. Static pixels cancel to near-zero; pixels flickering or oscillating near the target frequency glow brightly. Reveals hidden temporal rhythms in video content.","hash":"dbda0849119b86f5","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-halation-freeze","name":"Temporal Halation Freeze","category":"post-processing","tags":["halation","bloom","long-exposure","temporal","ghost","cinematic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Long-exposure halation and ghost echoes using a 7-tap hex-bokeh bloom, audio envelope, ACES tone mapping, depth-aware fog, and semantic alpha for dreamy time-blurred composites.","hash":"f58596800f6b75da","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-layered-time-stamps","name":"Temporal Layered Time-Stamps","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","psychedelic","echo","history","colorful","abstract"],"description":"Psychedelic temporal echo: blends 4–8 past frames from the history ring buffer (binding 13) with per-layer hue rotation and spiral UV distortion","hash":"65719d6c9bb86133","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-phosphor-burn-motion-adaptive","name":"Temporal Phosphor Burn (Motion Adaptive)","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","crt","phosphor","motion","adaptive","glow","amber","reactive"],"description":"Motion-adaptive CRT phosphor burn. Fast-moving pixels get slow decay (long bright trails); still areas clear quickly. Green/amber warm tint follows the motion glow for vivid CRT ambiance.","hash":"b0da1f55b7861fe7","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-phosphor-burn","name":"Temporal Phosphor Burn","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","crt","phosphor","persistence","glow","retro","amber"],"description":"CRT phosphor persistence combining exact immediate display history with seven older ring frames, sprung beam burns, bounded click afterimages, three-band plasma audio, ACES, and semantic burn alpha.","hash":"6cd11a20581f8d45","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-rgb-ghost","name":"Temporal RGB Ghost","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","ghost","chromatic","comet","rainbow","psychedelic","motion"],"description":"Per-channel temporal displacement: R=current, G=N frames ago, B=M frames ago. Moving objects leave vivid rainbow comet tails as each color channel trails a different distance behind. Static areas appear normal.","hash":"a642112b97c20f2b","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-slit-scan","name":"Temporal Slit Scan","category":"post-processing","tags":["temporal","slit-scan","time-smear","painterly","classic","retro","smear"],"description":"Classic slit-scan time-smear: each column (or row) samples a different point in the 8-frame history ring. One edge shows the current frame, the opposite edge shows 7 frames ago. Creates the flowing painterly time-smear of Radiohead's Street Spirit video on any motion.","hash":"7feca906cc9823a1","embedding":""},{"id":"tone-histogram-apply","name":"Tone Histogram (Pass 2: Apply)","category":"post-processing","tags":["tone","histogram","grading","auto-exposure","psychedelic"],"description":"Reads histogram buckets, computes auto-exposure and tone curve, and applies histogram-driven grading.","hash":"da6210edb258e28a","embedding":""},{"id":"tone-histogram","name":"Tone Histogram v2","category":"post-processing","tags":["tone","histogram","exposure","luminance","grading","film","local-contrast","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","depth-aware"],"description":"Single-pass local adaptive histogram equalization with film-like tonal curves, split-tone shadows/highlights, grain texture, and depth-driven haze removal. Bass stretches histogram dynamically.","hash":"a8d7ce07e8ba3e50","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-flow","name":"ASCII Flow","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vintage"],"description":"Parameterized animated ASCII current with eight procedural glyphs, held pointer vortices, click fronts, three-band audio, and shifting phosphor hues.","hash":"e0a8b8ba24e2d2c9","embedding":""},{"id":"bayer-dither-interactive","name":"Bayer Dither Interactive","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vintage","dither","bayer","crt"],"description":"Ordered 8x8 Bayer dither with blue-noise modulation, gather-style error diffusion, retro 1-bit/4-bit/8-bit palette switching, CRT phosphor dot pitch, and chromatic aberration on dither edges.","hash":"a64fbe5ef248dbef","embedding":""},{"id":"byte-mosh","name":"Byte-Mosh Glitch","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["bitwise","byte-mosh","datamosh","filter","glitch","image-processing","physics","showcase","simulation"],"description":"LFSR/GF(2) datamosh corruption with spring cursor, held burst, capped ripple packets, wired zoom_params, regional FFT edges, and ACES output.","hash":"b5d8ccbe7094e14c","embedding":""},{"id":"crt-magnet","name":"CRT Magnet","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","noise","curl","fractal","crt","magnet","bloom","feedback","palette","sdf","hybrid"],"description":"CRT degaussing distortion with continuous magnetic rings and rolling beam sweeps, held-pointer field gain, bounded click shocks, exact-load feedback echo, aperture grille, hex bloom, spectral palette, and preserved A-state packing.","hash":"feeb7b7d4100fe45","embedding":""},{"id":"crt-phosphor-decay","name":"CRT Phosphor Decay","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["crt","retro","glitch","phosphor","scanline","vintage","television","temporal","audio"],"description":"Simulates CRT phosphor persistence with per-channel RGB decay rates, scanline masking, sub-pixel triad rendering, and halation bloom. Audio-reactive brightness flash and scanline flutter. Touch cursor adds static.","hash":"5f9ff7453b6bc83d","embedding":""},{"id":"crt-tv","name":"CRT TV - Phosphor Physics","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["crt","retro","phosphor","scanlines","vintage","monitor"],"description":"Authentic CRT phosphor physics with aperture grille, halation, barrel distortion, spring focus, held bulge, capped ripples, exact C persistence, and three-band audio.","hash":"58a1126c1c1ad05b","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-rain-interactive","name":"Cyber Rain","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vintage","matrix","rain","glyph","parallax"],"description":"Layered glyph downpour with three parallax rain sheets, per-column FFT bins, spring-free pointer bending (distinct from cyber-rain-em), bounded EMP rings, luminance wetness cling, exact C trails, and ACES display.","hash":"b9ed9d939fb6db4f","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-terminal-ascii","name":"Cyber Terminal ASCII","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","terminal","ascii","cyber","glitch"],"description":"Scrolling hex-dump terminal with phosphor-green mono vs color blend, spring decoder lens, held decode widen, click packet bursts, exact C phosphor persistence, and ACES display.","hash":"9812bd9a70cfed46","embedding":""},{"id":"data-moshing-diffusion","name":"Data Moshing Diffusion","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","data-mosh","diffusion","anisotropic","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","mouse-driven","upgraded-rgba"],"description":"Anisotropic data-mosh diffusion with exact packed-state advection, rapid chromatic stream packets, held-pointer swirl, and click-launched smear fronts.","hash":"f69c1301ae8ec2c2","embedding":""},{"id":"data-moshing","name":"Data Moshing","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","data-mosh","retro","temporal","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","depth-aware","VHS"],"description":"Raw accumulated offset state in authoritative A drives motion-compensated macroblock smearing, sprung pointer scrubbing, bounded click corruption, three-band audio, ACES output, and semantic corruption alpha.","hash":"29f74da866ba0fab","embedding":""},{"id":"datamosh-brush","name":"Datamosh Brush","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","datamosh","temporal"],"description":"Interactive MPEG datamosh brush with spring smear vector, macroblock edge geometry, capped click corruption bursts, alpha ghost trail