xact C trail fade, and three-band audio.","hash":"ebf2007bfc43189e","embedding":""},{"id":"pixelation-drift","name":"Pixelation Drift","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","pixelation","drift","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","depth-aware"],"description":"Dynamic pixelated mosaic with audio-reactive pixel sizing, chromatic RGB pixel separation, depth-aware sizing, organic noise drift, and temporal persistence.","hash":"30f94cf6ff414dbc","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-glitch-displacement","name":"RGB Glitch Displacement","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","rgb","digital","scanlines","chromatic","datamosh","retro","vintage","audio","music"],"description":"Digital glitch effect with RGB channel displacement, block glitches, scanlines, pixel sorting, and datamosh effects. Mouse-reactive wave displacement and chromatic aberration. Audio reactivity pulses glitch intensity and adds beat-synchronized flashes.","hash":"3d27f6eb31b85893","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-glitch-trail","name":"RGB Glitch Trail","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Mouse leaves chromatic aberration trails with alpha-channel translucency blending. Uses domain-warped FBM for organic displacement and computes alpha from glitch intensity * temporal persistence.","hash":"3b83d15d411cf1c9","embedding":""},{"id":"scan-distort","name":"Scan Distort","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","glitch","crt","scanlines"],"description":"CRT scanline tear with block quantization, spring cursor, held glitch bursts, exact C smear, capped ripples, three-band audio, and ACES output. Medium complexity, clear structure.","hash":"19200a000ff61eb5","embedding":""},{"id":"scanline-drift","name":"Scanline Drift","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vintage","vhs"],"description":"Horizontal strip drift with spring tracking band, held jitter boost, capped click tears, regional FFT flicker, exact C memory, and ACES output.","hash":"6caac8244858dd7f","embedding":""},{"id":"signal-noise","name":"Signal Noise","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vhs","noise","analog"],"description":"Multi-octave analog noise with VHS head-switch bands, DCT artifacts, sprung cursor, held burst, capped ripples, exact C temporal smear, ACES output.","hash":"c5f7a7f65d2648a9","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-glitch-sort","name":"Spectral Glitch Sort","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vintage"],"description":"Brightness-gated spectral sorting with a guarded sprung epicenter, bounded click tears, read-only FFT block voices, and exact-C trails persisted through authoritative A display history.","hash":"139453fa3772102c","embedding":""},{"id":"spectrum-bleed","name":"Spectrum Bleed","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Sprung spectrum-ink diffusion with bounded click splatters, read-only FFT shimmer, exact-C persistence, semantic display RGBA in authoritative A, and ACES output.","hash":"4bda65ef22df2180","embedding":""},{"id":"vhs-tracking","name":"VHS Tracking Error","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","vhs","tracking","retro"],"description":"VHS capstan jitter and azimuth loss with sprung cursor, held tracking pull, capped dropout ripples, exact C row walk state, ACES output.","hash":"7bc0f17c75803cfa","embedding":""},{"id":"vinyl-scratch","name":"Vinyl Scratch","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","vinyl","scratch","retro","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"Vintage vinyl with spring stylus, held drag warp, click scratch bursts, groove sparkle exact-C coherence, ACES display, and semantic alpha from depth and groove mask.","hash":"41fc6a34171143bd","embedding":""},{"id":"waveform-glitch","name":"Waveform Glitch","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["glitch","retro","vhs","oscilloscope","waveform"],"description":"Oscilloscope Lissajous waveform glitch with signal aliasing, spring cursor, held burst, capped ripples, exact C phosphor trails, and three-band audio.","hash":"129fe71ac7198288","embedding":""},{"id":"xerox-degrade","name":"Xerox Degrade","category":"retro-glitch","tags":["filter","image-processing","photocopy","xerox"],"description":"Repeated photocopy degradation with halftone dots, ordered dither, spring smear, held burst, capped ripples, exact C memory, and three-band audio.","hash":"a139f2498c33dcd2","embedding":""},{"id":"aero-chromatics","name":"Aero Chromatics","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","physics"],"description":"Wind tunnel simulation where image brightness determines aerodynamic drag, creating chromatic smoke trails.","hash":"5a90baf09992e697","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-crystal-growth-phase","name":"Alpha Crystal Growth Phase","category":"simulation","tags":["crystal","growth","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","temporal","rgba-state-machine","dendritic"],"description":"Phase-field model of crystal growth with RGBA-packed state. Phase (solid/liquid), temperature, crystal orientation, and impurity concentration evolve together. Creates dendritic crystal patterns with orientation-dependent color. Mouse seeds new crystals; ripples trigger nucleation.","hash":"7d46ca79162b6d53","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-em-field-simulation","name":"Alpha EM Field Simulation","category":"simulation","tags":["electromagnetic","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","field","wave","rgba-state-machine"],"description":"Electromagnetic field simulation using RGBA32FLOAT as four data channels: R=E-field X, G=E-field Y, B=magnetic potential, A=charge density. Mouse and ripples inject alternating positive/negative charges. Wave equation propagation with damping.","hash":"060dfb5dc0921999","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-erosion-terrain","name":"Alpha Erosion Terrain","category":"simulation","tags":["erosion","terrain","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","temporal","rgba-state-machine","hydraulic"],"description":"Hydraulic erosion simulation with RGBA-packed terrain state. Height from image luminance is eroded by flowing water that picks up sediment and deposits it in flat areas. Mouse creates rainstorms; ripples trigger flash floods. Alpha tracks cumulative erosion history.","hash":"9951631b05f07041","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-fire-temperature","name":"Alpha Fire Temperature","category":"simulation","tags":["fire","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","temporal","rgba-state-machine","blackbody","smoke"],"description":"Fire simulation with RGBA-packed state: fuel, temperature, smoke density, and combustion age. Temperature drives blackbody radiation color. Fuel burns, generates smoke, and heat rises via convection. Mouse injects fuel; ripples create sparks.","hash":"d019d1697a775ecf","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-fluid-simulation-paint","name":"Alpha Fluid Simulation Paint","category":"simulation","tags":["fluid","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","navier-stokes","psychedelic","colorful","rgba-state-machine"],"description":"Full 2D incompressible fluid simulation packed into a single RGBA32FLOAT texture. R=velocity.x, G=velocity.y, B=pressure, A=dye density. Mouse creates vortices and injects dye. Requires f32 for signed velocity and pressure fields.","hash":"364bf3642be75eb6","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-multi-state-ecosystem","name":"Alpha Multi-State Ecosystem","category":"simulation","tags":["ecosystem","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","cellular-automata","pattern","rgba-state-machine"],"description":"Continuous multi-species ecosystem simulation packed into RGBA32FLOAT. Two species compete for shared resources while producing toxins. Species diffuse, grow, compete, and die. Mouse nurtures by adding resources.","hash":"0d663bb7201a051f","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-reaction-diffusion-rgba","name":"Alpha Reaction Diffusion RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["reaction-diffusion","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","pattern","rgba-state-machine","colorful"],"description":"Four-species ecological Gray-Scott with photo-nutrient chemotaxis, an interface membrane where warm and cool inhibitors meet, held inoculation, click seed fronts, and ACES display. Raw RGBA chemistry persists in dataTextureA.","hash":"5cf1f3562ac14891","embedding":""},{"id":"bitonic-sort","name":"Bitonic Pixel Sort","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","filter","glitch","algorithmic","sort","noise"],"description":"Workgroup bitonic pixel sort with polar kaleidoscope symmetry, Voronoi ridge sort keys, domain-warped FBM, Halton quasi-random jitter, depth-aware weighting, ACES tone mapping, chromatic aberration, bass-reactive mixing, and temporal feedback.","hash":"7eab56ea4ce97fc6","embedding":""},{"id":"cellular-automata-rgba","name":"Cellular Automata RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","cellular-automata","ecosystem","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","organic","predator-prey"],"description":"2D ecosystem cellular automaton with four interacting species packed into RGBA. Plants grow from nutrients, herbivores eat plants, predators eat herbivores, and all dead matter cycles back to soil nutrients. Continuous densities enable stable predator-prey oscillations.","hash":"35db1cf9ad368696","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatic-reaction-diffusion-rgba","name":"Chromatic Reaction Diffusion RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["reaction-diffusion","simulation","interactive","mouse-driven","pattern","rgba-state-machine","chromatic","colorful"],"description":"Two cross-coupled warm/cool Gray-Scott systems with competitive overlap quench, photo chroma seeding, pointer spiral inoculation, bounded click fronts, and ACES display. Raw chemistry persists in dataTextureA.","hash":"a2d70183fd2ead95","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatographic-fluid","name":"Chromatographic Fluid","category":"simulation","tags":["fluid","chromatography","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Physics Lab — RGB dyes with distinct viscosity in a shared wind field. Hold to paint, click solvent splashes, audio gusts. graph · 7 passes · rgba32float.","hash":"451df1e8c323fdd4","embedding":""},{"id":"cymatic-sand","name":"Cymatic Sand","category":"simulation","tags":["cymatic","sand","chladni","procedural","simulation","audio","music","reactive","organic"],"description":"Damped Chladni plate simulation with exact-load sand transport, persistent resonance and strike memory, three-band harmonic forcing, held mode displacement, bounded click strikes, ACES grain color, semantic alpha, and raw A-only state.","hash":"e2db95c69648fac2","embedding":""},{"id":"digital-moss","name":"Digital Moss","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing","simulation","organic","moss"],"description":"Four-state digital moss colonizes dark regions through moisture and spores; held input cleans colonies while clicks launch new growth fronts.","hash":"683e47e5d09fed93","embedding":""},{"id":"fabric-of-reality","name":"Fabric of Reality","category":"simulation","tags":["cloth","fabric","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Living mass-spring cloth — hold to tear, release to watch Self Heal knit seams. Bass breathes the drape; mouse spotlight rides the weave. Tier C graph · 7 passes.","hash":"9e5c647b73df4f54","embedding":""},{"id":"ferrofluid-spikes","name":"Ferrofluid Spikes","category":"simulation","tags":["ferrofluid","simulation","magnetic","liquid","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","metallic","PBR","3-point-lighting","anisotropic","ambient-occlusion"],"description":"A classic Rosensweig ferrofluid lattice with bounded magnet inertia, held polarity strength, click-launched spike fronts, exact-load viscous persistence, three-band response, honest depth, and studio-lit anisotropic GGX metal.","hash":"61a216c9563ef6d7","embedding":""},{"id":"flow-sort","name":"Streamline Pixel Sort","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Pixel sorting along vector field lines derived from luminance gradients.","hash":"913675579f230193","embedding":""},{"id":"galaxy-compute","name":"Galaxy Compute","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Volumetric spiral galaxy with logarithmic spiral SDF, procedural nebula clouds, Keplerian orbital mechanics, and stellar particle glow.","hash":"48627b7a33a59ece","embedding":""},{"id":"gray-scott-tank","name":"Gray-Scott Tank","category":"simulation","tags":["reaction-diffusion","gray-scott","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Physics Lab — true multi-step Gray–Scott reaction-diffusion (Jacobi ×4 / frame). Hold paints V, clicks seed spots. graph · 6 passes · rgba32float.","hash":"069617b6a6b71398","embedding":""},{"id":"jfa-aurora-voronoi","name":"JFA Aurora Voronoi","category":"simulation","tags":["jfa","voronoi","aurora","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Phase C stretch — Jump-Flood aurora Voronoi from mouse seeds. graph · seed + flood×8 + render.","hash":"f101d5510d922674","embedding":""},{"id":"lenia-on-video","name":"Lenia on Video","category":"simulation","tags":["lenia","cellular-automata","simulation","video-driven","bioluminescent","continuous-ca","organic","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Continuous Lenia cellular automaton (Chan 2019) seeded and continuously driven by live video. Video luminance seeds the initial cell state; video hue and saturation modulate Lenia's growth center and width parameters in real time, coupling the CA tightly to the subject. Bass beats inject fresh cells from bright video r","hash":"da7db7dc979a58eb","embedding":""},{"id":"lichtenberg-fractal","name":"Lichtenberg Fractal","category":"simulation","tags":["electric","lightning","fractal","procedural","simulation","glow","neon"],"description":"High-voltage electrical discharge with curl-noise branching, depth-aware strike targeting, audio-reactive spread, and chromatic glow (white core → cyan → deep purple).","hash":"9a30a5cc49dc060b","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-flow-field","name":"Luma Flow Field","category":"simulation","tags":["flow","curl","luma","gradient","simulation","audio","reactive","streaks","organic"],"description":"Exact-history luma-gradient flow field with iso-luminance advection, curl ribbons, three-band spectral coloring, pointer vortices, bounded click shocks, ACES display, and semantic HDR trail alpha in dataTextureA.","hash":"9589b763f6cd9965","embedding":""},{"id":"nano-assembler","name":"Nano Assembler","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","physics"],"description":"Photo rebuilt as a grid of nanobots. Mouse scatter is ballistic along the radial; docking bonds weld shared cell edges as assembly rises.","hash":"062947e6e278d389","embedding":""},{"id":"optical-flow-dream","name":"Optical Flow Dream","category":"simulation","tags":["optical-flow","feedback","exact-load-feedback","simulation","showcase"],"description":"Canonical single-pass optical-flow dream field using exact dataTextureC history, temporal luma gradients, chromatic advection, held pointer vortices, bounded click tears, three-band color, ACES display, semantic alpha, and A-only feedback.","hash":"eb031c2aa66adeee","embedding":""},{"id":"photonic-caustics-graph","name":"Photonic Caustics","category":"simulation","tags":["caustics","light","refraction","simulation","showcase"],"description":"Temporal caustic pool — move the light, watch chromatic ribbons accumulate. 4 graph passes fit battery; trace×2 under balanced. Tier C flagship.","hash":"7e1e565f204320b8","embedding":""},{"id":"photonic-caustics","name":"Photonic Caustics","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing","caustics","refraction","simulation"],"description":"Exact-history refractive height-field caustics with chromatic convergence bands, Fresnel response, three-band illumination, held light focus, bounded click wavefronts, ACES display, and semantic caustic alpha.","hash":"fbfecbebe2261fe0","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-sand","name":"Pixel Sand","category":"simulation","tags":["sand","granular","falling","interactive","audio-reactive","particles","simulation","fbm","domain-warp","curl-noise","blackbody","oklab","dither","feedback","temporal-echo","palette"],"description":"Granular density and velocity automaton with avalanche sheets, rising jet lanes, held-pointer gravity, bounded click shelves, three-band spectral heat, depth shading, ACES display, semantic alpha, and raw A-only state feedback.","hash":"d52b1612bf69be55","embedding":""},{"id":"poincare-tiling","name":"Poincaré Tiling","category":"simulation","tags":["poincare","hyperbolic","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Physics Lab — hyperbolic disk tiling with Möbius layer composite. graph · 2 passes.","hash":"8bf2d26b9104e105","embedding":""},{"id":"predator-prey-ecology","name":"Predator-Prey Ecology","category":"simulation","tags":["predator-prey","ecology","simulation","physics","showcase"],"description":"Physics Lab — packed Lotka–Volterra pixels: prey flora vs predator fauna waves. Hold to seed, clicks bloom prey. graph · 2 passes · rgba32float.","hash":"b365ccf51fe482b4","embedding":""},{"id":"predator-prey","name":"Pixel Ecology","category":"simulation","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Cellular-automata food chain of plants, herbivores, and carnivores. Prey lose energy to adjacent predators; animal death composts into plants.","hash":"d8aef18c7d1d3805","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-foam-pass1","name":"Quantum Foam (Pass 1: Field Generation)","category":"simulation","tags":["quantum","field-generation","noise","simulation"],"description":"Generates quantum probability field with curl noise and FBM. First pass of 3-pass system.","hash":"5f679d716770c085","embedding":""},{"id":"rd-on-video-pass1","name":"RD on Video (Pass 1: State Update)","category":"simulation","tags":["reaction-diffusion","video","luminance","organic","turing"],"description":"Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion seeded and continuously driven by video luminance, with exact-load chemistry, three-band kinetics, held inoculation, click seed fronts, ACES preview, semantic alpha, and A-only state ownership.","hash":"d47b9bdcabb8048c","embedding":""},{"id":"ripple-tank","name":"Ripple Tank","category":"simulation","tags":["wave-equation","interference","caustics","water","simulation","showcase"],"description":"Physics Lab flagship — click for rings, hold for a driven oscillator, audio rains droplets across the tank. 7 graph passes · target 60 fps at balanced.","hash":"497b127cafffdf52","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-decay-system-rgba","name":"Sim: Decay System RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","decay","corrosion","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","rust","aging"],"description":"Four-layer material decay simulation with cross-coupling. Paint integrity, metal corrosion, organic rot, and structural integrity each decay at different rates. When one layer fails, others decay faster. Mouse interaction can restore/repair.","hash":"e90eb1bc0a356730","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-decay-system","name":"Decay System","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Multi-layer decay and corrosion simulation. Image corrodes from edges inward with different materials.","hash":"a4e4d3b0e5d095ae","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-fluid-feedback-coupled","name":"Fluid Feedback Coupled","category":"simulation","tags":["fluid","simulation","mouse-driven","interactive","temporal"],"description":"Mouse-steerable coupled fluid simulation combining Navier-Stokes feedback fields with viscous fluid stirring. Mouse drags fluid creating vortex streets; click ripples inject bursts. Fluid thickness drives color absorption, blur, and glow.","hash":"cd34d7507b279de5","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-fluid-feedback-field","name":"Fluid Feedback Field","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Multi-pass Navier-Stokes fluid simulation with feedback trails. Glowing fluid that swirls and mixes.","hash":"bd8e98defe080ab1","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-heat-haze-field","name":"Heat Haze Field","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Temperature simulation with convection currents. Desert mirage effect with rising heat patterns.","hash":"8e1b3fc1c9266bd8","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-ink-diffusion-rgba","name":"Sim: Ink Diffusion RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","ink","diffusion","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","artistic","paper"],"description":"Four-ink wet diffusion simulation on paper texture. RGB channels hold cyan, magenta, and yellow pigment concentrations; alpha holds water saturation that drives all diffusion. Pigments mix subtractively on wet paper.","hash":"d9471a410caa4187","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-ink-diffusion","name":"Ink Diffusion","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Fluid ink diffusion with paper absorption. Multi-channel Gray-Scott with Wolfram-validated parameters.","hash":"1b7f4d137f172af6","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-sand-dunes-rgba","name":"Sim: Sand Dunes RGBA","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","sand","physics","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","wind","erosion"],"description":"Four-population grain simulation packing fine, coarse, moist, and airborne dust fractions in raw A state, with exact-load transport, audio gusts, held deposition, click dust fronts, ACES material color, and semantic coverage alpha.","hash":"6a455f6dbff4f32f","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-sand-dunes","name":"Sand Dunes","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Persistent dune height field with saltation, angle-of-repose avalanches, wind erosion, moisture cohesion, three-band gusts, held sand deposition, bounded click shelves, ACES shading, semantic alpha, and raw A-only state.","hash":"2dc6d57c691bfb87","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-slime-mold-growth-em","name":"Slime Mold Growth + EM Field","category":"simulation","tags":["interactive","mouse-driven","physics","slime","electromagnetic","agents"],"description":"Physarum slime mold simulation with mouse electromagnetic field interaction. Agents steer along electric field lines; click ripples spawn secondary charges.","hash":"ec3f64d32e2ee521","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-slime-mold-growth","name":"Slime Mold Growth","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Physarum-style slime mold with trail following. Branching network of glowing trails exploring space.","hash":"0c341da3a6108d16","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-smoke-trails","name":"Smoke Trails","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Volumetric smoke with vorticity and buoyancy. Billowing smoke rising with natural turbulence.","hash":"670ab41de65d587c","embedding":""},{"id":"sim-volumetric-fake","name":"Volumetric Fake (God Rays)","category":"simulation","tags":[],"description":"Fast approximation of volumetric lighting. Radial blur from light source with depth-based scattering.","hash":"8d5c7801f725d6ac","embedding":""},{"id":"slime-mold-on-video","name":"Slime Mold on Video","category":"simulation","tags":["slime","physarum","video","food-map","tendrils","glow","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic"],"description":"Video luminance feeds a slime-mold trail simulation with velocity-biased history advection, traveling chemotactic pulse packets, and click food fronts. Audio shifts tendril colors, depth boosts glow, and the mouse deposits food.","hash":"02366e37ad505cc8","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-runge-kutta-advection","name":"Runge-Kutta Advection","category":"simulation","tags":["runge-kutta","RK4","fluid","advection","simulation","vortex","temporal"],"description":"4th-order Runge-Kutta fluid advection. Dramatically more accurate than Euler method, preserving fine dye structures 10x longer. Mouse creates counter-rotating vortex pairs.","hash":"9ce2bbc3c4ad2317","embedding":""},{"id":"split-flap-display","name":"Split Flap Display","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Simulates a mechanical split-flap display where the image is made of rotating tiles.","hash":"31d2c6e7be163ecf","embedding":""},{"id":"steamy-glass","name":"Steamy Glass","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","physics"],"description":"Stateful condensation, droplets, and runoff refract a fogged window that can be wiped with held input and disturbed by click fronts.","hash":"822c0609aa1d267f","embedding":""},{"id":"wave-equation","name":"Wave Tank","category":"simulation","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Psychedelic ripple tank — click to drop interference rings, drag to stir, bass pulses the waves. Rainbow phase bands and caustic sparkles over your image.","hash":"22e4d616cced15ba","embedding":""},{"id":"wave-tank","name":"Wave Tank","category":"simulation","tags":["simulation","wave","ripple","physics"],"description":"Psychedelic 2D wave interference — click to drop ripples, drag to stir, bass pulses the tank. Tier C graph runner demo.","hash":"7a57be3b04d3d5e4","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-depth-fog-volumetric","name":"Alpha Depth Fog Volumetric","category":"visual-effects","tags":["volumetric","fog","depth-aware","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","atmospheric"],"description":"Seven depth layers accumulate turbulent Beer-Lambert fog with a live warm-to-cool temperature range, audio-lit scattering, held-pointer clearing, and click-driven vortices.","hash":"48772650441cd18e","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-hdr-bloom-chain","name":"Alpha HDR Bloom Chain","category":"visual-effects","tags":["hdr","bloom","tone-mapping","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","glow"],"description":"Temporal spectral HDR bloom with multi-ring dispersion, exposure-preserving feedback, audio-shaped radiance, held-pointer halos, and expanding click flashes.","hash":"fa2b5bd8da2f2ded","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-luminance-history","name":"Alpha Luminance History","category":"visual-effects","tags":["temporal","history","luminance","glow","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","light-painting"],"description":"Temporal luminance history with RGB plus rolling luminance in alpha. Slider-controlled diffusion, directional history advection, traveling click rings, and mouse painting create bounded light trails and warm afterimages.","hash":"7f2bc0f6a71d2b6d","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-multi-layer-glass","name":"Alpha Multi-Layer Glass","category":"visual-effects","tags":["glass","refraction","chromatic","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","fresnel","audio-reactive","roughness"],"description":"Multi-layer glass refraction with RGBA data channels. Simulates looking through 3 layers of procedurally-distorted glass with Fresnel reflection, chromatic aberration, GGX roughness, and per-layer tinting. Alpha stores accumulated transmittance.","hash":"4dbdc87815fa7deb","embedding":""},{"id":"alpha-spectral-decompose","name":"Alpha Spectral Decompose","category":"visual-effects","tags":["spectral","frequency","decomposition","interactive","mouse-driven","rgba-state-machine","filter"],"description":"Decomposes the image into 4 spectral frequency bands stored in RGBA. Low freq (R), mid-low (G), mid-high (B), high freq/detail (A). Recomposes with user-controlled per-band gain for frequency-equalizer style image manipulation.","hash":"537224747d425e75","embedding":""},{"id":"anaglyph-3d","name":"Anaglyph 3D","category":"visual-effects","tags":["anaglyph","3d","depth-aware","stereo","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","ghost"],"description":"Red-cyan stereoscopic anaglyph with temporal ghost fringing persistence, chromatic separation enhancement per depth, mouse focal depth curve refinement, bass-pulsed split width, and cinematic post-processing: film grain with temporal coherence, radial chromatic aberration, vignette darkening, CRT barrel distortion, col","hash":"64405f335715946d","embedding":""},{"id":"anamorphic-caustic-flare","name":"Anamorphic Caustic Flare","category":"visual-effects","tags":["anamorphic","caustic","lens-flare","cinematic","refraction","audio-reactive","water"],"description":"Premium cinematic anamorphic lens flares combined with living, refracting water caustics that distort and project the source footage. Bass stretches the flares dramatically while treble animates the caustic ripples. Mouse tilts the virtual lens.","hash":"f388394919729771","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-shockwave","name":"ASCII Shockwave","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Matrix glyph cells with traveling shock packets, held-pointer ASCII density, bounded click rings, and oil-slick phosphor color. Display RGBA is packed in A.","hash":"42dbdd48536bf846","embedding":""},{"id":"breathing-kaleidoscope","name":"Breathing Kaleidoscope","category":"visual-effects","tags":["kaleidoscope","petals","audio","reactive","organic","fbm"],"description":"Organic breathing kaleidoscope driven by domain-warped FBM, fractional symmetry, jewel-tone palette cycling, film grain, and depth-aware sector fading.","hash":"9315c395418a3c99","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-vortex","name":"Chroma Vortex","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music"],"description":"Rotational RGB splitting effect centered on the mouse.","hash":"7b54f15158fa3055","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatic-focus-interactive","name":"Chromatic Focus","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow"],"description":"Chromatic DOF with six-blade iris geometry, multi-tap blur, zone-plate caustics, oil-slick runners/packets, held focus squeeze/pinch, click iris shells, and light display history in A.","hash":"2870c47c3d6a3b3e","embedding":""},{"id":"cross-spec-alpha-spectral-bloom","name":"Spectral Bloom HDR","category":"visual-effects","tags":["crossover","spectral","bloom","hdr","rgba-as-data","chromatic"],"description":"Crossover shader combining spectral dispersion with HDR bloom using RGBA as independent spectral bands. Decomposes the image into wavelength channels and applies per-band bloom with exposure control in alpha.","hash":"83f24522273ce0f4","embedding":""},{"id":"crt-clear-zone","name":"CRT Clear Zone","category":"visual-effects","tags":["crt","retro","electron-beam","shadow-mask","temporal","image-processing"],"description":"Accurate CRT electron beam simulation with Gaussian spot spread, inline shadow mask, phosphor decay via temporal feedback, barrel distortion with corner darkening, per-RGB chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"611fdbdd7e82136c","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-grid-pulse","name":"Cyber Grid Pulse","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow"],"description":"","hash":"a3c6aef40b0ef2f8","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-physical-portal","name":"Cyber Physical Portal","category":"visual-effects","tags":["portal","cyber","swirl","grid","audio-reactive","lensing","hologram","chromatic"],"description":"Upgraded cyber portal with event-horizon frame dragging, gravitational lensing, accretion disk bands, cyan-magenta holographic rim, chromatic aberration, and HDR bloom. Bass drives spin, mouse positions portal, depth controls lensing.","hash":"9aaeb63c8a7c37a4","embedding":""},{"id":"cyber-scan","name":"Cyber Scan","category":"visual-effects","tags":["cyber","scan","hud","glow","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","temporal","holographic","hex-grid","interference","binary-rain"],"description":"A digital scanning ecosystem with triple-layer scan lines, holographic interference patterns, hex-grid data visualization, binary rain effects, and FBM noise corruption. Depth-based colorization with chromatic RGB separation driven by treble intensity.","hash":"1ba3a013b4db4bfa","embedding":""},{"id":"data-scanner","name":"Data Scanner","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow"],"description":"","hash":"50843ae1d4d07d96","embedding":""},{"id":"elastic-chromatic","name":"Elastic Chromatic","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","chromatic","lag","elastic","lissajous","mouse-driven","hdr","dither","split-tone","alpha-layered","luminance-key"],"description":"Elastic chromatic aberration with radial RGB shift, per-channel temporal lag, Lissajous mouse source, depth-aware audio reactivity, split-tone blackbody grading, ACES tone mapping, IGN dither and advanced layered alpha compositing.","hash":"35ae661a3a03060d","embedding":""},{"id":"electric-contours","name":"Electric Contours","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","electric-field","equipotential","dielectric","corona","plasma-glow","hdr-bloom","aces-tone-mapping","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","spark-charges"],"description":"Electric field line tracing with equipotential surfaces, capped click spark charges from ripples, held mouse charge boost, corona bloom packets, FFT band arcs, and treble sparkle. Display is ACES-tonemapped; A stores raw field diagnostics (potential, |E|, edge/spark, dielectric energy).","hash":"f709abd355feebdb","embedding":""},{"id":"glitch-pixel-sort","name":"Glitch Pixel Sort","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Luminance-based pixel stretching controlled by mouse position.","hash":"e33303ca50b3d030","embedding":""},{"id":"hex-circuit","name":"Hex Circuit","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow"],"description":"Overlays a cybernetic hexagonal grid that highlights image edges and reacts to mouse pulses.","hash":"d9b3c46b78832197","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-flicker","name":"Holographic Flicker","category":"visual-effects","tags":["hologram","flicker","glitch","ghost","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"Holographic flicker with temporal ghosting and depth-rainbow colorization. Bass drives blackout probability, treble adds micro-glitch. Chromatic ghosting separates RGB channels across frames.","hash":"1de51adfb016482f","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-projection-gpt52","name":"Holo Projection Prism gpt52","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music","hologram","bragg","diffraction"],"description":"Prismatic volume hologram with Bragg diffraction physics, stabilized focus, scan interference, and spectral tinting.","hash":"cacf1195aa760c28","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-projection","name":"Holo Projector","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Transforms the image into a flickering hologram. Move mouse to focus and stabilize the projection.","hash":"7d321b62185e7a03","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-sticker","name":"Holographic Sticker","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music","holographic","sticker","chromatic","temporal","iridescent"],"description":"Mouse-centered iridescent sticker with chromatic view-angle dispersion, temporal foil shimmer persistence, audio-driven sticker pulse, depth-layered alpha, and rainbow phase shift.","hash":"747d083e9559baa4","embedding":""},{"id":"hyper-space-jump","name":"Hyper Space Jump","category":"visual-effects","tags":["hyperspace","fast-motion","relativistic","interactive"],"description":"Continuous relativistic streak integration combines a Doppler palette, helical flight, a movable vanishing point, held acceleration, and age-bounded jump shocks.","hash":"a72cb2495ee949ef","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-fresnel","name":"Interactive Fresnel","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","fresnel","lensing","chromatic","temporal"],"description":"2.5D Fresnel lens curvature with Cauchy dispersion, held ring squeeze, oil-slick grout, radial packets, and bounded click shells. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"da425180f2138ee6","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-pcb-traces","name":"Interactive PCB Traces","category":"visual-effects","tags":["pcb","circuit","signals","interactive"],"description":"Coherent Manhattan routes connect pads and vias while signal packets, persistent trace glow, pointer injection, held drive, and click propagation animate the board.","hash":"a88d3d4e3edb0371","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-smear-interactive","name":"Kinetic Echo","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","smear","echo","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","curl-noise","fast-motion","aces"],"description":"Chromatic R-lag / B-lead streaks with curl-advected exact-C trails. Trail Decay, luma gate, color shift, and mouse eraser stay live. ACES display history with trail-energy alpha.","hash":"5056fa7b05e38d80","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-edge-glow","name":"Neon Edge Glow","category":"visual-effects","tags":["neon","edge","glow","bloom","sobel","gas-discharge","spectrum","colorful","post-processing","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Gas discharge tube simulation with accurate neon emission spectrum, AC rectification flicker, mercury vapor secondary lines, electrode sputtering, and atmospheric haze. Bass drives flicker frequency, mouse bends the tube, depth controls atmospheric scatter.","hash":"5e92f5f20edf434c","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-edge-pulse","name":"Neon Edge Pulse","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music","reactive","alpha","edge-preserve"],"description":"Detects edges and highlights them with pulsing neon colors. Mouse proximity increases intensity.","hash":"b5ebb8d0a2c74c27","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-edge-reveal","name":"Neon Edge Reveal","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Neon edge detection with interactive flashlight reveal.","hash":"cc74ca31dbaa6222","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-topology","name":"Neon Topology","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Renders the image as a glowing 3D topographic map.","hash":"0f2f5c7b2f317140","embedding":""},{"id":"phantom-lag","name":"Phantom Lag","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Creates trailing echoes of movement with chromatic multi-tap delays, spring-damper bass smoothing, and velocity-stretched cursor ghosts.","hash":"01e6c5f293d14b2d","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-sorter","name":"Pixel Sorter","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Glitch art pixel sorting with alpha translucency blending. Single sort pass with spectral tinting, depth-aware compositing, and audio-reactive shimmer.","hash":"00dd6bd35833552a","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-field-visualizer","name":"Quantum Field Visualizer","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","quantum","interference","glow","hdr","abstract"],"description":"Complex wavefunction visualization with real/imaginary parts mapped to hue, probability density to brightness, and phase to saturation. Features two-slit interference, Gaussian packet spreading, and mouse-driven quantum measurement collapse.","hash":"f153155493f4491d","embedding":""},{"id":"quantum-ghost","name":"Quantum Ghost","category":"visual-effects","tags":["quantum","ghost","interference","fringes","temporal","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","wave-packet","entanglement","hdr-bloom","aces-tone-mapping"],"description":"Quantum uncertainty visualization with Gaussian wave packet spreading, interference patterns from partial measurement, and entanglement correlation lines between ghost copies. Ghostly translucent copies with phase-dependent opacity, neon quantum numbers, HDR bloom on measurement events, ACES tone mapping, and chromatic","hash":"96c4b57f04de1829","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-distance-split","name":"RGB Distance Split","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow"],"description":"Chromatic aberration that intensifies with distance from the mouse.","hash":"35c6d330a22278cc","embedding":""},{"id":"rgb-topology","name":"RGB Topology","category":"visual-effects","tags":["topology","contour","rgb","depth-aware","audio-reactive","hypsometric","3d-terrain","hdr-specular"],"description":"Topographic contour extraction per RGB channel with index isolines, ridge ticks, traveling iso-runners, psychedelic hypsometric ramps, held shear, and bounded click fronts. Feedback A stays [lineR, lineG, lineB, alpha].","hash":"8417431e1815e1be","embedding":""},{"id":"signal-modulation","name":"Signal Modulation","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","signal","carrier","fft"],"description":"AM/FM carrier wave with sprung origin, held widen, capped click carrier bursts, honest regional FFT spectral bands, ACES composite.","hash":"cc4ef63693b372f2","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-rain","name":"Spectral Rain","category":"visual-effects","tags":["rain","chromatic","distortion","filter","image-processing","audio-reactive"],"description":"Falling streaks of chromatic distortion with audio-reactive intensity and mouse-driven angle and speed controls.","hash":"712e6077ab831916","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-rgb-smear","name":"Temporal RGB Smear","category":"visual-effects","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio-reactive","interactive","temporal","feedback","chromatic","curl-noise","domain-warp","depth-aware","tone-mapping","alpha-layered","luminance-key","edge-preserve","accumulative"],"description":"Directional RGB smear with curl-noise velocity field, domain-warped drift, Halton-jittered chromatic sampling, temporal feedback decay, ACES tone mapping, and advanced layered alpha compositing (luminance key, edge preserve, effect intensity, depth layer, accumulative trails).","hash":"fd5bc28cd6232b88","embedding":""},{"id":"time-slit-scan","name":"Time Slit Scan","category":"visual-effects","tags":["slit-scan","temporal","artistic","time-warp"],"description":"Multi-slit temporal scan with curved parametric slits, polar drift, and time-warp color tinting.","hash":"a3eab555d7f4d837","embedding":""},{"id":"voxel-grid","name":"Voxel Grid","category":"visual-effects","tags":["vfx","particles","glow","audio-reactive"],"description":"Transforms the image into a grid of rotating 3D voxels that react to mouse proximity and audio bass.","hash":"ac90018d80bf57dc","embedding":""},{"id":"warp-drive","name":"Warp Drive","category":"visual-effects","tags":["warp","streak","space","chromatic","audio-reactive","doppler","relativistic","alcubierre"],"description":"Alcubierre warp streaks with Doppler aurora packets, held warp aim, analytic stars, click fronts. Diagnostic A packing preserved.","hash":"de7bd35f0b802e2c","embedding":""},{"id":"zipper-reveal","name":"Zipper Reveal","category":"visual-effects","tags":["zipper","fashion","reveal","metal","fabric","chromatic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Mechanical zipper with interlocking tooth simulation, fabric physics, metallic specular highlights, and chromatic aberration on fast-moving teeth. Bass drives zipper speed and mouse controls pull position.","hash":"c8994e913d27a7c2","embedding":""}]}
