{"version":1,"model":"Xenova/clip-vit-base-patch32","dtype":"q8","dim":512,"recipe":"avg(name+id, name+description) l2; runtime mean-centered","count":1368,"mean":"","entries":[{"id":"aero-chromatics-prismatic","name":"Aero Chromatics Prismatic","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["prismatic","dispersion","chromatic","cauchy","smoke","simulation"],"description":"Wind-driven chromatic smoke trails enhanced with physical prismatic dispersion via Cauchy's equation. Each wavelength refracts at a different angle through a virtual lens, creating rainbow edge effects on advected smoke.","hash":"5233c2c6bc3eb4d0","embedding":""},{"id":"aerogel-smoke-hdr","name":"Aerogel Smoke HDR","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["volumetric","HDR","bloom","scattering","aerogel","atmospheric"],"description":"Ethereal aerogel volumetric smoke with HDR bloom enhancement. Silica nanoparticle scattering combines with an HDR bloom kernel that amplifies overbright regions, creating luminous glow around dense scattering zones.","hash":"b5b3536c4f556c75","embedding":""},{"id":"alucinate-hdr","name":"Alucinate HDR","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["ai-vj","conductor","spectrogram","glyphs","meta","hdr","audio-reactive","elegant"],"description":"When Alucinate (AI VJ) mode is active, this serves as a visual 'conductor's baton' — elegant, minimal music-reactive glyphs and a living spectrogram that represent the current vibe stack. The psychedelic warp + HDR bloom provides a rich atmospheric underlayer. Mouse acts as the conductor's hand.","hash":"d347769946ffc996","embedding":""},{"id":"ambient-liquid-coupled","name":"Ambient Liquid Coupled","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["liquid","membrane","viscous","organic","audio-reactive","hybrid"],"description":"Two persistent viscous height fields coupled through a living membrane, with bounded pointer velocity, held press and twist, click counter-waves, three-band tension, layer-separation optics, exact C state, ACES, and semantic alpha.","hash":"9f00c8d8c0cc37f0","embedding":""},{"id":"anamorphic-flare-iridescence","name":"Anamorphic Flare Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["lens-flare","thin-film-interference","spectral-render","mouse-driven","anamorphic","iridescence","advanced-hybrid"],"description":"Cinematic anamorphic lens flare combined with physical thin-film interference. Flare streaks, hexagonal ghosts, starburst rays, and halo rings carry angle-dependent iridescent soap-bubble reflections modulated by audio dynamics.","hash":"d7cd2bc0c8149fdb","embedding":""},{"id":"anisotropic-kuwahara-nlm","name":"Anisotropic Kuwahara + NLM","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["painterly","kuwahara","non-local-means","denoising","artistic","edge-aware","convolution"],"description":"Painterly anisotropic Kuwahara filter enhanced with Non-Local Means patch-similarity denoising. Structure tensor guides brush stroke direction while NLM preserves edges and creates an importance map.","hash":"355f2c82e15535e7","embedding":""},{"id":"ascii-flow-structure","name":"ASCII Flow + Structure Tensor","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["ascii","structure-tensor","flow-field","glyphs","edge-aligned","convolution","stylize"],"description":"Edge-aligned ASCII glyphs driven by structure-tensor flow and LIC brightness, with spring flow bias, held coherence lock, click shockfront, exact C coherency blend, and ACES display.","hash":"01245f9105a220c8","embedding":""},{"id":"astral-kaleidoscope-julia","name":"Astral Kaleidoscope Julia","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["kaleidoscope","quaternion-julia","raymarching","depth-aware"],"description":"Astral Kaleidoscope Julia","hash":"5e7c36a15d0280f4","embedding":""},{"id":"astral-kaleidoscope-morph","name":"Astral Kaleidoscope + Morphological","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["kaleidoscope","morphological","psychedelic","chromatic","erosion","dilation","convolution"],"description":"Psychedelic kaleidoscope with chromatic separation enhanced by morphological erosion/dilation operations. Morphological gradient creates glowing halos around segments, top-hat transform isolates bright sparkles.","hash":"9a6ea062999e9140","embedding":""},{"id":"atmos-fog-volumetric","name":"Atmospheric Fog Volumetric","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["volumetric","fog","atmosphere","depth-aware","mouse-driven","physics"],"description":"Enhanced volumetric fog combining physical transmittance with interactive depth-layered alpha. Mouse clears fog locally, ripples create swirling disturbances, and height-based density mixes with Beer's Law for atmospheric realism.","hash":"33e8334370ff9aad","embedding":""},{"id":"audio-voronoi-displacement","name":"Audio Voronoi Displacement","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["interactive","cursor","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Audio-reactive Voronoi cells that displace the image. Image fractured into cells that pulse with music.","hash":"570ef5f0adbdc2e8","embedding":""},{"id":"audio-voronoi-gabor","name":"Audio Voronoi Gabor","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["audio","music","reactive","texture","gabor","voronoi","displacement"],"description":"Audio-reactive Voronoi displacement modulated by Gabor texture analysis. Gabor filter banks detect local texture orientation and strength, rotating and scaling cell displacement. Edges and textured regions displace differently than smooth areas.","hash":"f184d2e17caca448","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-borealis-iridescence","name":"Aurora Borealis Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["aurora","iridescence","thin-film","interference","atmospheric","spectral"],"description":"Northern lights with flowing ribbon curves enhanced by thin-film iridescence, curl-noise turbulence, ACES tone mapping, and atmospheric luminescence persistence.","hash":"d545f7c825bab2e6","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-rift-2-iridescence","name":"Aurora Rift 2 Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["aurora-rift-2","thin-film-interference","spectral-render","interference","aurora","volumetric"],"description":"5-layer volumetric aurora curtains with multi-order thin-film interference, Beer's Law physical transmittance, geomagnetic turbulence, ACES tone mapping, and atmospheric luminescence persistence.","hash":"1a8602af5e7d179e","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-rift-iridescence","name":"Aurora Rift Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["iridescence","thin-film","aurora","volumetric","atmospheric","spectral","interference"],"description":"Atmospheric curl-flow aurora blended with thin-film interference. Pattern density drives soap-bubble and oil-slick film thickness, producing flowing iridescence with ACES tone mapping and continuous plasma persistence.","hash":"ebaf397c655e002f","embedding":""},{"id":"bio-lenia-rgba","name":"Bio Lenia RGBA","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["lenia","cellular-automata","reaction-diffusion","biological","emergence","simulation","rgba-state-machine","continuous-ca","colorful"],"description":"Four-species continuous cellular automata with Lenia-style smooth growth functions applied to each RGBA channel. Combines reaction-diffusion chemistry with biological emergence patterns. Cross-inhibition between species pairs creates complex multi-color morphologies.","hash":"1f9a50b47fe18992","embedding":""},{"id":"bio-touch-em","name":"Bio Touch EM","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["mouse-driven","organic","electromagnetic","glow","interactive"],"description":"Bio-luminescent cellular structures distorted by electromagnetic field lines. Magnetic field rotates cell glow colors. Click ripples spawn orbiting secondary charges.","hash":"ad9df156c9c1b14e","embedding":""},{"id":"bioluminescent-blackbody","name":"Bioluminescent Blackbody","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["bioluminescent","blackbody","organic","growth","thermal","physics"],"description":"Living organic growth patterns with physically-correct thermal coloring. Growth energy maps to blackbody temperature — cooler regions glow deep red, active growth burns orange-yellow, and intense hotspots reach white-hot temperatures.","hash":"3780465f60ed7533","embedding":""},{"id":"bismuth-crystal-growth","name":"Bismuth Crystal Growth","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["phase-field-crystal","hopper-crystals","iridescence","bismuth","crystal-growth","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Phase-field simulation of bismuth hopper crystal step-pyramid growth with 4-fold cubic anisotropy, thin-film oxide rainbow iridescence, and metallic luster.","hash":"da81989e3a88d7c3","embedding":""},{"id":"black-hole-iridescence","name":"Black Hole Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["black-hole","iridescence","gravitational-lensing","thin-film","interference","space"],"description":"Schwarzschild gravitational lensing with relativistic Doppler-boosted accretion disk, thin-film interference, gravitational wave strain, ACES tone mapping, and photon persistence.","hash":"65a5352ba29304ce","embedding":""},{"id":"block-distort-em","name":"Block Distort EM","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["mouse-driven","interactive","electromagnetic","distortion","chromatic"],"description":"Grid blocks pushed by mouse proximity, distorted by electromagnetic field lines. Electric field displaces UVs, magnetic field rotates hue. Click ripples spawn orbiting secondary charges.","hash":"37cce38a28cb36f3","embedding":""},{"id":"blueprint-reveal-guided","name":"Blueprint Reveal + Guided Filter","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["blueprint","guided-filter","depth-aware","edge-detection","technical","convolution"],"description":"Blueprint effect with depth-guided edge-aware filtering. The guided filter smooths the image using depth as guide before Sobel edge detection, creating blueprint lines that respect true object boundaries.","hash":"45f73b9975afd91a","embedding":""},{"id":"boids-rgba-ecosystem","name":"Boids RGBA Ecosystem","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["boids","flocking","ecosystem","simulation