"physical-media","drawing","edge-preserving","convolution"],"description":"Physical charcoal media simulation with Perona-Malik anisotropic diffusion preprocessing. Diffusion creates smooth tonal regions before charcoal conversion, with diffusion coefficient modulating charcoal density.","hash":"772f0acc71b0fc16","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-depth-tunnel-prismatic","name":"Chroma Depth Tunnel Prismatic","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["chroma-depth-tunnel","spec-prismatic-dispersion","depth-aware"],"description":"Stylized spectral tunnel with held-pointer lens pull, rapid axial packets, helical color runners, three-band audio response, and bounded click fronts.","hash":"461afa50479f369a","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-kinetic-blackbody","name":"Chroma Kinetic Blackbody","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["chroma-kinetic","blackbody-thermal","physical-color"],"description":"Chroma Kinetic Blackbody","hash":"5289dcd7bf0e7e24","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-lens-iridescence","name":"Chroma Lens Iridescence","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["chroma-lens","thin-film-interference","depth-aware","mouse-driven","lens","spectral","advanced-hybrid"],"description":"Chromatic lens magnification fused with physical thin-film optical iridescence. The lens body exhibits true wavelength-dependent interference, radial chromatic aberration, and Fresnel bevel reflections driven by pointer spring dynamics and audio.","hash":"04ccdce84b0859fb","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-threads-gabor","name":"Chroma Threads Gabor","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["chroma-threads","gabor-texture-analysis","mouse-driven"],"description":"Catalog entry for Chroma Threads Gabor.","hash":"b34a1cbf7a2bc667","embedding":""},{"id":"chroma-vortex-coupled","name":"Chroma Vortex Coupled","category":"advanced-hybrid","tags":["chroma-vortex","fluid-coupling","mouse-driven","birefringence","prismatic","temporal"],"description":"RGB vortex twist distorted by a live fluid velocity field, featuring Cauch