pping, and canvas grain. Bass drives heat gun intensity; mouse applies local heat; depth controls wax thickness.","hash":"0afa16b391484647","embedding":""},{"id":"engraving-stipple","name":"Engraving Stipple","category":"artistic","tags":["engraving","stipple","etching","line-art","audio-reactive","cross-hatch","copperplate"],"description":"Copperplate-inspired engraving with continuously traveling hatch runners, held-pointer burin pressure, click-engraved impact rings, ink pooling, and depth-shaped line width.","hash":"85790a8be1345d24","embedding":""},{"id":"fabric-step","name":"Fabric of Reality","category":"artistic","tags":["simulation","physics"],"description":"Mass-spring cloth simulation with Verlet integration, constraint solving, and interactive tearing mechanics.","hash":"359da61ab0420136","embedding":""},{"id":"film-cross-process","name":"Film Cross-Process","category":"artistic","tags":["film","cross-process","color-grade","darkroom","vintage","grain","audio-reactive"],"description":"Simulates E6 slide film developed in C41 negative chemistry. Each RGB channel is routed through a different S-curve (lifted shadows, crushed mids, blown highlights), the colour gamut is skewed so greens shift cyan and reds shift orange-yellow, film grain is layered in, and the image is pushed toward the iconic high-con","hash":"9622c08cdd2e50a7","embedding":""},{"id":"frosty-window","name":"Frosty Window","category":"artistic","tags":["frost","ice","glass","winter","filter","image-processing"],"description":"Animated frost crystal patterns on glass with audio-reactive growth and mouse-driven melting.","hash":"dd2de72f89b4efdf","embedding":""},{"id":"galaxy-sim","name":"Galaxy Simulation","category":"artistic","tags":["procedural","generative","galaxy","space","stars","spiral","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive spiral galaxy with breathing arms, diffraction-spike stars, mouse-parallax center, and silence-driven reverse flow.","hash":"d6da27d8b9bd9f87","embe