ce. Fringe spacing comes from the eight FFT bins and the reference-beam angle follows the pointer. Contours are extracted at three parallax offsets driven by scene dep","hash":"886346634ba5ff3c","embedding":""},{"id":"ink-diffusion","name":"Ink Diffusion","category":"artistic","tags":["ink","wash","painting","organic","temporal","mouse-driven","audio-reactive","artistic","navier-stokes","vorticity","surface-tension","sumi-e","hdr-specular","aces-tone-mapping"],"description":"Navier-Stokes advection-diffusion ink simulation in water with vorticity confinement and surface tension at boundaries. Sumi-e ink wash with turbulent eddies, paper fiber texture, chromatic edge darkening, ACES tone mapping, and HDR specular on wet regions.","hash":"32255bc325686983","embedding":""},{"id":"ink_dispersion_alpha","name":"Ink Dispersion RGBA","category":"artistic","tags":["ink","fluid","dispersion","chemical","curl","water"],"description":"Ink in water simulation with Navier-Stokes velocity field. Alpha = ink density/concentration. Multiple colors, chemical reactions.","hash":"927fcecff93861be","embedding":""},{"id":"ion-stream","name":"Ion Stream","category":"artistic","tags":["filter","image-processing","ion","curl","turbulence","magnetic","particles"],"description":"Helical ion packets race through a smooth turbulent flow while the mouse bends their bounded display wakes and clicks launch expanding ion fronts. Audio shapes flow and glow; depth is passed through unchanged.","hash":"f5e61dadaebb9a1b","embedding":""},{"id":"iridescent-oil-slick","name":"Iridescent Oil Slick","category":"artistic","tags":["iridescent","oil","soap-bubble","interference","rainbow","organic","flowing","kaleidoscope","artistic","stylized"],"description":"Mesmerizing thin-film interference simulation that recreates the rainbow patterns of oil on water or soap bubbles. Features flowing organic motion, hexagonal bubble cells, and mouse-reactive disturbances.","hash":"8065205babbd2f72","embedding":""},{"id"