ually does — and per-band telemetry rings: eight concentric arcs around the reticle, one per FFT bin, each sweeping at its own rate with arc length reporting it","hash":"389f1d5fbc63df56","embedding":""},{"id":"data-slicer","name":"Data Slicer","category":"distortion","tags":["glitch","slice","chromatic","audio-reactive","scanline","fractal","fbm","voronoi","quasicrystal"],"description":"Beat-reactive fractal tape-slice glitch with FBM domain warping, Voronoi cellular cracks, quasicrystal patterns, and 6-octave temporal jitter. Slices distort organically with curl-noise chromatic aberration and audio-reactive sparkle trails.","hash":"423d6777091508c4","embedding":""},{"id":"dimension-slicer","name":"Dimension Slicer","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","temporal","chromatic","audio-reactive","depth-aware","slice"],"description":"Opens a dimensional rift with temporal slice rotation memory, chromatic inside-slice dispersion, audio-driven slice width modulation, depth-aware zoom warp, and edge glow.","hash":"7ef5b5089125a92f","embedding":""},{"id":"elastic-strip","name":"Elastic Strip","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","elastic","physics","spring","chromatic","frequency","iridescent","bevel"],"description":"Spring-physics strips with sharper nested bevel sub-ribs, traveling pluck packets along each band, stronger soap-film iridescence driven by stretch energy, held drag punch, and bounded click plucks. Direction (V/H) preserved. Display RGBA packed in A.","hash":"9123ed300a05726d","embedding":""},{"id":"elastic-surface","name":"Elastic Surface","category":"distortion","tags":["elastic","rubber","wave","distortion","physics","organic","liquid","membrane","caustic"],"description":"Spring-mass elastic membrane with exact textureLoad state, surface-tension waves, depth-aware deformation, audio-reactive ambient drive, held punch, click ripples, thin-film stretch lighting, and caustic runners. A stores disp.rg+vel.ba (never tonemapped); display uses ACES.","hash":"7e1a5538cb5651c7","embedding":""},{"id":"ethereal-swirl","name":"Ethereal Swirl","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Ethereal swirling motion with soft gradients.","hash":"523a85ba09becd52","embedding":""},{"id":"fluid-grid","name":"Fluid Grid","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"A strain-aware major/minor lattice drawn in a deformed curl-flow domain, with spring-smoothed mouse pressure, depth obstacles, alternating click eddies, glowing junctions, and advected rail trails.","hash":"874964166959fe5e","embedding":""},{"id":"fractal-glass-distort","name":"IFS Attractor Glass","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","fractal","ifs","attractor","glass"],"description":"IFS attractor glass with branch runners, held contraction pinch, treble iridescence, and capped attractor shock rings.","hash":"8e2132a7b7dc0b4e","embedding":""},{"id":"fractal-image-surf","name":"Fractal Image Surf","category":"distortion","tags":["fractal","fbm","julia","mandelbrot","burning-ship","domain-warp","distortion","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Multi-octave FBM domain warping with Jacobian-preserving displacement. Morphs between Julia, Mandelbrot, and Burning Ship fractals driven by bass.","hash":"ec5f560a38be73ac","embedding":""},{"id":"fractal-kaleidoscope","name":"Fractal Kaleidoscope","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Fractal kaleidoscope with live sliders, facet seams, radial conveyors, held pivot, bounded iris clicks, and oil-slick color. Display RGBA in A.","hash":"dd265ef0d3644591","embedding":""},{"id":"gemstone-fractures","name":"Gemstone Fractures","category":"distortion","tags":["crystal","gemstone","fracture","transmission","voronoi","physical"],"description":"Fragments the image into crystalline shards with physical light transmission. Features internal fractures that scatter light, variable purity per cell, and IOR-based refraction.","hash":"f3d014fd229b0c3f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-vortex","name":"Chromatic Vortex","category":"distortion","tags":["vortex","polar","kaleidoscope","color-warp","audio","distortion","psychedelic","temporal","chromatic","depth-aware"],"description":"Rotates image in polar coordinates with psychedelic color-space warping, chromatic sector dispersion, temporal spiral drift via dataTextureC, and audio-driven YUV hue rotation.","hash":"b749df3eced182d7","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-brick-distortion","name":"Glass Brick Distortion","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","glass","brick","refraction","fresnel","chromatic","grid","audio-reactive","depth-aware","temporal"],"description":"Architectural glass brick wall with plano-convex lens distortion, chromatic aberration, Fresnel reflection, and depth-based thickness variation.","hash":"886985ef0820cc7a","embedding":""},{"id":"glass-brick-wall","name":"Glass Brick Wall","category":"distortion","tags":["glass","brick","caustic","refraction","audio-reactive","chromatic","fbm","voronoi","dispersion"],"description":"Refractive glass brick wall with FBM-perturbed normals, multi-frequency caustic patterns, chromatic dispersion through wavelength-dependent refraction, depth-layer compositing, and internal reflections. Beat-driven caustics and Voronoi cellular caustic enhancement.","hash":"6c5017b0695be3f3","embedding":""},{"id":"glitch-slice-mirror","name":"Glitch Slice Mirror","category":"distortion","tags":["glitch","mirror","distortion","chromatic-aberration","scanlines","filter"],"description":"Mirrors the image at a sprung cursor seam with fp128 integration, racing fracture packets, capped click slice bands, regional FFT blocks, and ACES composite.","hash":"86077a38e990e4e0","embedding":""},{"id":"gravity-well","name":"Gravity Well","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","black-hole","relativistic","accretion"],"description":"Schwarzschild-inspired lensing with photon-sphere rings, gravitational redshift, and Doppler-bright accretion flow.","hash":"7c44210ceb25583f","embedding":""},{"id":"heat-haze-gpt52","name":"Heat Haze Mirage gpt52","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","distortion","heat","atmospheric"],"description":"Rising heat mirage with thermal filaments, axial packets, held thermal source, bounded click rings, chromatic dispersion, and oil-slick shimmer. Display RGBA in A; 16x16x1.","hash":"0be76a1683b5d005","embedding":""},{"id":"heat-haze","name":"Heat Haze","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","heat","thermal","filter"],"description":"Stylized heat distortion with exact-load rising heat advection, fast convection packets, held-pointer injection, click thermal fronts, diffusion, and audio shimmer.","hash":"59dae36b71bff6f2","embedding":""},{"id":"infinite-zoom-lens","name":"Infinite Zoom Lens","category":"distortion","tags":["zoom","tunnel","temporal","spiral","audio-reactive","droste","escher","recursive"],"description":"Droste zoom lens with axial packets, interference runners, analytic rainbow caustics, held aim, click rings. Diagnostic A packing preserved.","hash":"08ddd719e704dcdc","embedding":""},{"id":"infinite-zoom","name":"Infinite Zoom","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"","hash":"28d4ebbd7f90413e","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-rgb-split","name":"Interactive RGB Split","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","chromatic-aberration","audio-reactive","distortion"],"description":"Smooth alpha-channel translucency blending driven by a single displacement field. Spectral tint via mix, depth-aware compositing, and audio-reactive bass response.","hash":"49b3e2de7c38c760","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive-zoom-blur","name":"Interactive Zoom Blur","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","zoom","radial","blur","chromatic","temporal","audio-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Radial zoom blur centered on the mouse cursor with temporal blur trail persistence, chromatic radial streak separation, depth-scaled blur attenuation, dithered sampling, and audio-reactive intensity.","hash":"64c52a18f5c13cd9","embedding":""},{"id":"julia-warp","name":"Julia Warp","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","audio","music","reactive","julia","fractal-optics","interactive"],"description":"Derivative-aware Julia orbit traps drive refractive distortion, animated complex-parameter control, held zoom, spectral orbit light, and age-bounded shockwaves.","hash":"c0a8deee83a1b72a","embedding":""},{"id":"kaleidoscope","name":"Rose FBM Kaleidoscope","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","kaleidoscope","mirror","symmetry","rose-curve"],"description":"Rose-FBM kaleidoscope whose mirror bank is now steerable: the segment fan pivots and re-centres on a spring-damped pointer in extraBuffer[133..134] instead of being pinned to frame centre, and each mirror segment owns one FFT bin driving its own petal amplitude and Gabor texture gain. Fixes a shader that never read the","hash":"8c3be8278608081c","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-prism","name":"Liquid Prism","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","audio","music","prism","dispersion","glass","refraction","chromatic"],"description":"Ripple glass with wavelength-correct Cauchy dispersion: n(lambda) = A + B/lambda^2 sets each channel's sample offset, so blue bends hardest as real glass does. Fixes the dead-audio bug where u.config.y (the ripple count) was read as an audio level. Clicks emit bounded caustic wavefronts.","hash":"3dc0f74bb2a9924e","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-swirl","name":"Liquid Swirl","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A spring-followed Lamb-Oseen vortex with a finite viscous core, counter-rotating satellite pair, midpoint transport, FFT circulation, bounded vortex wakes, tensor-derived strain caustics, and temporal sheen.","hash":"69decd7d05685ec9","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid-warp-interactive","name":"Liquid Warp","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform"],"description":"Four analytic stream-function modes provide divergence-free velocity and a full Jacobian in one pass. RK2 transport, depth-gradient Coanda attachment, strain caustics, viscous temporal memory, held-pointer flow, and bounded vortex fronts shape the warp.","hash":"864e4ecffc224f16","embedding":""},{"id":"log-polar-droste","name":"Log-Polar Droste","category":"distortion","tags":["droste","geometric","log-polar","pattern","physics","showcase","simulation"],"description":"Infinite recursive zoom with spiral distortion creating Droste/Escher-like effects.","hash":"ad6c9027e442c904","embedding":""},{"id":"luma-glass","name":"Luma Glass","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","glass","refraction","chromatic-dispersion","caustics"],"description":"Physically-based refraction shader where luminance drives glass refractive index. Features Sellmeier chromatic dispersion, caustic highlights, Fresnel reflections, and subsurface scattering.","hash":"4922ae5e797d5cdf","embedding":""},{"id":"luminescent-glass-tiles","name":"Luminescent Glass","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","glass","refraction","tiles"],"description":"Glass tiles that refract based on video brightness and mouse interaction.","hash":"3361840ef2469409","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-field","name":"Magnetic Field","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","magnetic","curl","particles","temporal","field-lines","physics","lorentz","aurora"],"description":"Multipole magnetic field where each pole draws its moment from one of the eight FFT bins, so the field geometry itself reshapes with the music. Luminous tracer bands advect along the field lines at a cyclotron rate set by local |B|, streaming fast in strong regions and stalling in weak ones. Fixes a mask-as-colour feed","hash":"5682c1428204fa8c","embedding":""},{"id":"parallax-shift","name":"Parallax Shift","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform"],"description":"Uses luminance as depth to create a mouse-controlled 3D parallax effect.","hash":"e267f06587a86a2f","embedding":""},{"id":"perspective-tilt","name":"Perspective Tilt","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Rotates the image plane in 3D space based on mouse position (Pitch/Yaw). Zoom param adjusts distance.","hash":"4bbd375f2b272ba7","embedding":""},{"id":"phase-shift","name":"Phase Shift","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"RGB channels are rotationally shifted relative to the mouse position.","hash":"7f829da5e76cb96e","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-sort-glitch","name":"Pixel Sort Glitch","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","glitch","edge","sort"],"description":"Edge-aware pixel sorting glitch with threshold masking. Creates melting pixels that flow along detected edges. Features horizontal, vertical, and angular sorting directions with adjustable window size and edge influence.","hash":"a794f484c9d87973","embedding":""},{"id":"pixel-storm","name":"Pixel Storm","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Mouse movement creates a chaotic storm of pixels.","hash":"12c41ac2beaf8712","embedding":""},{"id":"pixelate-blast","name":"Pixelate Blast","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","pixelate","blast","voronoi","fast-motion","audio-reactive","aces"],"description":"Voronoi cellular pixelation with shockwave domain distortion and explosive blast dispersal. Features spring-damper cursor dynamics, Cauchy chromatic aberration along blast normals, multi-ring click ripples, exact-C temporal feedback, and ACES tonemapping.","hash":"4e5f93100278953e","embedding":""},{"id":"predator-camouflage","name":"Predator Camouflage","category":"distortion","tags":["cloak","predator","camouflage","chromatic","audio-reactive","thermal","chromatophore","IR"],"description":"Stylized active-camouflage treatment with false-color thermal mapping, fast pigment-sac runners and hunt sweeps, held-pointer cloaking, click fronts, depth-shaped haze, bloom, and chromatic separation.","hash":"24b074e2db01d9ae","embedding":""},{"id":"prism-displacement","name":"Prism Displacement","category":"distortion","tags":["prism","distortion","chromatic","dispersion","lens","spectral","anamorphic"],"description":"Prismatic displacement with anamorphic spectral lens dispersion, depth-weighted magnification, and chromatic rotation.","hash":"61ec5e87b15e7ffc","embedding":""},{"id":"prismatic-mosaic","name":"Prismatic Mosaic","category":"distortion","tags":["mosaic","prism","distortion","zoom","chromatic","fog"],"description":"Multi-layer prismatic facet tiles with volumetric fog, chromatic dispersion, vortex distortion, and depth-gradient edge glows.","hash":"d7b1c8caa908bf83","embedding":""},{"id":"radial-rgb","name":"Radial RGB","category":"distortion","tags":["lens","chromatic","spectral","distortion","anamorphic"],"description":"Spectral chromatic aberration with lens distortion, anamorphic stretch, single-sample spectral tint via mix(), alpha translucency blending, and vignette.","hash":"2c002958e4daa2b0","embedding":""},{"id":"refraction-tunnel","name":"Refraction Tunnel","category":"distortion","tags":["distortion","refraction","chromatic","tunnel","volumetric"],"description":"Chromatic refraction tunnel with wall ribs, hoop rings, helical rails, analytic liquid-rainbow caustics, held aim, and bounded click shock rings. Display RGBA is packed in A.","hash":"a6b62efe2890b6bc","embedding":""},{"id":"scan-distort-gpt52","name":"Scan Distort Matrix gpt52","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","cinematic","vintage","atmospheric","fbm","bands","domain-warp","audio-palette","hybrid"],"description":"High-density scanlines with smooth multi-band jitter, opposing scan heads, diagonal tear conveyors, held-pointer band pulling, bounded click shocks, curvature, domain-warped FBM, and audio-reactive chromatic grading.","hash":"24f2cb58d41c1ea7","embedding":""},{"id":"sine-wave","name":"Sine Wave","category":"distortion","tags":["wave","ribbon","chromatic","audio-reactive","distortion","interference","caustics","HDR"],"description":"Multi-frequency sine wave interference with fast traveling packets, crest-aligned history streaks, click wave fronts, water-like caustics, chromatic dispersion, and bounded specular highlights. Bass drives wave amplitude and depth controls attenuation.","hash":"f2d073fb4d879c04","embedding":""},{"id":"sonic-boom","name":"Sonic Boom","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","shock-wave","mach-cone","supersonic"],"description":"","hash":"75db72f071810ae1","embedding":""},{"id":"spec-bicubic-crystal","name":"Bicubic Crystal","category":"distortion","tags":["bicubic","catmull-rom","crystalline","distortion","prismatic","high-order-sampling"],"description":"Bicubic Catmull-Rom crystalline distortion. Full 16-sample bicubic interpolation for perfectly smooth magnification, applied to prismatic crystalline faceting with chromatic separation.","hash":"d3c8d3bc37126821","embedding":""},{"id":"spectral-vortex","name":"Spectral Vortex","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing"],"description":"Spectral curl distortion whose authoritative A feedback packs phase, curl, and energy; sprung pointer and bounded click vortices drive three-band motion while source depth passes through unchanged.","hash":"8a2d2f6c5a8e656e","embedding":""},{"id":"spiral-lens","name":"Spiral Lens","category":"distortion","tags":["lens","spiral","distortion","chromatic","caustic","bloom","dof","audio-reactive","depth-aware","interactive","domain-warp","kaleidoscope","mobius"],"description":"Liquid rainbow interference through a Möbius kaleidoscopic lens, with spectral caustics, drag-twisted focus, bounded click-launched iris waves, domain warp, audio response, and layered depth alpha.","hash":"c22491b5dd9ccb2b","embedding":""},{"id":"temporal-distortion-field","name":"Temporal Distortion Field","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform","temporal","chromatic","audio-reactive","depth-aware","freeze"],"description":"Stylized temporal distortion with exact display-history feedback, depth-weighted freeze radius, moving clock rings, held freeze, click fronts, and chromatic lag.","hash":"9b72124e1ac292ec","embedding":""},{"id":"tensor-flow-sculpt","name":"Tensor Flow Sculpt","category":"distortion","tags":["depth-aware","tensor-warp","audio-reactive"],"description":"Catalog entry for Tensor Flow Sculpt.","hash":"72b5d615d9fbce79","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-chaos","name":"Voronoi Chaos","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","transform"],"description":"Animated Voronoi mosaic with moving ridge runners, held cell repulsion, click fronts, three-band audio, bounded source sampling, and psychedelic cell color.","hash":"c044462778fa5e8a","embedding":""},{"id":"voronoi-faceted-glass","name":"Voronoi Faceted Glass","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","voronoi","glass","refraction","faceted"],"description":"Cellular glass distortion effect with Voronoi facet refraction, mouse push/pull physics, and edge shading.","hash":"c0a1205e9cd567c6","embedding":""},{"id":"vortex-distortion","name":"Lamb-Oseen Vortex","category":"distortion","tags":["warp","distort","fluid","physics","vortex","reactive"],"description":"Lamb-Oseen vortex fluid dynamics with Kelvin-Helmholtz shear instability at vortex boundaries. Multiple interacting vortices from ripple history, velocity-magnitude and vorticity colour coding with chromatic aberration.","hash":"4e8df3e9675560e0","embedding":""},{"id":"vortex-pass1","name":"Clean Vortex (Pass 1)","category":"distortion","tags":["vortex","fluid-dynamics","vorticity","multi-pass","audio-reactive"],"description":"Vortex dynamics pass: four animated vortex centers, Biot-Savart velocity field, vorticity confinement, and turbulent FBM noise. Outputs velocity and vorticity field to dataTextureA.","hash":"f0ddb068de88f9aa","embedding":""},{"id":"vortex-warp","name":"Vortex Warp","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive","vortex","turbulence","chromatic","distortion"],"description":"Rankine vortex warp: solid-body rotation inside the core radius and free-vortex circulation (omega ~ 1/r^2) outside it, giving a tightly spun core with a slower, longer-reaching outer flow instead of a rigidly rotating disc. The vortex eye is spring-damped through extraBuffer[133..136] and its own velocity shears the f","hash":"6a7c83bf7f6262c5","embedding":""},{"id":"vortex","name":"Clean Vortex","category":"distortion","tags":["filter","image-processing","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"","hash":"209aaabf6641cda2","embedding":""},{"id":"zoom-burst","name":"Zoom Burst","category":"distortion","tags":["zoom","burst","radial","chromatic","audio-reactive","starburst","bloom","film-grain","fast-motion","aces"],"description":"Radial speed lines with rotational shear streaks and chromatic burst sampling. Sprung epicenter, click zoom packets, exact-C persist, ACES display, burst-energy alpha.","hash":"df06be0b66fe9a3f","embedding":""},{"id":"4d-projection-dream-weavers","name":"4D Projection Dream Weavers","category":"generative","tags":["4d","fractal","higher-dimensional","exploration","mathematical","dream"],"description":"A continuous slice through 4-dimensional fractal space. The mouse smoothly controls two extra dimensions, allowing genuine exploration of higher-dimensional forms. Audio modulates scale, speed, and detail.","hash":"f7f192eb7793c3de","embedding":""},{"id":"acoustic-string-theory","name":"Acoustic String Theory","category":"generative","tags":["generative","strings","harmonics","physics","acoustic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Vibrating string harmonics visualized as oscillating sine waves in perspective, with audio-driven pluck and resonance.","hash":"d581dc80814b25c6","embedding":""},{"id":"atmos_volumetric_fog","name":"Volumetric Fog","category":"generative","tags":["volumetric","fog","god-rays","scattering","atmosphere"],"description":"Volumetric fog with ray marching, Mie/Rayleigh scattering, height-based density, god rays, and mouse-controlled light source","hash":"24fceaaeb2c30936","embedding":""},{"id":"audio_geometric_pulse","name":"Geometric Pulse","category":"generative","tags":["geometric","audio","kaleidoscope","neon","sacred-geometry"],"description":"Audio-reactive geometric patterns with kaleidoscope symmetry, shape morphing, neon glow, and frequency band visualization","hash":"f92ccd1e77154d76","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-borealis-loom","name":"Aurora Borealis Loom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","aurora","fabric","loom","celestial","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","abstract","atmospheric"],"description":"Aurora curtains woven like fabric on a celestial loom. Curtain conveyor scroll, vertical ion drift streaks, and advected HDR trails. Bass swells the weave, mids shift hue through the spectrum, treble adds bead-like ionization nodes. Mouse pulls the fabric.","hash":"4859ea76cfb9d882","embedding":""},{"id":"aurora-curtain","name":"Aurora Curtain","category":"generative","tags":["aurora","borealis","northern-lights","generative","curtains","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","stars","atmospheric","physics"],"description":"Chapman layer auroral excitation with Kelvin-Helmholtz instability and domain-warped curtain folds. Physically inspired colors by altitude via OkLab mixing: red O(1D) high, green O(1S) mid, blue N2+ low. Enhanced with Fresnel rim lighting on folds, temporal feedback trails, two-tone atmospheric key/fill, starfield blac","hash":"2c0817ee93799f0d","embedding":""},{"id":"bio_lenia_continuous","name":"Lenia Continuous","category":"generative","tags":["lenia","cellular-automata","biological","emergence","simulation"],"description":"Continuous cellular automata (Lenia) with smooth growth functions, multiple kernel radii, and biological emergence patterns","hash":"a83eab38ba2403fb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioluminescent-abyss","name":"Bioluminescent Abyss","category":"generative","tags":["underwater","generative","3d","bioluminescence","raymarching","volumetric","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"An infinite deep underwater landscape with swaying tube worms and thermal vents, featuring bioluminescence and deep sea atmosphere.","hash":"c9e9028aecdde3e3","embedding":""},{"id":"bioluminescent-bloom","name":"Bioluminescent Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","bioluminescent","deep-sea","tendrils","glow","audio-reactive","organic","atmospheric","reaction-diffusion","gray-scott","chemotaxis","quorum-sensing","colony"],"description":"Deep-ocean bioluminescent colony driven by Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion with chemotaxis and quorum-sensing glow activation. Background tendrils provide ambient light. Audio injects nutrients and triggers stress flashes; mouse drops nutrient pellets. Depth attenuates bioluminescence.","hash":"899167f27898eca0","embedding":""},{"id":"bubble-chamber","name":"Bubble Chamber","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Simulates subatomic particle trails in a magnetic field using a feedback loop.","hash":"949800917ec1c09f","embedding":""},{"id":"chromatic-ghost-tunnel","name":"Chromatic Ghost Tunnel","category":"generative","tags":["generative","tunnel","perspective","chromatic","ghost","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"A perspective tunnel of chromatic ghost echoes. Each ring is RGB-split by audio bands. Bass warps tunnel depth, mids add spiral rotation, treble creates stroboscopic ring flashes. Mouse steers tunnel flight.","hash":"bf075f