","crack-propagation","iridescence","subsurface-scatter","percolation","hackle"],"description":"Fracture mechanics simulation with stress intensity factor-driven crack propagation, branching, percolation connectivity, and hackle marks on translucent crystal surfaces. Thin-film iridescence and subsurface scattering. Audio loads stress and triggers catastrophic failure; mouse applies point stress. Depth controls cr","hash":"d37f999618af4cc4","embedding":""},{"id":"crystalline-veins","name":"Crystalline Veins","category":"generative","tags":["generative","crystal","veins","mineral","gold","copper","silver","audio-reactive","chromatic","organic","abstract"],"description":"Mineral vein patterns growing through dark stone. FBM-based crack and vein generation with gold, copper, and silver chromatic veins. Bass drives vein pulse, mids control growth density, treble adds crystalline sparkles. Mouse attracts vein growth.","hash":"290a628506412fa2","embedding":""},{"id":"deep-sea-thermal-vent","name":"Deep Sea Thermal Vent","category":"generative","tags":["generative","deep-sea","thermal-vent","bioluminescence","underwater","audio-reactive","chromatic","organic","volumetric","abstract"],"description":"A layered black-smoker ecosystem with carbonate chimneys, mineral crust, stratified billows, rising bubbles and microbes, mouse-steered jets, click heat fronts, and advected HDR plume history.","hash":"0010c1cad386fe94","embedding":""},{"id":"electric-eel-storm","name":"Electric Eel Storm","category":"generative","tags":["generative","electric","storm","lightning","eel","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","abstract","bioluminescent"],"description":"Electric eels swimming through a conductive storm cloud, discharging arcs between them. Bass drives eel body pulses, mids create storm cloud turbulence, treble triggers lightning arc flashes. Mouse attracts the eel school.","hash":"e02faa9e6a5aca8a","embedding":""},{"id":"emergent-calligraphic-weave","name":"Emergent Calligraphic Weave","category":"generative","tags":["calligraphic","emergent","symbolic","organic","audio-reactive","abstract","sumi-e","ink","brush-dynamics","dry-brush","paper-texture","chromatic-edge"],"description":"Sumi-e ink wash simulation with pressure-sensitive Bézier brush strokes, ink viscosity flow, paper absorption capillary action, and dry-brush texture. Audio drives brush speed and splatter; mouse acts as the brush with pressure from click duration. Depth scales paper grain.","hash":"5e39c8be7c185a2a","embedding":""},{"id":"fire_smoke_volumetric","name":"Fire Smoke Volumetric","category":"generative","tags":["fire","smoke","volumetric","simulation","temporal","audio-reactive","chromatic","depth-aware","blackbody"],"description":"Raw smoke and density state advected through exact history loads, with sprung heat injection, bounded ignition fronts, chromatic fire, live plasma turbulence, ACES display, and source-depth ownership.","hash":"6e8e30250c7555a0","embedding":""},{"id":"fractal-ice-palace","name":"Fractal Ice Palace","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","ice","crystal","palace","winter","audio-reactive","chromatic","temporal","recursive"],"description":"Recursive ice crystal palace with fractal branching architecture. Chromatic ice refractions: blue core, cyan edges, white sparkle. Bass shakes the palace, mids control recursion depth visually, treble adds frost glitter. Mouse melts local ice.","hash":"f3ad4f86b70a18a8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-3d-sierpinski-chaos","name":"3D Sierpinski Chaos Game","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","sierpinski","ifs","3d","particles","generative","mathematical","pointcloud"],"description":"Iterated function system rendering a 3D Sierpinski tetrahedron using the chaos game algorithm. Thousands of point samples create intricate cloud-like renders of the fractal solid with depth-based coloring and perspective projection. Mouse rotates the 3D view in real-time.","hash":"c83bc1ccaebd147c","embedding":""},