c, deep-space biomechanical entity undulating through a quantum fluidic void, driven by audio-reactive bioluminescent plasma nodes.","hash":"d138f14f6e9024a9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-abyssal-quantum-leviathan-skeleton","name":"Abyssal Quantum-Leviathan Skeleton","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"A colossal undulating leviathan skeleton prowling the abyss, its quantum marrow glowing through the bones. Fast-motion upgrade: whip-amplified traveling-wave spine kinematics, ballistic lunge surges with bass-transient kicks, high-speed anisotropically-stretched aether-current speed streaks, and velocity-advected motio","hash":"8b00ac8580b4e5e3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-abyssal-silicate-geode-weaver","name":"Abyssal Silicate Geode-Weaver","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","geode","iridescent","organic","audio-reactive","raymarching"],"description":"A stylized warp-flight through a crystalline cavity with fast gyroid filaments, audio-lit shard pulses, click refraction waves, and bounded iridescent trails.","hash":"b33f26239e4859ee","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-acid-lissajous","name":"Acid Lissajous","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","colorful","lissajous","oscilloscope","generative","abstract","glow","audio-reactive","mouse-interactive","feedback","depth-aware"],"description":"Reactive neon Lissajous curves that live under your cursor and the music. Mouse gravity bends the strands, click bursts emit shockwaves, bass/mid/treble drive scale/morph/sparkle, video luma spawns extra color, and depth-aware temporal feedback leaves self-advecting acid trails.","hash":"114c33e6f3dca984","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-aetherial-plasma-loom","name":"Aetherial Plasma Loom","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A ray-integrated, FBM-warped plasma loom with alternating heddle lanes and bright shuttle-necking knots.","hash":"0e1c19f2e4e317eb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-alien-flora-ecosystem","name":"Gen Alien Flora Ecosystem","category":"generative","tags":["multi-species-flora","audio-seasons","mouse-pollinator","depth-canopy","symbiotic"],"description":"Gen Alien Flora Ecosystem","hash":"d87cf5bcf2d553be","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-alien-flora","name":"Alien Flora","category":"generative","tags":["nature","plants","bioluminescent","raymarching","3d","organic","forest","procedural","generative","audio","music"],"description":"An infinite procedural forest of bioluminescent alien vegetation with swaying mushrooms and atmospheric fog.","hash":"f2f38a52974a9ed7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-alpha-aurora","name":"Alpha Aurora","category":"generative","tags":["aurora","spectral","atmospheric","organic","translucent","curl-noise"],"description":"Procedural aurora borealis with rich spectral band blending, dynamic audio-reactive pulsing, and atmospheric depth. Enhanced color and motion for greater visual impact.","hash":"00d9dddc6f65bdaa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-aperiodic-monotile","name":"Aperiodic Monotile Hat","category":"generative","tags":["generative","tiling","aperiodic","monotile","hat","geometric","audio","music","sdf","raymarch","depth"],"description":"A stylized monotile-inspired 2D pattern with animated edge glow, paired with a raymarched geometric relief sculpture. It is an artistic motif rather than a proof-accurate hat tiling; scale, rotation, edge width, saturation, mouse, and audio remain live.","hash":"89963673dc4871fe","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-apollonian-gasket","name":"Apollonian Gasket","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","apollonian","circle-packing","geometric","audio-reactive","metallic"],"description":"Apollonian circle packing fractal rendered via iterative circle inversion. Descartes-based circle configuration with metallic coloring, rainbow chromatic aberration on inversions, and mouse-driven point inversion.","hash":"43fd576b2f24b197","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-art-deco-sky","name":"Art Deco Skyscraper","category":"generative","tags":["3d","ray