rives the spin and pulls the camera in, and clicks touch","hash":"03923839a7192bcc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-audio-spirograph","name":"Audio Spirograph","category":"generative","tags":["generative","audio-reactive","spirograph","harmonic","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Audio-reactive sampled epitrochoid and hypotrochoid trails with musical ratios, sprung mouse lensing, click chimes, bounded temporal persistence, and generated curve depth.","hash":"c1f872c7dde78553","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-audiovisual-mandelbulb-raymarcher","name":"Audiovisual Mandelbulb","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","3d","raymarched","audio-reactive","mandelbulb","neon","abstract","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"A Mandelbulb raymarched at speed: the fractal exponent morphs several times a second under bass, orbit-trap coloring races through a full psychedelic spectrum with treble, and a greebled ridge shell carves micro-detail into every surface. The spring-smoothed cursor orbits the camera, holding the button throttles the sp","hash":"635e67f389aafed1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-aurora-borealis-synthesis","name":"Aurora Borealis Synthesis","category":"generative","tags":["aurora","volumetric","audio-reactive","plasma"],"description":"Render a 3D volume of swirling aurora light and project it onto the 2D video surface, with audio-driven motion and depth-based mapping.","hash":"38b196281448074d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-aurora-silk","name":"Aurora Silk","category":"generative","tags":["generative","aurora","silk","atmospheric","audio-reactive","neon","hdr","volumetric","filmic"],"description":"Flowing aurora curtains with silky spectral ribbons, now in HDR with ACES filmic grading, dynamic temperature shifts, split-tone shadows/highlights, Fresnel rim lighting, volumetric god rays, caustic dapples, and depth-layered fog. Reacts to bass, mids, and treble.","hash":"6cf6138d0ad9b9b3