nds, deformed by click ripples, orbited by the mouse, and backed by a kaleidoscopic chrono-tessellation nebula.","hash":"ed7e322ba4692e4b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioluminescent-cyber-aether-void-seahorse","name":"Bioluminescent Cyber-Aether Void-Seahorse","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","biomechanical","audio-reactive","fluid","bioluminescent"],"description":"A hyper-majestic, biomechanical void-seahorse woven from shattered liquid-aether and pulsing cybernetic bioluminescence, drifting gracefully through a chaotic, fluid-dynamic quantum reef. Upgraded 2026-08-05: capsule-chain spine anatomy with smooth-union SDF composition, dorsal-fin membrane, tail orbit-trap filaments, ","hash":"ace93d73b7fd557a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioluminescent-neural-lattice-weaver","name":"Bioluminescent Neural-Lattice Weaver","category":"generative","tags":["organic","lattice","bioluminescence","neural","crystalline","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"An octahedral crystal lattice woven through an organic neural field, firing fast. Hollow shells carry strut greeble, pulses race the pathways at a treble-driven rate, and emission is graded through a psychedelic spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor is a gravity well that bends the whole structure toward it, holding dee","hash":"cac84c52c017e820","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioluminescent-neural-lattice","name":"Bioluminescent Neural Lattice","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A mesmerizing, pulsating web of deep-sea neural pathways that crackles with bioluminescent energy.","hash":"9bf63bedf2647e26","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioluminescent-reaction-diffusion","name":"Bioluminescent Reaction-Diffusion","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"Boundary-safe bioluminescent reaction-diffusion with raw A/B simulation feedback, state-derived cyan-violet species color, FFT-bin shimmer, depth-scaled glow, and direct intensity, speed, scale, and mouse-influence controls.","hash":"f8ea75ec3b570815","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-biomechanical-hive","name":"Biomechanical Hive","category":"generative","tags":["scifi","biomechanical","giger","alien","raymarching","horror","generative","audio","music"],"description":"An infinite, claustrophobic structure of hexagonal cells blending industrial machinery with organic tissue. Features pulsating lights, rhythmic breathing, and slimy metallic textures.","hash":"a81add600ad5f6a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bioreactor-bloom","name":"Bioreactor Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cellular","bioreactor","organic","toxic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Reactive cellular colonies pulse and mutate, with toxic blooms around the cursor field.","hash":"6c55cdf866e0d2f4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bismuth-crystal-citadel","name":"Bismuth Crystal Citadel","category":"generative","tags":["generative","raymarch","procedural","crystal","bismuth","metallic","iridescent","geometry","fractal","alpha-transmission","audio","music"],"description":"Endless procedural canyon of iridescent bismuth crystals with physical light transmission. Features metallic Fresnel reflection, thin-film interference, and oxide layer transmission.","hash":"89bcc280011b91ba","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-bismuth-singularity-loom-engine","name":"Bismuth Singularity-Loom Engine","category":"generative","tags":["geometric","crystal","iridescent","singularity","fractal","audio-reactive","bismuth"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, continually self-assembling bismuth crystal matrix orbiting a microscopic gravitational singularity, its iridescent geometric steps carving sharp staircases into the fabric of spacetime. The scene blends hard-edged, prismatic synthetic-architecture with chaotic fluid distortions driven by an intens","hash":"77cf3a802ae1eb73","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-brutalist-monument","name":"Brutalist Monument","category":"generative","tags":["brutalism","architecture","atmospheric","3d","raymarching","audio","music"],"description":"Massive concrete architecture in an atmospheric void.","hash":"e9693e889375d762","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-buddhabrot-aura","name":"Buddhabrot Aura","category":"generative","tags":["buddhabrot","fractal","generative","audio-reactive","ethereal","mouse-interactive","orbit-trap","HDR","bloom"],"description":"Upgraded Buddhabrot fractal with proper escaping-orbit trajectory accumulation, importance sampling, orbit-trap iridescence, HDR bloom, ACES tone mapping, and chromatic aberration on high-density regions. Bass drives orbit iteration count, mouse zooms into fractal regions, and depth controls orbit density perspective.","hash":"61e1167d03e0e256","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-aether-seraphim-wings","name":"Celestial Aether-Seraphim Wings","category":"generative","tags":["wings","angelic","plasma","fractal","audio-reactive","raymarched","upgraded-rgba","temporal","mouse-driven"],"description":"A majestic hyper-dimensional array of fractal wings enriched with aerodynamic lift physics. Angle of attack α from mouse Y drives C_L=2πα (thin airfoil). Stall at ~15° creates turbulent breakdown. Bass drives flapping frequency via damped oscillation. Temporal feedback, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"2904ee8f23036531","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-clockwork-plasma-loom","name":"Celestial Clockwork Plasma-Loom","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","cosmic","plasma","clockwork","fractal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A gargantuan interstellar loom of turning astrolabes and celestial gears forged from liquid plasma and starlight, weaving threads of radiant energy across an endless, deep-void chronosphere.","hash":"7c5b6184fc1bb1ce","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-forge","name":"Celestial Forge","category":"generative","tags":["space","megastructure","dyson sphere","plasma","rings","sci-fi","raymarching","3d","audio","music","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"A stellar engine hammering at speed: contra-rotating rings carry hull plating and rivet greeble, the core pulses on the beat, and plasma arcs fire through a psychedelic molten spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor orbits the forge, holding pulls the camera into the furnace, and clicks land hammer strikes that swell the ","hash":"7d2aa161e5c1901f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-glass-tornado","name":"Celestial Glass Tornado","category":"generative","tags":["generative","raymarching","glass","tornado","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","click-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"Raymarched celestial glass tornado featuring Cauchy prismatic facet TIR glints, helical plasma funnel discharge arcs, centrifugal glass dust accretion disk, sprung mouse orbit, and true hit depth.","hash":"4b82210187dca982","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-nanite-swarm-nebula","name":"Celestial Nanite-Swarm Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","particle-system","geometric","audio-reactive","nanites"],"description":"A majestic, slowly churning nebula constructed entirely from trillions of glowing, synchronized nanites that dynamically self-assemble into intricate, shifting geometric constellations and colossal architectural megastructures in deep space.","hash":"0ee5f02bda204df8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-prism-orchid","name":"Celestial Prism-Orchid","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cosmic","refractive","audio-reactive","raymarching","fractal","iridescent","atmospheric"],"description":"An infinite expanse of refractive crystalline petals with Cauchy edge dispersion, micro-venation bioluminescent nutrient flow, starlight corona diffraction starbursts, and pollinator spring dynamics.","hash":"c6be4d3e482ac13a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-quantum-glass-dragonfly","name":"Celestial Quantum-Glass Dragonfly","category":"generative","tags":["dragonfly","quantum","fractal","audio-reactive","raymarching","crystalline","iridescent"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional biomechanical dragonfly forged from quantum glass with Cauchy thin-film wing iridescence, starlight caustic core emission, acoustic wing-tip vortex trails, and spring-guided flight dynamics.","hash":"c936589f09b1cd6c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-weave","name":"Celestial Weave","category":"generative","tags":["generative","weave","cosmic","stars","textile","audio-reactive"],"description":"A woven night-sky tapestry of luminous warp and weft threads stitched with star knots.","hash":"f5cce61e3d7a4db4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-celestial-yggdrasil-matrix","name":"Celestial Yggdrasil-Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cosmic","fractal","kifs","plasma"],"description":"An infinitely branching, cosmic tree constructed from intertwining ribbons of stellar plasma and quantum circuitry that pulses with the heartbeat of the universe, fusing organic arboreal forms with intricate cosmic geometry.","hash":"676d791f19532c4b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cellular-automata-tapestry","name":"Cellular Automata Tapestry","category":"generative","tags":["cellular-automata","reaction-diffusion","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Convert the video feed into a living reaction-diffusion tapestry.","hash":"0aeb88c056261614","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chaos-game-ifs","name":"Chaos Game IFS","category":"generative","tags":["generative","ifs","chaos-game","fractal","attractor","audio","music","sdf","raymarch","depth"],"description":"A rotating 2D chaos-game IFS field anchored by a raymarched analytic orbit sculpture built from crystal, torus, and capsule forms. The four saved controls retain iteration, glow, ring, and saturation roles while audio drives the shared motion and material response.","hash":"936df614cf0285c9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-acid-drip","name":"Chromatic Acid Drip","category":"generative","tags"