rped cosmic loom weaving fractal strings of pure light around a central singularity.","hash":"bb0a1c23d50da851","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromatic-zonohedron","name":"Chromatic Zonohedron","category":"generative","tags":["generative","geometry","zonohedron","rhombic","tiling","rainbow","prismatic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A spinning rhombic zonohedron projected into 2D — each facet filled with a unique spectral color and neon edge outlines. Three-axis rhomb tiling creates jewel-like cells that pulse with bass and shimmer with treble. Mouse shifts the focal center.","hash":"5316029544c2fa49","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chromodynamic-plasma-collider","name":"Chromodynamic Plasma-Collider","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","particle","plasma","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A hyper-speed journey down an infinite magnetic containment tunnel where sub-atomic particles collide and shatter into vibrant, audio-reactive showers of exotic matter.","hash":"c561bd7fc7894c86","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chrono-kinetic-fractal-engine","name":"Chrono-Kinetic Fractal Engine","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A highly dynamic, continuously unfolding 4D mechanism where temporal gears and non-euclidean clockwork structures weave together into an infinite, hypnotic mandala of light and motion.","hash":"a1d8575d8406a4f2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chrono-kitsune-prism-weaver","name":"Chrono-Kitsune Prism Weaver","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A living prismatic kitsune spirit weaving through a chrono-void lattice with deep temporal feedback and audio reactivity. Optimized: bounding-sphere early-out, tetrahedral normals, HDR feedback chain, generated depth.","hash":"ac33fe023326e8f6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chrono-mycelial-tapestry","name":"Chrono-Mycelial Tapestry","category":"generative","tags":["generative","organic","mycelium","temporal","procedural","audio","music","reactive","ambient"],"description":"A multi-temporal fungal network where different generations of mycelium coexist in layered time, creating a living, breathing tapestry of organic growth across temporal dimensions.","hash":"ca7a300daf5697ca","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chrono-voronoi-mycelium","name":"Chrono-Voronoi Mycelium","category":"generative","tags":["generative","voronoi","organic","mycelium","temporal","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Multi-temporal Voronoi fungal growth with fast nutrient wavefronts, smoothly advected spores, and bounded luminous history trails. Mouse and clicks seed growth while audio drives layered colony motion.","hash":"f5186cf3413dbd93","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronodynamic-aether-weaver-automata","name":"Chronodynamic Aether-Weaver Automata","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","quantum","bioluminescent","automata","audio-reactive"],"description":"","hash":"b556bb8577d59169","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronomorphic-glass-tesseract","name":"Chronomorphic Glass Tesseract","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","glass","tesseract","iridescent","refraction"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional glass structure that continuously folds through time and space, refracting shifting iridescent cosmic energies. Features chronomorphic spatial distortion and raymarched chromatic dispersion.","hash":"42383d5a64e4f92f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-biomechanical-void-leviathan","name":"Chronos Biomechanical Void-Leviathan","category":"generative","tags":["leviathan","biomechanical","void","quantum","audio-reactive","temporal","volumetric"],"description":"A colossal, ancient biomechanical leviathan forged from shifting quantum-obsidian and echoing temporal-glass, swimming gracefully through a violently fractured space-time nebula while continuously shedding liquid auroral starlight.","hash":"42c44526df6353ba","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-crystal-labyrinth","name":"Chronos Crystal Labyrinth","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","tesseract","fractal","refraction","raymarching","time-distortion"],"description":"A mind-bending journey through an infinite, self-folding tesseract of crystalline structures where time distortion ripples visualize as chromatic refraction patterns. This shader creates a sensation of navigating a multidimensional clockwork maze built of light, bridging organic growth algorithms with rigid geometric p","hash":"4ef5ced0eddba037","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-labyrinth","name":"Chronos Labyrinth","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","geometry","escher","maze","impossible","abstract","infinite","generative","procedural","audio","music","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"An Escher-esque maze whose cells now shift several times a second, with masonry coursing carved into every wall and chronal iridescence staining the stone. Temporal rifts fire at a treble-driven rate and glow through a psychedelic spectrum, leaving decaying echoes. The spring-smoothed cursor orbits the labyrinth, holdi","hash":"04fb03a055c8867c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-chronos-monolith-resonator","name":"Chronos Monolith Resonator","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","quantum","mechanical","raymarching","KIFS","dark-matter","temporal"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, endlessly shifting obelisk of quantum dark-matter suspended in a cosmic void, projecting glowing ribbons of temporal energy that ripple and distort in sync with unseen gravitational waves.","hash":"df731b69a9287442","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-conway-game-of-life","name":"Conway Game of Life","category":"generative","tags":["conway","game-of-life","cellular-automata","neon","emergence","generative","gliders","spaceships"],"description":"Conway's Game of Life cellular automaton rendered with glowing neon cell states on a coarse grid. Rules morph between Classic, Day & Night, and HighLife over time. Bass triggers random cell births, mouse draws live cells, and depth controls grid density. Features temporal persistence for death fade trails and chromatic","hash":"fa0ac39ee34018f7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-coral-reef-colony","name":"Coral Reef Colony","category":"generative","tags":["coral","organic","generative","audio-reactive","mouse-interactive","underwater","bioluminescence","DLA","caustics","HDR"],"description":"Upgraded coral reef with space colonization branching, DLA patterns, fBm polyp detail, bioluminescent fluorescent proteins, subsurface scattering, caustic light, HDR bloom, and ACES tone mapping. Bass drives nutrient availability, mids steer current, treble triggers spawning. Mouse attracts growth; depth filters water ","hash":"235822f4ee5440c9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-clockwork-dyson-sphere","name":"Cosmic-Clockwork Dyson-Sphere","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","cosmic","fractal","audio-reactive","volumetric","kifs","domain-warping","voronoi","beer-lambert","fresnel"],"description":"A hyper-intricate colossal megastructure of interlocking golden gears, glowing plasma conduits, and rhythmic mechanical fractal shifts enclosing a blinding quantum singularity. Upgraded with enhanced KIFS SDFs, domain-warped FBM, Worley/Voronoi noise, Beer-Lambert volumetric extinction, Fresnel-Schlick metallic reflect","hash":"a2d8319eb6bad92b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-slime-mold","name":"Cosmic Slime Mold","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","slime-mold","organic","growth","veins","dendritic"],"description":"Simulation of slime mold growth with vivid psychedelic coloring. Branching veins of bright neon spread across the screen in organic dendritic patterns. Colors shift from deep purple to hot pink to electric cyan. Mouse feeds the slime causing rapid growth pulses.","hash":"5812220743541389","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-velvet-hypnosis","name":"Cosmic Velvet Hypnosis","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","hypnosis","spiral","velvet","cosmic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired velvet spiral well with soft chromatic arms, counter-spirals, and moving moire. Drags torque persistent trails and clicks send luminous hypnosis halos outward.","hash":"edd46d9b978228dd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cosmic-web-filament","name":"Cosmic Web Filament","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cosmic","voronoi","filament","organic","dark-matter","web","gravity","procedural","audio","music","reactive","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","audio-reactive","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"Large-scale cosmic structure evolving at speed — Zel'dovich streaming, Voronoi filaments and Apollonian voids, with caustic striation running along each strand. Stellar populations are graded through a psychedelic spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor opens a void well that drags the web toward it, holding collapses str","hash":"b851a72585517359","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cryogenic-frost-plasma-matrix","name":"Cryogenic Frost-Plasma Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","ice","plasma","fractal","raymarching","audio-reactive"],"description":"An infinitely shattering and reforming matrix of absolute-zero hyper-fractals that bleed iridescent thermal plasma when fractured by heavy bass frequencies.","hash":"e46e564f4c83fef1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystal-caverns","name":"Crystal Caverns","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","cave","3d","raymarching","fantasy","glowing","stalactites","procedural","generative","alpha-transmission","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Infinite procedural cave system with glowing crystals featuring physical light transmission. Crystals have IOR-based Fresnel reflection and variable purity affecting their glow transparency.","hash":"f465d0638d0a930b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-crystal-lattice-growth","name":"Crystal Lattice Growth","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","fractal","dendri