-organic-liquid-neon-pulsar","name":"Cyber-Organic Liquid-Neon Pulsar","category":"generative","tags":["neon","pulsar","magnetic-field","astrophysics","raymarched","abstract"],"description":"A biomechanical, pulsating celestial core composed of hyper-viscous liquid-neon and crystalline techno-organic fibers. Enriched with Crab Pulsar 30.2 Hz strobe and 10^8 Tesla magnetic field topology.","hash":"7368acd11b9a60ff","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cyber-terminal","name":"Procedural Cyber Terminal (ASCII)","category":"generative","tags":["ascii","terminal","retro","procedural","decoder","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Transforms the input video feed or image into a high-tech, procedural ASCII terminal display using Signed Distance Functions (SDFs).","hash":"91c3dfc6977b880f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-aether-moth-chrysalis","name":"Cybernetic Aether-Moth Chrysalis","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cybernetic","fractal","bioluminescence","plasma","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate cyber-organic cocoon pulses with bioluminescent plasma trails and crystalline micro-circuitry, breathing and evolving over time.","hash":"342f29e8719a9f7d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-crystalline-neuro-lattice","name":"Cybernetic Crystalline Neuro-Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["cybernetic","crystal","neural","lattice","organic","neon"],"description":"A hyper-structured, ever-evolving neural lattice that crystallizes data streams into neon-infused geometries, blending organic synaptic growth with cybernetic precision.","hash":"2e762d050ba33cb1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-ferro-coral","name":"Cybernetic Ferro-Coral","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","ferrofluid","coral","magnetic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A biomechanical reef of magnetic, liquid-metal coral that dynamically shapes itself in response to acoustic vibrations, revealing a glowing quantum-plasma core beneath a dark metallic exterior. Upgraded (Batch 36): domain-warped FBM branching spikes, ridged micro-creases, Gray-Scott Turing banding carved into the shell","hash":"ecaf83ba1494a185","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-liquid-chrome-engine","name":"Cybernetic Liquid-Chrome Engine","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","liquid-metal","audio-reactive","raymarching","fractal"],"description":"A liquid-chrome engine racing on a wrapped conveyor camera, with audio-driven piston surges, spectral reflection streaks, mouse orbit, and bounded metallic smears.","hash":"ac573c158d4744a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-mycelium-neural-web","name":"Cybernetic-Mycelium Neural-Web","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","mechanical","audio-reactive","fractal","fast-motion","psychedelic","mouse-reactive","click-ripples","aces-tone-map","semantic-alpha"],"description":"A bio-mechanical mycelial net streaming and firing fast. Hyphal filigree carves branching detail over the trails, data pulses race at a treble-driven rate, and the whole net is graded through a psychedelic neon spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor is an attractor whose whip speed mutates the growth, holding blooms the ","hash":"45f8c7a9015005ab","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cybernetic-plasma-orchid-nexus","name":"Cybernetic Plasma-Orchid Nexus","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cybernetic","floral","plasma","glow"],"description":"A hyper-stylized digital flora ecosystem where crystalline petals of plasma bloom from a glowing cybernetic core, pulsating with neon chromatic aberration.","hash":"8b192189181177e5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cycloid-bloom","name":"Cycloid Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","colorful","spirograph","cycloid","mandala","floral","generative","abstract","prismatic"],"description":"Five nested hypotrochoid curves form a blooming floral mandala. A coarse-plus-refined curve search keeps the petals efficient, the mouse pulls the bloom without an audio gate, clicks send petal waves, and each layer shimmers from its own FFT voice while color feedback burns bright arcs.","hash":"b2b7567466f90211","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cymatic-plasma-mandalas","name":"Cymatic Plasma-Mandalas","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mandala","cymatics","plasma","kaleidoscope","audio-reactive","liquid","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate, unfolding kaleidoscope of glowing liquid geometry that dances and weaves complex, sacred-geometry-inspired mandalas in direct response to audio frequencies.","hash":"3c7ecd4ec0685702","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cymatic-quantum-silk-loom","name":"Cymatic Quantum-Silk Loom","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","abstract","flowing","cymatic","audio-reactive","raymarched","iridescent","silk"],"description":"A majestic hyper-dimensional loom weaving luminescent quantum silk into cymatic mandalas driven by cosmic audio frequencies, with iridescent neon color shifting.","hash":"b6e2defd6ecb4c44","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-de-jong-attractor","name":"Peter de Jong Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["chaos","strange-attractor","de-jong","temporal","fractal","audio-reactive","raymarch","sdf-tube","depth"],"description":"Temporal density accumulation for the 2D Peter de Jong map, paired with a budgeted raymarched tube that lifts a sampled orbit into 3D. Morph controls drive the map, glow controls the density and tube radius, trail decay preserves feedback, and audio and mouse input animate the view.","hash":"fb0f2ec332dee121","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-depth-refracted-liquid-stained-glass","name":"Depth-Refracted Liquid Stained Glass","category":"generative","tags":["kaleidoscope","refraction","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","chromatic","temporal","depth-aware","caustic","heightfield","fresnel","material-lighting"],"description":"Depth-derived heightfield normals drive a polar stained-glass refraction with three-point lighting, Fresnel highlights, tessellated material colors, temporal feedback, and audio-reactive chromatic dispersion. Facet count now maps across 3 to 16 segments.","hash":"098c43c56f447491","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-dla-copper-deposition","name":"DLA Copper Deposition","category":"generative","tags":["copper","metallic","dendrite","DLA","fractal","organic","generative","abstract","oxidation","patina"],"description":"Persistent diffusion-limited copper growth with exact eight-neighbor aggregation, electrolyte depletion, stored oxidation age, and conductive tip activity. Bass thickens deposition, mids tune attachment, treble drives sparks, held mouse acts as an electrode, and timestamp-bounded clicks nucleate new dendrites.","hash":"36cbfe962865b961","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-dmt-fractal-zoom","name":"DMT Fractal Zoom","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","fractal","mandelbrot","julia","zoom","dmt","rainbow","neon","wolfram"],"description":"An infinite zoom through a fractal landscape with DMT-vision-like visual complexity enriched by Wolfram Alpha Mandelbrot data. Each zoom level reveals new fractal details. Escape radius |z|>2 guarantees divergence. Smooth coloring uses log(log|z|)/log(2). Colors are extremely saturated rainbow gradients that shift as y","hash":"0f087cbdc76eb174","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-dragon-curve","name":"Dragon Curve","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","neon","curve","geometric","mathematical","line-art","abstract","colorful"],"description":"Heighway dragon curve — a space-filling fractal created by repeatedly folding a strip of paper in half. Rendered as a glowing neon filament with iteration-depth coloring from red to violet, upgraded with thin-film iridescence, a warm-key / cool-fill two-temperature glow rig, split-tone grading, atmospheric depth haze, ","hash":"fc047a771b3f2f8a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-dynamic-tessellation-ornate-fractal-tiles","name":"Dynamic Tessellation (Ornate Fractal Tiles)","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"Compute a screen-space tile grid and replace each tile with a tiny procedurally rendered fractal. The result is a morphing lattice of fractal mini-universes. Now audio-reactive to bass frequencies with meaningful alpha compositing.","hash":"a545223e31c99b5b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-echo-dunes","name":"Echo Dunes","category":"generative","tags":["generative","desert","dunes","mirage","echo","audio-reactive"],"description":"Wind-carved sand ridges with heat mirage distortions and cursor-centered acoustic echo rings.","hash":"b15aa573e3aeb33e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-eldritch-quantum-fractal-eye","name":"Eldritch-Quantum Fractal-Eye","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","eldritch","quantum","eye","audio-reactive","neon"],"description":"A colossal, hyper-dimensional eye constructed from infinitely folding quantum fractals and liquid plasma.","hash":"9248daf6bfe8e0fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-eldritch-tesseract-hive-mind","name":"Eldritch Tesseract-Hive Mind","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"An impossible, non-Euclidean hypercube hive populated by swarms of luminescent algorithmic sentinels, constantly unfolding and fracturing into new geometric dimensions driven by quantum noise and acoustic energy. Upgraded for fast motion: dual-plane 4D tumble, velocity-stretched sentinel speed-streaks, clamped HDR feed","hash":"0ded622d35bd50b1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-electric-kaleidoscope-storm","name":"Electric Kaleidoscope Storm","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","lightning","kaleidoscope","electric","storm","generative"],"description":"Electric lightning bolts radiating from the center in a kaleidoscope symmetry pattern with 6, 8, or 12-fold symmetry. Neon cyan, magenta, and yellow bolts crack and flicker on a deep dark background. Bolts rebranch and reseed each frame for constant motion. Sparks fly randomly. Mouse rotates the kaleidoscope and change","hash":"ceb85b3fccfdb1fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-calligraphic-ecosystems","name":"Emergent Calligraphic Ecosystems","category":"generative","tags":["generative","calligraphy","emergent","flow-field","organic","audio-reactive","procedural","music","ecosystem","predator-prey"],"description":"A system of interacting calligraphic strokes following local orientation rules that spontaneously form complex alien writing systems. Mouse plants seeds or disturbs regions. Audio influences stroke behavior and interaction rules. Enriched with Wolfram Alpha Lotka-Volterra predator-prey dynamics: cyclic population oscil","hash":"d9c2987449c35918","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-calligraphic-weave","name":"Emergent Calligraphic Weave","category":"generative","tags":["calligraphy","ink","weave","flow-field","audio-reactive"],"description":"An emergent weave of pressure-shaped calligraphic filaments, chromatic hairlines, and timestamped ink fronts that bend beneath a held pointer.","hash":"a8f30b7b76a0e40d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-emergent-script-gardens","name":"Emergent Script Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["generative","calligraphy","emergent","script","glyphs","strokes","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","procedural","golden-ratio","phyllotaxis","biological"],"description":"Interacting ink-like and neon strokes follow golden-ratio phyllotaxis (137.5°) to self-organize into alien symbolic gardens. Bass drives growth iteration count. Mouse interaction plants dense stroke seeds with φ-boosted intensity. Temporal feedback creates organic overgrowth trails. ACES tonemapped with chromatic aberr","hash":"6630b45f26d86e88","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-erosion-strata","name":"Erosion Strata","category":"generative","tags":["generative","procedural","erosion","sedimentary","strata","canyon","earth-tones","fbm","voronoi","domain-warping","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Procedural sedimentary rock layers carved by domain-warped erosion channels, revealing mineral veins, fossil imprints, and weathered edges. Features atmospheric haze, subsurface scattering, and geological era palette cycling.","hash":"aeebaca750908600","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-anemone-bloom","name":"Ethereal Anemone Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["organic","bioluminescent","underwater","fluid","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A pulsating underwater expanse of translucent anemones that feed on audio, brighten under pointer drags, and answer clicks with traveling bioluminescent fronts and bounded display history.","hash":"9e74c63cc0496448","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-aurora-ghost-orchid","name":"Ethereal-Aurora Ghost-Orchid","category":"generative","tags":["generative","aurora","orchid","raymarched","volumetric","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","organic","neon"],"description":"A phantom-like, hyper-dimensional orchid whose transparent, glowing petals are formed entirely from captured aurora borealis, blooming and disintegrating infinitely in a volumetric dark-matter void, driven by acoustic resonance. Enriched with Wolfram Alpha aurora physics: oxygen green (557.7 nm) at lower altitude, red ","hash":"9b3d43a113ab0f97","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-bismuth-resonance-void-owl","name":"Ethereal Bismuth-Resonance Void-Owl","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","bismuth","avian","iridescent","void","quantum","sdf","raymarched","thin-film","tessellation","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional avian entity forged from iridescent bismuth lattices, suspended in a zero-gravity quantum field. Upgraded with thin-film interference on the stepped bismuth shell, per-facet crystal color variation, 3-point lighting with soft shadows and AO, horn-like stepped ear tufts, a tessellated hopper-crystal ","hash":"e19c9d8f1d7bf3f7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-chrono-plasma-void-manta","name":"Ethereal Chrono-Plasma Void-Manta","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic cybernetic space-manta ray gliding through a dark-matter ocean, its translucent biomimetic wings rippling with shifting auroral temporal energy as it consumes deep acoustic bass frequencies.","hash":"bef933a05613fbb5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-aurora-hummingbird-core","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Aurora Hummingbird-Core","category":"generative","tags":["organic","biomechanical","aurora","plasma","quantum"],"description":"A hyper-fast, biomechanical hummingbird woven from liquid auroral plasma and shattered quantum glass, hovering within a massive chrono-distortion flower.","hash":"89570a917ba3a269","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-chrono-nebula-phoenix","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Chrono Nebula-Phoenix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","biomechanical","phoenix","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic cybernetic phoenix rising from a deep-space nebula, its wings woven from liquid auroral plasma and shattered quantum glass that burst into geometric temporal fractals upon acoustic climax.","hash":"2304bbdf736a5186","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-chrono-void-whale","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Chrono Void-Whale","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cosmic","mechanical","void","volumetric"],"description":"A colossal, slow-moving biomechanical space leviathan swimming gracefully through a dense volumetric plasma-ocean, whose transparent cyber-skeletal ribs refract and ripple with shifting temporal energy streams.","hash":"48e9f27f42ddc6fe","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-cyber-plasma-void-dragon","name":"Ethereal Cyber-Plasma Void-Dragon","category":"generative","tags":["dragon","plasma","organic","quantum","audio-reactive","cybernetic","void","sdf","raymarched","voronoi","kaleidoscopic","geometry"],"description":"A majestic hyper-dimensional cyber-dragon of flowing quantum plasma with octahedral crystal scale-shards, box-ribbed spine segments and a bass-pulsed torus halo engraved with rotating star sigils, soaring through a kaleidoscopically folded dark-matter nebula veined with Voronoi energy circuits.","hash":"7f0aeb01c8038822","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-glass-flora-terrarium","name":"Ethereal Glass-Flora Terrarium","category":"generative","tags":["organic","glass","bioluminescent","audio-reactive","raymarched","botanical","refraction","terrarium"],"description":"A translucent macroscopic greenhouse where impossible glass botanicals bloom with neon nectar flowing through crystalline stems, surrounded by gravity-defying pollen particles.","hash":"9981ac739ec84f43","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-quantum-glass-nautilus","name":"Ethereal Quantum-Glass Nautilus","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"76ae606209d9d6e7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-quantum-hologram-bonsai","name":"Ethereal Quantum-Hologram Bonsai","category":"generative","tags":["bonsai","hologram","quantum","l-system","audio-reactive","interactive"],"description":"A serene, hyper-dimensional bonsai tree woven entirely from shimmering quantum hard-light, its branches continuously fracturing and self-assembling in probabilistic super-position.","hash":"46c48329e3525d25","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-quantum-holographic-fractal-coral","name":"Ethereal Quantum-Holographic Fractal-Coral","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","holographic","fractal","coral","oceanic","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, deep-void cybernetic coral reef that self-assembles through quantum superposition, weaving holographic bio-luminescence with hyper-geometric fractal branches. The coral branches pulsate with liquid neon energy driven by audio frequencies, expanding the fractal recursion depth on bass hits.","hash":"ee561b90c5b11e43","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-quantum-medusa","name":"Ethereal Quantum Medusa","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"A raymarched quantum medusa with chromatic tentacles, held-mouse gravity, finite click waves, temporal bioluminescence, and three-band plasma response.","hash":"72c86324c852d9cc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ethereal-silk-veil","name":"Ethereal Silk Veil","category":"generative","tags":["silk","fabric","veil","organic","gold","cream","elegant","showcase","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Multi-layered translucent silk ribbons flowing in an ethereal wind. Audio drives undulation amplitude; mouse gathers and disturbs the fabric like a hand through cloth. Gold-cream palette with depth-layered parallax and fabric sheen.","hash":"3f7a555d924bbac5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-evolutionary-cellular-gardens","name":"Evolutionary Cellular Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cellular-automata","evolutionary","organic","coral","audio-reactive","procedural","music"],"description":"Multi-state cellular automata where the rules themselves slowly evolve based on local conditions and global audio input. Audio drives genetic pressure on the automata. Mouse introduces invasive species or protected zones. Organic coral-like emergent structures that change fundamental behavior over time. Upgraded with a","hash":"c815a477058c727c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-feedback-echo-chamber","name":"Feedback Echo Chamber","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","echo","feedback","multi-layer","ghosting","audio","music","reactive","alpha","accumulative","mouse-reactive","shockwave"],"description":"Temporal feedback echo chamber with mouse gravity wells, click shockwaves, fBM domain warp, depth-aware compositing, and psychedelic palette blending","hash":"f96f5904bd2c9b50","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ferrofluid-monolith","name":"Ferrofluid Monolith","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","monolith","magnetic","raymarched","liquid-metal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A raymarched liquid-metal obelisk grows magnetic radial spikes around an emissive core, with pointer orbit and click-driven field rings.","hash":"ecbccd6e6fe706c6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fibonacci-spiral-garden","name":"Fibonacci Spiral Garden","category":"generative","tags":["fibonacci","phyllotaxis","spiral","garden","bloom","audio-reactive"],"description":"Ninety-six golden-angle blossoms unfurl as an interactive phyllotaxis garden with spectral petals and click-seeded growth fronts.","hash":"fcd427265b98e005","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-audio-symphony","name":"4th of July — Audio Symphony","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","audio-reactive","music-sync","spectrum","pyrotechnics","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"A fireworks display conducted by the music. A smoothed bass envelope triggers bigger, faster launches on transients; mids layer in secondary shells; treble crackles a cloud of micro-sparks. Mouse click or hold launches a personal synced shell at the cursor.","hash":"dbb35359962d20b3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-chrysanthemum","name":"4th of July — Chrysanthemum Burst","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","chrysanthemum","peony","pyrotechnics","spherical","dense","rings","audio-reactive","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Dense spherical chrysanthemum and peony shells with hundreds of sparks arranged in concentric rings. Fast ballistic petals, radial speed-line streaks, and advected HDR trails. Bass expands burst radius, mids add secondary ring shells, treble crackles the outer petals. Mouse detonates a massive peony at the cursor.","hash":"82d5929b4f2318de","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-comet-trail","name":"4th of July — Comet Trail","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","comet","trail","streak","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Blazing comet shells with brilliant heads and long luminous tails that streak across the night sky. Each shell launches upward then leaves a glowing path as sparks peel off the main trajectory. Bass makes bigger comet heads, treble adds sparkle along the trail. Mouse fires a comet from the cursor.","hash":"f6d2677a27678e3c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-crackle-palm","name":"4th of July — Crackle Palm","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","crackle","palm","multi-stage","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Multi-stage pyrotechnic shells that bloom in two acts. A primary burst erupts first, then delayed secondary crackle and palm fronds spawn from sub-points along the fading sparks. Treble drives thousands of micro-crackle pops; mids trigger the second-stage palm arms. Bass deepens the initial detonation. Mouse launches a","hash":"03b0c1031817b263","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-crossette","name":"4th of July — Crossette Split","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","crossette","split","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Crossette shells that split into four brilliant sub-bursts at the cardinal points. A primary flash blooms, then each arm detonates into its own mini-chrysanthemum. The iconic four-petal pattern creates geometric symmetry in the sky. Mids trigger the split timing, treble crackles each arm. Mouse fires a crossette at the","hash":"d77200842d23beb5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-dahlia-burst","name":"4th of July — Dahlia Burst","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","dahlia","petals","disk","flat-burst","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Flat dahlia-disk shells that bloom into layered rows of radial petals — warm coral cores fading to gold tips across concentric petal rings. Unlike spherical chrysanthemums, dahlia bursts spread in a wide flat disk before petals curl and fall. Bass expands disk radius, mids stagger petal-row timing, treble adds micro-pe","hash":"1e4ba0dca5e67428","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-fan-shell","name":"4th of July — Fan Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","fan","spread","hemisphere","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Wide fan shells that burst into a sweeping hemisphere of colored sparks, like a peacock tail opening in the sky. Sparks spread in a broad arc with strong horizontal bias before falling. Mids widen the fan angle, bass deepens the colors. Mouse opens a personal fan at the cursor.","hash":"ce786e8ba468f86f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-horse-tail","name":"4th of July — Horse Tail Brocade","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","horse-tail","brocade","streamers","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Classic horse tail and brocade shells rain long, straight golden streamers from a single burst point. Each spark traces a tight gravity arc with minimal spread, creating luminous waterfalls of light. Bass lengthens the tails, treble adds silver micro-dust along the streams. Mouse launches a personal brocade cascade.","hash":"2dbfcd986eaf6619","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-kamuro-gold","name":"4th of July — Kamuro Gold","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","kamuro","gold","glitter","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Dense kamuro shells rain slow-falling gold and silver glitter like a luminous snowstorm. Thousands of tiny sparks hang in the air before drifting down, creating thick clouds of metallic shimmer. Perfect July 4th brocade feel. Bass thickens the cloud, treble adds micro-sparkle. Mouse releases a golden kamuro shower at t","hash":"1b37185cc6742e6b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-nocturne","name":"4th of July — Fireworks Nocturne","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","pyrotechnics","celebration","sparks","gravity","particles","night-sky","audio-reactive","generative","explosive","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"A living fireworks display over a dark velvet night. Multiple mortar shells launch, burst in jewel and gold colors with realistic gravity arcs and lingering ember trails. Bass detonates bigger shells and richer bursts, treble crackles extra sparks. Mouse click or hold launches a personal command shell at the cursor. Te","hash":"aaabb57606df8191","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-ring-shell","name":"4th of July — Ring Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","ring","halo","donut","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Perfect ring and halo shells that bloom as luminous donuts in the night sky. Sparks launch outward along a crisp circular front then cascade downward with gravity. Classic Saturn-ring pyrotechnics with jewel-tone cycling. Bass widens the ring, treble adds inner sparkle. Mouse launches a personal halo at the cursor. Upg","hash":"57a6d1fafcddee26","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-roman-candle","name":"4th of July — Roman Candle","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","roman-candle","barrage","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","4th-of-july"],"description":"Classic roman candles firing rapid star bursts from fixed launch tubes along the horizon. Bass enlarges launches, treble adds trail and burst detail, held mouse fire follows the normalized cursor, and each click launches a discrete personal candle. Bright shells produce luminance-derived depth.","hash":"27a04bc510399bed","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-smoke-bloom","name":"4th of July — Smoke Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","smoke","bloom","volumetric","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Soft volumetric smoke gathers around bursts and along falling sparks, while a feedback light bloom adds luminous halos to the brightest areas. Bass swells the smoky glow, mids add secondary burst layers, and treble scatters micro-sparks. Mouse launches a smoky peony at the cursor.","hash":"88fc1778b539652f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-strobe-shell","name":"4th of July — Strobe Shell","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","strobe","blink","flash","pyrotechnics","july-4","audio-reactive","generative","psychedelic","4th-of-july"],"description":"Hypnotic strobe shells that flash multiple times before dissolving into falling sparks. Each burst pulses with rhythmic white-hot flashes synced to the beat, then blooms into color. Treble drives flash rate, bass amplifies each pulse. A psychedelic July 4th finale feel. Mouse triggers a strobe barrage at the cursor.","hash":"45bfc427e9d7b98d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-willow-cascade","name":"4th of July — Willow Cascade","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","willow","pyrotechnics","trails","golden","long-exposure","gravity","audio-reactive","generative","cinematic","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Classic willow-style fireworks with long, drooping golden and silver trails. Velocity-stretched droop streaks, wind-advected embers, and advected HDR trails. Bass deepens the droop, treble adds silver micro-sparkle along the trails. Mouse launches a personal willow shell at the cursor.","hash":"a9e766273b77cc19","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fireworks-wind-ripple","name":"4th of July — Wind & Ripple","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","wind","ripple","pyrotechnics","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","trails","generative","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Sparks drift on a fast time-varying wind while ripple events ignite shock-front barrages. Comet-tail speed lines, wind conveyors, and advected HDR trails. Bass deepens the shells, mids add secondary gusts, treble scatters silver micro-sparkle. Mouse launches a personal wind-swept shell at the cursor.","hash":"5dc5089425d744f8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-flame-fractal-attractor","name":"Flame Fractal Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","attractor","orbit-density","audio-reactive"],"description":"A curling orbit-density attractor folds luminous ember filaments through a bass-driven flame field with interactive vortex wakes.","hash":"3eb3794cf00c5fce","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-flowing-silk-ribbons","name":"Flowing Silk Ribbons","category":"generative","tags":["silk","ribbons","fabric","iridescent","flow","audio-reactive"],"description":"Layered anisotropic silk ribbons flow through an iridescent field, comb beneath a held pointer, and ring with timestamped clicks.","hash":"f3fd38814f15a325","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fourier-epicycles","name":"Fourier Epicycles","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","mathematical-art","epicycles","fourier","harmonics","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Rotating Fourier epicycle wheels tracing harmonic curves with chromatic separation, metallic rim glow, and temporal trajectory trails. Bass drives rotation speed, mouse reshapes coefficients.","hash":"78beab879eb5e38e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-bioluminescence-spore-network","name":"Fractal Bioluminescence Spore-Network","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","organic","bioluminescence","audio-reactive","network","kifs"],"description":"A hyper-organic, slowly expanding fractal network of glowing bioluminescent spores that mathematically bloom and connect via glowing filaments in response to audio frequencies.","hash":"cc5611e4b6cc855b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-chrono-dendrite-forge","name":"Fractal Chrono-Dendrite Forge","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","dendrite","time-manipulation","bismuth","glass","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-intricate procedural branching structure simulating crystalline growth and decay through a spacetime distortion field, rendered with a bismuth-iridescent glass aesthetic. Upgraded with a three-point warm/cool/rim lighting rig, HDR bloom-ready speculars, volumetric near-miss glow, chrono-violet depth fog, ACES t","hash":"d303d2f37607a188","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-clockwork","name":"Fractal Clockwork","category":"generative","tags":["steampunk","mechanical","3d","raymarching","gears","metallic","brass","clockwork","procedural","generative","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Infinite interlocking brass gears rotating in perfect mechanical sync, stepping one tooth per escapement tick around ruby jewel bearings. Steampunk raymarched masterpiece with metallic PBR shading and mouse orbit control.","hash":"56bbc648e4884153","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-ember-lattice","name":"Fractal Ember Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","fractal","ember","fire","shatter","lattice","showcase","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Hexagonal crystal lattice glowing like hot embers. Mouse click shatters the lattice into rigid shards that fly outward; release to watch them drift back and reform over ~1.5s. Audio drives glow pulse, lattice breathing, spark frequency, and ember beads that crawl along the lattice lines; flying shards cool to deep red ","hash":"cd0e88e03d5a0646","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-flame-classic","name":"Classic Fractal Flame","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","ifs","swirl","horseshoe","audio-reactive"],"description":"A classic fractal flame blends swirl, horseshoe, and polar affine variations into warm spectral density traps with temporal embers.","hash":"5c492784ed3e4034","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-neuro-mycelium-lattice","name":"Fractal Neuro-Mycelium Lattice","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-connected, pulsating network of organic filaments that endlessly branches and bridges across void space.","hash":"e5391437c1b695cd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractal-tree-growth","name":"Fractal Tree Growth","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","tree","growth","recursive","botanical","audio-reactive"],"description":"A recursively evaluated distance-field tree unfurls through binary branch paths, luminous leaves, pointer wind, and click-seeded growth fronts.","hash":"d27b1179dde32b8f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fractured-monolith","name":"Fractured Monolith","category":"generative","tags":["monolith","floating","fractured","glowing","ambient","generative","scifi","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A massive, ancient monolith floating above a dark liquid sea, fractured into segmented pieces that pulse with an inner, ethereal light that climbs the seams and spills through the cracks onto the water below.","hash":"15ca53aad6c49d19","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-galactic-aether-crystal-geode-core","name":"Galactic Aether-Crystal Geode-Core","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","geode","cosmic","volumetric","fractal","plasma"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, slowly rotating cosmic geode cracked open to reveal a pulsating, audio-reactive core of liquid aether-plasma and infinitely recursive chrono-crystals.","hash":"63eab935e85aa56e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ghost-flame","name":"Ghost Flame","category":"generative","tags":["flame","fire","ghost","fluid","blackbody","ethereal"],"description":"Fluid advection flame simulation with temperature-based alpha translucency. Hot regions are bright and slightly translucent, cool regions fade to transparent. Simplex noise advection with upward velocity and vorticity confinement creates ethereal ghost-fire, with a wick column, blue ignition chemiluminescence, buoyant ","hash":"33ce5b2168abfa85","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-glacial-aether-quantum-cavern","name":"Glacial-Aether Quantum-Cavern","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","ice","quantum","reactive","volumetric","cavern","raymarch","sdf","fresnel","depth"],"description":"A procedural raymarched ice cavern with analytic normals, three-point lighting, Fresnel highlights, crystalline material facets, temporal feedback, and audio-reactive glow and fracture accents.","hash":"f6eebbc7c0626cf2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-glass-mosaic-liquid-refraction","name":"Glass Mosaic Liquid Refraction","category":"generative","tags":["generative","glass","mosaic","refraction","liquid","caustics","audio-reactive","temporal","domain-warping","fbm","curl-noise","fresnel"],"description":"Stained-glass polygon mosaic with FBM domain-warped Voronoi cells, curl-noise liquid flow, physically-based IOR refraction with Fresnel-Schlick reflections, Beer-Lambert caustic attenuation, and chromatic RGB dispersion driven by audio bands. Mouse warps the mosaic grid.","hash":"6c014440b70c1b69","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravitational-ferrofluid-singularity-engine","name":"Gravitational Ferrofluid Singularity-Engine","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","singularity","raymarching","interactive","metallic","iridescent"],"description":"A stylized ferrofluid singularity with rotating magnetic domains, orbiting spike fronts, accelerating droplets, click shocks, and bounded horizon-aligned light trails driven by live audio.","hash":"7a056d49a363ae72","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravitational-strain","name":"Gravitational Strain Field","category":"generative","tags":["gravity","lensing","space","physics","stars","dark-matter","generative","simulation","audio","music","domain-warping","voronoi","beer-lambert","fresnel"],"description":"Orbiting gravity wells warp a procedural star field through bounded RK4 geodesic integration. Tidal emission, accretion disks, click fronts, and held-pointer strain runners illuminate the generated potential field.","hash":"2debf4e3ca20153c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-gravito-phononic-accretion","name":"Gravito-Phononic Accretion","category":"generative","tags":["generative","gravity","lensing","cosmic","accretion","audio-reactive","procedural","music","blackbody","physics"],"description":"Multiple audio-driven gravitational centers that accrete and sculpt procedural density fields with gravitational lensing distortion. Different audio bands control different gravitational bodies. Mouse can add temporary mass concentration. Dark cores with swirling filamentary gas. Blackbody temperature colors for accret","hash":"dcb48ba9c3f9c23b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-graviton-plasma-lotus","name":"Graviton Plasma Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["generative","lotus","raymarching","kifs","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A raymarched KIFS plasma lotus with sprung gravitational lensing, bounded click pulses, multi-band iridescent lighting, temporal petal echoes, and real hit depth.","hash":"1f3242793386837e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-bismuth-core-reactor","name":"Holographic Bismuth-Core Reactor","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","mechanical","kifs","raymarching","holographic"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, endlessly unfolding bismuth core reactor, merging metallic stepped-fractals with liquid-holographic interference patterns.","hash":"78cf4b554e65b409","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-data-core","name":"Holographic Data Core","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","cyberpunk","hologram","data","neon","procedural","infinite","audio","music"],"description":"An infinite journey through a quantum lattice of glowing data nodes, smooth scan packets, pointer beams, and click-launched data rings with bounded display history.","hash":"dce8a9e35018c867","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-fracture","name":"Holographic Fracture","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fracture","cracks","holographic","iridescent","crystal","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Iridescent cracked planes with SDF fracture lines and thin-film holographic shards. Audio drives crack glow, and mouse interaction spawns new radial cracks.","hash":"53a694ff48ced462","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-lens-flare-matrix","name":"Holographic Lens-Flare Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["generative","holographic","matrix"],"description":"Generate a matrix of holographic lens flares that follow motion in the video or a synthetic flow field.","hash":"91383cc2b6c59172","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-membrane","name":"Holographic Membrane","category":"generative","tags":["holographic","membrane","iridescence","thin-film","translucent","interference"],"description":"Thin-film interference membrane that undulates with depth-based alpha translucency. Audio drives vibration and iridescence; mouse controls viewing angle for rainbow interference patterns.","hash":"f70fdbc3e4813435","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-plasma-geode","name":"Holographic Plasma-Geode","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","plasma","audio-reactive","holographic","raymarching"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional geode cracked open to reveal a swirling, audio-reactive core of liquid plasma and holographic fractal crystals.","hash":"80a822fbd91e03a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-holographic-rainbow-surface","name":"Holographic Rainbow Surface","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","holographic","iridescent","prismatic","liquid","rainbow","thin-film","interference"],"description":"A liquid holographic surface with iridescent rainbow colors driven by thin-film interference physics. Prismatic diffraction highlights, spectral color separation based on surface normals, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and audio-reactive film thickness modulation create a scientifically-grounded chroma","hash":"8be52036c790da9a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hopf-fibration-fiber-bundle","name":"Hopf Fibration Fiber Bundle","category":"generative","tags":["hopf","fibration","topology","4d","fiber-bundle","mathematical","generative","abstract","geometric","chromatic"],"description":"Hopf fibration visualization from S³ to S². Each screen pixel maps to a point on S² whose fiber is a circle in S³, projected via stereographic projection to 2D. Linked circles colored by base-space coordinate with HDR bloom at crossings. Knot-diagram over/under gaps make the linking readable, bass-pumped beads ride eac","hash":"593458ac7bff7c6d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-bismuth-clockwork","name":"Hyper-Bismuth Clockwork","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","crystal","iridescent","audio-reactive","raymarching","SDF","KIFS","bismuth"],"description":"A relentlessly grinding, infinite geometric mechanism built entirely of iridescent, square-stepped bismuth crystals that unfold and interlock like a cosmic clockwork engine.","hash":"539f299eba51f003","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-dimensional-bismuth-matrix","name":"Hyper-Dimensional Bismuth-Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["bismuth","crystal","iridescent","fractal","audio-reactive","raymarched","KIFS","mouse-driven"],"description":"An infinite, procedurally growing expanse of hyper-dimensional bismuth crystals forming intricate stair-stepped geometric fractals that shimmer with iridescent interference patterns and warp dynamically to audio frequencies.","hash":"597425b1e83271d5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-dimensional-tesseract-labyrinth","name":"Hyper-Dimensional Tesseract-Labyrinth","category":"generative","tags":["geometric","4d","optical-illusion","audio-reactive","raymarching"],"description":"A dizzying, gravity-defying maze of glowing hyper-cubes that unfold and rotate through 4D space, creating impossible, Escher-like geometries driven by sound.","hash":"fd619d87eed2c4ae","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-labyrinth","name":"Hyper Labyrinth","category":"generative","tags":["neon","cyber","maze","4d","generative","abstract","geometric","procedural","audio","music"],"description":"A 4D maze visualization with neon aesthetics and evolving geometry. Use mouse to orbit the hyper-structure.","hash":"0c1728dec08fa3ef","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-rainbow-vortex","name":"Hyper Rainbow Vortex","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","vortex","rainbow","spiral","chromatic","fluid-dynamics","rankine"],"description":"A multi-layered chromatic vortex enriched with Wolfram Rankine fluid dynamics: solid-body rotation inside a bass-reactive core and irrotational flow outside. Angular velocity modulated by mids. Feedback history is advected by the Rankine differential rotation, and the cyclostrophic pressure well condenses a striated fu","hash":"eaf5f1f483651f41","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-refractive-rain-matrix","name":"Hyper-Refractive Rain-Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["generative","rain","refraction","caustics","raymarch","audio-reactive"],"description":"A raymarched refractive rain matrix with viscous drop merging, pointer repulsion, audio-driven caustics, bass-triggered lightning strobes, prismatic RGB dispersion on drop rims, and fall-aligned HDR rain streaks.","hash":"458f2017489b2bdf","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-crystal-symbiosis","name":"Hyperbolic Crystal Symbiosis","category":"generative","tags":["generative","hyperbolic","geometry","crystal","non-euclidean","iridescent","audio-reactive","mathematical"],"description":"Competing crystal growth in hyperbolic (Poincaré disk) geometry. Racing growth-front runners, tile pulse waves, and advected HDR trails. Local curvature influenced by audio and mouse. Iridescent jewel coloring with symmetry-breaking facet borders, hyperbolic growth zoning, symbiotic twin lamellae where rival crystals m","hash":"0ffb2cedef8c68b9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-tessellation","name":"Hyperbolic Tessellation Engine","category":"generative","tags":["hyperbolic","tessellation","fractal","non-euclidean","escher","geometric","generative","audio","music"],"description":"Non-Euclidean Poincaré-disk tessellation in real-time. Hyperbolic tiles subdivide infinitely toward the boundary disk, colored by recursive depth — M.C. Escher meets fractals.","hash":"d37513684f8c62ae","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperbolic-tree","name":"Hyperbolic Tree Fractal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","hyperbolic","tree","fractal","poincare","nature","audio","music"],"description":"Recursive tree fractal rendered in hyperbolic Poincare disk. Branches sway with audio, leaves glow with treble. Möbius-transformed space.","hash":"db1e030c6d191be5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperdimensional-bismuth-lattice","name":"Hyperdimensional Bismuth Lattice","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"16940da59a3f043d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyperdimensional-plasma-loom","name":"Hyperdimensional Plasma Loom","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","quantum","abstract","geometric","strands","raymarching"],"description":"A mesmerizing tangle of iridescent energy threads weaving themselves into complex, higher-dimensional geometric topologies, creating the illusion of cosmic fabric being spun in real-time.","hash":"ed9e3aff2bad6bfb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hypnotic-vortex-tunnel","name":"Hypnotic Vortex Tunnel","category":"generative","tags":["tunnel","vortex","hypnotic","generative","audio-reactive","psychedelic","abstract","neon"],"description":"An infinite vortex tunnel of nested spinning rings coloured by spectral light. Bass spins the rings faster, treble fires radial arc strobes, mouse shifts the vanishing point.","hash":"c5da2fb9d601128d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ice-crystal-lattice","name":"Ice Crystal Lattice","category":"generative","tags":["ice","crystal","hexagonal","frost","branching","audio-reactive"],"description":"Hexagonal ice branches advance through luminous frost fronts, pointer-seeded nucleation, Fresnel-like rims, and click-launched fracture waves.","hash":"d48afb0647921aa9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-ifs-fractal-flame","name":"IFS Fractal Flame","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","flame","ifs","organic","fire","bloom","abstract","translucent","alpha-layered"],"description":"Iterated Function System fractal flame with probabilistic affine transforms, non-linear variations, and flame palette rendering. Features organic fbm drift, temporal accumulation trails, HDR bloom, chromatic aberration, audio-reactive morphing, and advanced alpha compositing via Beer-Lambert transmittance, luminance ke","hash":"446cb2f5096b8a6d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-image-pixel-detonation","name":"4th of July — Pixel Detonation","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","image-reactive","pixel-flight","detonation","pyrotechnics","photo-burst","depth-aware","audio-reactive","celebration","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Your image detonates from within. Bright pixels and edges become launch cores — each spark lifts a fragment of the source photo into gravity arcs, recoloring and fading as it falls. Foreground depth elements launch higher and faster. The picture progressively dissolves into its own celebratory fireworks while revealing","hash":"b75275f5cced6ab2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-image-pyro","name":"4th of July — Image Pyro","category":"generative","tags":["fireworks","image-reactive","pyrotechnics","photo-burst","sparks","gravity","audio-reactive","celebration","color-sampling","4th-of-july","july-4"],"description":"Your photo or video frame becomes the fuel for a fireworks show. Bright regions of the image launch colored mortar shells and sparks that inherit the source hues. Explosions paint over the image with gravity arcs and glowing trails while the original image provides the palette. Bass triggers larger detonations, treble ","hash":"46dd56499c7bfedd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-interference-moire-field","name":"Interference Moire Field","category":"generative","tags":["moire","interference","lines","optical","waves","audio-reactive"],"description":"Crossed analytic line fields form evolving moire beats through phase warping, held-pointer lenses, and click-driven circular interference pulses.","hash":"78dbc82d036308a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-inverse-mandelbrot","name":"Inverse Mandelbrot Realm","category":"generative","tags":["mandelbrot","fractal","color-space","iteration","alien","abstract","generative","complex","audio","music"],"description":"Instead of iterating coordinates, we iterate color-space vectors through the Mandelbrot map. Each pixel's RGB becomes a complex number that orbits and escapes