"id":"gen-kaleidoscopic-synapse-bloom","name":"Kaleidoscopic Synapse Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","kaleidoscope","neural","mandala","chromatic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired neural mandala where traveling axon pulses, counter-rotating dendrites, and bridge sparks bloom around the pointer. Held drags twist persistent synapse trails and clicks launch expanding inoculation rings.","hash":"199b85c63b6c591c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kinetic-neo-brutalist-megastructure","name":"Kinetic Neo-Brutalist Megastructure","category":"generative","tags":["architecture","cyberpunk","mechanical","audio-reactive","raymarching"],"description":"An endlessly shifting, gravity-defying neo-brutalist megastructure of colossal floating concrete blocks that grind and interlock, revealing glowing, audio-reactive server cores hidden within.","hash":"5a8ed148a2199a87","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-klein-bottle-walk","name":"Klein Bottle Walk","category":"generative","tags":["generative","klein-bottle","parametric","3d","surface","audio","music"],"description":"Parametric walk across a Klein bottle surface with FBM texture, diffuse/specular lighting, and audio-reactive color modulation.","hash":"dab76eaab24405fc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-koch-snowflake-storm","name":"Koch Snowflake Storm","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","koch","snowflake","ice","crystalline","audio-reactive","storm"],"description":"Recursive Koch snowflake fractals animated with domain-warped fBm turbulence. Ice crystal aesthetic with subsurface scattering, HDR corner bloom, and chromatic dispersion on refracted edges.","hash":"c6075c921afc9f7a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kryonic-quantum-aether-fractal-core","name":"Kryonic Quantum-Aether Fractal-Core","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","quantum","reactive","raymarching","crystalline"],"description":"A pulsating, zero-gravity containment field where hyper-frozen fractal geometries endlessly unfold and s