tal patterns with phosphorescent afterglow and storm pulses. Branching discharge trees grow from multiple seed points with HDR bloom, halation glow, and electric palette.","hash":"e354c278ddf90640","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-cathedral-dream","name":"Liquid Cathedral Dream","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","cathedral","stained-glass","liquid","chromatic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired cathedral of melting stained-glass arches, rose tracery, and racing floor caustics. Pointer drags refract the persistent structure and clicks unfold rotating rose-window shock fronts.","hash":"762c6c262d554ed4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-crystal-hive-mind","name":"Liquid-Crystal Hive-Mind","category":"generative","tags":["cellular","liquid-crystal","fluid-dynamics","honeycomb","audio-reactive","audio","music","temporal","chromatic","depth-aware","raymarched","showcase"],"description":"A breathing network of hexagonal bio-synthetic cells filled with turbulent liquid crystal. Smoothed audio and pointer drag disrupt the field while clicks inject traveling chemotactic fronts into its preserved hive state.","hash":"e0a9316245ad3d3c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-metal-cymatic-resonator","name":"Liquid-Metal Cymatic Resonator","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-reflective pool of ferromagnetic liquid that dances and crystallizes into complex geometric mandala patterns driven by simulated acoustic resonances.","hash":"1d9b55ebe4322326","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-neon-cyber-metropolis","name":"Liquid-Neon Cyber-Metropolis","category":"generative","tags":["cyberpunk","neon","cityscape","audio-reactive","raymarching","kifs"],"description":"An infinite, gravity-defying cyberpunk cityscape constructed from rivers of hyper-luminescent liquid neon and dark matter concrete, where architectural monoliths dynamically extrude, twist, and warp their geometry to the rhythm of heavy audio frequencies.","hash":"983a919845298524","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-neon-topography","name":"Liquid Neon Topography","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A mesmerizing descent into a hyper-fluid, self-illuminating digital landscape where neon currents carve through shifting, organic terrain.","hash":"d925ef92d8452b85","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-liquid-rainbow-glass","name":"Liquid Rainbow Glass","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","liquid","glass","refraction","chromatic","oil","swirl"],"description":"Simulates looking through liquid rainbow glass - thick translucent layers of flowing color with refraction-like effects. Colors blend and swirl like oil in water but extremely bright and saturated. Chromatic dispersion at edges. Mouse stirs the liquid creating swirling vortices.","hash":"3108fd3133263400","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-live-studio-tab","name":"Live Studio Tab","category":"generative","tags":["broadcast","studio","video-overlay","audio-visualizer","scanlines","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","chromatic"],"description":"A broadcast studio control room aesthetic with live video preview, audio VU meters, waveform scopes, vector scopes, scanlines, chromatic separation, and a blinking LIVE indicator.","hash":"393e123a0c5ba262","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-lorenz-attractor-flow","name":"Lorenz Attractor Flow","category":"generative","tags":["chaotic","attractor","lorenz","generative","scientific","flow","butterfly","raymarch","interactive","audio"],"description":"Real-time Lorenz-system integration combining a 2D butterfly-flow field with a swept 3D orbit tube, kaleidoscopic orbit-trap shading, mouse orbit controls, bounded click ripples, temporal feedback, and audio/FFT response.","hash":"c90ea4e88a5e3f3a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-lorenz-attractor","name":"Lorenz Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["chaos","strange-attractor","lorenz","temporal","physics","audio-reactive","raymarch","sdf-tube","depth"],"description":"Temporal density accumulation for short Lor