idly advected charged-particle streaks, a mouse-positioned auxiliary source, and audio-reactive auroral trails.","hash":"aa0dd6b7d6f920bc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-magnetic-field-warp","name":"Magnetic Field Warp","category":"generative","tags":["magnetic","warp","audio-reactive","curl-noise","strange-attractor","domain-warp"],"description":"Charged particles warped by a magnetic field with domain-warped FBM turbulence, curl-noise vortices, and Clifford strange-attractor modulation.","hash":"2cb9b1138055d510","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-magnetic-kelp","name":"Magnetic Kelp","category":"generative","tags":["generative","kelp","underwater","bioluminescent","organic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Subsea kelp strands sway in synthetic currents while cursor magnetism bends entire bioluminescent forests.","hash":"11620413a63b4915","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-magnetic-storm","name":"Magnetic Storm","category":"generative","tags":["magnetic","field-lines","storm","generative","fluid","audio-reactive","abstract","particles","warp"],"description":"A dynamic magnetic field storm using divergence-free curl noise to render flowing field lines. The mouse sets the magnetic pole; bass drives flow speed and storm intensity; mids shift field-line color; treble adds sparkle.","hash":"e94d36dc74585601","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-mandelbox-explorer","name":"Mandelbox Explorer","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","mandelbox","orbit-trap","audio-reactive","metallic","futuristic"],"description":"2D cross-section of the 3D Mandelbox fractal with box folding, sphere folding, and orbit-trap coloring. Metallic surface with ambient occlusion, HDR specular highlights, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"caf08995d0130d4b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-metaball-soft-body","name":"Metaball Soft Body","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","metaballs","liquid-metal","organic","implicit-surface","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Organic liquid-metal metaballs with coupled harmonic oscillators, Fresnel reflections, subsurface scattering, and chromatic caustics in merge regions. Bass pulsates radii, mouse attracts centers.","hash":"24cdcfa14a8ce61a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-micro-cosmos","name":"Micro-Cosmos","category":"generative","tags":["biological","organic","microscopic","liquid","life","floating","generative","procedural","audio","music"],"description":"A stylized microscopic current with audio-driven helices, fast procedural organisms and wakes, smoothly traveling marine snow, and click-spawned microbe blooms.","hash":"ef8aede9bb5f3d68","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-minimal-surface-soap-iridescence","name":"Minimal Surface Soap Iridescence","category":"generative","tags":["soap","iridescence","minimal-surface","interference","caustics","rainbow","generative","abstract","organic","thin-film","hdr","aces","fresnel","volumetric-fog","subsurface-scattering","split-tone","chromatic-aberration"],"description":"Parametric minimal surfaces morphing between catenoid and helicoid via Bonnet rotation, now with cinematic HDR lighting: view-dependent thin-film interference, Fresnel rim, roughness-aware specular, subsurface scattering glow, HDR bloom, ACES tone mapping, dynamic color temperature, split-tone shadows/highlights, volum","hash":"16828b2471ca9c61","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-molten-planetary-core","name":"Molten Planetary Core","category":"generative","tags":["molten","planet","lava","generative","audio-reactive","cosmic","sphere","abstract"],"description":"A rocky planet's iron-nickel heart: convection cells churn in slow blackbody glow. Bass erupts mantle plumes, treble cracks the crust in magma seams, mouse tilts the view.","hash":"42f82fb66d768984","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-multi-scale-evolutionary-cellular-gardens","name":"Multi-Scale Evolutionary Cellular Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["generative","cellular-automata","evolutionary","organic","garden","audio-reactive","emergent","music"],"description":"A multi-state cellular automata system where growth rules slowly evolve based on local conditions and global audio input. Audio drives genetic pressure on the automata. Mouse introduces invasive species or protected zones. Organic, plant-like emergent structures that change their fundamental behavior over time.","hash":"e9084ef2d3cb6db6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-murmuration-phantom","name":"Murmuration Phantom","category":"generative","tags":["murmuration","flock","swarm","curl-noise","twilight","audio-reactive","organic","volumetric"],"description":"Starling murmuration simulation — thousands of dark birds flowing in organic, ever-changing shapes against a twilight sky. The flock morphs between coherent structures driven by a curl noise flow field, with individual birds only visible as subtle silver glints at the edges. Bass drives flock density, mids morph betwee","hash":"fa465e892024e93a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-mushroom-mandala-garden","name":"Mushroom Mandala Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","psychedelic","mushroom","mandala","bioluminescent","organic"],"description":"A psychedelic-inspired radial garden of breathing mushroom caps, luminous gills, traveling spores, and pulsing mycelium. Drags bend persistent growth and clicks release patterned fairy-ring fronts.","hash":"ad31c3ca12168ba3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-mycelium-network","name":"Mycelium Network","category":"generative","tags":["generative","organic","nature","bioluminescent","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Growing network patterns resembling fungal mycelium with diffusion-limited aggregation branching and bioluminescent tips Batch 38 FAST MOTION upgrade: bioluminescent signal pulses race along the hyphae (closed-form traveling wave), the growth front uses fast-in/smooth-out time-warp easing, bass transients fire expandin","hash":"bcdb54d475429a70","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-navier-stokes-ink","name":"Navier-Stokes Ink","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","simulation","fluid","navier-stokes","ink","turbulence","audio-reactive","vj","sdf","raymarch","interactive","depth"],"description":"A single-pass fluid-inspired ink field with semi-Lagrangian advection and local pressure approximation, extended by raymarched vortex tubes and a tessellated emitter corona. Mouse input, bounded click ripples, audio, and FFT energy shape the motion and geometry.","hash":"6bc82235abe78006","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-nebula-light-trail-swarm","name":"Nebula Light-Trail Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","particles","trails","glow","audio","generative","space"],"description":"Photon-like particles race through the scene leaving glowing, fading trails that pulse with audio. Creates a constantly reforming nebula.","hash":"7f1f4482ff8b2061","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-nebular-chrono-astrolabe","name":"Nebular Chrono Astrolabe","category":"generative","tags":["generative","nebula","astrolabe","raymarching","fbm","domain-warping","curl-noise","fresnel","beer-lambert","audio-reactive","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A cosmic nebula astrolabe with concentric FBM-domain-warped rings, volumetric curl-noise clouds, satellite box structures, Fresnel-Schlick reflections, Beer-Lambert attenuation, and audio-reactive gravity wells. Mouse bends spacetime.","hash":"65b9b3a12d76d6dc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-acid-geometry","name":"Neon Acid Geometry","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","geometry","acid","morphing","additive","shapes","ph-science","chemistry"],"description":"Geometric shapes (triangles, hexagons, circles) morphing and melting in psychedelic neon. Upgraded with universal-indicator pH color science: geometry edges glow with realistic acid/base transitions driven by bass oscillation. Critical-angle refraction distortion, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and ACE","hash":"98daa1572d3cbeaf","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-cyber-mandala","name":"Neon Cyber Mandala","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","mandala","geometric","sacred-geometry","rainbow","generative","golden-ratio","fibonacci"],"description":"A slowly rotating mandala made of neon geometric shapes including rings, stars, and polygons. Each ring features a different decorative pattern - dots, radiating lines, zigzags, waves, and diamonds. Bright neon rainbow gradients cycle through colors. Connecting threads pulse with energy. Floating particles orbit the de","hash":"3ff4c5b7b7284525","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-lotus","name":"Neon Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["lotus","flower","neon","generative","audio-reactive","colorful","abstract","psychedelic"],"description":"A blooming neon lotus flower with layered petals unfolding in real-time. Bass swells the bloom, mids shift the chromatic glow, treble adds iridescent shimmer on each petal edge.","hash":"6c456f3a4774e47a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-neural-network","name":"Neon Neural Network","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","network","glow","signals","data-flow","generative","neural","relu","ai","abstract"],"description":"A glowing neon neural network visualization enriched with ReLU activation mathematics. Neurons fire using R(x)=max(0,x) thresholds. Bass drives input layer activation intensity. Mids control synaptic connection strength. Treble adds backpropagation error glow as red halos along edges. Network layers visualized as conce","hash":"2b085c47a6d727fd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-plasma-biomechanical-hive","name":"Neon-Plasma Biomechanical Hive","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","neon","organic","plasma","audio-reactive","cyberpunk"],"description":"A hyper-organic, biomechanical labyrinth of pulsing neon circuitry and breathing metallic tissue that spawns luminescent plasma-spores reacting to ambient cosmic frequencies. Upgraded (fast-motion batch): the spores now swarm at speed with spring-damped cursor pursuit and velocity lead, bass kicks and clicks fire bound","hash":"3b01d43098ec1f5a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-snowfall","name":"Neon Snowfall","category":"generative","tags":["generative","snow","neon","particles","winter","audio-reactive"],"description":"Chromatic snow particles descend in luminous streaks with high-frequency treble twinkle.","hash":"1a0dd97140fa0d4d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-stellated-octahedron","name":"Neon Stellated Octahedron","category":"generative","tags":["generative","geometry","stellated","octahedron","star-tetrahedron","neon","kaleidoscope","audio-reactive"],"description":"A neon-lit stellated octahedron (star tetrahedron) — two interpenetrating tetrahedra with blazing rainbow edges and dual-color facet glow. Six-fold kaleidoscopic symmetry multiplies the geometry; bass pulses the star scale, treble ignites vertex spikes. Mouse spins the form through space.","hash":"cda964cd317d387e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neon-tropical-paradise","name":"Neon Tropical Paradise","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","tropical","nature","bioluminescent","aurora","sunset","ocean","ocean-optics","coral","fluorescence"],"description":"A psychedelic tropical paradise with stylized neon palm trees, aurora sky, glowing flowers, and bioluminescent water enriched with ocean light attenuation physics. Hot pinks, electric blues, neon greens, sunset oranges. Mouse creates ripples in the water and sways the trees. Stars twinkle in a psychedelic sky. Surface ","hash":"5a07e247ad274a49","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-bioluminescence-matrix","name":"Neural Bioluminescence Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","matrix","bioluminescence","neural"],"description":"A pulsing, infinite organic matrix of glowing synthetic neurons firing quantum light impulses across a void, merging biological growth with cybernetic circuitry.","hash":"4110b0664d6b7689","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-dust","name":"Neural Dust","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","particles","dust","neural","noise","glow","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Drifting luminous particle field driven by domain-warped FBM. Audio reactivity controls density and jitter, while mouse gravity attracts nearby dust motes.","hash":"c0ce4f38d9daca32","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-fractal","name":"Neural Fractal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","neural","mathematical","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Neural network weight visualization style fractals using sigmoid, tanh, and swish activation functions instead of standard z²+c iterations","hash":"d9346fb09ff2013c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neural-network-glow-synaptic-pulse","name":"Neural Network Glow","category":"generative","tags":["neural","glow","audio-reactive","network","mesh","feedback","trails"],"description":"Render a glowing neural mesh and drive action-potential pulses with audio, creating a living synapse network that lights up in layers.","hash":"e8d31051bab8f3fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neuro-cosmos","name":"Neuro-Cosmos","category":"generative","tags":["network","neural","cosmic","web","3d","raymarching","voronoi","glowing","cyber","procedural","generative"],"description":"A mesmerizing 3D generative visualization of a structure that visually bridges the gap between a biological neural network and the cosmic web of the universe.","hash":"39c6482b2820bf96","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neuro-fluid-plasma-lotus","name":"Neuro-Fluid Plasma-Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["organic","floral","plasma","audio-reactive","liquid-neon","volumetric","raymarched"],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic lotus flower suspended in zero-gravity, blooming endlessly with translucent liquid-neon neuro-fluid petals that ripple with bioluminescent plasma in sync with ambient cosmic frequencies.","hash":"a515e5ff7829945e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neuro-kinetic-bloom","name":"Neuro-Kinetic Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["organic","biomechanical","audio-reactive","flora","raymarching","volumetric"],"description":"A vast, deep-sea garden of biomechanical, neon-veined flora that dynamically uncoils and pulses with quantum energy, its tendrils whipping and synchronizing to the rhythm of sound.","hash":"75a78c93e1bf6582","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neuro-kinetic-liquid-gold-lotus","name":"Neuro-Kinetic Liquid-Gold Lotus","category":"generative","tags":["organic","liquid","gold","audio-reactive","geometry"],"description":"A liquid-gold lotus with rapid petal torque waves, audio-driven plasma runners, click-launched blossom shocks, direct saved-control behavior, and bounded rotational trails.","hash":"5e3f834590affdc7","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-neutron-star-magnetic-spindle","name":"Neutron-Star Magnetic Spindle","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"1aaa80d7be1b7f62","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-newton-fractal","name":"Newton Fractal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","newton","complex","audio-reactive","neon","mathematical","orbit-traps","domain-warp","reaction-diffusion"],"description":"Newton's-method basins for z^n - 1, now with FBM domain-warped coordinates, multi-root color accumulation, smooth iteration counts, multi-shape orbit traps, SDF smooth-union root halos, and reaction-diffusion boundary accents. Audio drives polynomial degree and halo shimmer; ACES tone mapping and chromatic aberration f","hash":"8cec5c363ff68890","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-obsidian-echo-chamber","name":"Obsidian Echo-Chamber","category":"generative","tags":["brutalist","obsidian","audio-reactive","reflection","dark"],"description":"A wrapped high-speed flight through polished obsidian monoliths, with audio-driven sonar bands, click echoes, spectral reflections, and bounded corridor trails.","hash":"1e8865c0194e9d49","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-opal-circuit","name":"Opal Circuit","category":"generative","tags":["generative","circuit","opal","iridescent","cyber","audio-