ic energy and refracting light in a dazzling abyssal void.","hash":"9adf065ae2d4295f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-radiant-quantum-plasma-kraken-core","name":"Radiant Quantum-Plasma Kraken-Core","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","plasma","tentacles"],"description":"A majestic, hyper-organic deep-space kraken composed of swirling quantum-plasma tentacles and a blinding radiant core that pulsates violently in sync with cosmic bass drops.","hash":"74a0aa34c67d684a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-rainbow-firefly-dance","name":"Rainbow Firefly Dance","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","particles","glow","fireflies","rainbow","organic"],"description":"A fast rainbow firefly swarm with analytic orbital motion, velocity-stretched comet tails, mouse attraction, click-launched mini-swarms, and bounded phosphorescent trails.","hash":"7b2962a635b9fc89","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-rainbow-icosahedron-cascade","name":"Rainbow Icosahedron Cascade","category":"generative","tags":["generative","geometry","icosahedron","polyhedron","rainbow","spectral","nested","audio-reactive","mouse-driven"],"description":"Nested concentric icosahedral wireframe shells radiating spectral edge glow. Each golden-ratio shell cycles through a full rainbow palette; bass expands the cascade, treble shimmers facet hues. Mouse orbits the entire structure through 3D space.","hash":"7afbcb7f8d085b5d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-raptor-mini","name":"Raptor Mini","category":"generative","tags":["agent","chase","audio","music","procedural","generative","reactive"],"description":"Fast predatory mini raptor agents chase the mouse and strike with claws. Audio rage mode boosts speed and attacks.","hash":"b31530cbb68a889a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-recursive-ancestral-terrains","name":"Recursive Ancestral Terrains","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fractal","terrain","landscape","procedural","evolutionary","audio-reactive","music","golden-ratio","fractal-dimension"],