description":"A hyper-organic biomechanical engine constructed from sleek, interlocking plates of liquid obsidian and glowing quantum circuitry that functions like a colossal scarab breathing and reacting to acoustic energy.","hash":"68d510800ec41b73","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-resonant-quantum-plasma-dragon-eye","name":"Resonant Quantum-Plasma Dragon-Eye","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","fractal","audio-reactive","dragon","eye","raymarched"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, endlessly morphing cosmic dragon's eye forged from swirling quantum plasma and fractal dark matter, its pupil dilating and glowing violently in response to deep acoustic bass frequencies.","hash":"b4c7fd5c53819d4a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-rgb-diffraction","name":"RGB Diffraction","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","colorful","diffraction","prismatic","spectral","interference","rainbow","generative","abstract"],"description":"Simulates a multi-slit diffraction grating where separate red, green, and blue wavelengths produce offset interference fringe patterns. Six-fold rotational symmetry creates a spectral starburst. Slit orientation and frequency pulse to audio for reactive prism effects.","hash":"5a6693fbdfac54c3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-aether-flora-biosphere","name":"Sentient Aether-Flora Biosphere","category":"generative","tags":["flora","organic","bioluminescent","fractal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A hyper-organic, bioluminescent extraterrestrial terrarium where fractal aether-spores drift and blossom into complex, sentient crystalline flora that pulse with cosmic energy in sync with ambient audio. Upgraded (fast-motion batch): spores now fly as a fast swarm with spring-damped cursor chase, bass kicks trigger blo","hash":"cf75fe73bfe7f792","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-aether-plasma-nebula-moth","name":"Sentient Aether-Plasma Nebula-Moth","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","volumetric","fractal"],"description":"A hyper-organic, bioluminescent space-moth woven from liquid auroral plasma and shattered chrono-glass, fluttering endlessly through a chaotic, violently decaying quantum-particle storm.","hash":"8eeb44d6559ac426","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-bismuth-hypercrystal","name":"Sentient Bismuth Hypercrystal","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"b33482e98f034f21","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-cyber-aurora-void-owl","name":"Sentient Cyber-Aurora Void-Owl","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"","hash":"ea7072358be5ec5d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-cyber-chrono-void-serpent","name":"Sentient Cyber-Chrono Void-Serpent","category":"generative","tags":["organic","cybernetic","fractal","volumetric","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","orbit-trap","tessellation","geometry"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional biomechanical serpent of shattered chrono-glass and liquid auroral plasma, octahedral scale-shards and torus chrono-rings clamped around its undulating spine, slithering through a Julia-orbit-trap temporal rift over a decaying void floor, pulsing with hex-etched bioluminescent armor.","hash":"9e12e87535c1b0fa","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-ferro-silicate-swarm","name":"Sentient Ferro-Silicate Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["mechanical","particle-system","audio-reactive","fluid-dynamics","fractal"],"description":"A hyper-dynamic, liquid-metal particle swarm that self-assembles into brutalist geometric architectures before dissolving back into a chaotic, churning ferro-fluid storm.","hash":"862fa2a6448cbd81","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-liquid-neon-fractal-heart","name":"Sentient Liquid-Neon Fractal-Heart","category":"generative","tags":["organic","biomechanical","fractal","neon","plasma"],"description":"A stylized liquid-neon fractal heart with live-audio contractions, traveling artery pulses, click shocks processed outside the march, and bounded plasma-flow trails.","hash":"5e587c462ea43c7a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-quantum-chrono-leviathan-moth","name":"Sentient Quantum-Chrono Leviathan-Moth","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","moth","quantum","crystal","organic","mechanical","audio-reactive"],"description":"A majestic, colossal cybernetic space moth floating through a deep-space nebula, its wings woven from crystalline threads of frozen time and quantum aether-plasma that softly pulse and ripple in sync with ambient cosmic acoustics.","hash":"c836f64c0450928a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sentient-void-silk-nebula","name":"Sentient Void-Silk Nebula","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-dimensional fluid simulation that weaves iridescent void silk threads.","hash":"d118c7fe80feb51d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-crystalline-pulse","name":"Crystalline Pulse","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","crystal","geometric","voronoi","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract","diamond-lattice","phonon","bravais"],"description":"Geometric crystal formations based on diamond cubic Bravais lattice structure with phonon pulse propagation. FCC lattice positions, acoustic phonon frequency ω = 2√(k/m)|sin(ka/2)|, bass-driven vibration, temporal feedback trails, chromatic aberration, and mouse lattice defect injection create a scientifically-grounded","hash":"def5fb01b7234674","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-kinetic-bloom","name":"Kinetic Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","flower","mandala","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","geometric","organic","upgraded-rgba"],"description":"Geometric flower mandala with damped harmonic oscillator physics. Each petal is a spring-mass system: ζ from mids, ω₀ from bass, underdamped motion x(t)=e^(-ζω₀t)cos(ωt). Bloom cycles triggered by bass. Temporal feedback, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.","hash":"b37316b7fd795912","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-showcase-nebula-core","name":"Nebula Core","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","nebula","space","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract","atmospheric","balmer-series","astrophysics"],"description":"Deep-space nebula with organic plasma clouds enriched by Wolfram Alpha Hydrogen Balmer Series astrophysics data. H-alpha dominates core, H-beta fills mid regions. Bass drives ionization front expansion. Mouse seeds new star formation.","hash":"dde898d05e48e06e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sierpinski-tetrahedron","name":"Sierpinski Tetrahedron","category":"generative","tags":["fractal","sierpinski","tetrahedron","3d","geometric","jewel","metallic"],"description":"3D Sierpinski tetrahedron rendered as a 2D projection with multi-orbit trap coloring (vertex, edge, shell). Domain-warped FBM distorts the view, jewel-tone palette with metallic sheen, HDR specular highlights, and audio-reactive recursion depth.","hash":"086afd5676cbbca4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-silica-tsunami","name":"Silica Tsunami","category":"generative","tags":["generative","raymarching","glass","refraction","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","click-reactive","depth-aware"],"description":"A slow-motion wave of refractive glass-like particles that crests and shatters, dynamically reshaping around the mouse and reacting to audio amplitude.","hash":"d6e369c9d2151c33","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-singularity-forge","name":"Singularity Forge","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","black-hole","gravity","plasma","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A gravity-warped stellar forge with relativistic accretion shear, ballistic jet knots, mouse lensing, and bounded angular light trails driven by live audio.","hash":"7680a87797904d0d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-solar-wind-ribbons","name":"Solar Wind Ribbons","category":"generative","tags":["solar","aurora","ribbons","plasma","generative","audio-reactive","cosmic","abstract"],"description":"Magnetised plasma ribbons stream like coronal mass ejections caught mid-flight. Bass swells ribbon width, treble brightens edges, mouse steers the aurora curtain.","hash":"3dafdd026421e687","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sonic-lava-flow","name":"Sonic Lava Flow","category":"generative","tags":["artistic","generative","fluid","lava","molten","volumetric"],"description":"Navier-Stokes-style fluid solver with domain-warped FBM, Voronoi crust detail, Beer-Lambert volumetric glow, Fresnel molten surface, enhanced curl noise, and deep audio reactivity creating a living molten world.","hash":"ef20128932bfdefc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-sonoluminescent-chrono-geode-matrix","name":"Sonoluminescent Chrono-Geode Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["geode","plasma","fractal","temporal","audio-reactive"],"description":"A colossal, infinitely shattering crystalline geode that fractures to reveal a violently erupting sonoluminescent plasma core. Fast-motion upgrade: closed-form orbital camera with eased time-warp spin, sonoluminescent flash-burst physics (bubble-collapse cycles with ballistic shockwave shells), bass-transient kick burs","hash":"04f269f6672b43b6","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-spectral-ferrofluid","name":"Spectral Ferrofluid","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","magnetic","organic","spikes","translucent","field-lines"],"description":"Magnetic ferrofluid simulation with field-strength alpha translucency and audio-reactive spikes. Mouse acts as a magnetic source while temporal feedback creates organic fluid memory.","hash":"4836d2ce57da8a2b","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stable-fluids-jos-stam","name":"Stable Fluids (Jos Stam)","category":"generative","tags":["fluid","simulation","dye","smoke","pressure","navier-stokes","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"Classic stable fluids solver with pressure projection. Velocity advection, force application, divergence estimation, Jacobi pressure solve, gradient subtraction, dye advection, and audio-reactive color mapping.","hash":"d1f3b067d62a01dc","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stardust-nebula","name":"Stardust Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","space","stars","generative","audio-reactive","cosmic","abstract","atmospheric"],"description":"A stellar nursery in HII emission colours: curl-noise gas clouds, dark absorption pillars, and proto-star sparkle. Bass swells the pillars of creation, treble ignites new suns.","hash":"98f803b0b5792ac5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-acoustic-resonance-manifold","name":"Stellar-Acoustic Resonance-Manifold","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"","hash":"c27302e9514697a1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-plasma-ouroboros","name":"Stellar Plasma-Ouroboros","category":"generative","tags":["generative"],"description":"An infinite, self-consuming mechanical serpent made of fractured glass scales and stellar plasma.","hash":"d743cc8e971dc4e4","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-stellar-web-loom","name":"Stellar Web-Loom","category":"generative","tags":["cosmic","neuro","plasma","volumetric","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional cosmic loom weaving infinite tendrils of starlight and plasma silk across a dark void, blending organic neuro-network vibes with vast, mechanical astrophysics. Upgraded for fast motion: warp-flight camera driven by Weave Speed, radial speed-line streaks, clamped HDR feedback light-trails, bass-trans","hash":"07ce5596e0aabd09","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-strange-field-flow","name":"Strange Field Flow","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","attractor","chaos","colorful","acid","neon","flow","generative","abstract","fractal"],"description":"A strange-attractor flow field blending Peter de Jong and Clifford attractor maps. Each pixel evaluates iterated orbit density and paints acid-neon whorls. Attractor coefficients pulse to bass and treble, morphing the topology. Temporal persistence burns psychedelic trails.","hash":"3cd54b4987c33f44","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-string-theory","name":"String Theory","category":"generative","tags":["generative","physics","waves","harmonics","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A stylized standing-wave string ensemble with harmonic modes, sprung mouse plucking, click resonance shells, audio excitation, temporal trails, and generated relief depth.","hash":"848d965c75437347","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-superfluid-quantum-foam","name":"Superfluid Quantum-Foam","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","fluid","audio-reactive","raymarching","volumetric","mouse-driven","click-reactive","temporal","depth-aware"],"description":"A mesmerizing, hyper-turbulent ocean of boiling quantum probability foam, where iridescent hyper-bubbles merge and burst in sync with audio frequencies, releasing flashes of raw cosmic energy.","hash":"a08da4cc904abf03","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-supernova-remnant","name":"Supernova Remnant","category":"generative","tags":["generative","nebula","physics","space","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Expanding shell structures with shockwave physics and Rayleigh-Taylor instability patterns, inspired by Hubble nebula images","hash":"f5ccaec2c888d92f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-bismuth-crystal-dragon-core","name":"Symbiotic Bismuth-Crystal Dragon-Core","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-intricate, continuously folding bismuth fractal labyrinth that breathes and pulses like a colossal, ancient techno-organic heart core.","hash":"9d49dc863cd06c9d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-chrono-mycelium-engine","name":"Symbiotic Chrono-Mycelium Engine","category":"generative","tags":["organic","mechanical","mycelium","audio-reactive","quantum","plasma"],"description":"A hyper-organic, ever-evolving cybernetic mycelial network that metabolizes temporal energy, pulsing with luminescent plasma as it entwines around a central quantum gear.","hash":"f860d6bb23984001","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-cyber-fungal-core-reactor","name":"Symbiotic Cyber-Fungal Core-Reactor","category":"generative","tags":["biomechanical","mycelium","quantum","volumetric","reaction-diffusion"],"description":"A biomechanical network of luminescent mycelium feeding off the chaotic energy of a fractured quantum singularity. Upgraded with a spring-smoothed mouse gravity-well attractor that steers fungal growth, click-spawned spore-burst shockwaves with bounded energy, hold-to-mutate surges, real audio reactivity (bass/mids/tre","hash":"030ca5ebba1d0287","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-cyber-mycelium","name":"Symbiotic Cyber-Mycelium","category":"generative","tags":["3d","raymarching","organic","cyberpunk","mycelium","neon","sdf"],"description":"A mesmerizing descent into a synthetic fungal network where glowing bioluminescent fibers transmit digital pulses between pulsating data-nodes. It bridges the gap between organic growth algorithms and rigid, luminous cybernetic aesthetics.","hash":"7de79d49158910e2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-light-networks","name":"Symbiotic Light Networks","category":"generative","tags":["generative","network","bioluminescent","organic","light-transport","audio-reactive","procedural","music"],"description":"A network of light-conducting organic structures that grow, compete, and support each other while transporting and transforming light in complex ways. Audio influences light color, intensity, and transmission rules. Mouse seeds or prunes the network. Bioluminescent organic networks with complex internal light transport","hash":"e5295c48f1907f1f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-symbiotic-plasma-reef-matrix","name":"Symbiotic Plasma-Reef Matrix","category":"generative","tags":["organic","ocean","bioluminescent","plasma","audio-reactive","raymarched","coral","deep-sea"],"description":"A hyper-vibrant deep-sea reef of fractal coral structures and bioluminescent plasma that pulsates with rhythmic audio, swarming with microscopic glowing entities.","hash":"a37d79202445a8ec","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-tectonic-plasma-crucible","name":"Tectonic Plasma-Crucible","category":"generative","tags":["magma","obsidian","fractal","lava","audio-reactive","tectonic","voronoi","raymarched"],"description":"A violently shifting landscape of cooling obsidian geometric slabs floating on a turbulent, audio-reactive ocean of blinding-hot plasma magma that constantly fractures, erupts, and reshapes itself.","hash":"8329ec14300e64b9","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-temporal-motion-smear","name":"Temporal Motion Smear","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","motion","smear","trails","frame-differencing","audio","music"],"description":"Motion-aware temporal smearing using frame differencing and directional blur, creating colorful trails that follow moving objects","hash":"ead088b8ac99323d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-thermal-rainbow-topography","name":"Thermal Rainbow Topography","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","neon","thermal","topography","terrain","contour","heatmap"],"description":"Topographic terrain visualization with thermal imaging color grading. Contour lines with neon glow trace evolving mountainous terrain rendered in a bright rainbow thermal palette from black through blue, cyan, green, yellow, red to white. Mouse creates glowing hot spots on the landscape. Upgraded (Batch 36): domain-war","hash":"01df75ffdf408de8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topological-acoustic-knots","name":"Topological Acoustic Knots","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topological","liquid-crystal","audio-reactive","flow-field","iridescent","abstract","music"],"description":"Orientational director field inspired by liquid crystals where audio frequencies drive topological defect creation, motion, and annihilation. Mouse can pin or create defects. Iridescent oil-slick coloring with flowing directional fields.","hash":"74a84041d15b8303","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topological-phase-weave","name":"Topological Phase Weave","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topology","liquid-crystal","nematic","defects","iridescent","procedural","audio","music","reactive","scientific","phase-transition","euler-characteristic"],"description":"A simulation of nematic liquid crystal fields where audio frequencies control topological defect creation, motion, and annihilation, producing mesmerizing swirling defect lattices with iridescent color mapping. Enriched with phase transition physics: bass drives an order parameter from disordered (warm chaotic weave) t","hash":"3dec04beff04d2c1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-topology-flow","name":"Topology Flow","category":"generative","tags":["generative","topology","flow","mathematical","procedural","audio","music"],"description":"Topological surface flow visualization inspired by Morse theory, showing gradient flows converging and diverging at critical points","hash":"ac1f740993af2bf0","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-torus-knot-rainbow","name":"Torus Knot Rainbow","category":"generative","tags":["psychedelic","colorful","torus","knot","rainbow","3d","generative","abstract","neon","chromatic","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","fractal","julia","domain-warp","fbm"],"description":"An algorithmically deep (p,q) torus knot rendered as an analytic smooth-union SDF of capsules. Tube radius harmonically modulates with FBM domain warp, while a multi-orbit Julia trap adds iridescent halo detail. Audio drives the wind modulation, spin, and glow intensity; temporal feedback leaves rainbow trails. Depth-a","hash":"e1ab222ba01afce2","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-translucent-nebula","name":"Translucent Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["nebula","volumetric","gas","stars","translucent","worley-noise"],"description":"Volumetric gas clouds with density-based alpha translucency. FBM and Worley noise create organic nebula structure where dense cores are opaque and edges fade to transparent. Star sparkle reacts to treble and nebula pulses with bass.","hash":"593ccdc366b5a5e5","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-turing-morphogenesis","name":"Turing Morphogenesis","category":"generative","tags":["turing","reaction-diffusion","morphogenesis","organic","biological","patterns","generative","spots","stripes"],"description":"Alan Turing's reaction-diffusion morphogenesis simulated via deterministic activator-inhibitor fields. Evolves organic spot, stripe, and labyrinth patterns reminiscent of animal coats and coral growth. Bass modulates feed/kill parameters causing pattern morphing, mouse deposits new activator seeds, and depth controls p","hash":"49337608747e32ba","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-velocity-bloom","name":"Velocity Bloom","category":"generative","tags":["temporal","bloom","velocity","motion","glow","audio","music"],"description":"Velocity-sensitive bloom effect that intensifies on motion, creating multi-octave glow with white core and colored aura based on velocity. Upgraded 2026-08-05: Lucas-Kanade-style flow estimation with motion-aligned anamorphic streaks, curl-noise advected feedback trails, Gray-Scott-hint diffusion accumulation, audio pu","hash":"f85e69478ed2e220","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-verlet-cloth-wind","name":"Verlet Cloth Wind","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cloth","physics","fabric","wind","simulation","audio-reactive"],"description":"Verlet integration cloth simulation with wind forces, silk/fabric shading, anisotropic specular highlights, and audio-reactive gusts.","hash":"fc0c5b2da6891684","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vitreous-chrono-chandelier","name":"Vitreous Chrono-Chandelier","category":"generative","tags":["crystal","mechanical","audio-reactive","raymarching","glass","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"An infinite, abyssal cavern illuminated by a colossal, self-assembling chandelier of hyper-refractive glass chimes and glowing quantum pendulums that shatter and reform to the rhythm of time and sound.","hash":"158c0b2c18b02938","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vitreous-quantum-lotus-singularity","name":"Vitreous Quantum-Lotus Singularity","category":"generative","tags":["organic","quantum","cosmic","fractal","flower","refraction","audio-reactive","sdf","raymarched","thin-film","iridescent"],"description":"A hyper-dimensional, translucent crystalline lotus flower continuously blooming and fracturing around a gravitational singularity. Upgraded with thin-film iridescence on the vitreous petals, per-petal cell color variation, symmetry-folded radial vein inlays pulsing with the music, an event-horizon core with photon ring","hash":"872a75ab3ffad765","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-void-harmonic-cymatic-resonator","name":"Void Harmonic Cymatic Resonator","category":"generative","tags":[],"description":"A hyper-dimensional sound-reactive sculpture that renders the visible form of acoustic frequencies in the void, resembling Chladni patterns suspended in dark matter.","hash":"650993074ec15d7d","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-volcanic-ink","name":"Volcanic Ink","category":"generative","tags":["generative","volcanic","lava","ink","embers","audio-reactive","LOD","blue-noise","temporal-feedback","ACES","HDR-ready"],"description":"Molten fissures and soot plumes mix with blue-noise ember sparks in a dark volcanic ink basin. Now with resolution-aware LOD scaling, unrolled temporal blur, pipeline data slots, and HDR output.","hash":"afd87474d6caf26c","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-von-karman-vortex","name":"Von Kármán Vortex Street","category":"generative","tags":["fluid-dynamics","vortex","karman","analytic","physics","audio-reactive"],"description":"Analytic vortex-street flow visualization. Ten alternating point-vortex pairs shed behind the mouse-driven obstacle; their combined streamfunction ψ = U·y + Σ ±(Γ/2π)·ln(r) produces isocontours tracing the classic Kármán street wake. Envelope-smoothed bass drives shedding speed and brightness pulses; mids morph vortex ","hash":"743f2863916c6522","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-voronoi-crystal","name":"Voronoi Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","voronoi","crystal","procedural","animated","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Animated Voronoi crystal growth with sprung seed refraction, audio-driven iridescence, click-fractured facets, temporal polish, and generated relief depth.","hash":"6a009940b175ca58","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-vortex-cathedral","name":"Vortex Cathedral","category":"generative","tags":["generative","vortex","cathedral","radial","cosmic","audio-reactive","volumetric-god-rays","starburst-diffraction","chromatic-aberration","light-attenuation"],"description":"Spinning radial arches and sanctum rings form a gothic vortex illuminated by bass-lit cores. Enhanced with volumetric god rays, 6-pointed starburst diffraction spikes, chromatic aberration at edges, multi-layered sanctum glow, and realistic light attenuation.","hash":"f7f80fdcf906a497","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-wasm-hls-physarum-swarm","name":"WASM HLS Physarum Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["physarum","slime-mold","agent-based","swarm","video-reactive","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal"],"description":"A living swarm of physarum agents that trace organic paths across the screen, reacting to live video input as food, audio frequencies as steering pulses, and mouse movement as attraction points.","hash":"4d7109190f96110a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-worley-cellular-noise","name":"Worley Cellular Noise","category":"generative","tags":["cellular","worley","organic","tissue","biological","abstract","natural"],"description":"Worley cellular noise generating organic tissue-like patterns. Computes F1, F2, and cell boundaries with time-varying feature points, fBm variation, and subsurface scattering simulation.","hash":"e2aaf0245dc93500","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-xeno-botanical-synth-flora","name":"Xeno-Botanical Synth-Flora","category":"generative","tags":["organic","botanical","cybernetic","bioluminescent","audio-reactive","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"A dense, alien jungle of luminescent, synthetic flora that blooms and breathes with the rhythm of sound, blending organic curves with crystalline cybernetic materials.","hash":"4a9bf9eb8d14ee98","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-xeno-mycelial-resonance-web","name":"Xeno-Mycelial Resonance-Web","category":"generative","tags":["organic","mycelium","fractal","bioluminescent","audio-reactive","raymarching"],"description":"An infinite, subterranean expanse of bioluminescent, hyper-dimensional mycelium that rhythmically pulses, grows, and interconnects its glowing neural networks in response to audio frequencies.","hash":"9db01174da766985","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-zeta-function-landscape","name":"Zeta Function Landscape","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mathematical","zeta","riemann","landscape","abstract","audio","music"],"description":"Critical-strip Riemann zeta landscape evaluated through a guarded Dirichlet-eta continuation. Magnitude creates height, near-zeros form valleys, click ripples refract the domain, and eight FFT regions voice the color field.","hash":"ac7941976867b64f","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-capabilities","name":"System Monitor","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Cyberpunk system monitor demonstrating mouse inputs, time, and frame feedback.","hash":"9463f18bc400d639","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-cyclic-automaton","name":"Greenberg-Hastings Automaton","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cellular-automaton","excitable-media","audio-reactive","waves"],"description":"Excitable cellular medium with firing, refractory cooling, bass-driven spontaneous ignition, directional held-mouse painting, and timestamp-bounded click wavefronts.","hash":"23a86ae783d27a4e","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-fluffy-raincloud","name":"Vorticity Raincloud","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","clouds","rain","storm","audio-reactive"],"description":"Audio-reactive cloudscape with curl-noise advection, buoyant thunderheads, Mie silver lining, and rain sheets driven by stored flow.","hash":"b83ac2a17b72fe75","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grid","name":"Domain-Warped FBM Grid","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","noise","grid","domain-warp","moire","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive domain-warped FBM grid with mouse gravity well, recursive moiré sub-grids, chromatic dispersion edges, and temporal motion blur.","hash":"03731c484789e6ff","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok41-mandelbrot","name":"Buddhabrot Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fractal","mandelbrot","buddhabrot","nebula","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Buddhabrot orbit accumulation with bass-breathing sample count, mids hue shift, treble sparkle stars, mouse-driven panning, orbital rainbow trails, and ACES temporal accumulation.","hash":"cc789aa2120f4fd1","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok41-plasma","name":"Spherical Harmonics Plasma","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","sphere","atmosphere","spherical-harmonics","gas-giant","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive 3D gas giant using Y(l,m) spherical harmonics with HDR ACES tone mapping, Rayleigh limb scattering, mouse-driven light, and treble-triggered lightning tendrils.","hash":"1525a34b6b871509","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok4-life","name":"SmoothLife Predator-Prey","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","simulation","life","predator-prey","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"Two-species SmoothLife cellular automaton with Lotka-Volterra predator-prey dynamics. Species A (green prey) uses Rafler 2011 birth/survival rules; species B (red predator) grows on prey density and decays without it. Audio bass drives prey birth-rate, treble drives predator decay, mids control coupling strength.","hash":"0307efd19a92b034","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grok4-perlin","name":"Stratified Erosion Terrain","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","terrain","erosion","sediment","landscape","audio-reactive"],"description":"Depth-aware terrain with sediment transport, layered rock hardness, reflective valley water tables, wind abrasion, and bass-driven seismic uplift.","hash":"0d3b05555b4112c8","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grokcf-interference","name":"Cylindrical Drum Modes","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","cymatics","bessel","drum","audio-reactive","chladni","physics"],"description":"Vibrating circular membrane Bessel function modal synthesis: u_{mn} = J_m(α_{mn}·r/R)·cos(mφ)·cos(ω_{mn}·t). GPU polynomial Bessel J₀–J₃ (Abramowitz & Stegun). Audio bands activate mode families (bass→radial, mids→azimuthal, treble→higher-order). Chladni node-line colouring.","hash":"219362d1c09ea219","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-grokcf-voronoi","name":"Worley Cellular","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","voronoi","cellular","worley","audio-reactive","thin-film","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Worley cellular fields with thin-film interference edge glow and micro-cosmic starfields hidden inside each cell.","hash":"0611510cb344e8b3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-hyper-warp","name":"Hyper Warp","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Advanced domain warping with fractal noise, etched warped contour lines, and flow-dispersed prismatic reaction-diffusion feedback.","hash":"20656da505a7e2bb","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-julia-set","name":"Julia Set — Orbit Trap","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","fractal","julia","orbit-trap","abstract","colorful"],"description":"Generalised Julia set iteration z^n+c for n=2..6 with smooth (continuous) iteration count μ=i−log₂(log₂|z|), multi-trap orbit colouring (circle, line, cross traps), and animated Julia parameter c orbiting a Mandelbrot cardioid boundary. Audio-driven trap scale.","hash":"28cfe651d61f0562","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kimi-crystal","name":"Kimi Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","crystal","ice","hexagonal","transmission","physical"],"description":"Animated crystalline structures growing on a hexagonal grid with physical light transmission. Features ice IOR-based Fresnel reflection, purity-based absorption, and variable crystal thickness.","hash":"8f42a9360837e621","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-kimi-nebula","name":"Kimi Nebula","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Cosmic nebula cloud swirls with ethereal gas formations, twinkling stars, and mouse-driven stellar winds.","hash":"67f65f05fcf7c4bd","embedding":""},{"id":"gen_mandelbulb_3d","name":"Mandelbulb 3D","category":"generative","tags":["mandelbulb","fractal","3d","raymarch","orbits"],"description":"3D Mandelbulb fractal with ray marching, orbit trap coloring, soft shadows, and distance-based alpha for atmospheric depth","hash":"4718025f85e3dd12","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-orb","name":"Lorenz Strange Attractor","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","particles","mathematical-art","chaos","attractor","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Lorenz strange attractor (σ, ρ, β) with bioluminescent depth halos and persistent scent trails. Mids drive rotation, bass adds streams, treble jitters chaos.","hash":"73711485d7d6d08a","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-psychedelic-spiral","name":"Superformula Spirograph Spiral","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","audio","music","reactive","spirograph","spiral","fractal-floral"],"description":"Superformula-driven spirograph spiral with nested epicycles, audio-reactive petal modulation, mouse-centered orbit drift, and temporal feedback warping.","hash":"0a707940f37318d3","embedding":""},{"id":"gen_quantum_foam","name":"Quantum Foam","category":"generative","tags":["quantum","generative","entanglement","volumetric","hdr"],"description":"Quantum vacuum fluctuation visualization with virtual particle pairs, entanglement webs, and HDR volumetric glow","hash":"939502c4c3e6be43","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-rainbow-smoke","name":"Rainbow Smoke with Dual Scattering","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","smoke","audio-reactive","scattering","volumetric"],"description":"Multi-scale rainbow smoke with vorticity confinement, buoyancy, Rayleigh edge glow, and Mie-lit cores driven by bass and treble.","hash":"181b7bec8ab1d441","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-reaction-diffusion","name":"FitzHugh-Nagumo Excitable Media","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","reaction-diffusion","excitable-media","audio-reactive","waves"],"description":"Dual-mode excitable media: Gray-Scott morphogenesis or FitzHugh-Nagumo action-potential waves with mouse/current injection and bass-triggered pulses.","hash":"9ae2dddc2a67e053","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-trails","name":"Boids Flocking","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","flocking","particles","boids","trails","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive Reynolds boids flocking with bass-driven panic, mids cohesion, treble flash bursts, mouse attraction, motion-blur streaks, and pheromone trails.","hash":"dfa4dfe8c9c12f23","embedding":""},{"id":"gen-wave-equation","name":"Fluid Ripples","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","liquid","waves","audio-reactive","vj"],"description":"Audio-reactive water ripple simulation with wave interference. Bass amplifies wave energy and mouse-driven pulses. Parameters control intensity, speed, scale, and damping detail.","hash":"029c861ff92e751d","embedding":""},{"id":"generative-psy-swirls","name":"Psychedelic Swirls","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","swirl","psychedelic","chromatic","temporal","audio-reactive","vortex","rainbow"],"description":"Multi-layer polar swirl vortex with chromatic hue separation per layer, temporal swirl accumulation, audio-driven twist modulation, HSV rainbow cycles, and ripple glow trails.","hash":"8fc9c17c580dabf4","embedding":""},{"id":"generative-turing-veins","name":"Turing Veins Generative","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative","turing","veins","organic","chromatic","audio-reactive","temporal","bioluminescence"],"description":"Multiscale reaction-diffusion Turing patterns generating organic vein/network structures with bioluminescent glow, chromatic activator/inhibitor separation, temporal colony evolution via dataTextureC, and audio-driven feed rate modulation.","hash":"9ea689c972fec066","embedding":""},{"id":"gravito-phononic-accretion","name":"Gravito-Phononic Accretion","category":"generative","tags":["gravitational","accretion","cosmic","organic","audio-reactive","lensing","blackbody","HDR"],"description":"SPH density estimation around orbiting accretors with cubic-spline kernel, shock-wave detection, and temperature-based blackbody coloring. Bass adds mass to primaries, mids drive orbital precession, treble creates acoustic standing waves. Mouse introduces a rogue body with tidal forces. Ripples seed density perturbatio","hash":"4dc72a9dbf85e6e6","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-crystal","name":"Holographic Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["generative","crystal","holographic","prismatic","interference","audio-reactive"],"description":"Crystal facet interference patterns with rainbow holographic shifts. Mouse tilts the crystal lattice.","hash":"15f69499e2febec4","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic-entropy-vortex","name":"Holographic Entropy Vortex","category":"generative","tags":["vortex","holographic","entropy","iridescent","atmospheric","audio-reactive"],"description":"A swirling entropy vortex with holographic color shifts, iridescent thin-film interference, and atmospheric depth.","hash":"c5279b8ee26c3717","embedding":""},{"id":"holographic_interference","name":"Holographic Interference","category":"generative","tags":["holographic","interference","rainbow","diffraction","temporal","audio-reactive","depth-aware","chromatic","speckle","generative"],"description":"Laser interference pattern simulation with multiple coherent sources, object beam and reference beam phase accumulation, speckle pattern, chromatic dispersion on holographic fringes, HDR bloom, and ACES tone mapping. Bass drives reference beam angle, mouse moves the virtual object, depth controls holographic parallax.","hash":"3ea1a973b5042ce4","embedding":""},{"id":"hyperbolic-crystal-symbiosis","name":"Hyperbolic Crystal Symbiosis","category":"generative","tags":["hyperbolic","crystalline","symbiosis","geometric","audio-reactive","abstract","iridescent","reaction-diffusion","ripple","drift","chromatic","interactive","kaleidoscope","audio-palette","smin","hybrid"],"description":"Voronoi crystal facets on a true Poincaré disk with geodesic distance and Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion. Kaleidoscope symmetry mirrors the domain into audio-reactive sectors, while an audio-driven palette shifts crystal hues with bass, mids and treble. Iridescent thin-film coloring on facet edges with HDR bloom at trip","hash":"a7a67aadc999cc80","embedding":""},{"id":"interactive_neural_swarm","name":"Neural Swarm","category":"generative","tags":["neural","network","swarm","interactive","neon","biological"],"description":"Agent-based neural network visualization with signal propagation, connection weights, and emergent activation patterns","hash":"cb26f226e059e6b4","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi_flock_symphony","name":"Kimi Flock Symphony","category":"generative","tags":["boids","flocking","generative","particles","musical","interactive","procedural"],"description":"Advanced particle flocking simulation with musical visualization, featuring separation, alignment, cohesion, and mouse interaction.","hash":"8b5aca8ac04301d0","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-fractal-dreams","name":"Kimi Fractal Dreams","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Multi-layer fractal with orbit traps, burning ship variant, and smooth color cycling.","hash":"2d9a41ab474c1866","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-nebula-depth","name":"Kimi Nebula Depth","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Halftone dot and Sobel edge ink-stipple effect: posterized luma rendered as resolution-independent dots with ink outlines, paper grain, and a mouse-driven vignette.","hash":"de29da041bc178d4","embedding":""},{"id":"kimi-quantum-field","name":"Kimi Quantum Field","category":"generative","tags":["procedural","generative"],"description":"Wave interference patterns with uncertainty visualization and probability densities.","hash":"1ecb5bfbaf26cb52","embedding":""},{"id":"lava-lamp-blobs","name":"Lava Lamp Blobs","category":"generative","tags":["generative","lava","metaballs","organic","retro","audio-reactive"],"description":"Metaball lava blobs rise and merge with chromatic warm-cool color shifts and audio-reactive heat.","hash":"69ed8e9ed2dc6707","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid_crystal_birefringence","name":"Liquid Crystal","category":"generative","tags":["interactive","cursor","liquid-crystal","birefringence","polarization","optics","lcd","interference"],"description":"Twisted-nematic cell between crossed polarizers. The analyzer now obeys Malus's law and rotates toward a held pointer, producing the dark extinction brushes real liquid-crystal microscopy shows — previously no analyzer existed at all, so the effect's most recognisable feature could not appear. Transmitted light relaxes","hash":"fb585155fda72e06","embedding":""},{"id":"liquid_magnetic_ferro","name":"Magnetic Ferrofluid","category":"generative","tags":["ferrofluid","magnetic","liquid","interactive","metallic"],"description":"Interactive ferrofluid simulation with magnetic field lines, Rosensweig instability spike formation, and metallic iridescent rendering","hash":"a807540ed1a1f58d","embedding":""},{"id":"magnetic-flux-garden","name":"Magnetic Flux Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","magnetic","ferrofluid","fields","organic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Ferrofluid-like magnetic field lines curve between cursor poles, blooming with organic turbulence and treble seeds.","hash":"978ea29d145206e9","embedding":""},{"id":"molten-gold","name":"Molten Gold","category":"generative","tags":["generative","showcase","gold","liquid","metal","molten","audio-reactive","mouse-driven","temporal","chromatic","abstract"],"description":"Molten gold liquid metal effect with flowing fBM noise. Hypnotic idle animation with satisfying mouse claim interaction. Audio-reactive: bass fuels glow, treble adds specular highlights, mid drives ripple shimmer.","hash":"8b9a2dcb5685671b","embedding":""},{"id":"morphogenic-resonance","name":"Morphogenic Resonance","category":"generative","tags":["generative","organic","geometric","morphing","audio-reactive","temporal","chromatic","abstract","biological"],"description":"Organic shapes that morph between geometric and biological forms via sinusoidal interpolation. Closed-form morph-field conveyor, traveling resonance rings, and advected HDR trails. Bass drives morph speed, mids add surface ripple resonance, treble creates smooth edge discharge. Mouse warps the morph field.","hash":"9f853ab175b28c6f","embedding":""},{"id":"multi-scale-evolutionary-cellular-gardens","name":"Multi-Scale Evolutionary Cellular Gardens","category":"generative","tags":["cellular-automata","evolutionary","organic","garden","audio-reactive","emergent"],"description":"Two competing cellular species whose growth rules slowly evolve under audio pressure. The garden changes its fundamental behavior over time while remaining visually coherent.","hash":"c8d02f61b19fc1fa","embedding":""},{"id":"mycelium-network","name":"Mycelium Network","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mycelium","fungal","network","branching","nutrients","pulse","audio-reactive","organic"],"description":"Underground fungal hyphae network with pulsing nutrient flows traveling along branches. Audio triggers bright nutrient pulses.","hash":"c9b7863a9a11d651","embedding":""},{"id":"nebula-gyroid","name":"Nebula Gyroid","category":"generative","tags":["generative","gyroid","raymarch","iridescent","organic","nebula","sdf","fluid","geometry","procedural","audio","music","reactive"],"description":"Ethereal, flowing organic form created with raymarched gyroid SDFs. Features iridescent lighting, multiple blended gyroid layers, and mouse-reactive domain warping for a fluid geometry effect.","hash":"6fea51330c04ea3e","embedding":""},{"id":"neon-fern-garden","name":"Neon Fern Garden","category":"generative","tags":["generative","fern","garden","organic","neon","nature","audio-reactive","chromatic","temporal","growth"],"description":"Procedurally generated fern fronds unfurling in neon colors against dark soil. Bass drives growth animation, mids control frond density, treble creates dewdrop sparkles. Mouse attracts or repels frond tips.","hash":"32168a9d75198de9","embedding":""},{"id":"neural-mandala","name":"Neural Mandala","category":"generative","tags":["generative","mandala","geometric","network","nodes","audio-reactive","pulsing","abstract"],"description":"Concentric geometric rings with interconnected node networks that pulse and evolve. Audio drives ring expansion and node brightness.","hash":"3c5809120f9326dc","embedding":""},{"id":"neural-synapse-web","name":"Neural Synapse Web","category":"generative","tags":["generative","neural","synapse","network","cybernetic","audio-reactive"],"description":"Pulsing neural nodes and synaptic signals with guarded six-float spring state, uniform bounded click waves, live plasma audio, exact display history, ACES, semantic alpha, and source depth.","hash":"da4e3b29ead53b6c","embedding":""},{"id":"phase-memory-weave","name":"Phase Memory Weave","category":"generative","tags":["viscous","memory","phase","material","audio-reactive","abstract","opalescent","caustics"],"description":"Authoritative Ginzburg-Landau state packed as psiR, psiI, slow memory, and activity, with exact center/neighbor loads, sp